gBwText_0_0:
	.string "Hi! I am a humble Maid!\pMy master has a big heart to match his\nbig belly. He's a gourmet!\pSo I am looking for ingredients that\nwill make his heart jump for joy!$"
gBwText_0_1:
	.string "Sniff, sniff... Sniff, sniff...\pOh, that aroma! It smells so gourmet!\pDo you have a wonderful ingredient in\nyour Bag?\lWould you consider selling it to me?$"
gBwText_0_2:
	.string "Oh, it smells so good!\pThat {STR_VAR_1} of yours is a very\nrare ingredient indeed!\pWould you take ${STR_VAR_2} for it?$"
gBwText_0_3:
	.string "Turned over the {STR_VAR_1} and\nreceived ${STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_0_4:
	.string "Merci! Thank you!!\pWith this, I can create a superb menu.\nMy master will be so surprised!$"
gBwText_0_5:
	.string "Hmmm... This is not quite what I'm\nlooking for.\pI don't think my master will be\nsatisfied with such a smell...$"
gBwText_0_6:
	.string "Aww... Well, that's OK.\pIf you find a gourmet ingredient for me,\nplease let me know!$"
gBwText_0_7:
	.string "Sniff, sniff... Sniff, sniff...\pWell, I don't smell anything interesting\nin your Bag.\pBut if you find a gourmet ingredient,\nplease let me know!$"
gBwText_0_8:
	.string "Ore, ore, ore...\nOres that I adore!\pAh, this is where you should laugh...\pAnyway... I will pay you well for\nrare ores.\pAnd not just ores! Stones, gems,\nshards...anything mineral! I love it all!$"
gBwText_0_9:
	.string "Don't you have an adorable ore\nthat shakes my core?$"
gBwText_0_10:
	.string "Oh, I do adore the ores!\pThat {STR_VAR_1}, it's shaking me!\nWill you sell it for ${STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_0_11:
	.string "Turned over the {STR_VAR_1}\nand received ${STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_0_12:
	.string "The deal is done!\nI've scored an ore I can adore!$"
gBwText_0_13:
	.string "Huh? What on earth is this?\pYou can't shake my core\nwith an ore so poor!$"
gBwText_0_14:
	.string "Hmmm. My core won't change.\nI hope you sell it to me someday.$"
gBwText_0_15:
	.string "Don't you have an adorable ore\nthat shakes my core?\pHmmmm. You don't seem to have it.\nCome back again.$"
gBwText_0_16:
	.string "As you can see,\nI am an ultrarich billionaire!\pAnd as you can see,\nmy hobby is to collect rare items!\pIn fact, this outfit is ultra expensive\nand rare.\lCan you see it? Can you?$"
gBwText_0_17:
	.string "There's something that this billionaire\nwants to get his hands on, even if it\lmeans spending a lot of money.\pDo you have such a rare item?\nDo you?$"
gBwText_0_18:
	.string "That {STR_VAR_1}!! Will you sell it to me\nfor ${STR_VAR_2}? Will you?$"
gBwText_0_19:
	.string "Turned over the {STR_VAR_1}\nand received ${STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_0_20:
	.string "I got a very good item!\nDon't you think it's great? Don't you?$"
gBwText_0_21:
	.string "This is slightly different.\nDon't you think so, too? Don't you?$"
gBwText_0_22:
	.string "If you ever change your mind,\nwill you sell me the rare item? Will you?$"
gBwText_0_23:
	.string "Actually, it's...\nIt's a rare treasure, Relic Crown!\pI was told it was at the innermost part\nof the Abyssal Ruins!\pI think it is understandable that you\nwant to treasure it, but will you sell it\lto me for ${STR_VAR_2}? Will you?$"
gBwText_0_24:
	.string "There's something that this billionaire\nwants to get his hands on, even if it\lmeans spending a lot of money.\pDo you have such a rare item?\nDo you?\pGrrr! You don't have a rare item,\ndo you?$"
gBwText_0_25:
	.string "Hey, check it out. I've got a sweet deal\nfor ya!\pYou know how Pokémon like to hide\nbehind stones or rocks, yeah?\pSometimes they hide cool stuff, too.\pIf you find something cool behind a\nrock, you should bring it to me.\pI'll make it worth your while.$"
gBwText_0_26:
	.string "What's up?\nDid you find something cool for me?$"
gBwText_0_27:
	.string "Hey, nice! Let me check out\nthat {STR_VAR_1}...\pI'll give you ${STR_VAR_2} for it.\nWhaddaya say?$"
gBwText_0_28:
	.string "Turned over the {STR_VAR_1}\nand received ${STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_0_29:
	.string "Hey, thanks!\pI bet I can sell this to a collector for\nway more than I just gave you.\pHa! That's business for ya!$"
gBwText_0_30:
	.string "Nope, this is no good. Not worth my\nwhile.$"
gBwText_0_31:
	.string "Hey, come see me if you find something\ncool, got it?\pI'll make it worth your while.$"
gBwText_0_32:
	.string "What's up?\nDid you find something cool for me?\p...Nope, nothing cool in your Bag.\nOh well. Maybe next time!$"
	.align 2
