	.4byte 33
gBwText_2_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_2_1:
	.string "Leo: Check me out! The excitement\nof the big city has made me stronger!$"
gBwText_2_2:
	.string "Looks like I wasn't wound up enough...\nI need a little more urban atmosphere.$"
gBwText_2_3:
	.string "Maybe all of this excitement is\na little too much for me...$"
gBwText_2_4:
	.string "Living in a fast-paced environment\nhelps with a person's growth.\lThis city is a model for those words.$"
gBwText_2_5:
	.string "Silvia: My glasses have locked onto you!\nLet's have a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_2_6:
	.string "Th-there's a crack in my glasses.\nThat was a smashing battle!$"
gBwText_2_7:
	.string "The time I've spent here has been\nreally fun and wonderful!\pBut, being this surrounded by\nexcitement makes you miss nature\lsomehow!$"
gBwText_2_8:
	.string "All the buildings reflected in my\nglasses are dazzling enough to make me\ldizzy!$"
gBwText_2_9:
	.string "Dave: Hey! You've got it goin' on!\nLet's get a Pokémon battle goin'\lto see who's got it goin' on the most!$"
gBwText_2_10:
	.string "No one's got it goin' on more than you!\nYou can hang out with all the tough\lguys!$"
gBwText_2_11:
	.string "The life of a tough guy in the city is\na little much.\pWhite Forest is looking better\nall the time.$"
gBwText_2_12:
	.string "This city is big and tough, just like me!\nWhat do you think of me now? I've got\lit goin' on as much as it will go! Right?$"
gBwText_2_13:
	.string "Britney: Hey there! You over thataway!\nHave a Pokémon battle with me!\pBring heaps of cute Pokémon, OK?$"
gBwText_2_14:
	.string "Whoa, what was that?!\pYou are way strong!\nThere's no chance I'm keepin' up!$"
gBwText_2_15:
	.string "All the racket in this city is getting\nto be too much.\pI want to lie on my back in the\nwide-open spaces!$"
gBwText_2_16:
	.string "I have to try somethin' awful to keep\nup with city life! But I still enjoy it a\lbit.$"
gBwText_2_17:
	.string "Robbie: In Black City, my groove's\ngetting into a groove! And in battle,\lI'll never lose!$"
gBwText_2_18:
	.string "Ooh, now I'm grooveless.\nBut I'll get my groove back, so\llet's battle again sometime!$"
gBwText_2_19:
	.string "Aaah! I've grooved my way into a rut!\nI want to take a break in White Forest!$"
gBwText_2_20:
	.string "Developing and developing.\nBlack City changes every day!\lI love that about this place!$"
gBwText_2_21:
	.string "Miki: Hello!\nI'm a fan of sudden beginnings!\pLet's get right to the Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_2_22:
	.string "Oh, gosh. I already lost?\nSudden endings, I'm not such a fan of!$"
gBwText_2_23:
	.string "It's too busy and noisy, and it's\nenough to make a slow-paced person\llike me dizzy. I want to relax in White\lForest.$"
gBwText_2_24:
	.string "I was worried, since I'm a little laid\nback and do things at my own speed,\lthat Black City and I aren't a good fit.\pBut it'll work out, and it's fun here!$"
gBwText_2_25:
	.string "Ryder: Hyah! Hello!\nI want to test my strength against you!\lThat's OK, right?$"
gBwText_2_26:
	.string "Huh... So that's how much I've improved.\pThanks! Battling with you\nhas given me a goal!$"
gBwText_2_27:
	.string "Hyah! Hyah... Hyah?\nMy heart's not really into it.\lMaybe I just can't concentrate here.$"
gBwText_2_28:
	.string "Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!!\pSince strong people gather here, it's\nthe optimal place for a test of\lstrength!$"
gBwText_2_29:
	.string "Karenna: Faster! Faster! I'm ready\nto go! Please spar with me!$"
gBwText_2_30:
	.string "Thank you very much! I still haven't\ntrained enough. I need to be faster!$"
gBwText_2_31:
	.string "There are many things to learn from\nbattle, but to improve on what I\llearned, I want to run and train in the\lforest.$"
gBwText_2_32:
	.string "There is a lot to learn from battles!\nI want to battle more and more!$"
gBwText_2_33:
	.string "Doug: Hello, hello! Nice to work with you!\pHow about a Pokémon battle to\ncelebrate our new acquaintance?$"
gBwText_2_34:
	.string "Hey! You must be Unova's best!$"
gBwText_2_35:
	.string "Black City has everything! But if\nthere's one thing it's missing, it's...\pNature! Relaxation! I want to relax!$"
gBwText_2_36:
	.string "Black City is full of hustle and bustle!\nI'm sure my work will progress here!$"
gBwText_2_37:
	.string "Vincent: You don't really think you can\nbeat me, Black City's Ace Trainer?$"
gBwText_2_38:
	.string "An Ace Trainer like me, losing?!\nThis doesn't count! It just doesn't!$"
gBwText_2_39:
	.string "I was born and raised in the city, but\nI think nature is really great.\lI want to go to White Forest.$"
gBwText_2_40:
	.string "The awesomeness of this city\nspices up my life!$"
gBwText_2_41:
	.string "Marie: Take deep, deep breaths before\nbattle. When your mind is clear,\lthe battle can begin!$"
gBwText_2_42:
	.string "I overthought things, and I lost...\pSometimes just acting on instinct\nmight be better.$"
gBwText_2_43:
	.string "I was working on my paper, but now\nI've got writer's block.\pMaybe getting some fresh air in\nWhite Forest would clear my head.$"
gBwText_2_44:
	.string "Black City is really exciting, and\nthere's always so much going on. It\lgives me lots of ideas!$"
gBwText_2_45:
	.string "Lena: Since I started my journey as a\nPokémon Trainer, I haven't lost\lmany battles.\pCan you make me lose?$"
gBwText_2_46:
	.string "Oh. I really lost, didn't I...?\nIt's strange. I'm usually calm, but now\lI'm a little frustrated.$"
gBwText_2_47:
	.string "In the end, everything returns\nto nature, no matter what.\pSo that's why White Forest may\nbe so calming...$"
gBwText_2_48:
	.string "People build buildings because\nthey fear the power of nature.\lThat's why I feel so calm here...$"
gBwText_2_49:
	.string "Carlos: Oh! Hello!\pWe must've met here because of fate!\nLet's have a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_2_50:
	.string "Black City battles really\nmake a person excited, huh?$"
gBwText_2_51:
	.string "Hmmm. I think I'd like\nto see somewhere else soon.$"
gBwText_2_52:
	.string "Black City has so much to see.\nI never get tired of it!$"
gBwText_2_53:
	.string "Molly: If you look at everything while\nwalking, you make eye contact with\lvarious Trainers.\pWhich Pokémon will you use, Trainer who\nmet my gaze?$"
gBwText_2_54:
	.string "When you don't feel confident,\nlower your eyes as you walk.\lThat is a bit of wisdom.$"
gBwText_2_55:
	.string "When there is this much commotion,\nit's hard to calm down.\lI want to relax somewhere quiet.$"
gBwText_2_56:
	.string "Black City always feels like it is going\nforward. It's really cool, isn't it?$"
gBwText_2_57:
	.string "Frederic: Oh! Have a look at this!\pMy Pokémon is saying it wants to battle\nwith yours!$"
gBwText_2_58:
	.string "My Pokémon is saying that was\na good battle.\pDon't you think my Pokémon\nis truly well mannered?$"
gBwText_2_59:
	.string "I love this place, but my Pokémon\nseems unsatisfied.\lMaybe I should take it to White Forest.$"
gBwText_2_60:
	.string "This is definitely the best place for\nme.\pThe constant change and development\nreally put me in high spirits.$"
gBwText_2_61:
	.string "Lynette: How do you do?\pWould you please let me see\nif you are strong or not?$"
gBwText_2_62:
	.string "Ah, you are a strong person!\nI can feel it in my heart.$"
gBwText_2_63:
	.string "I've grown a little tired of looking for\nmy Prince Charming.$"
gBwText_2_64:
	.string "There are many strong people in this\ncity, so I never get bored!\pI want to meet more and more\nstrong people!$"
gBwText_2_65:
	.string "Pierce: Phew! What a thrilling lifestyle!\pWant to taste the thrill with\na Pokémon battle?$"
gBwText_2_66:
	.string "That felt like being on the edge!\nIt was thrilling and fun!$"
gBwText_2_67:
	.string "Aaahhh. I'm even getting tired of\nthrilling things. I want to pass time\lslowly and simply with my Pokémon...$"
gBwText_2_68:
	.string "Black City is great. It has culture,\nand you can live comfortably.\pI think when you're picking a place\nto live, living comfortably is important!$"
gBwText_2_69:
	.string "Gene: I can't remember how many\nPokémon I've encountered...\pWhy don't you test your powers\nagainst someone like me?$"
gBwText_2_70:
	.string "Hmmm... I still have a long way to\ngo as a Trainer.$"
gBwText_2_71:
	.string "I want to meet more Pokémon\nin my day-to-day life.$"
gBwText_2_72:
	.string "You can keep battling more and more\nand test your power here!\lBlack City is a great city!$"
gBwText_2_73:
	.string "Piper: Fight efficiently and without\nwaste! That is my policy!$"
gBwText_2_74:
	.string "Your efficient fighting style\nis truly wonderful!$"
gBwText_2_75:
	.string "Maybe there's more to life\nthan efficiency...$"
gBwText_2_76:
	.string "Efficiency is everything in\nbattling and in business.\pBlack City is efficient.\nI like that in a place!$"
gBwText_2_77:
	.string "Miho: I'm adorable, and so is my\nPokémon! Do you think you can win\lagainst us?$"
gBwText_2_78:
	.string "How can we lose when we're so cute?$"
gBwText_2_79:
	.string "I've been thinking lately that it would\nbe better for my Pokémon and me to get\lback to nature...$"
gBwText_2_80:
	.string "You can get everything in Black City, so\nI'm sure I can find things that will\lhelp me become cuter and stronger!$"
gBwText_2_81:
	.string "Shane: You strong? I'm sure you are!\nI'll check by battling with you!$"
gBwText_2_82:
	.string "I see...\nI must be weak, then...$"
gBwText_2_83:
	.string "I'm a little tired of living a life where\nI'm worried about how people see me.$"
gBwText_2_84:
	.string "In Black City, I can always confirm what\nkind of guy I am by battling others.\lIt's easy to understand.$"
gBwText_2_85:
	.string "Ralph: My feelings! I'll use a Pokémon\nbattle to get them through!$"
gBwText_2_86:
	.string "Did some of my excitement\nget through to you?$"
gBwText_2_87:
	.string "Recently, I've been thinking I don't\njust want to try and get my feelings\lthrough to people, but I also want\lto listen a little better...\pI want to live the slow life in\nWhite Forest.$"
gBwText_2_88:
	.string "In Black City, you can quickly let me\nknow how you feel!\pThis directness feels really great!$"
gBwText_2_89:
	.string "Eliza: I want this! I want that! But\nwhat I really want is to beat you in a\lPokémon battle!$"
gBwText_2_90:
	.string "My oh my...\nI lost!$"
gBwText_2_91:
	.string "Even if I buy a lot of stuff, I'm still\nunsatisfied... I have times like that!$"
gBwText_2_92:
	.string "In Black City, you can get whatever\nyou want! You can live securely!$"
gBwText_2_93:
	.string "Collin: Pokémon battles are good\nfor business!\pI'll defeat you and take advantage of\nthe business opportunity!$"
gBwText_2_94:
	.string "My business opportunity!\nIt's going up in smoke!!$"
gBwText_2_95:
	.string "Business opportunities don't just come\nrolling your way...\pMaybe White Forest is a better fit\nfor me...$"
gBwText_2_96:
	.string "Time is limited!\pI want to always give things my all\nso I don't regret anything!$"
gBwText_2_97:
	.string "Ken: I've dedicated my life to Pokémon\nbattling. I will win as a specialist!$"
gBwText_2_98:
	.string "I apparently still haven't done enough\nresearch on Pokémon battling.$"
gBwText_2_99:
	.string "All I think about every day is\nPokémon battling.\pBut maybe it would be better\nto think about other things, too...\lI think that sometimes.$"
gBwText_2_100:
	.string "If I'm in Black City, I can focus on\nPokémon battling and get really good!\pI'll try to master one thing!$"
gBwText_2_101:
	.string "Jacques: Win or lose!\nContests have a clear answer!\pI'm going to research\nyour battling style.$"
gBwText_2_102:
	.string "The result is a loss.\nIt's a beautiful, clear answer.$"
gBwText_2_103:
	.string "Just one answer...\pI think there may be a way of research\nthat looks for something besides that.$"
gBwText_2_104:
	.string "In Black City, you can get a clear\nanswer if you battle... It's satisfying\lfor a researcher.$"
gBwText_2_105:
	.string "Rosa: Life is just killing time.\nDon't you think so?\lPlay with me for a bit!$"
gBwText_2_106:
	.string "I managed to kill some time!$"
gBwText_2_107:
	.string "I might not know what to do with a life\nof killing time every day!$"
gBwText_2_108:
	.string "Black City has lots of ways to kill time,\nso I never get bored! It's great!!$"
gBwText_2_109:
	.string "Herman: I can't be tied down to a single\nplace... I wander around, and today's\lanother battle!$"
gBwText_2_110:
	.string "I lost! This city doesn't fit me well.$"
gBwText_2_111:
	.string "Just staying in one place...\nI'd like to try living like that.$"
gBwText_2_112:
	.string "Wandering and having Pokémon battles!\nI like living like this!$"
gBwText_2_113:
	.string "Emi: Pokémon battling...\nThat is the goal for my journey!$"
gBwText_2_114:
	.string "I couldn't win! But this is one of the\nthrills of battling!$"
gBwText_2_115:
	.string "Recently, I've been thinking I would\nlike to take a more leisurely trip\lwithout any particular destination in\lmind.$"
gBwText_2_116:
	.string "In Black City, I can enjoy Pokémon\nbattles, and it fits my\ljourney perfectly!$"
gBwText_2_117:
	.string "Grace: I am about to show you the\nbeauty of artistic Pokémon battling!\lPlease be overwhelmed!$"
gBwText_2_118:
	.string "The combination of you and your\nPokémon was very beautiful!!$"
gBwText_2_119:
	.string "There is a limit to the beauty a person\ncan create... I feel like that when I\llook at this city.$"
gBwText_2_120:
	.string "My heart dances in delight at the\ncalculated beauty of a city built\lby people!$"
gBwText_2_121:
	.string "Black City\nProsperous and Vibrant$"
