	.4byte 3
gBwText_6_0:
	.string "The country, huh?\pI'm amazed anyone can live in a place\nthat's so inconvenient.$"
gBwText_6_1:
	.string "Nature and slow-paced living?\nI don't need a boring life like that!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_6
gBwTextTable_6:
	.4byte gBwText_6_0
	.4byte gBwText_6_1
	.global gBwTextCount_6
gBwTextCount_6:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_7_0:
	.string "Welcome to Black City.\pThis is the city of dreams, greed, and\nmore greed.\pAnd I am Black City's boss, so I'm\na whirlpool of greed!$"
gBwText_7_1:
	.string "This city is filled with vibrant people\nwho are like big piles of greed.\pHmm. Try defeating {STR_VAR_1} of the\npeople outside.\pThen I'll respond to your greed.$"
gBwText_7_2:
	.string "I see you've defeated {STR_VAR_2} of\nthem. Hmph. Keep trying.$"
gBwText_7_3:
	.string "What? You've already beaten\n{STR_VAR_1} people?\pYou...\nYou're a greedier one than I expected.\lDeep down, you want a lot.\pI like you!\nI'll respond to your greed.$"
gBwText_7_4:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} received ${STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_7_5:
	.string "Next, try to defeat {STR_VAR_3} people.\nShow me how greedy you really are.$"
gBwText_7_6:
	.string "Wow! You're the best!\pYou're definitely the greediest\nof the greedy!\pYou put the other greedies to shame!$"
gBwText_7_7:
	.string "Wow! It's all really expensive, so these\nthings must be great...\pI want this, and that, and that\nthing over there!$"
gBwText_7_8:
	.string "I want to become more powerful and\nmake more money!$"
gBwText_7_9:
	.string "If you have the money, you can get\nanything you want in this city!$"
gBwText_7_10:
	.string "This city has everything!\nAbsolutely everything!$"
gBwText_7_11:
	.string "Hmmm... Isn't there a better job where\nI can make more money?$"
gBwText_7_12:
	.string "I wonder how strong this Pokémon\ncould become...$"
gBwText_7_13:
	.string "Everything I want is here!\nIf I only had money! If only!$"
gBwText_7_14:
	.string "The power of civilization is amazing...\nWe can make anything people could want!$"
gBwText_7_15:
	.string "Hee hee! Let's have a Rotation Battle!$"
gBwText_7_16:
	.string "Prepare three Pokémon for battle, OK?\pRotation Battle is a new kind of battle\nthat uses three Pokémon at a time!$"
gBwText_7_17:
	.string "Heh! Scared of me, aren't you?!$"
gBwText_7_18:
	.string "Rotation Battles are shocking!$"
gBwText_7_19:
	.string "I just got lucky and got some\nPokémon here...\pI want to use them right now, so let's\nhave a Rotation Battle!$"
gBwText_7_20:
	.string "Rotation Battles use three Pokémon!\nSo get three of yours ready!$"
gBwText_7_21:
	.string "Scared of how lucky I am, huh?$"
gBwText_7_22:
	.string "Hmmmph. I only lost today because\nI got unlucky.$"
gBwText_7_23:
	.string "$"
gBwText_7_24:
	.string "$"
gBwText_7_25:
	.string "$"
