gBwText_8_0:
	.string "It's lined with Pokémon picture books.$"
gBwText_8_1:
	.string "Are these books for Pokémon\nto read?$"
gBwText_8_2:
	.string "It's chock full of Pokémon books and\nphoto collections.$"
gBwText_8_3:
	.string "There are lots of Pokémon magazines!\p“Pokémon Pal“\n“Pokémon Handbook”\l“Adorable Pokémon“$"
gBwText_8_4:
	.string "The trash can is empty.$"
gBwText_8_5:
	.string "The shelves are jammed with vibrant\nPokémon goods.$"
gBwText_8_6:
	.string "It looks like a cabinet full of\nPokémon goods.$"
gBwText_8_7:
	.string "Goods are arranged on the shelves in a\nvery orderly fashion.$"
gBwText_8_8:
	.string "$"
gBwText_8_9:
	.string "$"
