gBwText_9_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_1:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Single Train here.$"
gBwText_9_2:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Double Train here.$"
gBwText_9_3:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Multi Train here.$"
gBwText_9_4:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Wi-Fi Train here.$"
gBwText_9_5:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Super Single Train here.$"
gBwText_9_6:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway.\pI am sorry, but this Super Single Train\nis only for those who beat the Single\lTrain.$"
gBwText_9_7:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Super Double Train here.$"
gBwText_9_8:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI am sorry, but this Super Double Train\nis only for those who beat\lthe Double Train.$"
gBwText_9_9:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI will guide you to\nthe Super Multi Train here.$"
gBwText_9_10:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI am sorry, but this Super Multi Train is\nonly for those who beat the Multi Train.$"
gBwText_9_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_12:
	.string "Currently, {STR_VAR_1} has\nwon {STR_VAR_2} battles in a row.$"
gBwText_9_13:
	.string "In the Single Train, you will battle\nusing three Pokémon.\pYou may not have duplicate Pokémon\nor duplicate held items.\pAll Pokémon will be temporarily set to\nLv. 50 for the battles here.\pThe Single Train has seven cars, so you\nwill fight against seven Trainers.$"
gBwText_9_14:
	.string "If you manage to defeat all seven,\nyou will arrive at a station and earn\lBattle Points (BP).\lGood luck!\pIf you need a break from your\nchallenge, remember to save the game!\pIf you don't save, you'll have to start\nthe challenge all over again.\lPlease be aware of that!$"
gBwText_9_15:
	.string "In the Double Train, you will battle\nusing four Pokémon.\pYou may not have duplicate Pokémon\nor duplicate held items.\pAll Pokémon will be temporarily set to\nLv. 50 for the battles here.\pThe Double Train has seven cars, so you\nwill fight against seven Trainers.$"
gBwText_9_16:
	.string "If you manage to defeat all seven,\nyou will arrive at a station and earn\lBattle Points (BP).\lGood luck!\pIf you need a break from your\nchallenge, remember to save the game!\pIf you don't save, you'll have to start\nthe challenge all over again.\lPlease be aware of that!$"
gBwText_9_17:
	.string "In the Multi Train, you and a friend will\nteam up to battle another team of two\lTrainers. Everyone will use two Pokémon.\pA team cannot have duplicate Pokémon,\nand the two Pokémon of one Trainer\lcannot hold the same item.\pAll Pokémon will be temporarily set to\nLv. 50 for the battles here.\pThe Multi Train has seven cars, so you\nwill battle seven pairs of Trainers.$"
gBwText_9_18:
	.string "If you manage to defeat all seven\npairs, you will arrive at a station and\learn Battle Points (BP). Good luck!\pIf you need a break from your\nchallenge, remember to save the game!\pIf you don't save, you'll have to start\nthe challenge all over again.\lPlease be aware of that!$"
gBwText_9_19:
	.string "In the Wi-Fi Train, you will battle\nusing three Pokémon.\pYou may not have duplicate Pokémon\nor held items.\pAll Pokémon will be temporarily set to\nLv. 50 for the battles here.\pThe Wi-Fi Train has seven cars, so you\nwill fight against seven Trainers.$"
gBwText_9_20:
	.string "Your opponents will come from around\nthe world via Nintendo Wi-Fi\lConnection.\pIf you manage to defeat all seven,\nyou will arrive at a station and earn\lBattle Points (BP).\lGood luck!\pThe Wi-Fi Train has a ranking system.\pIf you keep winning, your rank will go\nup, and if you lose, it will go down.\pKeep winning and fight against\nstronger opponents.\pIf you need a break from your\nchallenge, remember to save the game!\pIf you don't save, you'll have to start\nthe challenge all over again.\lPlease be aware of that!$"
gBwText_9_21:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Single Train?$"
gBwText_9_22:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Double Train?$"
gBwText_9_23:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Multi Train?$"
gBwText_9_24:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Wi-Fi Train?$"
gBwText_9_25:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Super Single Train?$"
gBwText_9_26:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Super Double Train?$"
gBwText_9_27:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe Super Multi Train?$"
gBwText_9_28:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_29:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_30:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_31:
	.string "Please select the Pokémon you wish\nto enter.$"
gBwText_9_32:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Single Train!$"
gBwText_9_33:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Double Train!$"
gBwText_9_34:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Multi Train!$"
gBwText_9_35:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Wi-Fi Train!\pAre you ready?$"
gBwText_9_36:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Super Single Train!$"
gBwText_9_37:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Super Double Train!$"
gBwText_9_38:
	.string "Now, please board\nthe Super Multi Train!$"
gBwText_9_39:
	.string "Would you like to save and interrupt\nyour challenge?$"
gBwText_9_40:
	.string "It's good to see you back.\pWould you like to resume your challenge\nat the Battle Subway?$"
gBwText_9_41:
	.string "Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_9_42:
	.string "Now, I will guide you to the place\nwhere you interrupted your challenge.$"
gBwText_9_43:
	.string "Thank you for playing!\pIf you want to resume your challenge,\nplease visit us again.$"
gBwText_9_44:
	.string "Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_9_45:
	.string "Excuse me!\pYou didn't save before you quit your\nchallenge last time.\pI am sorry, but you'll have to start\nyour challenge over again.$"
gBwText_9_46:
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"
gBwText_9_47:
	.string "Board$"
gBwText_9_48:
	.string "Info$"
gBwText_9_49:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_9_50:
	.string "Successive records$"
gBwText_9_51:
	.string "Earlier train$"
gBwText_9_52:
	.string "Please select whether to use your\nparty Pokémon or your Battle Box.$"
gBwText_9_53:
	.string "In party$"
gBwText_9_54:
	.string "Battle Box$"
gBwText_9_55:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_9_56:
	.string "Would you like to communicate with a\nfriend and take this challenge\ltogether?$"
gBwText_9_57:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s current rank is\n{STR_VAR_2}.$"
gBwText_9_58:
	.string "It's good to see you back.\pYour previous results were not sent out\nusing Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection.\lWould you like to send them now?$"
gBwText_9_59:
	.string "Your results were sent out using\nNintendo Wi-Fi Connection!$"
gBwText_9_60:
	.string "I've downloaded the Rank {STR_VAR_1}\nTrain No. {STR_VAR_2}'s successive\lrecords.\pPlease confirm on the Performance\nMonitor outside this platform.$"
gBwText_9_61:
	.string "Please decide which of you two will\nbecome the leader.\pThe other player must then choose\n“Join group.“$"
gBwText_9_62:
	.string "Both Trainers have chosen the\nPokémon {STR_VAR_1}.\pPlease confer with the other Trainer\nand choose different Pokémon.$"
gBwText_9_63:
	.string "Both Trainers have chosen the Pokémon\n{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.\pPlease confer with the other Trainer\nand choose different Pokémon.$"
gBwText_9_64:
	.string "You and the other Trainer have chosen\ndifferent trains.\pPlease confer with the other Trainer\nand come back again.$"
gBwText_9_65:
	.string "Hi! I'm Hilbert!\pIt's your first time challenging the\nMulti Train, right?\pWell, you need a partner!$"
gBwText_9_66:
	.string "Hi! I'm Hilda!\pYou're challenging the Multi Train for\nthe first time, right?\pYou can't take this challenge alone.\nYou need a partner!$"
gBwText_9_67:
	.string "Hi, {STR_VAR_1}!\nGood to see you again!$"
gBwText_9_68:
	.string "Hi, {STR_VAR_1}!\nNice to see you again!$"
gBwText_9_69:
	.string "Are you looking for a partner?\pThen why don't you team up\nwith me? Yeah! It'll be great!\pWhat sort of Pokémon should I use?$"
gBwText_9_70:
	.string "Are you here by yourself today?\pWhy don't you team up with me, then?\nIt'll be fun!\pWhat sort of Pokémon should I use?$"
gBwText_9_71:
	.string "FOCUSED ON ATTACK$"
gBwText_9_72:
	.string "FOCUSED ON DEFENSE$"
gBwText_9_73:
	.string "FOCUSED ON BALANCE$"
gBwText_9_74:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on Attack!\nThen, let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_75:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on Defense!\nThen, let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_76:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on a balance between\nAttack and Defense! Let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_77:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on Attack!\nThen, let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_78:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on Defense!\nThen, let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_79:
	.string "OK. I'll focus on a balance between\nAttack and Defense! Let's begin!$"
gBwText_9_80:
	.string "You don't want to team up with me?\nOK then, bye!$"
gBwText_9_81:
	.string "You don't want to team up with me?\nOK then, bye!$"
gBwText_9_82:
	.string "Become leader$"
gBwText_9_83:
	.string "Join group$"
gBwText_9_84:
	.string "Launch DS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_9_85:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_86:
	.string "Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_9_87:
	.string "Unfortunately, you have been\ndemoted to Rank {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_9_88:
	.string "Would you like to use\nInfrared Communication or\lDS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_9_89:
	.string "Infrared Communication$"
gBwText_9_90:
	.string "DS Wireless Communications$"
gBwText_9_91:
	.string "Would you like to launch\nInfrared Communication and\lDS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_9_92:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway.\pI am sorry, but this Super Single Train\nis only for those who beat the Single\lTrain.$"
gBwText_9_93:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway.\pI am sorry, but this Super Double Train\nis only for those who beat the Double\lTrain.$"
gBwText_9_94:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway.\pI am sorry, but this Super Multi Train is\nonly for those who beat the Multi Train.$"
gBwText_9_95:
	.string "That was awesome!\nLet's battle together again!$"
gBwText_9_96:
	.string "That was really fun!\nLet's battle together again!$"
gBwText_9_97:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI'm sorry, but this Super Single Train\nisn't ready yet.$"
gBwText_9_98:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI'm sorry, but this Super Double Train\nisn't ready yet.$"
gBwText_9_99:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI'm sorry, but this Super Multi Train\nisn't ready yet.$"
gBwText_9_100:
	.string "Welcome to the Battle Subway!\pI'm sorry, but this Wi-Fi Train\nisn't ready yet.$"
gBwText_9_101:
	.string "Would you like to send these\nresults using Nintendo WFC?$"
gBwText_9_102:
	.string "Communicating. Please stand by...$"
gBwText_9_103:
	.string "What kinds of Pokémon\nshould I enter?$"
gBwText_9_104:
	.string "What kinds of Pokémon\nshould I enter?$"
gBwText_9_105:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} achieved a win streak of\n{STR_VAR_2} in the Multi Train challenge\lwith a Trainer.$"
gBwText_9_106:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} achieved a win streak of\n{STR_VAR_2} in the Multi Train challenge\lwith a friend.$"
gBwText_9_107:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} achieved a win streak of\n{STR_VAR_2} in the Multi Train challenge\lwith a Trainer and a win streak of\l{STR_VAR_3} in the Multi Train challenge\lwith a friend.$"
gBwText_9_108:
	.string "$"
gBwText_9_109:
	.string "Would you like to board\nthe train to Anville Town?$"
gBwText_9_110:
	.string "The train is leaving the station\nshortly. All aboard!$"
gBwText_9_111:
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"
gBwText_9_112:
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"
