gBwText_11_0:
	.string "Hey there!\nI'm Fennel.\pProfessor Juniper asked me\nto give you something.\lPlease, follow me!$"
gBwText_11_1:
	.string "Are you looking for the Gym Leader?\pHe is not here.\nHe could be in the Trainers' School.\pIf you want to challenge him,\nplease go find him.\pThe Trainers' School is not far from\nthis Gym.$"
gBwText_11_2:
	.string "Yes? Yes, I am a Gym Leader of this\ntown. You are...?\pRight. You want to challenge the Gym.\pIn that case...\nWhat was the first Pokémon you chose?\p{STR_VAR_1}... I see. It's weak against\n{STR_VAR_2}-type Pokémon.\pI think you need to prepare to face\nthat type.\pI'll be waiting for you inside.$"
gBwText_11_3:
	.string "Yes? Yes, I am a Gym Leader\nof this town.\lYou are...?\pRight. You want to challenge the Gym.\pIn that case...\nWhat was the first Pokémon you chose?\p{STR_VAR_1}... I see. It's weak against\n{STR_VAR_2}-type Pokémon.\pI think you need to prepare to face\nthat type.\pFor example, try training your Pokémon\nin the Dreamyard.\pPlease excuse me now.$"
gBwText_11_4:
	.string "You don't seem to have any Gym Badges,\nso I can't let you by.\pWith your lack of training, you'll have\na hard job making any progress.\pLet me give you some friendly advice.\pChallenge a Gym Leader in this town,\nand test your ability!$"
gBwText_11_5:
	.string "You don't seem to have\nany Gym Badges.\pWith your lack of experience,\nyou'll have a hard time in the future.\pHere's some friendly advice.\nChallenge a Gym Leader in this town,\land test your ability!$"
gBwText_11_6:
	.string "The scientist Fennel was looking for\nyou a little while ago!$"
gBwText_11_7:
	.string "The scientist Fennel was looking for\nyou a little while ago!$"
gBwText_11_8:
	.string "Wow!\nIt's a shiny Gym Badge!\pGetting that Badge proved you have\nskill enough to handle whatever comes\lnext!$"
gBwText_11_9:
	.string "The Striaton City Gym Leader.\pNo matter how often I challenge him,\nhe always uses Pokémon\lthat I don't like...$"
gBwText_11_10:
	.string "If a Pokémon type and a move type are\nthe same, the move's power will\lincrease! The Gym Leader told me!$"
gBwText_11_11:
	.string "At the site of an old factory,\nat a place we call the Dreamyard,\lthere's an unusual Pokémon\lthat can make dreams appear!$"
gBwText_11_12:
	.string "I too studied at the Trainers' School\nwhen I was a beginner.$"
gBwText_11_13:
	.string "Do you know how Technical Machines\nwork?\pA TM can instantly teach a move to a\nPokémon. You can use it over and over\lwith different Pokémon. How cool is\lthat?$"
gBwText_11_14:
	.string "Er... Um...\pGrass-type Pokémon are\nweak against Fire-type moves.\pI know more stuff!$"
gBwText_11_15:
	.string "Er... Um...\pWater-type Pokémon are\nweak against Grass-type moves.\pI know more stuff!$"
gBwText_11_16:
	.string "Um... Er...\pFire-type Pokémon are\nweak against Water-type moves.\pI know more stuff!$"
gBwText_11_17:
	.string "Some Trainers train themselves and\ntheir Pokémon in the Dreamyard.\pYou might think about going there...\nCould be you'll find something...$"
gBwText_11_18:
	.string "I'm so glad you came.\nI'd like to give you this!$"
gBwText_11_19:
	.string "To live quietly and do a lot of fishing...\nI truly live my ideal existence!$"
gBwText_11_20:
	.string "Pokémon can be found in dark places,\ntoo. That's when a Dusk Ball can do the\ltrick! Here's one for you.$"
gBwText_11_21:
	.string "A Dusk Ball works well at night\nor in a cave.\pPlus, its name is excellent!\nThe Dusk Ball. Dusk!$"
gBwText_11_22:
	.string "Striaton City\nThree Stand Together as One!$"
gBwText_11_23:
	.string "Dreamyard ahead.\nA place for novice Trainers.$"
gBwText_11_24:
	.string "Trainers' School\nBrush up on Pokémon knowledge!$"
gBwText_11_25:
	.string "Striaton City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: ---\lTriple Trouble!$"
	.align 2
