gBwText_12_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Striaton City\nPokémon Gym.$"
gBwText_12_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_12_2:
	.string "I'm Chili! I light things up with\nFire-type Pokémon!$"
gBwText_12_3:
	.string "I'm a Water-type specialist,\nand my name is Cress.\lPleased to make your acquaintance.$"
gBwText_12_4:
	.string "And my name is Cilan.\nI like Grass-type Pokémon.$"
gBwText_12_5:
	.string "Cilan: Um, you see...\pAs for why the three of us, um,\nare all here is, well, er...$"
gBwText_12_6:
	.string "Chili: Oh, enough! Listen up!\pThe three of us will\ndecide whom you'll battle!\pIt'll be based on the type of\nthe first Pokémon you chose!$"
gBwText_12_7:
	.string "Cress: That is indeed the case.\pAnd the partner you first chose was\n{STR_VAR_1} type, it seems.$"
gBwText_12_8:
	.string "Ta-da! The Fire-type scorcher Chili--\nthat's me--will be your opponent!$"
gBwText_12_9:
	.string "That is correct!\pIt shall be I and my esteemed Water\ntypes that you must face in battle!$"
gBwText_12_10:
	.string "Nothing personal... No hard feelings...\nMe and my Grass-type Pokémon will...um...\lWe're gonna battle, come what may.$"
gBwText_12_11:
	.string "Yeeeeooow!\pTime to play with FIRE!!\nI'm the strongest of us brothers!$"
gBwText_12_12:
	.string "What incredible luck for you--you get\nto battle the best among the three of\lus.$"
gBwText_12_13:
	.string "So, um, if you're OK with me, I'll, um,\nput everything I've got into being, er,\lyou know, your opponent.$"
gBwText_12_14:
	.string "Aww, man!\nI was all fired up, too!$"
gBwText_12_15:
	.string "How exceedingly lucky for you\nthat you do not have to face me.$"
gBwText_12_16:
	.string "...Uh hm. I always seem to lose\nthe timing of...of the dance. Like that.\pTrue enough, I did want to...\nwant to have a Pokémon battle with you.$"
gBwText_12_17:
	.string "Whoa ho! You're on fire!\pWell, it's the Pokémon League's rule.\nTake this Gym Badge!$"
gBwText_12_18:
	.string "Why, you're quite remarkable.\pIt's the Pokémon League's rule, so--\nplease take this Badge.$"
gBwText_12_19:
	.string "...What a surprise.\nYou...are very strong.\pSeems like not even\nChili or Cress could beat you...$"
gBwText_12_20:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received\nthe Trio Badge from Chili!$"
gBwText_12_21:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received\nthe Trio Badge from Cress!$"
gBwText_12_22:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received\nthe Trio Badge from Cilan!$"
gBwText_12_23:
	.string "Gym Badges are proof\nof a Trainer's abilities.\pIf you have one Badge, Pokémon,\nincluding traded Pokémon up to Lv. 20,\lwill obey you without question.\pWe also want you to have this.$"
gBwText_12_24:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} contains Work Up.\pIf you use Work Up, the Pokémon's\nAttack and Sp. Atk go up!\pBy the way, TMs can be used\nas many times as you want.$"
gBwText_12_25:
	.string "In the Unova region, we are still\nnovice Gym Leaders.\pWhich means the other Gym Leaders\nare much stronger than we are.\lWe'll need to work hard and improve.$"
gBwText_12_26:
	.string "I can't believe TMs can be used\nover and over!\pIf you wanted, you could use one to\nteach all your Pokémon the same move!$"
gBwText_12_27:
	.string "If there were 17 siblings in\nthe Striaton City Gym...\pThere could be a specialist for\neach type of Pokémon.$"
gBwText_12_28:
	.string "Cilan: In the Unova region, um,\nwe are still novice Gym Leaders.\pWhich means, well, that other Gym\nLeaders are much stronger than we are.\pGoing...slow...and steady...is OK, so...\nwe compete with one another\land get, um, stronger and stronger.$"
gBwText_12_29:
	.string "Chili: Oh! It's you!\pYour fire is more intense than\nwhen you got the Trio Badge!$"
gBwText_12_30:
	.string "Cress: ...We heard about\nthe incident with N's Castle.\pIf we had received the message in time,\nthe three of us could have helped.$"
gBwText_12_31:
	.string "Hello! I'm Clyde. I'm the guide for\nTrainers challenging a Pokémon Gym.\pWe appreciate your challenging the Gym.\nTake this to commemorate the occasion.$"
gBwText_12_32:
	.string "One basic element of Pokémon battles is\nthe relationship between types.\pIf you choose Pokémon with effective\ntypes and effective moves,\lvictory is just a step away!\pIn this Gym, you proceed by\nstepping on the switch with\lthe type that is effective against the\lPokémon type shown on the curtain.$"
gBwText_12_33:
	.string "I hope you'll always remember the\nincredible moment when you received\lthis Gym Badge.$"
gBwText_12_34:
	.string "Welcome!\pWe are very proud of our menu,\nwhich we adjust to suit each Trainer!$"
gBwText_12_35:
	.string "Striaton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leaders: Cress, Chili, and Cilan\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_12_36:
	.string "Striaton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leaders: Cress, Chili, and Cilan\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_12_37:
	.string "Striaton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leaders: Cress, Chili, and Cilan\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
	.align 2
