gBwText_13_0:
	.string "I've just learned that the more\nGym Badges you win, the more items\lyou can buy at a shop!$"
gBwText_13_1:
	.string "Have you been catching Pokémon?\pWhen you have more Pokémon,\nyou're less likely to lose in battles,\land it's more fun to look at\lyour Pokédex and PC Box!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_13
gBwTextTable_13:
	.4byte gBwText_13_0
	.4byte gBwText_13_1
	.global gBwTextCount_13
gBwTextCount_13:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_14_0:
	.string "Fennel: You're going to meet all of the\nPokémon in the Unova region. Am I right?\pOh, the stairs are right here!$"
gBwText_14_1:
	.string "Fennel: My room is upstairs here.\nCome on, go upstairs!$"
gBwText_14_2:
	.string "After a battle, to my surprise,\nmy Pokémon evolved and\lchanged its appearance!$"
gBwText_14_3:
	.string "Some evolve and some don't...\pPokémon really are mysterious\ncreatures.$"
gBwText_14_4:
	.string "You can't go upstairs now!\p'Cause Fennel said she was testing\nsomething, and she had a scary look\lon her face!$"
gBwText_14_5:
	.string "She may not look like it,\nbut Fennel is a great scientist!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_14
