	.4byte gBwText_14_5
	.global gBwTextCount_14
gBwTextCount_14:
	.4byte 6
gBwText_15_0:
	.string "So like I said, I'm Fennel, and as you\ncan see, I'm a scientist.\pIn fact, the subject I'm researching\nis Trainers!\pProfessor Juniper is my friend\nfrom college.\pShe asked me to help you guys.$"
gBwText_15_1:
	.string "So!\pI'll give you something to help you.\nThis is a Hidden Machine for you!$"
gBwText_15_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_3:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_5:
	.string "There are some moves that a Pokémon\ncan use even when it is not fighting!\pWith this Hidden Machine, you can teach\nyour Pokémon a move called Cut.\lIt can cut down a small tree.\pAnd you can use the Hidden Machine as\nmany times as you want, like a TM.\lIsn't that great?\pBut it's difficult to make a Pokémon\nforget a hidden move once it learns it.$"
gBwText_15_6:
	.string "And I'd like to ask you a favor, too!\pThere is a place called the Dreamyard\non the outskirts of Striaton City.\pI'd like some of the Dream Mist that a\nPokémon there called Munna gives off.\pWith that, I'll be able to use\nGame Sync to collect save files of\lvarious Trainers!$"
gBwText_15_7:
	.string "Fennel: Did Juniper ask you to complete\nthe Pokédex?\pIt is a challenge to update the Pokédex\nregularly, isn't it?\pOops! I got distracted! Please bring me\nsome of the Dream Mist that Munna\lgives off in the Dreamyard!$"
gBwText_15_8:
	.string "Fennel: Ta-da!\pThanks to you, I got some Dream Mist,\nand now I can collect save files of\lvarious Trainers!\lThank you very much!\pAs a token of my appreciation,\nI will give you this C-Gear to use!\pThe C-Gear is a device related to\ncommunications, such as\lInfrared Connection or\lNintendo Wi-Fi Connection.$"
gBwText_15_9:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} obtained the C-Gear!$"
gBwText_15_10:
	.string "Turn on the C-Gear and\nestablish communications?$"
gBwText_15_11:
	.string "Yes$"
gBwText_15_12:
	.string "No$"
gBwText_15_13:
	.string "Some functions of the C-Gear\nwill be restricted. Is that OK?$"
gBwText_15_14:
	.string "Wireless communications\nare turned OFF.\pTurn wireless communications\nON in the System Settings.\lError code: 50699$"
gBwText_15_15:
	.string "You see! The C-Gear was activated, and\nthat screen showed up!\pIf you touch the “?“ icon at the\nbottom-right of the screen, you can\lread about the C-Gear.$"
gBwText_15_16:
	.string "If you want to turn on the C-Gear,\ntouch the Power symbol at the bottom\lright of the screen.\pThen, after turning on the power, if you\ntouch the “?“ icon at the bottom right\lof the screen, you can read about\lthe C-Gear.$"
gBwText_15_17:
	.string "About Game Sync...\pI'd like to explain a little more about\nthe system to collect Trainers' save\lfiles.\pDo you have time to learn more?$"
gBwText_15_18:
	.string "I am sorry!\nI am so happy, so I will explain about it!\pBecause, thanks to you, we can do a\ngreat thing!$"
gBwText_15_19:
	.string "Now Game Sync can retrieve memories\nof sleeping Pokémon using Dream Mist!\pThat's right! We can collect save files\nof Trainers from all over the world!$"
gBwText_15_20:
	.string "What's more, we learned that if you use\nGame Sync to make a Pokémon sleep,\lit will have dreams.\pThen, when you wake up that Pokémon,\nits dream becomes the reality in a\lspace called Entralink in the middle of\lthe Unova region.\pIsn't Game Sync interesting?\nIf you like, please send your save file.\pI've summed up the details in the PC, so\nplease check it if you get a chance!$"
gBwText_15_21:
	.string "Fennel: Game Sync is fascinating, I\nthink. Do you think so, too?\pIf you get interested, please send your\nsave file.\pI've summed up the details in the PC\nat the back.\lSo, please check it, if you'd like!$"
gBwText_15_22:
	.string "Fennel: Oh, thank you! \pYou also sent your save file. I saw it\nwhile I was researching Trainers!\pIsn't Game Sync great?$"
gBwText_15_23:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_24:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_25:
	.string "Are you a Trainer?\pDo you use the PC at Pokémon Centers?\pI am Amanita. I maintain the Box system.\nDo you know about the Battle Box?$"
gBwText_15_26:
	.string "Amanita: Impressive!\pIf there's a Pokémon you often use in\nyour battles, you can register it in the\lBattle Box!$"
gBwText_15_27:
	.string "Amanita: Let me give you a quick how-to!\pIf there's a Pokémon you often use in\nyour battles, you can register it in the\lBattle Box!$"
gBwText_15_28:
	.string "Amanita: Please do use the Battle Box.\pYou can register Pokémon in the PC\nover there, too!$"
gBwText_15_29:
	.string "Amanita: Oh, Trainer! Thank you very\nmuch for helping Fennel!\pThis is from me. Please take it.\nDon't be shy.$"
gBwText_15_30:
	.string "You can register your friends in your\nPal Pad.\pAfter you register, you can link with\nthose friends over Nintendo Wi-Fi\lConnection to do all kinds of fun\lthings!\pYou can trade Pokémon, challenge\nyour friends to a battle, and so on.\pLet me give you a quick how-to on\nregistering your friends.\pYou can either input your friend's code\ndirectly by using your Pal Pad...\pOr you can use the IR Connection\nfeature of the C-Gear.\pThen, you can register your friend!$"
gBwText_15_31:
	.string "Amanita: Is there something you'd like\nto ask me?$"
gBwText_15_32:
	.string "In the Battle Box, you can register up\nto six Pokémon that you often use\lin battles.\pWhen you battle using Infrared\nConnection, you can choose to battle\lwith either your party Pokémon or with\lthe Pokémon in the Battle Box!$"
gBwText_15_33:
	.string "In order to register your friend\nin your Pal Pad...\pYou can either input your friend's code\ndirectly by using your Pal Pad...\pOr you can use the IR Connection\nfeature of the C-Gear.\pThen, you can register your friend!$"
gBwText_15_34:
	.string "Catch a lot of Pokémon,\nand use the Box a lot!$"
gBwText_15_35:
	.string "Battle Box$"
gBwText_15_36:
	.string "Pal Pad$"
gBwText_15_37:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_15_38:
	.string "Trainer! Do you use the PC in a\nPokémon Center?\pI am the one who maintains the\nBox system.\pDo you know about the Battle Box?$"
gBwText_15_39:
	.string "C-Gear Help\pIf you have trouble using it, touch the\n“?“ icon on the screen!$"
gBwText_15_40:
	.string "What is the Pokémon Storage System?\pThe person who developed the\nPokémon Storage System for the PC\lconnection is Bill in the Kanto region.$"
gBwText_15_41:
	.string "$"
gBwText_15_42:
	.string "The monitor of the PC does not\nshow anything...$"
gBwText_15_43:
	.string "Fennel's Memo$"
gBwText_15_44:
	.string "Read which topic?$"
gBwText_15_45:
	.string "Game Sync$"
gBwText_15_46:
	.string "Pokémon Dreams$"
gBwText_15_47:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_15_48:
	.string "Game Sync is a system to collect save\nfiles from Trainers all over the world\lthrough Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection\lby making Pokémon sleep and retrieving\ltheir dreams.\pTouch the Online button on the C-Gear\nscreen, and a button called\lGame Sync appears.\pChoose a Pokémon to send to sleep, then\nyou can send your save file through\lNintendo Wi-Fi Connection.\pYou should be able to make more Pokémon\nsleep as a result of the research.$"
gBwText_15_49:
	.string "Pokémon Dreams...\pIf you use Game Sync to make a\nPokémon sleep, it will have dreams.\pWhen you wake up the Pokémon with\nGame Sync, its dream becomes\lthe reality in a space called Entralink\lin the middle of the Unova region...$"
	.align 2
