gBwText_16_0:
	.string "Oh! Trainer!\nDo you have enough Poké Balls?\pDon't be shy.\nTake this with you!$"
gBwText_16_1:
	.string "You cannot have too many Poké Balls!\pMy advice is that when you use a better\nPoké Ball, it's easier to catch Pokémon!$"
gBwText_16_2:
	.string "The beginning of my relationship with\nmy wife was our Pokémon battles.\pI could not defeat her, even\nthough I tried many times!$"
gBwText_16_3:
	.string "My husband and I are compatible...\nbecause he cannot beat me in battle!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_16
