gBwText_17_0:
	.string "Do your Pokémon have nicknames?\pWhen we give a Pokémon a nickname, we\ngrow attached to it. Don't you agree?$"
gBwText_17_1:
	.string "I went abroad to have Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_17_2:
	.string "Hi, traveling Trainer!\pYour family must be talking about you\nright now!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_17
gBwTextTable_17:
	.4byte gBwText_17_0
	.4byte gBwText_17_1
	.4byte gBwText_17_2
	.global gBwTextCount_17
gBwTextCount_17:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_18_0:
	.string "You can tell how strong Trainers are\nby the number of Gym Badges they have!\pIf you're a Trainer, you should\nchallenge Gym Leaders and collect a lot\lof Badges!$"
gBwText_18_1:
	.string "Lately, I have a favorite model.\pHer name is Elesa, and her Pokémon\nare strong, too!$"
gBwText_18_2:
	.string "The GTS! It links the world from the\nsecond floor of a Pokémon Center!\pThe full name of the GTS is the\nGlobal Trade Station!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_18
gBwTextTable_18:
	.4byte gBwText_18_0
	.4byte gBwText_18_1
	.4byte gBwText_18_2
	.global gBwTextCount_18
gBwTextCount_18:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_19_0:
	.string "I've trained only Fire-type Pokémon,\n'cause they're my favorites!\pBut they had no chance in a battle\nagainst Water-type Pokémon...\pSigh... Maybe I should try to train\nPokémon of other types.$"
gBwText_19_1:
	.string "It is quite hard to train six Pokémon at\nonce, so I've heard some Trainers focus\lon training three Pokémon at a time.$"
gBwText_19_2:
	.string "Skreee!$"
gBwText_19_3:
	.string "Fwee lee lee... ?$"
gBwText_19_4:
	.string "Fwee-oosh!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_19
