	.4byte 5
gBwText_20_0:
	.string "Cheren: When a Pokémon is poisoned,\nits HP decreases while it is battling.$"
gBwText_20_1:
	.string "Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\pHave you come looking for the\nGym Leader?$"
gBwText_20_2:
	.string "He was here talking about Pokémon\ntypes until just a few moments ago...\pMaybe you walked right past him?$"
gBwText_20_3:
	.string "Nothing improves your skill as a Trainer\nlike real battles.\pThat's why challenging Gym Leaders is\ngreat practice.$"
gBwText_20_4:
	.string "By the way, {STR_VAR_1}, will you have a\nbattle with me?\pI want to test how important items are\nin battles.$"
gBwText_20_5:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, will you have a\nbattle with me?\pI want to test how important items are\nin battles.$"
gBwText_20_6:
	.string "Really? I really want to try out my\nitems, so I'll just wait here until you\ldecide you're ready.$"
gBwText_20_7:
	.string "Cheren: Well, let's see how effective\nmy items are...\pOr maybe I should test how well I can\nbattle without items...?\pAnyway, this is an indoor match, so\nlet's battle without getting too rough!$"
gBwText_20_8:
	.string "Cheren: So learning to use items well is\ndefinitely important, then.\pOh, here. {STR_VAR_1}, I'll give you\nthese Berries.$"
gBwText_20_9:
	.string "Cheren: If you give a Pokémon this kind\nof Berry to hold, it will eat it to heal\lup when its HP goes down in battle.\pBut if you give Pokémon man-made items\nlike Potions to hold, they can't\luse them.\pWell, good luck, then.$"
gBwText_20_10:
	.string "This Trainers' School exists to meet\nthe demands of Trainers who want to\lknow more about Pokémon because they\llove them!$"
gBwText_20_11:
	.string "Pokémon have mysterious powers\ncalled Abilities.\pAbilities have a variety of effects, and\nmany of those effects are activated\lwhen Pokémon are in battle!$"
gBwText_20_12:
	.string "There is a technique that lets you\ncancel evolution!\pI'll read the book about it to you.\nAre you ready?\p“You can surprise a Pokémon and stop\nits evolution by pressing the B Button\lwhen a Pokémon is evolving.“$"
gBwText_20_13:
	.string "Some moves can only be taught with TMs.\pTMs can be used over and over, so you\nmight want to use them a lot.\pIf you don't like the move you taught,\nyou can always use a different TM.$"
gBwText_20_14:
	.string "Would you like to take a quiz about\nstatus conditions?$"
gBwText_20_15:
	.string "So here is the question:\pWhich of the following items\ncures poison?$"
gBwText_20_16:
	.string "Antidote$"
gBwText_20_17:
	.string "Parlyz Heal$"
gBwText_20_18:
	.string "Awakening$"
gBwText_20_19:
	.string "Ding ding ding!\pRight answer!\nNow for the next question.$"
gBwText_20_20:
	.string "The item that cures paralysis is\nParlyz Heal, but...\pWhich of the following items\nwakes up a sleeping Pokémon?$"
gBwText_20_21:
	.string "Ding ding ding! We have a winner!\nFantastic answer!\pSince you know so much about status\nconditions, I'll give you this!$"
gBwText_20_22:
	.string "Full Heal does exactly what the name\nsuggests--it heals all status\lconditions!$"
gBwText_20_23:
	.string "Come talk to me if you want\nto take a quiz.$"
gBwText_20_24:
	.string "Buzzzzz!\pToo bad... That's incorrect.\nPlease try again sometime!$"
gBwText_20_25:
	.string "The blackboard explains Pokémon\nstatus changes in battle.$"
gBwText_20_26:
	.string "What do you want to read about?$"
gBwText_20_27:
	.string "If poisoned, a Pokémon steadily loses\nHP when battling.\pThe poison lingers after the battle.\nTo cure it, use an Antidote.$"
gBwText_20_28:
	.string "Paralysis reduces the Speed stat\nand may prevent movement.\pIt remains after battle, so use a\nParlyz Heal.$"
gBwText_20_29:
	.string "If a Pokémon falls asleep, it will be\nunable to attack.\pThe Pokémon may wake up on its own,\nbut if a battle ends while it is\lsleeping, it will stay asleep.\pWake it up using an Awakening.$"
gBwText_20_30:
	.string "A burn reduces the Attack stat and\nsteadily reduces the victim's HP.\pA burn lingers after battle.\nCure a burn using a Burn Heal.$"
gBwText_20_31:
	.string "If a Pokémon is frozen, it becomes\ncompletely helpless.\pThe Pokémon may thaw out on its own,\nbut if a battle ends while it is\lfrozen, it will stay frozen.\pThaw it out using an Ice Heal.$"
gBwText_20_32:
	.string "Poison$"
gBwText_20_33:
	.string "Paralysis$"
gBwText_20_34:
	.string "Sleep$"
gBwText_20_35:
	.string "Burn$"
gBwText_20_36:
	.string "Frozen$"
gBwText_20_37:
	.string "Cancel$"
