gBwText_21_0:
	.string "Cheren: Come with me a sec.$"
gBwText_21_1:
	.string "If you go straight from here,\nthere's a Pokémon Center.\pAnd...\nUse these if you want.$"
gBwText_21_2:
	.string "Cheren: Give your Pokémon a\nChesto Berry to hold. Then, if it ever\lfalls asleep, it will wake up immediately.\pOh, and another piece of advice--\pNacrene City's Gym Leader uses\nNormal types.\pIf you have a Fighting-type Pokémon,\nit might give you a big advantage.$"
gBwText_21_3:
	.string "N: I...want to see things no one can see.\pThe ideals of Pokémon inside Poké Balls.\pThe truths of how Trainers should be.\pAnd a future where Pokémon\nhave become perfect...\pDo you feel the same?$"
gBwText_21_4:
	.string "N: I...want to see things no one can see.\pThe truths of Pokémon inside Poké\nBalls.\pThe ideals of how Trainers should be.\pAnd a future where Pokémon\nhave become perfect...\pDo you feel the same?$"
gBwText_21_5:
	.string "N: That so?\pI think my friends and I should test\nyou to see if you can see this future,\ltoo.$"
gBwText_21_6:
	.string "N: Huh. I expected more from you.\nNow pay attention.\pMy friends and I will test you\nto see if you can see this future, too.$"
gBwText_21_7:
	.string "N: Right now, my friends aren't strong\nenough to save all Pokémon.\pMaybe I can't solve the equation\nthat will change the world.\pSo, I need power... Power enough\nto make anyone agree with me.$"
gBwText_21_8:
	.string "$"
gBwText_21_9:
	.string "Now I know what power I need.\nReshiram!\pThe legendary Pokémon that, along with\nthe hero, created the Unova region.\pIt's my turn to become that hero--\nand you and I will be friends!$"
gBwText_21_10:
	.string "Now I know what power I need.\nZekrom!\pThe legendary Pokémon that, along with\nthe hero, created the Unova region.\pIt's my turn to become that hero--\nand you and I will be friends!$"
gBwText_21_11:
	.string "???: Good day, Lenora.\nFind any good Fossils lately?$"
gBwText_21_12:
	.string "Lenora: This is a surprise visit! Are you\nsuffering from artist's block again?$"
gBwText_21_13:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\pThis is Burgh.\nHe may not look like it, but he's\lCastelia City's Gym Leader!$"
gBwText_21_14:
	.string "Burgh: ...Eh?\nJust looking for a change of pace.\pSeems hectic or something around here.\nWhat's up?$"
gBwText_21_15:
	.string "Lenora: What's up?!\pSomeone just walked away with an\nexhibit, that's what's up!$"
gBwText_21_16:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, hi, {STR_VAR_1}!\nWhat's everybody doing here?$"
gBwText_21_17:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, is there\nsome kind of problem?$"
gBwText_21_18:
	.string "Lenora: And these two are...?\pYour friends?\p...\n...\pBianca and Cheren...\nOh, I see. They're Trainers.\pOK, then. Let's split up and search.\nI'll head this way.$"
gBwText_21_19:
	.string "Everyone!\pCheren and Bianca,\nI want you to stay here at the museum.$"
gBwText_21_20:
	.string "Burgh and {STR_VAR_1},\nyou two search Pinwheel Forest!\pGot it?\nBurgh, you show the way!\pI'm counting on you, everyone!$"
gBwText_21_21:
	.string "Burgh: Uh-huh.\nYou are...{STR_VAR_1}, is it?\pAre you raring to round up\nour robbers?$"
gBwText_21_22:
	.string "Burgh: Uh-huh.\nYou are...{STR_VAR_1}, is it?\pAre you raring to round up\nour robbers?$"
gBwText_21_23:
	.string "Bianca: Oh! Oh, {STR_VAR_1}!\nTake this with you!\pFennel gave me this Dowsing Machine\nto give you.$"
gBwText_21_24:
	.string "Now, what did she tell me? Um...\pYou can use the Dowsing Machine to find\nplaces where items are hidden. So you\lcan find stuff you can't even see!$"
gBwText_21_25:
	.string "Cheren: For now, all we need to do is\nprotect the museum, right?$"
gBwText_21_26:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, wait for me!$"
gBwText_21_27:
	.string "Lenora: It doesn't look like there are\nany members of Team Plasma over here...\lI think I'd better stay here, though.\pPlease head to Pinwheel Forest\nand search very carefully!$"
gBwText_21_28:
	.string "These old textile factories\nand storehouses were abandoned.\pBut enterprising young people\nstarted using them as studios.\pThat could be called the beginning of\nNacrene City, the city of art.$"
gBwText_21_29:
	.string "That warehouse...\nThey're selling something good inside.$"
gBwText_21_30:
	.string "Even though it's just an old warehouse,\nit's become so popular...\pIt makes me take a second look at\nwhat I think things are worth.$"
gBwText_21_31:
	.string "Nacrene City is a highly fashionable\nand admired locale!\pContrariwise, if you happen to be a bit\nordinary, here that's cool in its own\lway.$"
gBwText_21_32:
	.string "How do you like the sound of\naccordions?$"
gBwText_21_33:
	.string "Nacrene City\nA Pearl of a Place$"
gBwText_21_34:
	.string "Café Warehouse\nTry our delicious Wednesday specials!$"
gBwText_21_35:
	.string "Nacrene City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Lenora\lAn Archeologist with Backbone$"
gBwText_21_36:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Alder told me what's\ngoing on.\p{STR_VAR_1}, you got caught up\nin something serious, it seems...$"
gBwText_21_37:
	.string "Lenora: Is this it?$"
gBwText_21_38:
	.string "Bianca: Whoa. Isn't that the...stone...\nfound in the Desert Resort?$"
gBwText_21_39:
	.string "Lenora: Yes, that's right, but is this\nreally a Dragon-type Pokémon?$"
gBwText_21_40:
	.string "Cedric: Surely... When I investigated\nDragonspiral Tower, I found elements\lthat were dated to the same era as this\lDark Stone!$"
gBwText_21_41:
	.string "Cedric: Surely... When I investigated\nDragonspiral Tower, I found elements\lthat were dated to the same era as this\lLight Stone!$"
gBwText_21_42:
	.string "Professor Juniper: ...I looked into that.$"
gBwText_21_43:
	.string "Lenora: Impressive, as always.$"
gBwText_21_44:
	.string "Bianca: But, you know, we're lucky...\n'Cause what if Team Plasma, like,\lnoticed that old stone that time...$"
gBwText_21_45:
	.string "Lenora: That's a good point.\pIt's clear to me that they were\ntrying to steal the Dragon Skull so\lthey could revive the legendary\lDragon-type Pokémon.$"
gBwText_21_46:
	.string "If you would, {STR_VAR_1}, take this...$"
gBwText_21_47:
	.string "Alder: Wait a moment, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_21_48:
	.string "If you take this Dark Stone, that\nmeans you'll be the one to battle N\lif anything happens to me.\pAre you really OK with that?$"
gBwText_21_49:
	.string "If you take this Light Stone, that\nmeans you'll be the one to battle N\lif anything happens to me.\pAre you really OK with that?$"
gBwText_21_50:
	.string "Alder: I understand. You are determined\nto take on this duty.\pThen, here it is.\nPrepare yourself. Be strong.$"
gBwText_21_51:
	.string "Alder: So, you're just going to allow\nN to fulfill his plans for a new world?\pA world where Pokémon and Trainers\nare separated?$"
gBwText_21_52:
	.string "Alder: Still, I must ask you...\nSincerely, I must ask you...\pTake this stone.\nJust in case it's needed!$"
gBwText_21_53:
	.string "Alder: I am deeply sorry.\nI wish I didn't have to burden you.\pThis world of ours, where Pokémon\nand people live together...\pPlease...\nIf anything happens to me, protect it!$"
gBwText_21_54:
	.string "Lenora: ...I see.\pIf things don't go as planned,\nyou'll use this Dark Stone.\pYou'll protect the ideal future\nfor us and Pokémon.\p{STR_VAR_1}, we're counting on you.\nPlease take care of yourself.$"
gBwText_21_55:
	.string "Lenora: ...I see.\pIf things don't go as planned,\nyou'll use this Light Stone.\pYou'll protect the true future\nfor us and Pokémon.\p{STR_VAR_1}, we're counting on you.\nPlease take care of yourself.$"
gBwText_21_56:
	.string "Cedric: ...\pSo, how do we wake the Dragon-type\nPokémon from the stone, then?$"
gBwText_21_57:
	.string "Huh?$"
gBwText_21_58:
	.string "...$"
gBwText_21_59:
	.string "Umm...$"
gBwText_21_60:
	.string "Lenora: That's it!\nWe've got them, don't we?$"
gBwText_21_61:
	.string "Alder: Ah-hah. We've got those two.$"
gBwText_21_62:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\nGo to Opelucid City.\pThe Gym Leader of that city\nuses Dragon-type Pokémon.\pThe Gym Leader could know something.\nI'll go ahead and wait for you there!\pUntil then!$"
gBwText_21_63:
	.string "Professor Juniper: That's right!\pOpelucid City's Iris might know\nsomething!$"
gBwText_21_64:
	.string "Professor Juniper: That's right!\pOpelucid City's Drayden might\nknow something!$"
gBwText_21_65:
	.string "Cedric: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\pNever forget that you always\nhave Pokémon right by your side.$"
gBwText_21_66:
	.string "Professor Juniper: I'm going to head\nback to the lab and do some research...\pI'll see if I can uncover what kinds of\nbeings these legendary Dragon-type\lPokémon are and if there is any way\lto awaken them...$"
gBwText_21_67:
	.string "Lenora: Don't worry!\pIf we have something for you,\nwe'll come running to find you!$"
gBwText_21_68:
	.string "Lenora: Don't worry!\pIf we have something for you,\nwe'll come running to find you!$"
gBwText_21_69:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh. Sounds real serious...\nUm, that's about all I got out of it.\p{STR_VAR_1}, do you know Opelucid City?\pWhen you leave from Icirrus City\nand, like, cross the Tubeline Bridge,\lit's on the other side. Umm...\pI'm not that great with directions, so\nif you need more, check your Town Map,\lOK?$"
gBwText_21_70:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh. Sounds real serious...\nUm, that's about all I got out of it.\p{STR_VAR_1}, do you know Opelucid City?\pWhen you leave from Icirrus City\nand, like, cross the Tubeline Bridge,\lit's on the other side. Umm...\pI'm not that great with directions, so\nif you need more, check your Town Map,\lOK?$"
