gBwText_22_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Nacrene Museum!$"
gBwText_22_1:
	.string "Those robbers... What in the world is\nTeam Plasma?$"
gBwText_22_2:
	.string "You can get to the Pokémon Gym by going\nto the back of the museum!$"
gBwText_22_3:
	.string "What do they plan to accomplish by\nstealing the Dragon Skull?$"
gBwText_22_4:
	.string "Wow! Whenever I look at this skeleton,\nI'm...fascinated.$"
gBwText_22_5:
	.string "Welcome! I'm Hawes, the\nassistant director.\pSince you were kind enough to visit,\nI'll give you a tour of the museum.$"
gBwText_22_6:
	.string "This skeleton is of a Dragon-type\nPokémon.\pThere's a theory that it had an\naccident while it was flying around the\lworld, and so it became a Fossil.$"
gBwText_22_7:
	.string "This rock is amazing! It's a meteorite!\pIt contains some kind of energy\nfrom space.$"
gBwText_22_8:
	.string "Oh, this? It's an ordinary old stone.\pIt was found near the desert, but other\nthan the fact that it's old, it doesn't\lseem to have any value...\pWe only display it because it's rather\npretty to look at.$"
gBwText_22_9:
	.string "The Pokémon Gym is just beyond here.$"
gBwText_22_10:
	.string "At the end of the Gym, a very strong\nand kind Gym Leader is waiting.\pBy the way, the Gym Leader Lenora\nhappens to be my wife!$"
gBwText_22_11:
	.string "At the end of the Gym, a very strong\nand kind Gym Leader is waiting.\pBy the way, the Gym Leader Lenora\nhappens to be my wife!$"
gBwText_22_12:
	.string "Lenora: Now, you wait!\nEnough fooling around!$"
gBwText_22_13:
	.string "Team Plasma: So you've come, Gym\nLeader.\pWe, Team Plasma, claim this museum's\nDragon Skull in the name of\lPokémon liberation!$"
gBwText_22_14:
	.string "Team Plasma: To show you we're serious,\nwe'll steal it right before your eyes!$"
gBwText_22_15:
	.string "Team Plasma: Well, then, here's\nour smoke screen!$"
gBwText_22_16:
	.string "Plasmaaaa!$"
gBwText_22_17:
	.string "Plasmaaaa!$"
gBwText_22_18:
	.string "Lenora: What's going on?$"
gBwText_22_19:
	.string "Hawes: Oh! Oh! We have to go after them!$"
gBwText_22_20:
	.string "Hawes: Lenora loves that skull...$"
gBwText_22_21:
	.string "Bianca: I won't forgive those thieves!$"
gBwText_22_22:
	.string "Cheren: So I can't battle the Gym\nLeader because of Team Plasma, huh...\pWhat a bother.$"
gBwText_22_23:
	.string "Skeletal specimens are so mysterious...\pFrom the outside, you can't see their\nfunctional, efficient design.\pIt's almost as if it is an embodiment of\ntheir former essence... So fascinating!$"
gBwText_22_24:
	.string "Rare Pokémon from around the world...\nMuseums are packed with adventure!$"
gBwText_22_25:
	.string "My oh my oh my!$"
gBwText_22_26:
	.string "The Gym Leader here studies Fossils and\nancient artifacts.$"
gBwText_22_27:
	.string "Those thugs sure were bold...\pIt's almost as if they believe they are\ndoing the right thing.$"
gBwText_22_28:
	.string "Perhaps there is a Pokémon that came\nfrom space along with this meteorite.$"
gBwText_22_29:
	.string "What in the world could Team Plasma\nbe thinking?!$"
gBwText_22_30:
	.string "This is a skeletal specimen from a\nPokémon that flew around the world.$"
gBwText_22_31:
	.string "Part of the skeleton was stolen by\nTeam Plasma and is missing!$"
gBwText_22_32:
	.string "It's a Fossil of a Pokémon that was\nprotected by a very hard shell.$"
gBwText_22_33:
	.string "A meteor that has a space virus\nattached to it.$"
gBwText_22_34:
	.string "An ancient round stone that was buried\nin the desert.$"
gBwText_22_35:
	.string "A plate with an unknown script carved\ninto it.$"
gBwText_22_36:
	.string "A mask that ancient people used to wear\nat festivals.$"
gBwText_22_37:
	.string "Bones that were once carried as\nweapons by a certain kind of Pokémon.$"
