gBwText_23_0:
	.string "A Pokémon Gym where a Leader waits for\na challenger at the back of a museum...\lIt has a great atmosphere, doesn't it?\pSo... I will give this to you!$"
gBwText_23_1:
	.string "All Trainers in this Gym use\nNormal-type Pokémon.\pThis is just between you and me...\pNormal-type Pokémon are weak against\nFighting-type Pokémon.\pAround here, Fighting-type Pokémon\nshow up around Pinwheel Forest.\pNow, I will explain about the Gym itself!\pIn this Pokémon Gym, if you answer\nquestions hidden in books,\lyou can move forward.\pFor your information, the first book is\n“Nice to Meet You, Pokémon.“\pIf you don't know where the book is,\nplease ask anyone!$"
gBwText_23_2:
	.string "All Trainers in this Gym use\nNormal-type Pokémon.\pThis is just between you and me...\pNormal-type Pokémon are weak against\nFighting-type Pokémon.\pAround here, Fighting-type Pokémon\nshow up around Pinwheel Forest.\pNow, I will explain about the Gym itself!\pIn this Pokémon Gym, if you answer\nquestions hidden in books,\lyou can move forward.\pFor your information, the first book is\n“Nice to Meet You, Pokémon.“\pIf you don't know where the book is,\nplease ask anyone!$"
gBwText_23_3:
	.string "I love to compare the expressions when\na Trainer comes here for the first time\land when a Trainer wins the Gym Badge.$"
gBwText_23_4:
	.string "Did you hear it? Strange people came\ncharging through the museum...\pOh! The Gym Badge!! Congratulations!\pSo, the museum!\nOh, no. What shall we do?!$"
gBwText_23_5:
	.string "Nacrene Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Lenora\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_23_6:
	.string "Nacrene Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Lenora\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_23_7:
	.string "Nacrene Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Lenora\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
gBwText_23_8:
	.string "Oh?\nAre you looking for a book?\p...I think “Nice to Meet You, Pokémon“\nis on a shelf near the entrance.$"
gBwText_23_9:
	.string "Hello, Trainer!\pYou've found a memo already, and\nyou're looking for a book about\lPokémon?\pTee hee! In fact, I am also reading a\nbook about Pokémon. It's about Tepig.\pI wonder if the first Pokémon you met\nin this Gym was Tepig?$"
gBwText_23_10:
	.string "Tee hee! What a pity!\pThe first Pokémon you met in this Gym\nwas not Tepig!\pTry to remember the Pokémon you\nbattled at the entrance of the Gym.\pThere's a hint on the bookshelf\nto the left!$"
gBwText_23_11:
	.string "Tee hee! OK!\pWhat was the Pokémon you battled\nat the entrance of the Gym?\pThere's a hint on the bookshelf\nto the left!$"
gBwText_23_12:
	.string "What was the first Pokémon you met\nin this Gym?\pThere's a hint on the bookshelf\nto the left!$"
gBwText_23_13:
	.string "You found the second memo, and you're\nlooking for a book?\p...What does the memo say?\p“Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head\lwhile it runs.“\pI'm reading a book about Tepig, but\nis this book the correct answer?$"
gBwText_23_14:
	.string "Tee hee! What a pity!\nThis book about Tepig says:\p“It gives off flame from its nostrils.\nWhen it's not well, it can give off\lonly smoke.“\pThat's slightly different from “it\ngives off smoke from its head while it\lruns.”\p...The answer to this memo may not be\na living thing. Tee hee!$"
gBwText_23_15:
	.string "Wow! Great! That's correct!\pThe book that I am reading says:\p“It gives off flame from its nostrils.\nWhen it's not well, it can give off\lonly smoke.“\pIt's slightly different from “it gives\noff smoke from its head while it runs.”\p...The answer to this memo may not be\na living thing. Tee hee!$"
gBwText_23_16:
	.string "“Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while\lit runs.“\pDid you figure it out?\p...The answer to this memo may not be\na living thing! Tee hee!$"
gBwText_23_17:
	.string "Have you already found the third memo?\nPretty good!\p...So, what does the memo say?\p“If you heat it up in a pot,\nit'll be delicious. What is this?“\pThe book I am reading is about Tepig...\pBut you don't think this book\nabout Tepig is the answer, do you?!$"
gBwText_23_18:
	.string "Oh, I know you're just kidding!\p...It reminds me. In the past, I've seen\nsweets made by heating up Berries.\pNow, what were they called?$"
gBwText_23_19:
	.string "Of course you don't!\p...It reminds me. In the past, I've seen\nsweets made by heating up Berries.\pNow, what were they called?$"
gBwText_23_20:
	.string "In the past, I've seen sweets made by\nheating up Berries.\pNow, what were they called?$"
gBwText_23_21:
	.string "...I'm wondering, did you see the last\nmemo and come to me?\pOK. I'll give you the last question!\p“Can you challenge the Gym Leader\nif you win against me?“$"
gBwText_23_22:
	.string "Tee hee! That is correct!\nWell, here we go, Trainer!$"
gBwText_23_23:
	.string "Hmmmmm...\nWhat a pity!\pI will tell you the answer\nif you win against me!$"
gBwText_23_24:
	.string "You'll meet the Gym Leader soon.\nThis is the last book.\pNow! Read the last book!$"
gBwText_23_25:
	.string "You'll meet the Gym Leader soon.\nThis is the last book!$"
gBwText_23_26:
	.string "Going through a maze in the\nlibrary and defeating the Gym Leader!\pYou...must be a very studious Trainer.$"
gBwText_23_27:
	.string "...Hmhm. I see.\pOh! The book I am reading now is called\n“The Structure of a Locomotive.“\pIf you'd like to read this book,\nplease let me know.$"
gBwText_23_28:
	.string "...Hmhm. I see.\pOh! Did you find the memo and come here\nto look for this book?\pWhat does the memo say?\p“Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while it\lruns.“\pI'm reading a book called\n“The Structure of a Locomotive.”\pIs this book the correct answer?$"
gBwText_23_29:
	.string "Oh!\nThat is correct!\p“Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while it\lruns.“\pThat's exactly how a locomotive looks!\nWell, I'll let you read this book.\pBut, before that...\pIt would be great for my research\nif we had a Pokémon battle.$"
gBwText_23_30:
	.string "Hmmm...\nWhat a pity!\p“Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while it\lruns.“\pThat's exactly how a locomotive looks!\p...Well, as a special treat, I'll let you\nread this book.\pBut, before that...\pIt would be great for my research\nif we had a Pokémon battle.$"
gBwText_23_31:
	.string "Return a book to a shelf after\nreading... This is a rule when you read a\lbook.$"
gBwText_23_32:
	.string "Return a book to a shelf after\nreading... This is a rule when you read a\lbook.$"
gBwText_23_33:
	.string "This is the bookshelf\nfor “General Studies.“$"
gBwText_23_34:
	.string "This is the bookshelf\nfor “Pokémon.“$"
gBwText_23_35:
	.string "This is the bookshelf\nfor “Children's Books.“$"
gBwText_23_36:
	.string "“Potions Are Great!“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_37:
	.string "“The Structure of a Locomotive“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_38:
	.string "“Techniques for Pokémon Battles“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_39:
	.string "“The System of a Pokémon Center“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_40:
	.string "“The Biology of Patrat“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_41:
	.string "“The Biology of Snivy“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_42:
	.string "“The Biology of Oshawott“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_43:
	.string "“The Biology of Tepig“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_44:
	.string "“Connect the Dots to Draw Pokémon“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_45:
	.string "“Nice to Meet You, Pokémon!“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_46:
	.string "“Adventure on Route 3“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_47:
	.string "“Sweets for Pokémon“\nDo you want to read this book?$"
gBwText_23_48:
	.string "It describes the structure and\ncorrect use of Potions.\pIt also offers tips for applying\nPotions to mischievous Pokémon.$"
gBwText_23_49:
	.string "This is a book about a locomotive.\pFlame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while it\lruns by using steam power!$"
gBwText_23_50:
	.string "It describes the best timing\nto switch Pokémon in battle.\pYou should switch out your Pokémon\nbefore you think it's in danger!$"
gBwText_23_51:
	.string "It describes how a\nPokémon Center works.\pIt also describes a typical day of a\nwoman who works there.$"
gBwText_23_52:
	.string "It describes the biology of Patrat.\pThey communicate with each other by\nmovement of their tails. A Patrat raises\lits tail when it sees an enemy.$"
gBwText_23_53:
	.string "It describes the biology of Snivy.\pIf they expose their tails to the sun\nby basking in a sunny place, they are in\lthe middle of photosynthesis.$"
gBwText_23_54:
	.string "It describes the biology of Oshawott.\pThe scalchop on its belly is very hard\nand grows from its bellybutton.\pOshawott use it as a tool.$"
gBwText_23_55:
	.string "It describes the biology of Tepig.\pFlame burns inside its body, and\nit gives off flame from its nostrils.\pWhen it's not well, it can give off\nonly smoke.$"
gBwText_23_56:
	.string "It's a connect-the-dots book with\nlots of Pokémon pictures.$"
gBwText_23_57:
	.string "It's a fairy tale about a little boy\nwho met a Pokémon for\lthe first time in his life.\pHe is with a small brown Pokémon.$"
gBwText_23_58:
	.string "It's a story about a boy with Pokémon\nembarking on a great adventure.\pTwo boys and a girl are having\nadventures together.$"
gBwText_23_59:
	.string "It describes delicious sweets made by\nheating Berries in a pot.\pThere are sweets called “Poffins“\nmade from Berries in the faraway\lSinnoh region, and Pokémon love them!$"
gBwText_23_60:
	.string "There is a memo on the back cover...\p“It's impressive you found this place!\pThat's what I'd expect from a\nchallenger like you!\pWell, this is the third question!\pQ: If you heat it up in a pot, it'll be\ndelicious. What is this?\pThe hint is on a bookshelf closer to\nthe entrance than here!“$"
gBwText_23_61:
	.string "There is a memo on the back cover...\p“As I thought, that question was easy.\nWell, this is the second question!\pQ: Flame burns inside its body, and it\ngives off smoke from its head while\lit runs...\lWhat is this book?\pThe hint is...\nSomebody may be reading it.“$"
gBwText_23_62:
	.string "There is a memo between the pages!\p“You've managed to get here. Well done!\pYou seem to have wisdom as well as\nstrength! I look forward to our battle!\pGym Leader Lenora“$"
gBwText_23_63:
	.string "There is a memo between the pages...\p“Pokémon Trainers!\nI am the Gym Leader, Lenora!\pI hid four memos in this library. \nEach of them has a question.\pCan you solve the questions and \ncome find me?\pNow, this is the first question!\pQ: What is the first Pokémon you met\nin this Gym?\pThe hint is...\non a bookshelf in the middle row!\pNow, try to find it!“$"
gBwText_23_64:
	.string "There is a memo on the cover...\p“Did you manage to get here without\nbeing tricked by the questions?\pNow, this is the last question!\pQ: From this bookshelf... Move two\nbackward, move one to the left, move\ltwo forward, move one to the right, and\lmove one backward... Now, where is it?\pThe hint is...\nFind it by yourself!“$"
gBwText_23_65:
	.string "...\pThis is not the book you're looking for.$"
gBwText_23_66:
	.string "Click!\pThere is a switch\nunder the book!$"
gBwText_23_67:
	.string "Wow!\nA hidden staircase!$"
	.align 2
