gBwText_24_0:
	.string "Welcome!\pThe director of the Nacrene Museum\nand the Nacrene Gym's Leader\lis me! Lenora!\pWell then, challenger,\nI'm going to research\lhow you battle with the\lPokémon you've so lovingly raised!$"
gBwText_24_1:
	.string "Your fighting style is so enchanting.\nIt is charming.\pYou are a Pokémon Trainer\nworthy of receiving this Basic Badge!$"
gBwText_24_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received\nthe Basic Badge from Lenora!$"
gBwText_24_3:
	.string "If you have two Badges, traded\nPokémon up to Lv. 30 will obey you.\pHere, I also want you to have this TM.$"
gBwText_24_4:
	.string "Retaliate does a lot more damage if an\nally fainted the turn before you use it!\pIf you master the timing, you can\ndefeat even strong opponents.$"
gBwText_24_5:
	.string "Some problems you can't solve even if\nyou think about them your whole life.\pSome problems have different answers\ndepending on the person.\pStill, the reason I can't keep my\ncuriosity down is this:\lI want to figure out the truth, but I\lalso have a desire for adventure!$"
gBwText_24_6:
	.string "Deeear!$"
gBwText_24_7:
	.string "Hawes: Dear! Come quickly!\pTeam Plasma is threatening to steal\nsome bones!$"
gBwText_24_8:
	.string "Lenora: What? What's going on?!\p{STR_VAR_1}!\nYou come, too!$"
gBwText_24_9:
	.string "Lenora: Oh, it's you!\pAs always, you're raising your Pokémon\nwith a lot of love!\pBy the way, ol' Clay contacted me\nrecently.\pHe said you can find Pokémon Fossils\nin Twist Mountain!\pGo check it out if you like!$"
gBwText_24_10:
	.string "Lenora's research materials are stored\nin an orderly fashion.$"
gBwText_24_11:
	.string "The bones Lenora is using for research\nare on display.$"
