gBwText_25_0:
	.string "Hi, Trainer! Do you know a Pokémon\ncalled Audino?\pIt's a Pokémon that I sometimes find\nwhen I'm walking.\pIt jumps out of rustling grass.\nI can get a lot of Exp. Points.\pIt's kind of a friendly Pokémon, isn't\nit?$"
gBwText_25_1:
	.string "I heard that the Fossils in the museum\nwere found in Twist Mountain.\pThen, a person called Clay apparently\ndonated them to the museum.$"
gBwText_25_2:
	.string "When you choose “HELP“\nat the PC at a Pokémon Center,\lyou can learn many things. It's so cool!$"
