gBwText_27_0:
	.string "I play the guitar and have\nPokémon battles every day.\pI keep doing that 'cause I enjoy it!$"
gBwText_27_1:
	.string "Even the same kind of Pokémon can have\ndifferent natures!$"
gBwText_27_2:
	.string "I am a poet...\nI write poems.\pEvery day, I stretch my imagination and\ndevote myself to my creative activity.\pPeople dream when sleeping, but if a\nPokémon dreams...\pI cannot even imagine how it is...$"
gBwText_27_3:
	.string "I am a poet...\nI write poems.\pEvery day, I stretch my imagination and\ndevote myself to my creative activity.\pPeople dream when sleeping, but\nif a Pokémon dreams...\pJust thinking about it fuels\nmy imagination.\pPokémon probably enjoy sleeping, too!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_27
