	.global gBwTextCount_27
gBwTextCount_27:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_28_0:
	.string "Hi! Do you have a Pokémon called\n{STR_VAR_1}?\pWould you like to trade your {STR_VAR_1}\nfor my {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_28_1:
	.string "Wow. Thanks!\nThen, let's trade!$"
gBwText_28_2:
	.string "Yay! Please take good care of\nmy {STR_VAR_2}!\pI will take good care of your\n{STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_28_3:
	.string "I'd like to trade for a {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_28_4:
	.string "It's OK if you don't want to...\pBut if you change your mind, let's\ntrade Pokémon!$"
gBwText_28_5:
	.string "Thanks to our Pokémon, you and I\nbecame friends!$"
gBwText_28_6:
	.string "The {STR_VAR_1} that I got from you has\ngrown up and become very strong!\pLet's have a battle!$"
gBwText_28_7:
	.string "Yay! I'll show off how I trained\nthis Pokémon!$"
gBwText_28_8:
	.string "I want to show you how {STR_VAR_1}\nhas grown up...$"
gBwText_28_9:
	.string "I had a great time!\pI traded my Pokémon with yours, and\non top of that, we had a great battle.\pI'm so happy to be with Pokémon!$"
gBwText_28_10:
	.string "Oh my, what a lovely Trainer!\nWhat kind of Pokémon do you have?\pOh, your {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_28_11:
	.string "It's very friendly toward you!\nIt must be happy with you.$"
gBwText_28_12:
	.string "It's a little bit friendly to you...\nSomething like that.$"
gBwText_28_13:
	.string "Hmmm...\nIt may still take some time.$"
gBwText_28_14:
	.string "Fwish fwish!$"
gBwText_28_15:
	.string "Pwoof...$"
gBwText_28_16:
	.string "Pokémon you get through trades\ngrow up fast. But be careful!\pIf a traded Pokémon grows up too much,\nit won't listen to you.\pBut if you have a lot of Badges, you'll\nbe OK.$"
	.align 2
