gBwText_29_0:
	.string "DS Wireless Communications is great!\pWe can trade Pokémon with people\nwho are far away!$"
gBwText_29_1:
	.string "Just now, I traded a Pokémon holding an\nitem! So, it's like the item is a present!$"
gBwText_29_2:
	.string "Dire Hit? In Unova, it's called Dire Hit.\nHuh? No difference?\p...Anyway, in a battle, it's very\npowerful when a move is a critical hit!$"
gBwText_29_3:
	.string "I started a shop in this warehouse!$"
	.align 2
