gBwText_30_0:
	.string "Burgh used this warehouse until\ntwo years ago!\pWhen Burgh gets artist's block,\nhe comes back here to Nacrene City!$"
gBwText_30_1:
	.string "Burgh is an artist, and also the\nGym Leader in Castelia City.\lWe want to be like him!$"
gBwText_30_2:
	.string "That thing you have is a Pokédex,\nisn't it?\pWow! Coooooool! You collect Pokémon!\nOK! I'll help you.\pWhich Pokémon did you choose at the\nbeginning of your journey?$"
gBwText_30_3:
	.string "You have Snivy! Then I will give you\nthis!\pWhen you let your Pokémon hold it, it\ncan raise the power of Grass-type\lmoves!$"
gBwText_30_4:
	.string "You have Oshawott! Then I will give\nyou this!\pWhen you let your Pokémon hold it, it\ncan raise the power of Water-type\lmoves!$"
gBwText_30_5:
	.string "You have Tepig! Then I will give you\nthis!\pWhen you let your Pokémon hold it, it\ncan raise the power of Fire-type moves!$"
gBwText_30_6:
	.string "A lot of items have effects when\nPokémon hold them, so try to find them!\pWell, work hard to fill up your Pokédex!\nGood luck!$"
gBwText_30_7:
	.string "Snivy$"
gBwText_30_8:
	.string "Oshawott$"
gBwText_30_9:
	.string "Tepig$"
gBwText_30_10:
	.string "Quit$"
gBwText_30_11:
	.string "Do you have Snivy?$"
gBwText_30_12:
	.string "Do you have Oshawott?$"
gBwText_30_13:
	.string "Do you have Tepig?$"
gBwText_30_14:
	.string "Then, what is the Pokémon you chose\nat the beginning of your journey?$"
gBwText_30_15:
	.string "If you want to tell me, please speak\nto me!$"
	.align 2
