gBwText_31_0:
	.string "Welcome to Café Warehouse,\na stylish café in a rural area!$"
gBwText_31_1:
	.string "Welcome to Café Warehouse,\na stylish café in a rural area!\pOur café has a special on Wednesdays!\nHere, have a Soda Pop!\pEnjoy the taste of our specialty!$"
gBwText_31_2:
	.string "Enjoy the taste of our specialty!$"
gBwText_31_3:
	.string "This café has a special on Wednesdays!$"
gBwText_31_4:
	.string "As far as I'm concerned, it doesn't\nmatter that the café is in a rural area\lthat nobody knows.$"
gBwText_31_5:
	.string "Do you know about the Battle Box?\pI heard it is a useful function you can\nuse at the Pokémon Center.$"
gBwText_31_6:
	.string "The Striaton City Gym Leaders are a\ngreat triplet combo!\pThe Grass-type Pokémon user, Cilan,\nchooses great tea leaves.\pThe Water-type Pokémon user, Cress,\nprepares the best water.\pAnd the Fire-type Pokémon user, Chili,\npours hot water at the right heat.\pNo wonder their tea is the best!$"
gBwText_31_7:
	.string "When you battle with a friend using\nwireless communications, you can use\litems using a Wonder Launcher!$"
gBwText_31_8:
	.string "Yes, I know!\pIf you have a Wonder Launcher, energy\nwill be charged, and you can use\lvarious items.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_31
