gBwText_33_0:
	.string "Burgh: That way!\pM'hm. There, heading toward the Gym?!$"
gBwText_33_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_33_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_33_3:
	.string "When work's finally over...\pWhen my thrown Poké Ball rocks three\ntimes and I hear that great “click“...\pMy life is full of things that give me\njoy!$"
gBwText_33_4:
	.string "I'm a battling Clerk ?!\n...But my Pokémon are weak.$"
gBwText_33_5:
	.string "Busy, busy!\pAfter I eat breakfast, I have to think\nabout lunch.\pAfter eating lunch, I worry about\ndinner. Every day's the same. What a\lbusy life!$"
gBwText_33_6:
	.string "Hey there, Trainer!\nAre your Pokémon healthy?\pBeing healthy's the best, because when\nyou're healthy, you can do anything!$"
gBwText_33_7:
	.string "...Grumble, grumble, grumble.\pShould I change my Pokémon's moves,\nor should I change my Pokémon?\pGrumble, grumble...$"
gBwText_33_8:
	.string "Castelia City has so many people!\pSometimes there are people who are only\ninterested in themselves.$"
gBwText_33_9:
	.string "My favorite way to spend my lunch break\nis watching ships at the dock.$"
gBwText_33_10:
	.string "Working women are beautiful, and\nbattling Pokémon are wonderful!$"
gBwText_33_11:
	.string "At the Battle Company, we welcome\nTrainers who are proud of their skills.$"
gBwText_33_12:
	.string "Next time, I'll do it! Next time, I want\nto eat a Casteliacone for sure!$"
gBwText_33_13:
	.string "Castelia City\nA City of Grandeur$"
gBwText_33_14:
	.string "$"
gBwText_33_15:
	.string "Ahead: Castelia Street\nOcean Side: Cruise Dock$"
gBwText_33_16:
	.string "Ahead: Mode Street\nOcean Side: Prime Pier$"
gBwText_33_17:
	.string "Ahead: Narrow Street\nOcean Side: Unity Pier$"
gBwText_33_18:
	.string "Ahead: Pokémon Gym\nOcean Side: Liberty Pier$"
gBwText_33_19:
	.string "Passerby Analytics HQ\n...People pass by as they walk along.$"
gBwText_33_20:
	.string "Battle Company\nTalented Trainers Welcome!$"
	.align 2
