gBwText_34_0:
	.string "Thanks again for your help.\pMy bug Pokémon are scurrying with\nexcitement about getting to battle\lyou.\pLet's get straight to it!$"
gBwText_34_1:
	.string "Aww...\nI lost.\pWhatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me\nbecause you are a-MAZ-ingly strong!\pThis is the Gym Badge!\nYou beat me, so it's yours!$"
gBwText_34_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the\nInsect Badge from Burgh.$"
gBwText_34_3:
	.string "It's the Insect Badge!\nIt's insectible--I mean, incredible!\pIf you have three Badges,\nPokémon up to Lv. 40 will obey you,\lincluding traded Pokémon.\pBecause I'm a generous guy,\nI'll also give you this.$"
gBwText_34_4:
	.string "Struggle Bug also lowers the\nSp. Atk of the target that was damaged.\pI'm the best guy to tell you,\nit's the little things that count!$"
gBwText_34_5:
	.string "How many discoveries have you made\nsince you started your adventure?\pWhen I was a kid, my innocent heart was\ncaptured by the beauty of bug Pokémon.\pI drew with them and battled with them,\nand after all this time, I continue\lto discover new things.\pA world shared with Pokémon is a world\nswarming with mysteries.$"
gBwText_34_6:
	.string "Burgh: Heya!\nThis is what I do.\pI keep raising Pokémon and drawing\npictures inspired by the Pokémon I\lraise.\pIt's what I love to do. My life hums\nwith energy. What could be better?$"
gBwText_34_7:
	.string "When you step on the switch,\nthe one that pops out is--moi!\pOn that note, have a battle with moi!$"
gBwText_34_8:
	.string "Hiding makes battle instincts dull,\nyou know.$"
gBwText_34_9:
	.string "Now. Come. On.\pStep on this switch, and what happens?\nMoi!$"
gBwText_34_10:
	.string "Yeeeeeeeeah! Thank you for going\nto the trouble of calling me out!\pI'll channel my gratitude into my\nPokémon's moves and...\lmake sure it gets to you!$"
gBwText_34_11:
	.string "If you hadn't stepped on that switch,\nI'd still be stuck hidden away.\pThat's right! Bug Gym Trainers like to\nbe bugged!$"
gBwText_34_12:
	.string "Hiding beneath the floor, I understand\nhow a Bug-type Pokémon feels.$"
gBwText_34_13:
	.string "What do you think of Castelia City?\pI bet, with all of the bustling people,\nyou started feeling worn down on your\lway to the Gym!\pNever mind! This will help. Take it!$"
gBwText_34_14:
	.string "The theme of this Gym is\nwalking through walls.\pAt first glance, these funny honey\nwalls may look impassable or even\limpossible. If you try hard, it'll work\lout. So I say.\pBut...if it doesn't, here's a sweet tip:\nstep on the switches on the floor!$"
gBwText_34_15:
	.string "Wow! That's amazing!\pYou swatted aside our Gym Leader\nBurgh's tricky attacks...\pI can barely imagine how much\nstronger you're going to get!$"
gBwText_34_16:
	.string "The Gym Leader said he was going to\nPrime Pier and left for a little bit.\pYou're welcome to go track him down.$"
gBwText_34_17:
	.string "The Gym Leader said he was going to\nPrime Pier and left for a little bit.\lYou're welcome to go track him down.$"
gBwText_34_18:
	.string "Castelia Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Burgh\nCertified Trainers:\lCheren$"
gBwText_34_19:
	.string "Castelia Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Burgh\nCertified Trainers:\lCheren\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_34_20:
	.string "Castelia Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Burgh\nCertified Trainers:\lCheren\l{STR_VAR_1}\lBianca$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_34
