gBwText_35_0:
	.string "Burgh: That way!\pM'hm. Toward the Gym?!$"
gBwText_35_1:
	.string "Hey, Trainer!\pShow me your paces!\nGive me a whirl!$"
gBwText_35_2:
	.string "All riiight!\nA fight is like a dance!$"
gBwText_35_3:
	.string "Come on, man!\nYou gotta go with the flow!$"
gBwText_35_4:
	.string "Hey hey, Trainer!\pShow me what you can do!\nTake me on for a second!$"
gBwText_35_5:
	.string "All riiight!\nLet's get down!$"
gBwText_35_6:
	.string "How 'bout that! Those were some smooth\nmoves, no doubt!\pBut it'd be even tighter if I had a\ngroup.$"
gBwText_35_7:
	.string "Hey, you!\nWould you talk to the other Dancers?\pIf you invite both of them,\nthe three of us can groove as a team!$"
gBwText_35_8:
	.string "Same outfit as me!\nThat guy's a Dancer!$"
gBwText_35_9:
	.string "The word on the street is...\pWho's that dancin' in a lonely street?\nWho's that dancin' in a port?\pWho can you meet? Word on the street!$"
gBwText_35_10:
	.string "Thanks for talking to him!\nWe're checkin' out our moves!$"
gBwText_35_11:
	.string "Really? I'd sure show you some\nsweet moves if I had a team, though.$"
gBwText_35_12:
	.string "I've got what I needed to find my\ndance! A team! Fantastic!$"
gBwText_35_13:
	.string "Dancers dance!\nThe audience smiles!\lHearts beat with joy!\lEnough happiness to share!$"
gBwText_35_14:
	.string "Thanks, man! I've got the best team in\nthe world here! That's how I feel.$"
gBwText_35_15:
	.string "We communicate by dancing.\pIt's how we say happy things,\nsad things...\lHow we say the world shines brightly!$"
gBwText_35_16:
	.string "All riiight!\nLet's dance!$"
gBwText_35_17:
	.string "Landscapes with people...\nLandscapes with Pokémon...\pEach has power and beauty,\ncompelling me to draw them both.\pOh, my studio is down Mode Street a bit.$"
gBwText_35_18:
	.string "Castelia City, Central Plaza\nAhead: Route 4$"
gBwText_35_19:
	.string "Ahead: Mode Street\nCasteliacones and Studio Castelia$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_35
