gBwText_36_0:
	.string "Cheren: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\nI just challenged the Gym Leader Burgh.$"
gBwText_36_1:
	.string "He's a seasoned Gym Leader.\nHe made me work for that Gym Badge!\pBut for me, Bug-type Pokémon\naren't much of a challenge.$"
gBwText_36_2:
	.string "I'm going to keep winning like this\nagainst all of the Unova region's Gym\lLeaders!\pThen, I'll head for the Pokémon League\nand outperform the Champion!\pIf I do that, everyone will admit\nwhat a strong Trainer I am...\pThat will make me feel truly alive...$"
gBwText_36_3:
	.string "Burgh: Ah hah!\pYou're the one who fought\nTeam Plasma in Pinwheel Forest...\pIf I remember, your name is...\n{STR_VAR_1}!\pCome to challenge the Gym, I suppose?$"
gBwText_36_4:
	.string "Burgh: Ah hah!\pYou're the one who fought\nTeam Plasma in Pinwheel Forest...\pIf I remember, your name is...\p{STR_VAR_1}!\pCome to challenge the Gym, I suppose?$"
gBwText_36_5:
	.string "Aww. Sorry, but could you wait a bit?\pI was informed that Team Plasma\nhas shown up!\pIn fact... Come with me!\nI'm going to the dock at Prime Pier!$"
gBwText_36_6:
	.string "Burgh: This is definitely the place.$"
gBwText_36_7:
	.string "Team Plasma: No one's here! Not a soul!\pNo other Team Plasma members, nor any\nof the Seven Sages, are inside.\p...If you think I'm lying, why don't\nwe have a little battle and find out?$"
gBwText_36_8:
	.string "Team Plasma: Don't scare me like that.\nCome on!$"
gBwText_36_9:
	.string "Team Plasma: I...had a thought!\pI'll take care of this weak-looking\nrunt, so you can show off by handling\lthat tough-looking guy over there!$"
gBwText_36_10:
	.string "Think about how a Pokémon feels when\nit's being used by a pathetic Trainer!$"
gBwText_36_11:
	.string "What's your problem with\ntaking people's Pokémon?!$"
gBwText_36_12:
	.string "Burgh: Oh, please!\n{STR_VAR_1}, I'll leave that one to you!$"
gBwText_36_13:
	.string "Burgh: Oh, please!\n{STR_VAR_1}, I'll leave that one to you!$"
gBwText_36_14:
	.string "Burgh: Looks like our only\noption is to battle them and go on in.$"
gBwText_36_15:
	.string "Team Plasma: This is bad...\pBadbadbadbadbadbadbad!\pBad for Team Plasma!\nOr Plasbad, for short!\pIt's in my best interest to go\nreport to the Seven Sages right now!$"
gBwText_36_16:
	.string "Iris: Phew, we got lost.\pEven with directions from the\nXtransceiver, I couldn't figure it out!$"
gBwText_36_17:
	.string "Burgh: Team Plasma is inside.\pThe stolen Pokémon may be in\nthere as well.\lOK, I'm going in!$"
gBwText_36_18:
	.string "Iris: OK! This time, I'll join the fight!\pCome on, Bianca. You, too!$"
gBwText_36_19:
	.string "Bianca: W-wait!\p{STR_VAR_1}! You come, too!$"
gBwText_36_20:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_36_21:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_36_22:
	.string "What Gym Leaders test is the strength\nof the bond between the challenger\land his or her Pokémon!$"
gBwText_36_23:
	.string "Before challenging the Gym, you'll want\nto be sure you have enough Potions.$"
gBwText_36_24:
	.string "Being a Pokémon Trainer doesn't\nnecessarily make someone stronger.\pBut everyone can love their Pokémon\nand enjoy playing together.$"
gBwText_36_25:
	.string "I have six Poké Balls in my Bag!\pBut, really, what I want is\nGreat Balls and Ultra Balls!\pYou can't buy them at the Poké Mart\nuntil you've collected Badges, though.$"
gBwText_36_26:
	.string "My Pokémon is soooo cute!\pIt always makes me feel better\nwhen I come home!$"
gBwText_36_27:
	.string "Castelia City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Burgh\lPremier Insect Artist$"
	.align 2
