gBwText_37_0:
	.string "In Nimbasa City, where I work,\nI went to see a musical.\pHave you heard about it?\nThe Pokémon Musical?\pPokémon get all dressed up and\ndance to the music!$"
gBwText_37_1:
	.string "Pokémon Trainers on Route 4\nshow combinations with Pokémon\leven during road construction!$"
gBwText_37_2:
	.string "Route 4 Ahead$"
	.align 2
