	.4byte 3
gBwText_38_0:
	.string "I finally get to eat it!\nIt was worth lining up!$"
gBwText_38_1:
	.string "I came all the way from Accumula Town\njust to have a taste!$"
gBwText_38_2:
	.string "These sweets are mega popular!!$"
gBwText_38_3:
	.string "That's a popular store for you!\nIt's amazingly crowded!$"
gBwText_38_4:
	.string "Huh? Oh, here you can buy the dessert\nthat everyone in Castelia City\lis talking about!\pAre you going to get in line?$"
gBwText_38_5:
	.string "I see!\nThe line gets really long!\pBut it's definitely delicious.\nIt's worth lining up!$"
gBwText_38_6:
	.string "I see. Well, it is crowded.\pBut just between you and me,\nit's actually pretty empty today.\pUsually, it's sold out by now.$"
gBwText_38_7:
	.string "Huh? Oh, here you can buy the dessert\nthat everyone in Castelia City\lis talking about!\pBut it looks like I got the last one.\nThey're sold out for today!$"
gBwText_38_8:
	.string "Huh? Oh, here you can buy the dessert\nthat everyone in Castelia City\lis talking about!\pBut it looks like I got the last one.\nThey're sold out for today!\pTry again on a different day!$"
gBwText_38_9:
	.string "How about Castelia City's famous\nCasteliacone!\pIt's $100.\nWould you like to buy one?$"
gBwText_38_10:
	.string "Oh, you really aren't going to buy one?\nThey'll sell out soon!$"
gBwText_38_11:
	.string "Thank you very much!\pWe hope you enjoy the cute appearance\nand the naive flavor!$"
gBwText_38_12:
	.string "Thank you very much!\p...Huh? Oh, dear!\nIt looks like you don't have enough\lmoney. Please come again sometime.$"
gBwText_38_13:
	.string "Thank you very much!\p...Huh? Oh, dear!\nIt looks like your Bag is full.\pPlease come again sometime.$"
gBwText_38_14:
	.string "Even though you waited in line...\nWell, please come again, OK?$"
gBwText_38_15:
	.string "We sell Castelia City's famous\nCasteliacone here!\pBut the owner closes the\nshop for the winter!\pPlease come again when it gets warm!$"
gBwText_38_16:
	.string "Buy$"
gBwText_38_17:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_38_18:
	.string "Studio Castelia$"
gBwText_38_19:
	.string "Castelia's Famous Casteliacone\nClosed during Winter$"
