	.4byte 1
gBwText_40_0:
	.string "Where did I put those sunglasses?$"
gBwText_40_1:
	.string "Ah, I found them.\pAnd you've really got to have more\nlight to see your way by. \pTake this--it'll help you see in\ndark places.$"
gBwText_40_2:
	.string "Meow!\nHow did you find me?!\pYou are something else! So, I'm going to\ngive you something. This!$"
gBwText_40_3:
	.string "If you use the move Flash, the accuracy\nof the opponent's moves goes down.\pWhen you use it twice, the rate to get\nhit by a move will be about half.\p'Cause it means more light!$"
gBwText_40_4:
	.string "If you use the move Flash, the accuracy\nof the opponent's moves goes down.\pWhen you use it twice, the rate to get\nhit by a move will be about half.\p'Cause it means more light!$"
gBwText_40_5:
	.string "Smirk!$"
gBwText_40_6:
	.string "Ehehehe...$"
gBwText_40_7:
	.string "There's not a lot you can do alone.\nThere are more things two people can\ldo.\pThere are even more things three people\ncan do!\pThat's right... I think what's missing\nfrom my dance is company.$"
gBwText_40_8:
	.string "Do you need something?\pWhat...?\nYou're looking for Dancers for a team?\pIt sounds very interesting, but I don't\nwant to do a favor for someone who\lisn't stronger than me.\pHey!\nLet's have a battle!$"
gBwText_40_9:
	.string "OK!\nLet's begin!$"
gBwText_40_10:
	.string "Hmmmm...$"
gBwText_40_11:
	.string "You're going to create a dance team,\naren't you?\pIt sounds very interesting.\nI'd like to join up!$"
gBwText_40_12:
	.string "Café Sonata$"
	.align 2
