	.4byte 13
gBwText_41_0:
	.string "Aren't Pokémon great?\pEven if they're fightin' someone\nbigger than them, up and at 'em they go!$"
gBwText_41_1:
	.string "Hahaha!\nStrength is not in the size of a body.\pIt's in the size of the heart!$"
gBwText_41_2:
	.string "It is small compared to a luxury liner,\nbut the size of a ship doesn't change\lthe feeling of adventure when you're\lout on the open sea.$"
gBwText_41_3:
	.string "Oh! You have a Liberty Pass.\pWould you like to go to Liberty Garden?$"
gBwText_41_4:
	.string "Your timing is perfect.\nThe ship is about to leave.\lPlease get aboard ship and wait.$"
gBwText_41_5:
	.string "If you'd like to go to Liberty Garden,\nplease let me know.$"
gBwText_41_6:
	.string "Would you like to go to Liberty Garden?$"
gBwText_41_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_41_8:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_41
