	.4byte 9
gBwText_42_0:
	.string "Hi! Would you like to go to Unity Tower?$"
gBwText_42_1:
	.string "People are quite different,\ndepending on where they live.\pIt's a bit surprising that rules and\nways of thinking are different just\lbecause the places we live are\ldifferent!$"
gBwText_42_2:
	.string "One person will be on board!\nPlease get on board!$"
gBwText_42_3:
	.string "Unity Tower is a place where Trainers\ngather from all over the world!\pIf you have friends who live far away,\nyou may be able to have a merry reunion!$"
gBwText_42_4:
	.string "Please come again!$"
gBwText_42_5:
	.string "Yes$"
gBwText_42_6:
	.string "No$"
gBwText_42_7:
	.string "What is it?$"
gBwText_42_8:
	.string "Both Pokémon and people will meet their\ndestined partner someday!\pI believe it because my sister who got\nmarried said so!$"
gBwText_42_9:
	.string "I've come to Castelia City to have a\ndance lesson!$"
gBwText_42_10:
	.string "What do you want?\pOh! The dance team! You're going to\nintroduce me to the team!\pOh! Then, before that, let's have a\nPokémon battle!$"
gBwText_42_11:
	.string "I was great in Pokémon lessons!$"
gBwText_42_12:
	.string "If you want me to join your dance team,\nyou've got to be strong!$"
gBwText_42_13:
	.string "What was that?\pOh! The dance team!\nI will join the team!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_42
