gBwText_43_0:
	.string "Burgh: Come on! This way!$"
gBwText_43_1:
	.string "Burgh: Team Plasma...\nThey took this young lady's Pokémon.$"
gBwText_43_2:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, is there\nanything we can do? My Munna...\pTeam Plasma took it...$"
gBwText_43_3:
	.string "???: I heard this lady's scream and\nran after the thief as fast as I could.\pBut this city is so big and so crowded...\nI'm afraid I lost them.$"
gBwText_43_4:
	.string "Burgh: Iris...\nYou did everything you could.$"
gBwText_43_5:
	.string "Iris: But that's so bad!\pTaking people's Pokémon is really bad!\p'Cause it's really nice when\npeople and Pokémon are together!\pThey each have something the other\ndoesn't, and they help each other!$"
gBwText_43_6:
	.string "Bianca: Iris...$"
gBwText_43_7:
	.string "Burgh: Agreed!\nNo fear--we will get that Pokémon back.$"
gBwText_43_8:
	.string "Right, {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_43_9:
	.string "Right, {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_43_10:
	.string "Having said that, finding a person or a\nPokémon here in Castelia City will be\llike finding a needle in a haystack.$"
gBwText_43_11:
	.string "Team Plasma: I spy a Gym Leader?!\pLast time went so well, I thought\nI'd grab another Pokémon...\lRethinking...\lI need to get out of here!$"
gBwText_43_12:
	.string "Burgh: {STR_VAR_1}, let's go!\pIris! You stay by that young lady's\nside.$"
gBwText_43_13:
	.string "Burgh: {STR_VAR_1}, let's go!\pIris! You stay by that young lady's\nside.$"
gBwText_43_14:
	.string "Iris: I'm gonna be Bianca's bodyguard.\pSo you go after those bad guys, OK?$"
gBwText_43_15:
	.string "Iris: I'm gonna be Bianca's bodyguard.\pSo you go after those bad guys, OK?$"
gBwText_43_16:
	.string "Iris: I'm gonna be Bianca's bodyguard.\pSo you go after those bad guys, OK?$"
gBwText_43_17:
	.string "Iris: I'm gonna be Bianca's bodyguard.\pSo you go after those bad guys, OK?$"
gBwText_43_18:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, Munna, I can't believe it.\pHere I am, a Trainer, and I can't even\nprotect my own Pokémon... I'm sorry...$"
gBwText_43_19:
	.string "When someone is getting under your skin\nand you want to yell at them,\lscream at the ocean!\p...When you're alone, of course.$"
gBwText_43_20:
	.string "That black boat...\nWhat could it be?$"
	.align 2
