gBwText_44_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Royal Unova!\pThe scenery is exhilarating,\nthe battles are exciting.\pThe ticket is $1,000.\nWould you like to get on board?$"
gBwText_44_1:
	.string "The Royal Unova leaves once a day,\nonly in the evening.\lIt is a cruiser-type passenger ship.$"
gBwText_44_2:
	.string "The Royal Unova operates only in\nthe evening.\lPlease come back again.$"
gBwText_44_3:
	.string "I'm sorry, you don't have enough money.\nPlease come back again.$"
gBwText_44_4:
	.string "The ticket is $1,000.\nWould you like to get on board?$"
gBwText_44_5:
	.string "The ship goes under a big bridge called\nSkyarrow Bridge in the Unova region,\lthen turns around at Marvelous Bridge\land returns to Castelia City.\pWe'll let you know when it's time\nto leave by blowing a whistle five times.$"
gBwText_44_6:
	.string "From the deck of the world-famous\nRoyal Unova, you can enjoy a\lspectacular view.\pAnd the passenger cabins are full of\nTrainers who love to battle.\pPlease enjoy both the view and\nthe battles!\pNote that as C-Gears may affect radio\nsignals or instruments in the ship, we\lask that you refrain from using them.\lThank you.$"
gBwText_44_7:
	.string "The power of the C-Gear will be turned\noff. Is that OK?$"
gBwText_44_8:
	.string "We are leaving the port shortly.\nBon voyage!$"
gBwText_44_9:
	.string "Certainly.\nPlease come back again.$"
gBwText_44_10:
	.string "Thank you for sailing with us on the\nRoyal Unova.\pHave a nice day!$"
gBwText_44_11:
	.string "We are closed for the day.\nPlease come again tomorrow.$"
gBwText_44_12:
	.string "Congratulations!\pYou've defeated all the Trainers\non the ship!\pPlease accept this prize.$"
gBwText_44_13:
	.string "The Royal Unova is now in preparation.\pWe are working very hard to ready the\nship for the best Pokémon Trainers.$"
gBwText_44_14:
	.string "Get On Board$"
gBwText_44_15:
	.string "About the Ship$"
gBwText_44_16:
	.string "Cancel$"
	.align 2
