	.4byte 17
gBwText_45_0:
	.string "Pansage, Pansear, and Panpour are\nPokémon that evolve with special\lstones!\pWhich Pokémon do you want to evolve?$"
gBwText_45_1:
	.string "Pansage...\nThen, it's a Leaf Stone you need.$"
gBwText_45_2:
	.string "Pansear...\nThen, it's a Fire Stone you need.$"
gBwText_45_3:
	.string "Panpour...\nThen, it's a Water Stone you need.$"
gBwText_45_4:
	.string "You might already know this, but I will\ngive you some advice!\pWhen a Pokémon evolves, it will be more\npowerful, but it will be slower to learn\la new move.\pThis is especially true for Pokémon\nthat evolve with stones.\pSo, it's up to you: you can have it learn\na good move and then evolve it with\la stone, or evolve it with a stone fast\land then have it learn a move with a TM!$"
gBwText_45_5:
	.string "Pansage$"
gBwText_45_6:
	.string "Pansear$"
gBwText_45_7:
	.string "Panpour$"
gBwText_45_8:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_45_9:
	.string "All right, so it's Pansage?$"
gBwText_45_10:
	.string "All right, so it's Pansear?$"
gBwText_45_11:
	.string "All right, so it's Panpour?$"
gBwText_45_12:
	.string "Then, which Pokémon do you want\nto evolve...\pPansage, Pansear, or Panpour?$"
gBwText_45_13:
	.string "Yes, that's true.\pIt's difficult to choose one.\nWhen you decide, let me know!$"
gBwText_45_14:
	.string "Stick up your thumbs, and curl in\nyour fingers.\pThis is a thumbs-up pose. That means\nOK! In some places, it also means money!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_45
