gBwTextCount_46:
	.4byte 12
gBwText_47_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_47_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_47_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_47_3:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_47_4:
	.string "YES$"
gBwText_47_5:
	.string "NO$"
gBwText_47_6:
	.string "What are people's favorite things?\nWhat is popular right now?\pHave you ever wondered about\nthese things?\pWelcome to Passerby Analytics HQ!\pThis is where you can find\nall the answers.\p...You have good eyes.\nEyes full of curiosity.\p...Good! I will specially appoint you\nas a statistician!$"
gBwText_47_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} was appointed\nas a statistician!$"
gBwText_47_8:
	.string "Statisticians have only one task!\nThey conduct requested surveys.\pFirst, you'll receive survey requests\nfrom me.\pThen, with the Survey Radar, you'll\nchoose the survey you want to conduct.\pThen, if you pass by a lot of people,\nthe radar will collect the information.\pOf course, we've prepared compensation\nfor the survey.\pStatistician {STR_VAR_2}!\nI expect you to do a great job!$"
gBwText_47_9:
	.string "Statistician {STR_VAR_2},\ngood to see you!\pAre you surveying people vigorously?$"
gBwText_47_10:
	.string "You've finished all the requests.\pFrom now on, feel free to survey\nwhatever you want to know!$"
gBwText_47_11:
	.string "What would you like to do today?$"
gBwText_47_12:
	.string "Accept a request$"
gBwText_47_13:
	.string "Report the result$"
gBwText_47_14:
	.string "Nothing$"
gBwText_47_15:
	.string "Check the request$"
gBwText_47_16:
	.string "Accept a survey request, right?\pFirst, choose a survey method.$"
gBwText_47_17:
	.string "Timed survey$"
gBwText_47_18:
	.string "Head-count survey$"
gBwText_47_19:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_47_20:
	.string "A timed survey, right?\pThis is a survey to collect data\nfor a specified time.$"
gBwText_47_21:
	.string "A head-count survey, right?\pThis is a survey to collect data for\na specified number of people.$"
gBwText_47_22:
	.string "Please choose a request on which\nyou are going to conduct a survey.$"
gBwText_47_23:
	.string "OK...\pPlease come back again\nif you want to accept a request.$"
gBwText_47_24:
	.string "You've already accepted a survey\nrequest!\pTry your best to conduct the survey.\nOr do you want to cancel the survey?$"
gBwText_47_25:
	.string "You'll need to resurvey for the data\nyou've already collected...\pAre you sure you want to cancel?$"
gBwText_47_26:
	.string "OK...\pPlease come back again if you\nwant to accept a request.$"
gBwText_47_27:
	.string "Then, please continue the survey.$"
gBwText_47_28:
	.string "Which version is more popular?$"
gBwText_47_29:
	.string "The first Pokémon you picked?$"
gBwText_47_30:
	.string "How long have you been playing?$"
gBwText_47_31:
	.string "More men or more women?$"
gBwText_47_32:
	.string "The most common job?$"
gBwText_47_33:
	.string "The most common hobby?$"
gBwText_47_34:
	.string "More popular, battles or trades?$"
gBwText_47_35:
	.string "Favorite kind of Pokémon?$"
gBwText_47_36:
	.string "Favorite Pokémon type?$"
gBwText_47_37:
	.string "Where do people prefer to live?$"
gBwText_47_38:
	.string "About what's most important$"
gBwText_47_39:
	.string "Favorite kinds of people?$"
gBwText_47_40:
	.string "About seasons$"
gBwText_47_41:
	.string "About art$"
gBwText_47_42:
	.string "Favorite music?$"
gBwText_47_43:
	.string "About TV and movies$"
gBwText_47_44:
	.string "Favorite time in school?$"
gBwText_47_45:
	.string "About study$"
gBwText_47_46:
	.string "Most popular sport?$"
gBwText_47_47:
	.string "About a holiday$"
gBwText_47_48:
	.string "What do you want to become the most?$"
gBwText_47_49:
	.string "Most popular Gym Leader?$"
gBwText_47_50:
	.string "Most fun part of Pokémon?$"
gBwText_47_51:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_47_52:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out which is more\npopular, Pokémon Black Version\lor Pokémon White Version.\pThe survey must be conducted for\ntwo hours or more.\pI'm thinking of taking up Pokémon, too.\nI want to know which one is most\lpopular.$"
gBwText_47_53:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a Pokémon Professor.\pYou need to find out the most popular\nstarter Pokémon.\pThe survey must be conducted for\ntwo hours or more.\pHe wants to use the results\nfor his research.$"
gBwText_47_54:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a mother.\pYou need to find out how long people\nhave been playing the game.\pThe survey must be conducted for\nfour hours or more.\pShe wants to compare her child's game\ntime and the result of the survey.$"
gBwText_47_55:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a newspaper company.\pYou need to find out which are the\nmajority, men or women.\pThe survey must be conducted for\nfour hours or more.\pThey want to publish the result\nin tomorrow's morning paper.$"
gBwText_47_56:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a magazine company.\pYou need to find out the most\ncommon job.\pThe survey must be conducted for\nfour hours or more.\pThey want to use the result for their\nfeature article.$"
gBwText_47_57:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a leisure company.\pYou need to find out the most\ncommon hobby.\pThe survey must be conducted for\nfour hours or more.\pThey want to use the result as a\nreference for their projects.$"
gBwText_47_58:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out which one is more\npopular, battles or trades.\pThe survey must be conducted for\neight hours or more.\pLately, I've been addicted to Pokémon,\nso I want to know how other people play.$"
gBwText_47_59:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a girl.\pYou need to find out the most popular\nkind of Pokémon.\pThe survey must be conducted for\neight hours or more.\pShe wants to submit the result as her\nhomework.$"
gBwText_47_60:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a Trainer.\pYou need to find out the most popular\nPokémon type.\pThe survey must be conducted for\neight hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result to plan\nhis battles.$"
gBwText_47_61:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a real-estate firm.\pYou need to find out where people want\nto live, in a city or in the countryside.\pThe survey must be conducted for\neight hours or more.\pThey want to use the result for\ntheir business.$"
gBwText_47_62:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out which one people\nwant more, time or money,\land what's most important to people.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n12 hours or more.\pI'd like to know...\nwhat people cherish the most...\pWhat? Why?\nI cannot tell you the reason.$"
gBwText_47_63:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out which kind of\nperson is more popular, a smart person\lor an athletic person...\pand which one people desire more,\nappearance or substance.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n12 hours or more.\pIt's a survey about the most popular\ntype of person.\pWhat? Did something happen?\nNo, nothing... Never mind!$"
gBwText_47_64:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out people's favorite\nseason and favorite food.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n12 hours or more.\pDon't you want to offer delicious food\ndepending on the season?\pTo whom? That's a secret!$"
gBwText_47_65:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from an artist.\pYou need to find out people's favorite\ncolors and favorite music.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n12 hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result for his art.$"
gBwText_47_66:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a popular singer.\pYou need to find out\npeople's favorite music.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n16 hours or more.\pShe wants to use the result\nfor her new song.$"
gBwText_47_67:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out people's favorite\nTV programs and movies.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n16 hours or more.\pI want to have a lot of things to talk\nabout. So I need to know the trends!$"
gBwText_47_68:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a student.\pYou need to find out\npeople's favorite time in school.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n16 hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result\nfor his school life.$"
gBwText_47_69:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a teacher.\pYou need to find out people's favorite\nsubjects and weakest subjects.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n16 hours or more.\pShe wants to use the result\nfor her classes.$"
gBwText_47_70:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from an athlete.\pYou need to find out\nthe most popular sport.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n20 hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result\nfor his games.$"
gBwText_47_71:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out the most popular\nway to spend a holiday, and the most\lpopular fun place.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n20 hours or more.\pWhy? Well, to tell you the truth,\nI have a date next weekend.\pSo, I want to check out some\ntrendy places.$"
gBwText_47_72:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a Pokémon fan.\pYou need to find out what people most\nwant to become.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n20 hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result\nto promote Pokémon.$"
gBwText_47_73:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from a Gym Leader.\pYou need to find out who is the most\npopular Gym Leader.\pThe survey must be conducted for\n24 hours or more.\pHe wants to use the result\nfor his Gym operation.$"
gBwText_47_74:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pYou need to find out the most fun part\nof Pokémon.\pThe survey must be conducted\nfor 24 hours or more.\p...There is a lot going on for grown-ups.\pFrom now on, I will live a life dedicated\nto Pokémon.\pI will research the appeal of Pokémon!$"
gBwText_47_75:
	.string "...Oh?\pYou've passed by so many people\nalready! I knew you could do it,\l{STR_VAR_2}.\pI think the current data is enough.\nPlease report the survey results to me!$"
gBwText_47_76:
	.string "This survey is...\na request from me.\pThis survey requires you to pass by\nfive or more people to find out which is\lmore popular, Pokémon Black Version\lor Pokémon White Version.\pI'm thinking of taking up Pokémon, too.\nI want to know which one is most\lpopular.$"
