gBwText_47_221:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for Pokémon Black Version and\nPokémon White Version, more people have\lPokémon {STR_VAR_1} Version.\pThat is helpful.\pEither version seems to be fun to play.\nNow, it's more difficult to choose!$"
gBwText_47_222:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like the\nmost selected starter Pokémon.\pThat came as a surprise.\nThat's why the survey is interesting!$"
gBwText_47_223:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe most common playing time.\pI am happy that people enjoy the game\nfor long hours!$"
gBwText_47_224:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for women and men,\nthe majority of people who play Pokémon\lare “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pAnyone can enjoy Pokémon!\nI want everyone to enjoy it.$"
gBwText_47_225:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe most common job.\pMany different people\nare playing the game.\pWhat a wonderful thing!$"
gBwText_47_226:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe most common hobby.\pIt's great to enjoy various things.\nBecause your world will be broadened.$"
gBwText_47_227:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for battles and trades, more people\nseem to enjoy “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pThat is helpful.\pYou can enjoy various things.\nThat's the beauty of Pokémon.$"
gBwText_47_228:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pIt looks like people prefer\n“{STR_VAR_1}“ Pokémon.\pThere are so many different Pokémon!\nI want to meet lots of them.$"
gBwText_47_229:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe most popular Pokémon type.\pThere are many different Pokémon\ntypes.\pThis will be useful information\nfor battles!$"
gBwText_47_230:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for a city or the countryside,\nmore people seem to want to live in\l“{STR_VAR_1}.“\pThere is a saying: Every bird finds its\nown nest charming. It's difficult to\lsay which one is better.$"
gBwText_47_231:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for time or money, it looks like more\npeople chose “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pAnd what's most important to people\nseems to be “{STR_VAR_2}.”\pThat is helpful.\pI don't want to lose sight of\nwhat is important for myself.$"
gBwText_47_232:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pAs for a smart or an athletic person,\nmore people chose “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pAs for appearance or substance,\nmore people chose “{STR_VAR_2}.”\pThe most popular type of person is\n“{STR_VAR_3}.“\pThat is helpful.\pDifferent people are charmed by\ndifferent qualities.\pWhy don't people notice\nmy charms...?$"
gBwText_47_233:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe people's favorite season.\pThe people's favorite food seems to be\n“{STR_VAR_2}.”\pIt was helpful.\pDelicious food varies seasonally.\nTaste the difference!$"
gBwText_47_234:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe people's favorite color.\p“{STR_VAR_2}” looks like\nthe people's favorite music.\pPopular things are not necessarily\ngood. We should value what we love.$"
gBwText_47_235:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe people's favorite music.\pIt may be a good idea\nto relax and listen to music.\pI will make use of the result\nfor my life.$"
gBwText_47_236:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like the people's\nfavorite kind of TV program.\p“{STR_VAR_2}” looks like\nthe people's favorite kind of movie.\pThat is helpful.\pThat should prevent me from\nrunning out of conversation topics.\pI look forward to my next date.$"
gBwText_47_237:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe people's favorite time in school.\pSchool... It brings back memories.\pIn the old days,\njust being in school was fun.$"
gBwText_47_238:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe people's favorite subject.\pAnd, “{STR_VAR_2}” looks like\nthe people's weakest subject.\pTo have a balanced life, play hard and\nstudy hard.$"
gBwText_47_239:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pIt looks like the most popular sport is\n“{STR_VAR_1}.“\pExercise is also important.\pThere is nothing more valuable\nthan good health.$"
gBwText_47_240:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\p“{STR_VAR_1}“ looks like\nthe most popular way of\lspending a holiday.\pAnd, “{STR_VAR_2}” looks like\nthe most popular fun place.\pThat is helpful.\nThis will make my date special.\pWith who? That's a secret!$"
gBwText_47_241:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pIt looks like people want to become a\n“{STR_VAR_1}“ the most.\pIt's not bad to long to be something,\nbut first we should have confidence\lin ourselves.$"
gBwText_47_242:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pIt looks like the most popular Gym\nLeader is “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pGym Leaders are icons for children.\nI think all Leaders are attractive.$"
gBwText_47_243:
	.string "Hmm... I see...\pIt looks like the most fun part\nof Pokémon is “{STR_VAR_1}.“\pThat is helpful.\pThere are many ways to enjoy Pokémon.\nSo you can enjoy Pokémon indefinitely!$"
gBwText_47_244:
	.string "It's an excellent survey!\p{STR_VAR_2}, you've come up to\nmy expectation.\pThis is the compensation for the\nsurvey. Please accept this.$"
gBwText_47_245:
	.string "Your great work surprises me every\ntime.\pAll right! From today, you are a\n“B-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_246:
	.string "Your great work surprises me every\ntime.\pAll right! From today, you are an\n“A-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_247:
	.string "Your great work surprises me every\ntime.\pAll right! From today, you are an\n“S-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_248:
	.string "Your great work surprises me every\ntime.\pAll right! From today, you are an\n“S+ rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_249:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}\nwas appointed as a\l“B-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_250:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}\nwas appointed as an\l“A-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_251:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}\nwas appointed as an\l“S-rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_252:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}\nwas appointed as an\l“S+ rank statistician“!$"
gBwText_47_253:
	.string "You'll become a “B-rank statistician“\nif you complete a requested survey\lthis many more times: {STR_VAR_2}.\lKeep it up!$"
gBwText_47_254:
	.string "You'll become an “A-rank statistician“\nif you complete a requested survey\lthis many more times: {STR_VAR_2}.\lKeep it up!$"
gBwText_47_255:
	.string "You'll become an “S-rank statistician“\nif you complete a requested survey\lthis many more times: {STR_VAR_2}.\lKeep it up!$"
gBwText_47_256:
	.string "You'll become an “S+ rank statistician“\nif you complete a requested survey\lthis many more times: {STR_VAR_2}.\lKeep it up!$"
gBwText_47_257:
	.string "I'm expecting great work\nfor the next survey, too!\l{STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_47_258:
	.string "This completes all the survey requests.\n{STR_VAR_2}, well done!\lI'm incredibly moved!\pThis is a token of my appreciation.\nPlease accept this.$"
gBwText_47_259:
	.string "From now on, feel free to survey\nwhatever you want to know.\pI have high hopes for\nyour future success!$"
gBwText_47_260:
	.string "I see...\pI'm lonely, so\nplease come visit me sometimes.$"
gBwText_47_261:
	.string "This is Passerby Analytics HQ.\pIf you want to join us,\nplease speak to the leader.$"
gBwText_47_262:
	.string "Hi, {STR_VAR_2}. Are you conducting a\nsurvey vigorously?$"
gBwText_47_263:
	.string "Excuse me, new statistician!\nPlease wait!$"
gBwText_47_264:
	.string "Actually, I have a favor to ask you.\pI'm asking statisticians to answer\na questionnaire.\pOK, here we go!$"
gBwText_47_265:
	.string "I'd like to ask you to answer\na questionnaire again.\pWill you?$"
gBwText_47_266:
	.string "All right.\pIf you change your mind,\nplease speak to me.$"
gBwText_47_267:
	.string "Oh? It looks like you've answered\nall the questionnaires.\pWould you like to re-answer\nthe questionnaires you did before?$"
gBwText_47_268:
	.string "Then, will you choose a questionnaire\nyou'd like to answer?$"
gBwText_47_269:
	.string "Details about people$"
gBwText_47_270:
	.string "Pokémon favorites$"
gBwText_47_271:
	.string "Ideals and values$"
gBwText_47_272:
	.string "Likable people$"
gBwText_47_273:
	.string "Preferences$"
gBwText_47_274:
	.string "Entertainment$"
gBwText_47_275:
	.string "School life$"
gBwText_47_276:
	.string "Sports and pastimes$"
gBwText_47_277:
	.string "More about Pokémon$"
gBwText_47_278:
	.string "Choose this questionnaire?$"
gBwText_47_279:
	.string "You can answer the questionnaires\nas many times as you want.\pIf you want to change your answers,\nplease let me know.$"
gBwText_47_280:
	.string "Let's get started.\nThis questionnaire...\pis about\n“Details about people.“$"
