gBwText_47_319:
	.string "The “Details About People“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_320:
	.string "The “Pokémon Favorites“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_321:
	.string "The “Ideals and Values“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_322:
	.string "The “Likable People“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_323:
	.string "The “Preferences“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_324:
	.string "The “Entertainment“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_325:
	.string "The “School Life“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_326:
	.string "The “Sports and Pastimes“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_327:
	.string "The “More About Pokémon“ survey\nwas added to the Survey Radar!$"
gBwText_47_328:
	.string "And... This is a thank-you gift\nfor answering the questionnaire.$"
gBwText_47_329:
	.string "This is the end of \nall the questionnaires.\pIt was fun to get to know you!$"
gBwText_47_330:
	.string "You can answer the questionnaires\nas many times as you want, so\lif you want to change your answers,\lplease let me know.$"
gBwText_47_331:
	.string "Now, you have... this many\nquestionnaires left: {STR_VAR_2}.$"
gBwText_47_332:
	.string "If you want to answer other\nquestionnaires, too, speak to me.$"
gBwText_47_333:
	.string "Since you're here, why don't you\nanswer other questionnaires, too?$"
gBwText_47_334:
	.string "Hello!\nGreeting is important, isn't it?$"
gBwText_47_335:
	.string "If you don't mind, would you tell me\nyour favorite greeting?$"
gBwText_47_336:
	.string "If you don't mind, would you tell me\nyour favorite greeting again?$"
gBwText_47_337:
	.string "Hello!$"
gBwText_47_338:
	.string "Then, maybe next time.\nLet's always have a cheerful greeting!$"
gBwText_47_339:
	.string "Yes, it's a good greeting!\nIt cheers me up!\pPlease feel free to come and say hi\nagain! I look forward to seeing you\lagain!$"
gBwText_47_340:
	.string "Hello! Do you always have a feeling\nof gratitude?$"
gBwText_47_341:
	.string "Oh, you dropped your Poké Ball.\nHere you are.$"
gBwText_47_342:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} received a Poké Ball.$"
gBwText_47_343:
	.string "Please remember to thank someone\nwho helps you!\pIt may sound trivial, but it's\nimportant.\pNow, will you tell me your\nfeeling of gratitude?$"
gBwText_47_344:
	.string "If you don't mind, will you show me your\nfeeling of gratitude again?$"
gBwText_47_345:
	.string "Thanks!$"
gBwText_47_346:
	.string "Then, maybe next time.\pDon't forget a feeling of gratitude!$"
gBwText_47_347:
	.string "What a wonderful phrase!\nIt warms up my heart.\pIf somebody helps you,\nshow your feelings of gratitude.\pI am sure they will appreciate\nyour feelings.$"
gBwText_47_348:
	.string "Do you know the ranks of\nstatisticians?\pIf you complete several survey\nrequests, you can advance in rank!\pIf you advance in rank,\npeople will look up to you, and\lyou can get something good!$"
gBwText_47_349:
	.string "Do you know the ranks of\nstatisticians?\pOh, you are {STR_VAR_2}.\nYou are a B-rank statistician.\pYou advanced to the B rank!\nYou've been working hard.\pIf you advance in rank,\nyou'll get more new requests, so\lyou might want to talk to the leader.$"
gBwText_47_350:
	.string "Do you know the ranks of\nstatisticians?\pOh, you are {STR_VAR_2}.\nYou are an A-rank statistician.\pYou're already in the A rank.\nThat's awesome!\pI also have to work hard\nand take surveys.\pI heard requests for the A rank\nwere difficult.\pKeep up the good work!$"
gBwText_47_351:
	.string "Do you know the ranks of\nstatisticians?\pOh, you are {STR_VAR_2}.\nYou are an S-rank statistician.\pYou are close to the S+ rank,\nwhich is the best!\pI will support you!\nGood luck.$"
gBwText_47_352:
	.string "Do you know the ranks of\nstatisticians?\pOh, you are {STR_VAR_2}.\nYou are an S+ rank statistician!\pWow! I will also do my best to\nadvance in rank as much as possible!$"
gBwText_47_353:
	.string "If you want to check your information,\nlook at the graph on the back wall.\pInformation about all the\nstatisticians is kept there.\pOf course, we checked the information\nabout you!$"
gBwText_47_354:
	.string "Have you answered a questionnaire?\pYou should at least answer about\nwhat kind of person you are.$"
gBwText_47_355:
	.string "Are you having a hard time getting new\nsurvey items in the Survey Radar?\pIf you want more survey items, answer\nquestionnaires in the headquarters.$"
gBwText_47_356:
	.string "If you are an S-rank statistician, you\nmust have answered all the\lquestionnaires.\pWhat you want to know is\nwhat everybody wants to know.\pPlease volunteer to answer\nquestionnaires.$"
gBwText_47_357:
	.string "Good work today,\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pWe have more statisticians, and\nthis place has become quite lively.\pThe way things are going,\nwe can collect more survey data.$"
gBwText_47_358:
	.string "The more I conduct surveys,\nthe more fun it will be.\pI'm determined to pass by more people!\pIt's way more fun to conduct surveys\nwith people than doing them by myself.$"
gBwText_47_359:
	.string "By any chance, are you having trouble?\pIf it's difficult to pass by many\npeople, I recommend you try a timed\lsurvey.\pIt takes time, but if you pass by just\none person, you can complete the\lrequest.$"
gBwText_47_360:
	.string "I'll give you a hint.\pIf you go to a place full of people,\nI recommend a head-count survey.\pYou can collect survey data really\nfast, so you can complete the request\lin a short time.$"
gBwText_47_361:
	.string "Good work today,\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pYou've become the top statistician\ninstantly.\pI should learn a lot from you\nand work hard!$"
gBwText_47_362:
	.string "When I answered a questionnaire\nearlier, I got a questionnaire sheet.\pMaybe I will answer all the\nquestionnaires...$"
gBwText_47_363:
	.string "After the questionnaire, the next step\nis conducting a survey.\pSet the request you want to survey\non the Survey Radar...\lAnd let's go!$"
gBwText_47_364:
	.string "New statisticians are not\nanswering questionnaires.\pIf they answered questionnaires,\nthey could conduct more surveys...\lWhat a shame!$"
gBwText_47_365:
	.string "Hello, {STR_VAR_2}!\pI've also started teaching novice\nstatisticians how to conduct surveys.$"
gBwText_47_366:
	.string "What is the popular movie now?\n{STR_VAR_2}, do you have any idea?$"
gBwText_47_367:
	.string "What is the popular food now?\n{STR_VAR_2}, do you have any idea?$"
gBwText_47_368:
	.string "What is the popular...\nOh, {STR_VAR_2}.\pI knew it.\nI have to take a survey by myself...\pAh, it is a pain in the neck...$"
gBwText_47_369:
	.string "The survey requests from the leader\nare hard. Don't you agree?\pBesides, the number of more difficult\nsurveys are increasing...$"
gBwText_47_370:
	.string "Hello! Good work today, {STR_VAR_2}.\pHave you finished all the\nsurvey requests from the leader?\pI heard if you finish all the requests,\nyou can get something good!$"
gBwText_47_371:
	.string "Oh! {STR_VAR_2}!\nI'm honored to see you!\pOh, wow!\n{STR_VAR_2} spoke to me!$"
gBwText_47_372:
	.string "STATISTICIANS WANTED!\nFOR DETAILS, ASK THE LEADER!$"
gBwText_47_373:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}\nStatistician rank: C rank\lNumber of times thanked: {STR_VAR_3}\lNumber of people passed by: {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_47_374:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}\nStatistician rank: B rank\lNumber of times thanked: {STR_VAR_3}\lNumber of people passed by: {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_47_375:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}\nStatistician rank: A rank\lNumber of times thanked: {STR_VAR_3}\lNumber of people passed by: {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_47_376:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}\nStatistician rank: S rank\lNumber of times thanked: {STR_VAR_3}\lNumber of people passed by: {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_47_377:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}\nStatistician rank: S+ rank\lNumber of times thanked: {STR_VAR_3}\lNumber of people passed by: {STR_VAR_2}$"
	.align 2
