gBwText_48_0:
	.string "Currently, we exhibit works in the motif\nof legends in the Unova region.$"
gBwText_48_1:
	.string "If you want to see Burgh's paintings,\ngo to the Pokémon Gym!$"
gBwText_48_2:
	.string "Title “Ideals and Truth“$"
gBwText_48_3:
	.string "Title “Soaring White Dragon“$"
gBwText_48_4:
	.string "Title “White Flame“$"
gBwText_48_5:
	.string "Title “Alighting Black Dragon“$"
gBwText_48_6:
	.string "Title “Black Lightning Bolt“$"
gBwText_48_7:
	.string "Title “Twin Heroes“$"
gBwText_48_8:
	.string "I am not as good an artist as Burgh,\nbut I have a liking for paintings.\pLet me see. Today, I'd like to paint\n{STR_VAR_1}-type Pokémon!\pWill you show me what kinds of Pokémon\nyou have?$"
gBwText_48_9:
	.string "Please show me a Pokémon that's\n{STR_VAR_1} type!$"
gBwText_48_10:
	.string "Oh! You have that type!\nI'm inspired!\pThank you! As a token of my gratitude,\nwhich one would you like?$"
gBwText_48_11:
	.string "Cheri Berry$"
gBwText_48_12:
	.string "Chesto Berry$"
gBwText_48_13:
	.string "Pecha Berry$"
gBwText_48_14:
	.string "Rawst Berry$"
gBwText_48_15:
	.string "Aspear Berry$"
gBwText_48_16:
	.string "One {STR_VAR_1}!\nIt's all yours now!$"
gBwText_48_17:
	.string "Aww. You are the best!\nPlease come back tomorrow, too!$"
gBwText_48_18:
	.string "As long as the artist enjoys creating\nan artwork, it doesn't matter if the\lresult is judged as bad or good.$"
gBwText_48_19:
	.string "If you catch a Pokémon that's\n{STR_VAR_1} type, please show it to me!\lI'll give you a little something.$"
gBwText_48_20:
	.string "The Pokémon you chose is not the one\nI requested.\pWhat I want to paint is a Pokémon\nthat's {STR_VAR_1} type!$"
gBwText_48_21:
	.string "Oh!\nThe shape of this Egg...\pSuperb! It gives me chills!\nIt's electrifying! It makes me tremble!\pAlas, even I cannot tell what type\nan Egg is!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_48
