	.4byte 6
gBwText_50_0:
	.string "I am in charge of development!\pI'm going to give you this, because you\ncame here for a company tour!$"
gBwText_50_1:
	.string "If a Pokémon holds a Scope Lens, it has\na better chance to make a critical hit!$"
gBwText_50_2:
	.string "Oh! A company tour?\nOr some Pokémon practice?\pEither way, I'm glad you came.\nI'm happy, so I'll give you these!$"
gBwText_50_3:
	.string "I'm very happy, so I will give you\nanother present!$"
gBwText_50_4:
	.string "A Quick Ball makes it easier to catch a\nPokémon if you use it at the very\lbeginning of a battle.\pAnd a Timer Ball makes it easier to\ncatch a Pokémon you've been battling\lfor a long time!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_50
