	.4byte 3
gBwText_52_0:
	.string "...$"
gBwText_52_1:
	.string "'Cause he is alone and looks lonely,\nI was reading a book to him!\lI will read it to you, too!$"
gBwText_52_2:
	.string "'Cause he is alone and looks lonely,\nI was reading a book to him!\lI will read it to you, too!$"
gBwText_52_3:
	.string "Here, I'll keep reading!\p...\nZorua, who was left alone, wandered\laround looking for its mother...$"
gBwText_52_4:
	.string "Have you seen Zorua? See, it's\nthe Pokémon that looks like this!$"
gBwText_52_5:
	.string "They say Zorua has the power\nto bewitch people!\pIt would be scary if I were bewitched,\nbut I like Zorua!\l'Cause it's cute!\p...Huh?\nWhy are you blushing?$"
gBwText_52_6:
	.string "Castelia City is so big\nthat I feel dizzy.\lEven I can get lost!$"
gBwText_52_7:
	.string "This little boy got lost!\nHe looks lonely, so\lplease talk to him!$"
gBwText_52_8:
	.string "This little boy got lost!\nHe looks lonely, so \lplease talk to him!$"
gBwText_52_9:
	.string "Yip yap!$"
gBwText_52_10:
	.string "Lululalala!$"
gBwText_52_11:
	.string "Oh, that little boy was really Zorua!\nSo cooooool!$"
gBwText_52_12:
	.string "It looks like Zorua and Celebi are really\ngood friends!\pI'm sure Zorua wants to go with you\nand Celebi!$"
gBwText_52_13:
	.string "Will you add Zorua to your party?$"
gBwText_52_14:
	.string "Zorua joined your party!$"
gBwText_52_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_52_16:
	.string "...Yip?$"
gBwText_52_17:
	.string "$"
gBwText_52_18:
	.string "Zorua had been waiting for Celebi here!\nNow, I am relieved!$"
gBwText_52_19:
	.string "It looks like Zorua and Celebi are really\ngood friends!\pI'm sure Zorua wants to go with you\nand Celebi!\p...But do you have room for Zorua\nin your party?\pYou can't take more than six Pokémon\nwith you. Right?$"
gBwText_52_20:
	.string "It looks like Zorua and Celebi are really\ngood friends!\pI'm sure Zorua wants to go with you\nand Celebi!\p...But do you have room for Zorua\nin your party?\pYou can't take more than six Pokémon\nwith you. Right?$"
gBwText_52_21:
	.string "So you won't take Zorua with you...\nPoor thing. It looks lonely...$"
gBwText_52_22:
	.string "So you won't take Zorua with you...\nPoor thing. It looks lonely...$"
gBwText_52_23:
	.string "Zorua is waiting for you!$"
gBwText_52_24:
	.string "Trainer, do you have a Poké Ball?$"
gBwText_52_25:
	.string "Trainer, do you have a Poké Ball?$"
gBwText_52_26:
	.string "...Can't you take Zorua with you?$"
gBwText_52_27:
	.string "$"
gBwText_52_28:
	.string "It looks like Zorua and Celebi are really\ngood friends!\pI'm sure Zorua wants to go with you\nand Celebi!\p...But do you have room for Zorua\nin your party?\pYou can't take more than six Pokémon\nwith you. Right?$"
gBwText_52_29:
	.string "It looks like Zorua and Celebi are really\ngood friends!\pI'm sure Zorua wants to go with you\nand Celebi!\p...But do you have room for Zorua\nin your party?\pYou can't take more than six Pokémon\nwith you. Right?$"
gBwText_52_30:
	.string "Would you like to give a nickname\nto the Zorua who joined your party?$"
	.align 2
