gBwText_53_0:
	.string "Hi there!\nI am the Game Director.\pOh! You are working on your Pokédex! If\nyou fill it up a lot, please let me see!$"
gBwText_53_1:
	.string "Hi there!\nI am the Game Director.\pOh! You've caught every kind of\nPokémon in Unova!\pWow! Excellent!\nWe'll give you an award!!$"
gBwText_53_2:
	.string "I will send this award certificate\nto your house!$"
gBwText_53_3:
	.string "Hi there!\nI am the Game Director.\pOh! Excellent! You've finally collected\nall the Pokémon and completed\lyour Pokédex!\pTo honor the efforts you have made in\ncompleting this Pokédex...\pAllow me to present you with this award!$"
gBwText_53_4:
	.string "How did you meet all the Pokémon\nto fill up your Pokédex?\pDid you work long and hard to catch\nand raise them?\pDid you receive them as gifts from\nfriends?\pMaybe you got some in trades from\naround the world?\pThough everyone's Pokédex may look\nthe same, the stories they contain are\lall unique!$"
gBwText_53_5:
	.string "I will send this award certificate\nto your house, too!$"
gBwText_53_6:
	.string "Beware of spoilers! What I'm working on\nis the ending of the game.\pDon't look at it here! You'll have\nto play it for yourself.$"
gBwText_53_7:
	.string "I am the Graphic Designer. I am devoting\nall my energy to every dot!\pHup! I should put one dot here as if I'm\nmaking this part hollow!$"
gBwText_53_8:
	.string "A tip for getting strong\nin Pokémon battles...\pLet me see.\nI guess the most important thing is...\lhaving a lot of battles!\pIf you become very strong, come back\nand have a Pokémon battle with me!$"
gBwText_53_9:
	.string "Oh! You've become strong! I can tell.\nDo you want to have a battle with me?$"
gBwText_53_10:
	.string "Well, let's begin!$"
gBwText_53_11:
	.string "You think about battles very\nthoroughly.\pI lost, but I learned a lot from you.\nBesides, it was fun!\pCome back again tomorrow.$"
gBwText_53_12:
	.string "No?\pI've been raising Pokémon, thinking\nabout their Abilities and just the right\lcombination of held items.\pWhat a pity...$"
gBwText_53_13:
	.string "I'm Snorlax.\pNo, no. I'm the Planner!\pI don't mean to butt in, but the\nLeftovers item is important, isn't it?$"
gBwText_53_14:
	.string "I am the Sound Designer!\pI put in a lot of wonderful mechanisms\nto change the game's music!\pHow many of them have you noticed?$"
gBwText_53_15:
	.string "I can tell you take the sound seriously,\nso here's a treat for you!\pWhat do you think about this\ndramatic sound?$"
gBwText_53_16:
	.string "Were you surprised?\pWell, for a strong Trainer like you,\nwinning against Team Rocket\lwould be a piece of cake!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_53
