gBwText_54_0:
	.string "I am the Feeling Reader.\pI've heard a lot of people take\nFeeling Checks using the C-Gear.$"
gBwText_54_1:
	.string "I am the Feeling Reader.\pFrom the results of your Feeling\nChecks, I'll tell you your lucky person\lfor today!\pAre you interested?\nDo you want to know your lucky person?$"
gBwText_54_2:
	.string "The person who can make your day\nexceptionally happy...\pIt's {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_54_3:
	.string "Oh, you don't have to hesitate.\nI will read it for free!$"
gBwText_54_4:
	.string "The person who can make your day\nexceptionally happy is...\pOh dear. You've taken a Feeling Check\nonly with {STR_VAR_1}.\pI suggest that you take Feeling Checks\nwith a lot of people!$"
gBwText_54_5:
	.string "You can't change the name of a Pokémon\nyou got from someone.\pBecause the name contains wishes\nof the person who named it!$"
gBwText_54_6:
	.string "Gesundheit: Gyu gyu?$"
gBwText_54_7:
	.string "By taking a Feeling Check, you can get a\nSweet Heart. That's a good item, right?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_54
