gBwTextCount_55:
	.4byte 13
gBwText_56_0:
	.string "Bianca: Heeey, {STR_VAR_1}!\pYou remember the promise you\nmade on the Xtransceiver, right?\pSo, let's get right to our\nPokémon battle!$"
gBwText_56_1:
	.string "Bianca: Hello, {STR_VAR_1}!\pYou remember the promise you\nmade on the Xtransceiver, right?\pSo, let's get right to our\nPokémon battle!$"
gBwText_56_2:
	.string "But, before that...$"
gBwText_56_3:
	.string "They said we can have a Pokémon battle\nin the gate as long as we're careful not\lto break the electric bulletin board.\pI'm the new-and-improved version of\nme! It's gonna go great this time!\pLet's start up our Pokémon battle\nagain!$"
gBwText_56_4:
	.string "Bianca: I'll never be a strong Trainer\nlike you or Cheren or Iris, but...\pYou know, since we left Nuvema Town,\nI've met a lot of people and I've been\lthinking about what I want to do in\llife!\pWhen you look at it that way, Pokémon\nhave given me a lot of new experiences.$"
gBwText_56_5:
	.string "Having my Pokémon stolen was just\nreally hard, and I felt really unsure...\pStill, I gotta say I'm really glad I\nwent!\pI've learned so much on this journey.\nAnd I also learned that being with\lPokémon is really, really important!\pOK, well, I hope to see you again soon!\nBye-bye, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_56_6:
	.string "Maybe I should try to find a\nPokémon on Route 4 to catch!$"
gBwText_56_7:
	.string "Route 4 is long!\nBe careful if you plan to follow it!$"
gBwText_56_8:
	.string "Nimbasa City is at the end\nof Route 4.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_56
