	.4byte 9
gBwText_57_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_57_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_57_2:
	.string "The number of Trainers on the\nRoyal Unova today is {STR_VAR_3}.\lAnd you've won against {STR_VAR_3}.\pThe ship is nearing the port.\nWould you like to get off the ship?$"
gBwText_57_3:
	.string "The number of Trainers on the\nRoyal Unova today is {STR_VAR_3}.\pThe ship is nearing the port.\nWould you like to get off the ship?$"
gBwText_57_4:
	.string "There are a lot of cabins in this big\nship! I would like to give you advice\l'cause you need help finding Trainers!\pDo you want to listen to my hint?$"
gBwText_57_5:
	.string "Some guests like to tell really long\nstories, and they just keep talking\luntil they hear a whistle!$"
gBwText_57_6:
	.string "The Royal Unova's renowned\nobservation deck is just ahead.$"
gBwText_57_7:
	.string "If you're looking in the cabins with\nblue doors for someone to battle,\lyou'll find only one Trainer there\ltoday.$"
gBwText_57_8:
	.string "It seems the number of Trainers in the\ncabins with blue doors today is\l{STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_57_9:
	.string "It's running on the ocean!\nWhat a peculiar thing to see!$"
gBwText_57_10:
	.string "I can't make up my mind whether to go\nto the observation deck or battle some\lTrainers in the cabins.$"
gBwText_57_11:
	.string "I'm running with the rhythm of the\nwaves, but it's a real challenge!$"
gBwText_57_12:
	.string "Having battles on the ship and seeing\nthe scenery from the deck...\lThis ship is the best!$"
gBwText_57_13:
	.string "I'm still wondering which cabin to\nenter.$"
gBwText_57_14:
	.string "I came here from Johto for business,\nbut everything is dynamic here.$"
gBwText_57_15:
	.string "Are you from Unova?\nI came here from Johto for business.\pAs I thought, a foreign region is\nso different! What's the difference?\p... ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... so,\l... ... ... ... ...\lWell, ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ... Don't you agree?$"
gBwText_57_16:
	.string "Oh! A whistle is blowing!\nSorry to keep you so long...\pBut it was fun to talk with you.\nThank you!$"
gBwText_57_17:
	.string "A battle break from work!\nIt is particularly fun.$"
gBwText_57_18:
	.string "I had a great battle on my break\nfrom work.$"
gBwText_57_19:
	.string "There are yet more Pokémon across\nthe water!\pThe excitement never stops!$"
gBwText_57_20:
	.string "I am having a relaxing time in this\nopulent cabin.$"
gBwText_57_21:
	.string "I heard that strong Trainers gather\nhere, so I came all the way from Sinnoh!\pLet me enjoy some Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_57_22:
	.string "I can have Pokémon battles while\nI'm being rocked in the ship.\pPlus, I can see Pokémon that are rarely\nseen. I am soooo happy!$"
gBwText_57_23:
	.string "I heard a lot of Trainers in this ship\nare from the other side of the ocean.\pSpeaking of which, I am also from Kanto!$"
gBwText_57_24:
	.string "Did you go to the observation deck?\nYou can see an incredible view!$"
gBwText_57_25:
	.string "Having Pokémon battles while on the\nship, being rocked by the ocean waves...\lIsn't it exciting?$"
gBwText_57_26:
	.string "I lost...\nMaybe I will go check out the view...$"
gBwText_57_27:
	.string "Cool! Cool!\pWhat is cool?\nThis ship! This ship!\p...Which part is cool?\nHmmmm... It's just cool!$"
gBwText_57_28:
	.string "A Pokémon battle!\pI thought about it, but...\nI don't have any Pokémon with me!$"
gBwText_57_29:
	.string "OK, Trainer! I will give you a practical\ndemonstration that I am not just some\lkid who wears shorts!$"
gBwText_57_30:
	.string "Argh! I lost!\nI take off my socks to you!$"
gBwText_57_31:
	.string "Listen! Listen!\nI love this ship 'cause I can\lbring my Pokémon on board!$"
gBwText_57_32:
	.string "Hey! Will you listen to my story?\pThe other day, I went to Nimbasa City!\p... ... ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... I know, right?\lThen, ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... That's what I heard, anyway!$"
gBwText_57_33:
	.string "Oh! A whistle!\pI apologize for making you listen\nto my long story...\lBut it was fun talking to you. Thanks!$"
gBwText_57_34:
	.string "I am a Trainer.\nI came from a faraway region.\lI will show you my rarely seen Pokémon!$"
gBwText_57_35:
	.string "My Pokémon! Weren't they unusual?\nIn particular, Wormadam is my favorite!$"
gBwText_57_36:
	.string "This gorgeous ship suits a rich person\nlike me très bien. Am I right?$"
gBwText_57_37:
	.string "They blow a whistle five times! Even if I\npretend I don't hear it, when they blow\lfive times, it's the end...$"
gBwText_57_38:
	.string "I will show you a graceful battle\non this elegant ship!$"
gBwText_57_39:
	.string "Even if I lose the battle, I will not lose\nmy grace.\lThat's how a Rich Boy behaves.$"
gBwText_57_40:
	.string "Oh, their room service?\pI tried the specialty, Royal Unova tea.\nIt tasted wonderful!$"
gBwText_57_41:
	.string "The beautiful scenery outside the\nwindow is perfection, but I also like\lthe royal atmosphere inside the cabin.$"
gBwText_57_42:
	.string "With a few waltz steps, I will\nchoreograph a royal Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_57_43:
	.string "I am enraptured with the royal\nPokémon battle...$"
gBwText_57_44:
	.string "From your standpoint,\nI am a Trainer from beyond the sea,\land from my standpoint,\lyou are a Trainer from beyond the sea!$"
gBwText_57_45:
	.string "Oh, what a cute guest!\nWould you like a cup of tea?\lCome! Sit there and listen to my story!\p... ... ... ... ...\n... ... ... but\lit ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ..., you see!$"
gBwText_57_46:
	.string "Sorry, sorry.\nI talked too much.\lIt was fun, though. Thank you!$"
gBwText_57_47:
	.string "Heh heh. A Pokémon battle?\pI got tired of relaxing in my cabin.\nWell, let's dance, Trainer!$"
gBwText_57_48:
	.string "You see two or three moves ahead.\nSure enough, I can't win against youth!$"
gBwText_57_49:
	.string "Are you looking for Pokémon Trainers?\nSorry, I don't know where to find them.\pBut the crew may know where they are.$"
gBwText_57_50:
	.string "Oh, look at you!\nWhat a cute guest!\pI could talk to you for ages.\n... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... exactly.\lThen, ... ... ... ... \l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... That's how it is!$"
gBwText_57_51:
	.string "Oh, my! The sound of a whistle!\nI am so sorry.\lI rambled on too much!$"
gBwText_57_52:
	.string "Hi there! You are such a cute guest.\nMay I have a Pokémon battle with you?$"
gBwText_57_53:
	.string "You're not only cute--you're also\nstrong in Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_57_54:
	.string "Oh, I can feel the sound in my stomach!\nThe sound of that whistle is powerful!$"
gBwText_57_55:
	.string "You! Did you talk to me?\nYou came at the right time!\pI have a very funny story.\nI wanted to tell the story to someone.\p... ... ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... That's the thing!\pThen, ... ... ...\n... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... ... ...\l... ... ... That's how it ends.$"
gBwText_57_56:
	.string "Oops. Did I talk your ear off? Sorry,\nsorry. But I had a great time. Thanks!$"
gBwText_57_57:
	.string "To look for someone stronger than me,\nI crossed over the mountains,\lcrossed over the sea, and came here.\pMy Pokémon are special because\nthey went through a lot of difficulties.\pNow, let's have a fair battle!$"
gBwText_57_58:
	.string "I can't believe you're stronger than\nme. I have traveled around the world!\pNow I understand...\nthe world is ridiculously big!$"
gBwText_57_59:
	.string "$"
gBwText_57_60:
	.string "$"
gBwText_57_61:
	.string "Today...\pAs for people, we have {STR_VAR_1} on\nthe port side and {STR_VAR_2} on the\lstarboard side.$"
gBwText_57_62:
	.string "Today...\pThe number of people on the starboard\nside is {STR_VAR_2}, and...none on the\lport side.$"
gBwText_57_63:
	.string "Today...\pThe number of people on the port side is\n{STR_VAR_1}, and...none on the starboard\lside.$"
gBwText_57_64:
	.string "If you're so inclined, speak to me.\nI will give you a hint anytime.$"
gBwText_57_65:
	.string "Do you want to know a hint\nabout looking for Trainers?$"
gBwText_57_66:
	.string "Certainly. Just a moment, please.$"
gBwText_57_67:
	.string "Certainly.\nPlease continue to have a great time!$"
gBwText_57_68:
	.string "Won against every Trainer on the ship!$"
gBwText_57_69:
	.string "Thank you very much for sailing with us\non the Royal Unova.\pThe number of Trainers aboard the\nRoyal Unova today is {STR_VAR_3}.\lPlease enjoy the trip.$"
gBwText_57_70:
	.string "The number of Trainers aboard the\nRoyal Unova today is {STR_VAR_3}.\lYou... Congratulations!\pYou've won against every Trainer\non the ship!\pThe ship is nearing the port.\nWould you like to get off the ship?$"
gBwText_57_71:
	.string "Thank you for sailing with us.\pThis cruise ship will arrive\nin Castelia City shortly.$"
	.align 2
