gBwText_58_0:
	.string "A beautiful melody makes people happy.\nA sad melody makes people sorrowful...\lThat's the power of melodies...$"
gBwText_58_1:
	.string "The scent you brought me reminded me\nof a long-ago melody from the fringes\lof my sepia-toned memories.\pIt was a song my mother loved...\nIt makes me feel so nostalgic.\pWould you like to hear the melody?$"
gBwText_58_2:
	.string "My mother once told me of a Pokémon\nthat played a melody and danced so\llightly that it filled people's hearts\lwith joy.\pThen sorrow darkened the entire world,\nand the Pokémon lost the melody...\pAlso, at that time, some red shoes\nwere lost somewhere...$"
gBwText_58_3:
	.string "When you came through the door,\nI remembered the melody!\pAnd the Pokémon that had forgotten\nhow to dance began to step lightly once\lmore!\pYou are the inspiration.\nYou are a mysterious child...$"
gBwText_58_4:
	.string "Let it sing the Relic Song.\pAria Forme will become Pirouette Forme,\nand vice versa.$"
gBwText_58_5:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} remembered\nthe Relic Song it had forgotten!$"
gBwText_58_6:
	.string "$"
gBwText_58_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_58_8:
	.string "This is your first visit to this café.\nAm I correct?\pPlease...$"
gBwText_58_9:
	.string "Give this to your dear Pokémon.$"
gBwText_58_10:
	.string "You came all the way here.\nEnjoy...$"
gBwText_58_11:
	.string "After a tiring day of work, this café is\na perfect spot to let your mind relax.$"
gBwText_58_12:
	.string "When I listen to his guitar, it reminds\nme of leaving home for the first time,\land the tears of farewell my mother\lcried...$"
	.align 2
