gBwText_60_0:
	.string "Check places you are curious about!\nYou may find some hidden items there.\pIf you use the Town Map item, you may\nfind a new place to explore!\pTalk to a person you are curious about!\nIt may be a wonderful encounter.$"
gBwText_60_1:
	.string "People in the past said wise things.\n“A child who sleeps well grows well.“\pYes, if a Pokémon uses the move Rest,\nthe Pokémon will fall asleep and\lrecover!\pI already taught the move to my\nPokémon, so I will give this to you!$"
gBwText_60_2:
	.string "Even if a Pokémon falls asleep, I heard\nthere is a Berry to wake it up instantly.\pIf a Pokémon holds that Berry and uses\nRest, the Pokémon will fall asleep\land recover, then wake up instantly!\pIt's a great combination!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_60
