	.4byte 3
gBwText_61_0:
	.string "Ghetsis: My word, if it isn't\nthe Gym Leader, Burgh.$"
gBwText_61_1:
	.string "Burgh: So, what would you say is the\nguiding principle of Team Plasma,\lanyway?\p“Take what you want from people“?$"
gBwText_61_2:
	.string "Bronius: I thought it would be amusing\nto prepare a hideout right in front of a\lPokémon Gym, but we were detected\lmore quickly than I imagined.$"
gBwText_61_3:
	.string "Ghetsis: Indeed...\pNo matter. We already have an\nexceptional base of operations.\pIs everyone familiar with the legend\nof the founding of the Unova region?$"
gBwText_61_4:
	.string "Iris: I am! It's the white\nDragon-type Pokémon, right?$"
gBwText_61_5:
	.string "Iris: I am! It's the black\nDragon-type Pokémon, right?$"
gBwText_61_6:
	.string "Ghetsis: The truth is this...\pThe white dragon appeared before a\nhero who sought the true way to knit\ltogether a world full of many warring\lpeople.\pThis white Dragon-type Pokémon shared\nits knowledge--and bared its fangs\lat those who stood against it.\pTogether, the power of this Pokémon\nand the hero brought unity to the\lhearts of everyone in the land, and\lthat is how Unova was created.$"
gBwText_61_7:
	.string "Ghetsis: The truth is this...\pThe black dragon appeared before a\nhero who sought the ideal way to knit\ltogether a world full of warring people.\pThis black Dragon-type Pokémon shared\nits knowledge--and bared its fangs\lat those who stood against it.\pTogether, the power of this Pokémon\nand the hero brought unity to the\lhearts of everyone in the land, and\lthat is how Unova was created.$"
gBwText_61_8:
	.string "We shall bring back the hero and\nthat Pokémon to Unova once again!\pIf we can win people's hearts and\nminds, we can easily create the world\lthat I--I mean, Team Plasma--desires!$"
gBwText_61_9:
	.string "Burgh: Here in Castelia, we have\na lot of different kinds of people.\pEveryone's ways of thinking and\nlifestyles are very different.\pHonestly, there's something about what\nyou're saying I don't quite\lunderstand.$"
gBwText_61_10:
	.string "Yes?$"
gBwText_61_11:
	.string "What is it?$"
gBwText_61_12:
	.string "Burgh: One thing we all have in\ncommon is that we all care a lot\labout Pokémon.\pEven people meeting for the first time\ncan talk about Pokémon.\lTalk or battle or trade...$"
gBwText_61_13:
	.string "Remember your speech at Accumula\nTown?\pYou were responsible for leading me to\nrethink my relationship with Pokémon.\lFor that, I thank you.\pAt that time, I made a promise...\pI swore to myself that I would dedicate\nmyself to Pokémon even more strongly!\pWhat you guys are doing... Aren't you\ngoing to strengthen the bond between\lpeople and Pokémon even more?$"
gBwText_61_14:
	.string "Ghetsis: Myah-ha-ha-ha!\pYou are quite hard to figure out--a\nlittle more intelligent than I'd\lexpected.\pI am fond of intelligent people, you\nsee. You'll enjoy hearing about this...\pFrom every corner of the world,\nI have gathered knowledgeable people\lfor our king's benefit.\pYou could call them the Seven Sages.\pVery well! We will submit to your\nopinion and be on our way.$"
gBwText_61_15:
	.string "That girl over there...\nReturn her Pokémon!$"
gBwText_61_16:
	.string "Bianca: Th-thank you!\pMunny, I'm so glad to see you again!$"
gBwText_61_17:
	.string "Iris: Bianca!\pWhy are you thanking them?\nThey take people's precious Pokémon!$"
gBwText_61_18:
	.string "Bianca: It's just... I'm...I'm so happy\nthat my Munna is safe.$"
gBwText_61_19:
	.string "Ghetsis: The friendship between\nPokémon and people can be very\ltouching.\pBut, in order to liberate Pokémon from\nfoolish people, we will revive the legend\lof Unova--and win the hearts and minds\lof everyone. Farewell...$"
gBwText_61_20:
	.string "Iris: What are you doing?\nWhy are you letting them get away?!$"
gBwText_61_21:
	.string "Burgh: Gah!\pWhat do we do if anything's happened\nto the other stolen Pokémon?$"
gBwText_61_22:
	.string "Bianca: It's OK. Thank you, Iris!\pNo one was hurt. More than anything,\nI got my darling Pokémon back again!$"
gBwText_61_23:
	.string "Iris: OK, if you're happy...$"
gBwText_61_24:
	.string "Burgh: What is everyone\nplanning to do now?$"
gBwText_61_25:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, it would be sensational to\nlook around Castelia City, but...$"
gBwText_61_26:
	.string "Iris: Don't worry!\nI'll keep on being your bodyguard!$"
gBwText_61_27:
	.string "Bianca: Iris...$"
gBwText_61_28:
	.string "Burgh: Uh-hm. That's great!\pIris is a dazzling Pokémon Trainer,\nbut maybe not at home in the\lbig city yet.\pSo, a little give-and-take, hm! People\nand Pokémon need to help each other\lout!$"
gBwText_61_29:
	.string "Iris: Also, thanks for looking\nfor the Pokémon!\pHere, this is for you!$"
gBwText_61_30:
	.string "Iris: Also, thanks for looking\nfor the Pokémon!\pHere, this is for you!$"
gBwText_61_31:
	.string "Iris: See you!$"
gBwText_61_32:
	.string "Wha...$"
gBwText_61_33:
	.string "Waaait!$"
gBwText_61_34:
	.string "Burgh: Well, then, {STR_VAR_1}.\nI'll be waiting in the Gym.$"
gBwText_61_35:
	.string "Burgh: Well, then, {STR_VAR_1}.\nI'll be waiting in the Gym.$"
gBwText_61_36:
	.string "$"
gBwText_61_37:
	.string "$"
gBwText_61_38:
	.string "$"
