gBwText_63_0:
	.string "I am a Pokémon fanatic.\nI am famous in Castelia, too!\pOh, look!\nYou have a Pokédex!\pHow many Pokémon\nhave you found so far?\p...\n{STR_VAR_1} Pokémon!\pIf you have 20 Pokémon or more,\nI'll give you something good!$"
gBwText_63_1:
	.string "I am a Pokémon fanatic.\nI am famous in Castelia, too!\pOh, look!\nYou have a Pokédex!\pWell, how many Pokémon\nhave you found so far?\p...\n{STR_VAR_1} Pokémon!\lThis is quite a Pokédex!\pI am quite impressed, so\nI will give this to you!$"
gBwText_63_2:
	.string "Eviolite is great!\pBoth Defense and Special Defense of\nthe Pokémon who holds it will increase!\pHowever, it's a peculiar stone because\nit's only effective on Pokémon that\lcan still evolve.$"
gBwText_63_3:
	.string "I've been thinking about starting\na new business...\pBut it's quite a chore.$"
gBwText_63_4:
	.string "Do you think it's a good idea to provide\na service to raise Pokémon for\lTrainers?\pWhat? There's a Pokémon Day Care on\nRoute 3?!$"
gBwText_63_5:
	.string "What kinds of Abilities do\nyour Pokémon have?$"
gBwText_63_6:
	.string "My Patrat's Ability is Keen Eye!\pEven SmokeScreen and Sand-Attack\ncannot lower its accuracy!$"
gBwText_63_7:
	.string "Skeeree!$"
gBwText_63_8:
	.string "Hmmm! Fantastic! Excellent!\nBurgh's paintings are magnificent!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_63
