gBwText_66_0:
	.string "Welcome!\nWelcome to my party!\pPlease enjoy conversations\nwith everyone!$"
gBwText_66_1:
	.string "Ich habe mir nun ein Auto zugelegt!\pDamit ist die nächste Stadt auch\nganz ohne Orden zum Greifen nah!\pEs sei denn, ich rassele durch\nmeine Führerscheinprüfung...$"
gBwText_66_2:
	.string "Hello. Have you tried a Casteliacone\nyet?\pI managed to buy one on Tuesday, but\nit's very difficult to get!$"
gBwText_66_3:
	.string "Hey, Trainer!\nCheck out my moves!\pHave you gone to the next city yet?\nI learned this move at the\lmusical over there.\lPretty cool, isn't it?$"
gBwText_66_4:
	.string "Ohhhh! Your Pokémon are so charming!\pI want cute Pokémon, too, so I can\nuse this!$"
gBwText_66_5:
	.string "This move makes your Pokémon\nunbearably charming!\pAll Pokémon of the opposite gender\nwill fall in love!$"
gBwText_66_6:
	.string "Did you see the dress that the\nsupermodel, Elesa, was wearing?$"
gBwText_66_7:
	.string "Whatever Elesa wears is beautiful.\nA stunning ensemble!$"
gBwText_66_8:
	.string "My boyfriend isn't good at getting out\nof bed in the morning...\pIn fact, he's so slow getting out of\nbed that I asked his Pokémon to use\lWake-Up Slap on him!$"
gBwText_66_9:
	.string "Ciao!\nTi stai divertendo?\pNon sentirti in imbarazzo.\nParla pure con chi vuoi.$"
gBwText_66_10:
	.string "It's hard to get up the morning after\na fun day like today.$"
gBwText_66_11:
	.string "I've asked my Pokémon to use Sing\ninstead of setting an alarm clock.\pBut I cannot get up at all.\nI don't know why.$"
gBwText_66_12:
	.string "¡Es la primera vez que vengo aquí!\p¡Pero este precioso paisaje hace\nque me sienta como en casa!\p¡La próxima vez traeré a mis amigos!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_66
