gBwTextCount_66:
	.4byte 13
gBwText_67_0:
	.string "Team Plasma: Gramps! We know you run\nthe Day Care!\pHow do we know?\nBecause we're Team Plasma!$"
gBwText_67_1:
	.string "Team Plasma: We are taking Pokémon away\nfrom people.\pSince you work at the Day Care, we\nfigure you must have a lot of Pokémon!\lHand 'em over!$"
gBwText_67_2:
	.string "Day-Care Man: What kind of\nnonsense is this?!$"
gBwText_67_3:
	.string "Oh! A strong-looking Trainer!\nPlease help me!$"
gBwText_67_4:
	.string "Team Plasma: If you're going to get in\nour way, we'll take your Pokémon, too!$"
gBwText_67_5:
	.string "Team Plasma: !!$"
gBwText_67_6:
	.string "Team Plasma: This went downhill fast!\nSo I think... We'd better... Ruuuun!\pLet's hide out at the amusement park!$"
gBwText_67_7:
	.string "Day-Care Man: Thank you so much!\pPlease take this as a token\nof my gratitude.\pIt's a brand-new Bike.\nI'd always planned on riding around\lNimbasa City...\lBut I never ended up riding it.$"
gBwText_67_8:
	.string "Day-Care Man: I have a Day Care\non Route 3!\pIf you have any Pokémon you want\nme to raise, please drop them off!\pI just came to sightsee, but\nI got in a lot of trouble!$"
gBwText_67_9:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}! Yoo-hoo!$"
gBwText_67_10:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}! Know what?$"
gBwText_67_11:
	.string "The professor told me Nimbasa City\nhas a lot of things to see and do--\pthe amusement park, Big Stadium,\nSmall Court, and the Battle Subway!$"
gBwText_67_12:
	.string "I'm going to go see the Pokémon\nMusical! See you later!$"
gBwText_67_13:
	.string "Bianca: Yoo-hoo, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_67_14:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}! Know what?$"
gBwText_67_15:
	.string "I just had a look at the Musical\nTheater. It's sooo cool!\pSince you're here, come on, {STR_VAR_1}!\pCome with me!\nOver here, over here!$"
gBwText_67_16:
	.string "OK, we're here! Let's go in!$"
gBwText_67_17:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh, {STR_VAR_1}!\pAre you interested in musicals?\nThen, let's go in together!$"
gBwText_67_18:
	.string "Bianca: Daddy?!\nWhat are you doing here?$"
gBwText_67_19:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: I've come to take you\nback home, of course!\pYour mother told me that you'd\nmade it all the way out here.\pHaven't you gone far enough?$"
gBwText_67_20:
	.string "Bianca: No way!\pI'm going to keep traveling\nwith {STR_VAR_1} and my Pokémon!$"
gBwText_67_21:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Absolutely not! Others do\nthings their way, and we do things ours!$"
gBwText_67_22:
	.string "Bianca: Is that so?\pThen, how about you do things your way,\nand I'll do things mine!$"
gBwText_67_23:
	.string "Sweetie, you keep going on your travels.$"
gBwText_67_24:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Hey! Who do you think\nyou are? This is a family matter!$"
gBwText_67_25:
	.string "My name is Elesa.\pI'm this town's Gym Leader.\nI also happen to be a model.$"
gBwText_67_26:
	.string "You know, there are many people\nin this world.\pThere are people whose way of thinking\nmay be completely different from yours.\lSometimes, this means you may get hurt.$"
gBwText_67_27:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Of course!\pThat's exactly right!\nIt's because I'm worried about that...$"
gBwText_67_28:
	.string "Elesa: But it's important to keep\ntrying, to learn about the differences\lbetween yourself and others...\pTo learn that being different is OK.\pAnd you shouldn't worry.\pTrainers always have Pokémon\nat their side.\pPokémon are wonderful. It's not only\nhow cute they can be, but also how much\lyou can depend on them...$"
gBwText_67_29:
	.string "Bianca: Please!\pI know there's gonna be painful stuff\nlike you're worrying about!\lI know! Really, I get it!\pBut, like, listen...\nThere'll be tons of nice people, too.\pKnow what else? Since I've been\ntraveling with Pokémon, I've already\lgotten tougher, I can totally tell.\pSo...please?$"
gBwText_67_30:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Hmm...\nI guess.\pIf wanting to continue your journey\nis selfishness on your part,\lwanting to stop you is\lselfishness on mine.\pI'm surprised to find I'm the one\nbeing childish--at my age!$"
gBwText_67_31:
	.string "This Gym Leader's comments helped me\nwake up.\pBianca, I'm sure it's better that you\ntake the path you want to take now.\pI hope that your journey will be fun.\nBon voyage!$"
gBwText_67_32:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, please...\nTake care of my little girl, OK?$"
gBwText_67_33:
	.string "Bianca: Papa, I'll come home after\nI find out what I really want to do!$"
gBwText_67_34:
	.string "Elesa: I'm sure he traveled\nas a Trainer himself, in the past...\lBeing a parent must be hard.$"
gBwText_67_35:
	.string "Did I meddle unnecessarily?\pYou looked troubled, so\nI decided to chime in.$"
gBwText_67_36:
	.string "By the way, if you're Trainers, please\nstop by the Pokémon Gym.\pI'll teach you a little something about\nhow tough a journey can get.$"
gBwText_67_37:
	.string "I'm sorry, {STR_VAR_1}.\nI'll be waiting on Route 5.$"
gBwText_67_38:
	.string "Bianca: She's so cool! Hah!\nI want to be a totally cool woman\llike Elesa!\pMm. I wonder how I'll get there.\pWell, before that, I guess I need to\ndiscover what I really want to do!\lSee you later, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_67_39:
	.string "We athletes and our Pokémon\nshow excellent teamwork!\pYou can see it at Big Stadium and\nSmall Court, so please stop by!$"
gBwText_67_40:
	.string "As it happens, Nimbasa City is a major\ndestination for Pokémon battles.\pThere are Pokémon Trainers in\nlots of these buildings.$"
gBwText_67_41:
	.string "Leisurely trips by train...\pRiding from Gear Station to\nAnville Town feels a bit like a dream.$"
gBwText_67_42:
	.string "Coming to flashy Nimbasa City makes\nme feel light and happy, as if I were\lholding an Air Balloon.$"
gBwText_67_43:
	.string "There are performers\ncrowding around Route 5.\pSeeing all the fun the Pokémon and\nTrainers are having fills me with\lenergy!$"
gBwText_67_44:
	.string "I was a good girl, so I got to\ngo to the amusement park!$"
gBwText_67_45:
	.string "Ferris wheel! Ferris wheel!\nI love Ferris wheels!$"
gBwText_67_46:
	.string "Nimbasa's Pokémon Gym is\nin the amusement park!\pNo doubt it has a surprising gimmick!$"
gBwText_67_47:
	.string "I won!\nThen I lost...$"
gBwText_67_48:
	.string "Gear Station has trains where\nyou can battle other Trainers.\lThe Battle Subway!$"
gBwText_67_49:
	.string "You're a Trainer, aren't you?\nPlease just accept this without a word!$"
gBwText_67_50:
	.string "If you have a Vs. Recorder, you can\nrecord battles with friends or on the\lBattle Subway!\pAnyway, this woman of mystery will\ngo somewhere... That's right!\lShe'll go to the Battle Institute!$"
gBwText_67_51:
	.string "Nimbasa City\nLit by the Flash of Lightning!$"
gBwText_67_52:
	.string "Big Stadium\nBaseball, Football, and Soccer$"
gBwText_67_53:
	.string "Small Court\nTennis and Basketball$"
gBwText_67_54:
	.string "Battle Subway\nBattle and Ride!$"
gBwText_67_55:
	.string "Musical Theater$"
gBwText_67_56:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pGames occur at specific times in\nBig Stadium and Small Court!\pYou might be able to have a Pokémon\nbattle with your favorite athlete!$"
gBwText_67_57:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pThe Musical Theater is always\nlooking for participants!\pYou might get more wonderful Props\nif you participate repeatedly!$"
gBwText_67_58:
	.string "Battle Institute!\nTest your Trainer Skills!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_67
