	.4byte 59
gBwText_68_0:
	.string "Did the fantastic speed leave you\ndizzy?\pMy beloved Pokémon will be the next one\nto make your head spin!$"
gBwText_68_1:
	.string "My, oh my...\nYou have a sweet fighting style.\pI mean, you're a great Trainer!\nExcuse me, I...uh... Oh, here!\lI want you to have this!$"
gBwText_68_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the\nBolt Badge from Elesa!$"
gBwText_68_3:
	.string "If you have four Badges, including this\nBolt Badge, Pokémon up to Lv. 50,\lincluding traded Pokémon, will obey you.\pAlso, here's this move I like.\nFeel free to use it, um, if you want to.$"
gBwText_68_4:
	.string "Volt Switch lets the Pokémon switch\nwith a different Pokémon after\lattacking.\pOf course, if you don't have another\nPokémon in your party, you can't\lswitch.$"
gBwText_68_5:
	.string "You're going to Driftveil City next?\pOf course. There is a Pokémon Gym there,\nafter all. Oh...\pI bet you won't be able to get there.\nYou know what?\pI'll fix it so you can cross.\nWait for me on Route 5.$"
gBwText_68_6:
	.string "What you'd like to do...\nWhat your Pokémon would like to do...\pDon't you think it could be amazing\nif those are aligned?$"
gBwText_68_7:
	.string "Elesa: I think the real me is the one who\nbattles with Pokémon as a Gym Leader.\pA model's job is to make someone else's\nvision look like a reality.\lIt's interesting, but it's not easy...$"
gBwText_68_8:
	.string "Are you cool riding a roller coaster?$"
gBwText_68_9:
	.string "When you ride a roller coaster, the\nspeed can make you dizzy.\pI'm going to make your head spin with a\nPokémon battle that's just as intense!$"
gBwText_68_10:
	.string "Your way of battling...\nIt's elegant! You've got style!\lEven compared to Ms. Elesa!$"
gBwText_68_11:
	.string "If you press the switches, the\nroller coaster's path will change.$"
gBwText_68_12:
	.string "Your Nimbasa Gym challenge is finally\nnearing its finale.\pBut if you don't beat me,\nyou won't get to meet Ms. Elesa.$"
gBwText_68_13:
	.string "I'm also a Pokémon Trainer who was\ntoughened up by Ms. Elesa.\pI'll show you power and style befitting\nthis Gym.$"
gBwText_68_14:
	.string "It pleases me to be the opponent of a\nstrong and honorable Trainer like you!$"
gBwText_68_15:
	.string "If you maintain your calm and don't get\nflustered by this Gym's gimmicks,\lyou'll be able to defeat Ms. Elesa...\land any other Trainer, as well!$"
gBwText_68_16:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} pressed the switch.\pThe roller coaster's path\nhas been changed!$"
gBwText_68_17:
	.string "How about it? I can see you're\nsurprised!\pWould you ever have guessed that\nthis Gym is a roller coaster?\pOK, let me fill you in...\nAnd take this, too!$"
gBwText_68_18:
	.string "In this roller coaster Gym, the first\nstep is to get in the car.\pNext comes the platform!\nThere, you can change\lwhere the coaster is going!\pSometimes you continue by riding\nthe cars of opponents you defeat.\lThat's how you aim for the Gym Leader!\pBy the way, Electric-type Pokémon\ndon't do well against Ground-type\lmoves...$"
gBwText_68_19:
	.string "Elesa uses sparkling bright\nElectric-type attacks!\pBut the combination of you and your\nPokémon was even more impressive!\pIt was... It was...\nan emotional roller coaster!$"
gBwText_68_20:
	.string "Nimbasa Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Elesa\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_68_21:
	.string "Nimbasa Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Elesa\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_68_22:
	.string "Nimbasa Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Elesa\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_68
