gBwText_69_0:
	.string "N: You're looking for Team Plasma,\nright?\pThey ran into the amusement park.\nCome with me.$"
gBwText_69_1:
	.string "N: They're not here.\pLet's ride the Ferris wheel\nand see if we can spot them.\pI love Ferris wheels.\nThe circular motion... The mechanics...\pThey're like collections of\nelegant formulas.$"
gBwText_69_2:
	.string "Team Plasma: My lord N!$"
gBwText_69_3:
	.string "Team Plasma: You're safe, sire!$"
gBwText_69_4:
	.string "N: There's no problem.\pYou're part of the people we brought in\nto help us save the Pokémon.\lSo, you're under my protection, as well.\pGo, quickly, and let my battle cover\nyour retreat.\p...Now then, {STR_VAR_1},\ndo you follow my logic?$"
gBwText_69_5:
	.string "If true, your words please me.\pAh. Then...\nThe future I envision...\pPerhaps I can't beat you here and now,\nbut I'll battle you to buy time for\lthese members of Team Plasma to get\laway!$"
gBwText_69_6:
	.string "So that's how it is...\nThat's unfortunate.\pAh. Then...\nThe future I envision...\pPerhaps I can't beat you here and now,\nbut I'll battle you anyway to buy time\lfor these members of Team Plasma\lto flee.$"
gBwText_69_7:
	.string "N: You're quite strong.\pBut I have a future that I must change.\nAnd, for that future...$"
gBwText_69_8:
	.string "I'll defeat the Champion and become\nunbeatable, unlike any other!\pI'll make all Trainers free their\nPokémon! Just try and stop me!\pIf you want to be together with\nPokémon, your only hope is to collect\lthe Badges from each area and head for\lthe Pokémon League! Try and stop me\lthere, if you dare!$"
gBwText_69_9:
	.string "If your conviction is not strong\nenough, you will never be able to defeat\lme.$"
gBwText_69_10:
	.string "Whooshing, swooshing roller coaster!\nWhirltwirlwhirltwirl...whoa!$"
gBwText_69_11:
	.string "Spinning, spinning Ferris wheel!\nClimbing, climbing Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_69_12:
	.string "No matter how old you get, amusement\nparks are always exciting, am I right?$"
gBwText_69_13:
	.string "Look! Look!\nIt's a clown!$"
gBwText_69_14:
	.string "Nimbasa City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Elesa\lThe Shining Beauty$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_69
