gBwText_71_0:
	.string "You can take the Battle Subway from\nGear Station!$"
gBwText_71_1:
	.string "The Battle Subway!\pAs the name suggests, it's the subway\nwhere Trainers wage battles.$"
gBwText_71_2:
	.string "The Battle Subway has seven lines\nin total!\pBut I heard that the only lines you can\ntake at the beginning are the Single,\lDouble, or Multi Trains!$"
gBwText_71_3:
	.string "The Battle Subway has seven lines\nin total!\pBut you can't take the trains called\n“Super“ unless you make a great effort.$"
gBwText_71_4:
	.string "Hi, hi!\pPlease tell me how you introduce\nyourself before a battle and how you\lfeel when you win or lose.$"
gBwText_71_5:
	.string "Please tell me how you introduce\nyourself before a battle.$"
gBwText_71_6:
	.string "Please tell me how you feel when you\nlose a battle.$"
gBwText_71_7:
	.string "Please tell me how you feel when you\nwin a battle!$"
gBwText_71_8:
	.string "Please tell me how you feel when you\nbecome No. 1!$"
gBwText_71_9:
	.string "Got it! Thanks!\n{STR_VAR_1}, huh...$"
gBwText_71_10:
	.string "Oh, you prefer not to say?\nOh, well...$"
gBwText_71_11:
	.string "Thanks! Will you tell me your other\nfeelings, too?$"
gBwText_71_12:
	.string "Got it! Thanks!$"
gBwText_71_13:
	.string "INTRODUCTION$"
gBwText_71_14:
	.string "WHEN YOU WIN$"
gBwText_71_15:
	.string "WHEN YOU LOSE$"
gBwText_71_16:
	.string "WHEN YOU BECOME NO. 1$"
gBwText_71_17:
	.string "NOT TELLING$"
gBwText_71_18:
	.string "Platform for Single Trains$"
gBwText_71_19:
	.string "Platform for Double Trains$"
gBwText_71_20:
	.string "Platform for Multi Trains$"
gBwText_71_21:
	.string "Platform for Wi-Fi Trains$"
gBwText_71_22:
	.string "Platform for Super Single Trains$"
gBwText_71_23:
	.string "Platform for Super Double Trains$"
gBwText_71_24:
	.string "Platform for Super Multi Trains$"
gBwText_71_25:
	.string "Platform for Trains to Anville Town$"
gBwText_71_26:
	.string "Under Construction$"
	.align 2
