gBwText_81_0:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received {STR_VAR_2} BP!$"
gBwText_81_1:
	.string "Saving your record data...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_81_2:
	.string "Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_81_3:
	.string "Congratulations! You've successfully\nreached a seven-win streak!\pSince you've won seven in a row,\nI present you with these Battle Points!$"
gBwText_81_4:
	.string "Congratulations!\pYou had a seven-win streak and\nbrilliantly beat the Subway Boss,\lso I present you with these\lBattle Points.$"
gBwText_81_5:
	.string "And, {STR_VAR_1}, now you have earned\nthe right to challenge\lthe Super Single Train!$"
gBwText_81_6:
	.string "And, {STR_VAR_1}, now you have earned\nthe right to challenge\lthe Super Double Train!$"
gBwText_81_7:
	.string "And, {STR_VAR_1}, now you have earned\nthe right to challenge\lthe Super Multi Train!$"
gBwText_81_8:
	.string "Also, to commemorate this, I give you\nthis trophy.\pPlease display it in your home!$"
gBwText_81_9:
	.string "Please enjoy your time here.\pIf you would like to continue your\nchallenge or go back to Nimbasa City,\lplease talk to me.$"
gBwText_81_10:
	.string "This is the end of the Single Train line.\pWhen you want to return to Nimbasa\nCity, please talk to me again.\pPlease enjoy your time here.$"
gBwText_81_11:
	.string "This is the end of the Double Train line.\pWhen you want to return to Nimbasa\nCity, please talk to me again.\pPlease enjoy your time here.$"
gBwText_81_12:
	.string "This is the end of the Multi Train line.\pWhen you want to return to Nimbasa\nCity, please talk to me again.\pPlease enjoy your time here.$"
gBwText_81_13:
	.string "Do you want to return to Nimbasa City?$"
gBwText_81_14:
	.string "Well then, we'll return to Nimbasa City.$"
gBwText_81_15:
	.string "What would you like to do?$"
gBwText_81_16:
	.string "Continue Challenge$"
gBwText_81_17:
	.string "Return to Nimbasa City$"
gBwText_81_18:
	.string "Stay Here$"
gBwText_81_19:
	.string "Awaiting your friend's response...$"
gBwText_81_20:
	.string "“Return to Nimbasa City” was chosen, so\nyour challenge\lwill end for now.$"
gBwText_81_21:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, you have been promoted\nto Rank {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_81_22:
	.string "Would you like to send these results\nusing Nintendo WFC?$"
gBwText_81_23:
	.string "There's still a lot more to go, but let's\ndo our best!$"
gBwText_81_24:
	.string "There's still a lot more to go, but let's\ndo our best!$"
gBwText_81_25:
	.string "We finally made it this far!\pOur opponents will get tougher, but\nlet's do our best and not get\ldiscouraged!$"
gBwText_81_26:
	.string "We finally made it this far!\pOur opponents will get tougher, but\nlet's do our best and not get\ldiscouraged!$"
gBwText_81_27:
	.string "We finally made it here!\p...Could we be the best partners ever?!$"
gBwText_81_28:
	.string "We finally made it here!\p...Could we be the best partners ever?!$"
gBwText_81_29:
	.string "This is the end of the Wi-Fi Train line.\pWhen you want to return to Nimbasa\nCity, please talk to me again.\pPlease enjoy your time here.$"
gBwText_81_30:
	.string "The challenge was interrupted.$"
gBwText_81_31:
	.string "The selection was canceled.$"
gBwText_81_32:
	.string "Constant battles make me nervous.\nI'm taking a little rest here.$"
gBwText_81_33:
	.string "I'm going to save up Battle Points and\nget some items for my Pokémon to hold.$"
gBwText_81_34:
	.string "For each seven-win streak, the Trainers\nand Pokémon who challenge you become\lprogressively tougher.$"
gBwText_81_35:
	.string "I've decided to use only cute Pokémon!\pDo you have any unique thing you're\nparticular about?$"
gBwText_81_36:
	.string "OK! I'm all prepared!\nAll aboard for a battle journey!$"
gBwText_81_37:
	.string "Phew...I'm worn out.\pThese Trainers are tough. I wonder\nhow far I'll get with my skills.$"
gBwText_81_38:
	.string "Have you heard of the Subway Bosses?\pThey appear only to strong Trainers,\nand they challenge them to battles.\pThey are the Battle Subway's bosses.$"
gBwText_81_39:
	.string "That last battle was tough...\pI should've traded in my BP for a\nbetter item.$"
gBwText_81_40:
	.string "If you have wooon, the trip goes ooon!\nRelying on Pokémon, this vagabooond!$"
gBwText_81_41:
	.string "About time to take it to the next level.\nGive it your best shot, too!$"
gBwText_81_42:
	.string "The Trainers here are really tough\nfrom the very start.$"
gBwText_81_43:
	.string "My 42nd straight win...\nNot too shabby, eh?$"
gBwText_81_44:
	.string "Can't believe I won 84 straight...\nIs this a dream or a hallucination?$"
gBwText_81_45:
	.string "You've got a 14-win streak!\nPretty good! Not bad!$"
gBwText_81_46:
	.string "I hear the Super Train is endless!\pIn other words, if you keep winning, you\ncan keep going, on and on to wherever!$"
gBwText_81_47:
	.string "I can go a lot further!\nI can win a lot more!$"
gBwText_81_48:
	.string "The eyes of the Trainers here are very\nserious, or maybe you could say\lglinting.$"
gBwText_81_49:
	.string "Is this the best this officer can do...?\pThe light from the passing trains seems\nway too bright.$"
gBwText_81_50:
	.string "The Subway Boss was a suspicious,\nstrange fellow.\pI still don't believe he was giving it\nhis all.$"
gBwText_81_51:
	.string "Challenging people is also part of my\npolice training.$"
gBwText_81_52:
	.string "I can legally go as wild as I want!\nThis place! It's paradise, isn't it?$"
gBwText_81_53:
	.string "My journey has just started!\nNeither of us can afford to lose!$"
gBwText_81_54:
	.string "Being alone on the station's platform\nsomehow makes me feel a little sad.\pPeople leave on their journeys here,\nand it reminds me of those memories.$"
gBwText_81_55:
	.string "The Subway Boss was a piece of cake!\pMaybe I should cut loose on the\nSuper Train next time!$"
gBwText_81_56:
	.string "The Trainers sure have become\nstronger. I'm feeling a little uneasy...$"
gBwText_81_57:
	.string "It looks like my Pokémon skill has\nreached its peak power.\pI couldn't let go of my dreams...\nI'll hang them on you, stranger,\lyoung Trainer.\pAnd this is proof.\nPlease accept this, youngster...$"
gBwText_81_58:
	.string "I'm going to return to my home and\nquietly cheer myself up with art!$"
gBwText_81_59:
	.string "Oh ho ho ho...\pI've already done better than I did\nduring my last challenge!$"
gBwText_81_60:
	.string "Battle between two excellent Trainers\nis very artistic.$"
gBwText_81_61:
	.string "For being called a Subway Boss,\nthat Trainer sure wasn't as strong\las “Boss“ suggests.\pIt was almost as if...\pAs if they are simply gauging\nhow strong we really are.$"
gBwText_81_62:
	.string "Well then!\pIt's about time to get on\nthe train!$"
gBwText_81_63:
	.string "Now just wait a minute, little Pokémon!\nI'll let you battle lots and lots soon!$"
gBwText_81_64:
	.string "Urk!\pI got motion sickness on the train...$"
gBwText_81_65:
	.string "You beat our boss, right?\nNot half bad, hey!\pAnd now, super Trainer, you've\nearned the qualification to take on the\lSuper Train!\pThe Trainers on the Super Train are\nreally tough.\pIf you want to know the essence of the\nBattle Subway, you should give it a try!$"
gBwText_81_66:
	.string "I'd rather have an exciting battle than\nslowly drive the train.$"
gBwText_81_67:
	.string "Where did you come from?\nAnd where are you going?$"
gBwText_81_68:
	.string "We Depot Agents are the protectors of\npeace and order in the station.\pWe are verrry opposed to littering on\nthe platform, shouting or playing\linstruments, loitering, or any\lactivities that bother other people!$"
gBwText_81_69:
	.string "Just like how a machine needs\nfine-tuning, Pokémon need maintenance,\ltoo.\pIt's a necessity.\pFor example, rethinking the moves that\na Pokémon knows.$"
gBwText_81_70:
	.string "No clumsy gimmicks...\nNo unnecessary items...\pThe only thing you can rely on is the\nstrength of you and your Pokémon.\pThis place is wonderful, isn't it?$"
gBwText_81_71:
	.string "Over 100 straight victories...\pIf this is all due to your strength,\nyou're even a match for the Champion.$"
gBwText_81_72:
	.string "The strength of the Trainers on\nthe Super Train is beyond imagination!$"
gBwText_81_73:
	.string "I had a taste of it...\nThe rush of battle...\pI shouldn't...\nIt's too wild...\pBut at this rate, I'm going to\nend up on the path of battlers...$"
gBwText_81_74:
	.string "Howdy! I'm a genius Pilot!\nUnova's finest!\pAnd I'm comin' in first here, too!$"
gBwText_81_75:
	.string "I've seen elite Trainers like me\nall over the place, but...\pSeems like the battles will be tough\nfrom here on.$"
gBwText_81_76:
	.string "Even for an elite Trainer such as\nmyself, it's starting to get hard.$"
gBwText_81_77:
	.string "Hey, how are you doing?\nI'm still going strong!$"
gBwText_81_78:
	.string "I've a-done it--77 straight wins!\nThat number has a lucky sound!$"
gBwText_81_79:
	.string "We've defeated over 300 Trainers...$"
gBwText_81_80:
	.string "My my, what a weak-looking Trainer...\pI think I would just get bored if I\nbattled you...\pI'll give you this, so just get a little\ntougher, OK?$"
gBwText_81_81:
	.string "I'm only interested in strong\nopponents...\pIf you get tougher, I wouldn't\nmind battling you.$"
gBwText_81_82:
	.string "Not many people left on the platform...\pGuess that shows how hard it is\nto keep winning on the Battle Subway.$"
gBwText_81_83:
	.string "...\pHuh? What? What do you want?\pI'm busy planning my tactics for my\nnext battle.\pI don't mean to be rude, but I really\nneed to concentrate. Would you mind\lnot talking to me right now?$"
gBwText_81_84:
	.string "91 straight victories is nothing more\nthan a natural result for me.\pMy glorious record will just keep\ngoing up!$"
gBwText_81_85:
	.string "You...\nYou have the same eyes as me.\pYou love battling so much...\nNo, it's not just that...\pBattling is your reason for living.\nYou and I are the same type, aren't we?\pSo...I'll give you this.$"
gBwText_81_86:
	.string "You're continuing your battle, right?\pThat's because we are that type of\nperson, aren't we...$"
gBwText_81_87:
	.string "I'm going to leave a rockin' record and\nturn into a big star!$"
gBwText_81_88:
	.string "Hey, how are you doing?\nI'm still going strong!$"
gBwText_81_89:
	.string "There's more to Pokémon than it seems.\pThe world of Pokémon battling really\ngets deeper and deeper.$"
gBwText_81_90:
	.string "I found this when I was cleaning.\nYou can have it if you'd like.$"
gBwText_81_91:
	.string "Oh, no need to thank me!\nAfter all, I just found it in the trash.\pI don't understand it. Recently, many\nfolks have just been throwing away\lperfectly good things.$"
gBwText_81_92:
	.string "I may be a Janitor, but I have a lot\nof confidence in my abilities!$"
gBwText_81_93:
	.string "All right! Bring out your Poké Balls!\nNow is the time for a battle!$"
gBwText_81_94:
	.string "You like battles, too!$"
gBwText_81_95:
	.string "I can't believe a Veteran like me\nwould get into trouble like that.\pWhere in the world are the Trainers\nhere training?$"
gBwText_81_96:
	.string "How are you doing, Trainer?\nAre you starting to get tired yet?$"
gBwText_81_97:
	.string "Mumble, mumble, mumble...\pIn order to bring good fortune, I always\nthink about my family before a battle.$"
gBwText_81_98:
	.string "I've been watching you battle.\pNice technique and judgment... Not\nsurprising, after a win streak like\lyours.$"
gBwText_81_99:
	.string "Not many people around.\pBut each person who is still here has\nshown true strength.$"
gBwText_81_100:
	.string "Even a Veteran can lose to a\nPreschooler if they get careless.\pPokémon battling requires that you\nalways be on guard.$"
gBwText_81_101:
	.string "Just a little more to 50 straight wins!\nSuddenly, I'm all pumped up!$"
gBwText_81_102:
	.string "You have the face of someone who\nabsolutely loves Pokémon battling.\pEven now, you're still completely\nhooked on battling. Amazing.\pHee hee...\nYou have a promising future!$"
gBwText_81_103:
	.string "You and I both have 91 straight wins!\pWhich of us will reach a 100-win\nstreak first?$"
gBwText_81_104:
	.string "Dawn and dusk behind my battles...\pThe rocking train softly rattles...\pHow many hours have now passed\nsince we left Nimbasa in the past?$"
gBwText_81_105:
	.string "This is the end of the line...\pThe trip sure ended quickly.\nI don't want to go home yet.$"
gBwText_81_106:
	.string "If you've made it this far, that means\nyou've won 14 in a row.\pWhat a fluke! Fourteen is how old I am!\pHa ha ha...$"
gBwText_81_107:
	.string "I'm going to let people know I'm still\nas active as ever!$"
gBwText_81_108:
	.string "It's the end of the line already...\pI guess that means my Pokémon\nbattle journey is over for now.$"
gBwText_81_109:
	.string "Phew...\pThis long journey is hard on this\nold body.$"
gBwText_81_110:
	.string "Hmm. You've got 28 straight wins, huh?\pThis time, I want to keep going\nwith this momentum.$"
gBwText_81_111:
	.string "You also beat the Subway Boss, right?\nSomeday I want to battle you, too!$"
gBwText_81_112:
	.string "When my favorite Poké Ball begins\nto shake, I tremble with excitement!\pYou're no ordinary Trainer, are you?\nPerhaps you are the Champion\lsomewhere?$"
gBwText_81_113:
	.string "Winning battles feels good, but I've\ntraveled quite far...I wonder if I can\lget back in time for work tomorrow...$"
gBwText_81_114:
	.string "I finally have a 49-battle win streak.\pIf I can do this well at work, I wonder\nif I can get promoted...$"
gBwText_81_115:
	.string "Both you and I have won more than\n100 straight battles!\pI may have too much time on my hands,\nbut so do you.\pTake this to commemorate our meeting\nof two similar people!$"
gBwText_81_116:
	.string "It's a really precious Berry, but I\ndon't know how to use it other than to\leat it as a snack...$"
gBwText_81_117:
	.string "It's a subway map of the Unova region.$"
gBwText_81_118:
	.string "Communicating. Please stand by...$"
	.align 2
