gBwText_82_0:
	.string "Bianca: A. Mazing. Isn't it?$"
gBwText_82_1:
	.string "Hello, you two! How do you do?\pI'm the owner of this theater.\nPleasure to meet you!$"
gBwText_82_2:
	.string "Ooh! I must say that you two seem like\nphenomenal Trainers!\pWhat do we do here? We use Props to\nmake your Pokémon fashionable and\lglamorous!\pDo you want to join in and play Dress\nUp? To get you started, here's a Prop\lCase!$"
gBwText_82_3:
	.string "This Prop Case lets you store Props for\ndecorating your Pokémon!\pFirst off, you need to pick a Pokémon!$"
gBwText_82_4:
	.string "Aw, I'm sorry, but that Pokémon can't\nplay Dress Up. Please choose a\ldifferent Pokémon next time.$"
gBwText_82_5:
	.string "Hmm, I guess I get it! You are\nexpressing your Pokémon's innate\lcharm by choosing not to decorate it!\pHonestly, though, I think using Props\nwould be better received in this\lmusical.$"
gBwText_82_6:
	.string "Now, now. Don't be like that. Please\nreconsider and select a Pokémon!$"
gBwText_82_7:
	.string "Then... It's time to play Dress Up!$"
gBwText_82_8:
	.string "Wow! The two of you did a fantastic job\ncoordinating everything!\lUtterly charming!$"
gBwText_82_9:
	.string "If you have a Pokémon who can play\nDress Up, you can participate in the\lPokémon Musical!\pWould you two please join us? The\nreceptionist can explain everything.\pLet us say a brief farewell! I eagerly\nanticipate seeing you on stage!$"
gBwText_82_10:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, I don't know what to do!\pDoing the musical would be totally cool,\nbut there's other stuff I wanna do.\pOK, that's it! I made up my mind!\nI'm going to see the sights in Nimbasa!\pSee ya, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_82_11:
	.string "We really want you to participate in\nthe musical!\pI apologize in advance if any of our\nProps don't suit some kinds of Pokémon.\pPokémon are individuals, after all!$"
gBwText_82_12:
	.string "Wait! Please, wait!\pYou participated in a musical\nwith your friends, right?\pI felt like you opened up new\npossibilities for musicals!\pThat's why I feel impelled to give you\nthis present! Please accept it!$"
gBwText_82_13:
	.string "I eagerly anticipate seeing you\non stage again!$"
gBwText_82_14:
	.string "Your continued participation makes me\na happy owner!\pYou're attracting a lot of attention as\nan up-and-coming stylist.\pOf course, I'm watching you closely,\nas well.\pPlease accept this as a token of\nmy appreciation.$"
gBwText_82_15:
	.string "Ah, I eagerly anticipate seeing you\non stage again!\p...Actually, it feels like I've said this\nline before.\pWell, that's OK. Because I'm the owner!$"
gBwText_82_16:
	.string "Seeing your continued participation\nmakes me a happy owner.\pApparently, some audience members have\nbeen calling you a top stylist as of\llate!\pBest of all... How impressive am I for\nrecognizing your talent?\pPlease accept this as a token of\nmy gratitude!$"
gBwText_82_17:
	.string "I hope you continue to enjoy the\nmusical!$"
gBwText_82_18:
	.string "Happy birthday!\nI've got this festive Prop to give you!\pIt's a cake from me, the owner!\pOf course, this is a Prop, so you should\nattach it to your Pokémon and not eat\lit.\pBy the way, even if today isn't your\nbirthday, I won't take it back!\pWhy?\nBecause I'm the owner!$"
gBwText_82_19:
	.string "I want to make Pokémon more glamorous\nthan ever before, so I'm researching\lthe styles others use when playing\lDress Up.$"
gBwText_82_20:
	.string "Great work! I saw your Pokémon up\nthere today!\pOverall, totally {STR_VAR_1}!\pThe {STR_VAR_2} Prop\nwas a great accent.\pI noticed that your {STR_VAR_3}\nfactor was a bit subdued today.\pOK! I'm not going to lose!$"
gBwText_82_21:
	.string "Gwah!$"
gBwText_82_22:
	.string "When you play Dress Up, matching the\nshow you're performing in is\lim-por-tant!\pIf it's a good match, you can win the\nhearts of the audience!\lYou'll be sure to attract attention.\pIf you're going to get on stage,\nit's a waste if you don't stand out!$"
gBwText_82_23:
	.string "Pokémon Props each have their own\nimage: cool, cute, elegant, or quirky.\pBefore you play Dress Up, take a moment\nto think about the image you prefer.$"
gBwText_82_24:
	.string "I'm not trying to brag, but we're\nrather rich.\pWhen you say rich people, you think\nmusical. It's a matter of taste, I\lguess.$"
gBwText_82_25:
	.string "It is such a treat when Trainers have\nplayed Dress Up with their Pokémon\lwith such charming results.$"
gBwText_82_26:
	.string "Your Pokémon are wonderful!\nI'm always watching them.\pI hope you can keep entertaining us\nwith your performances.$"
gBwText_82_27:
	.string "I always make sure to watch the\nshows you participate in!\pEven from the perspective of a rich man\nlike me, it's impressive!\pIt's unparalleled entertainment!$"
gBwText_82_28:
	.string "There is a Musical Photo saved from\nlast time!$"
gBwText_82_29:
	.string "You can hang Musical Photos from your\nprevious shows here.$"
gBwText_82_30:
	.string "Know what? When there are cute\nPokémon, my eyes are glued to the\lstage!$"
gBwText_82_31:
	.string "Originally, people performed in this\nMusical Theater.\pOne time, a Pokémon wandered up on\nstage and started imitating the actors.\pEverybody thought it was sensational!\nTa-daaa! The Pokémon Musical was born.$"
gBwText_82_32:
	.string "If you are active in the musical, people\nwill become your fans and give you\lProps.\pI don't have any Props, so I'll give you\nthis instead!$"
gBwText_82_33:
	.string "With the move Echoed Voice, the power\nis boosted more and more if it's used\levery turn.\pHaving a group use it might work well!$"
gBwText_82_34:
	.string "Persistence is important, so keep\nparticipating in the musical, and keep\lusing Echoed Voice!\pYou'll make more fans in the musical,\nand you'll do more damage with Echoed\lVoice!$"
gBwText_82_35:
	.string "Musical Theater Props + Music + Dance =\nMoving Spectacle!$"
gBwText_82_36:
	.string "The seats are beyond this entrance,\nbut I think you belong on the\lspectacular stage!$"
