gBwText_83_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_83_1:
	.string "Welcome to the musical! I'm very\npleased with your participation!\pParticipants for this musical are:$"
gBwText_83_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} will participate\nwith {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_83_3:
	.string "And the show you'll be performing\nis {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat is a popular show\namong {STR_VAR_2}.\pWell, without further ado...\nLet's play Dress Up!$"
gBwText_83_4:
	.string "I guess everyone is ready.\nLet's go up on stage!$"
gBwText_83_5:
	.string "Good job!\nThe Pokémon were in total sync!\pIt was the best musical ever! I am the\nowner, but even I was greatly moved.\pSince it's the best musical ever seen,\nwe have received many comments from\lthe audience!\pThere are comments for everyone,\nso let me give them to you in order!$"
gBwText_83_6:
	.string "Hmmm... Good job!\nIt was a great musical!\pIn fact, I've received comments for\nyou from the audience!\pI am really pleased.\nI will give them to you in order!$"
gBwText_83_7:
	.string "Good job!\nIt was quite an interesting musical!\pI've received comments for you\nfrom the audience!\pWell, I am so pleased.\nI will give them to you in order!$"
gBwText_83_8:
	.string "Good job!\pIt was a musical with some very\nexciting moments!\pBy the way, I received comments for you\nfrom the audience.\pI am quite pleased.\nI will give them to you in order.$"
gBwText_83_9:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s Dress Up performance\nwas very {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_83_10:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s Dress Up performance\nwas very distinctive!$"
gBwText_83_11:
	.string "In this musical, it's not an\noverstatement to say that\l{STR_VAR_1}'s Pokémon was the lead\lrole.$"
gBwText_83_12:
	.string "The Pokémon used Props to convey such\nabundant expression, just as if they\lwere actors!$"
gBwText_83_13:
	.string "Watching your Pokémon's sharp moves,\nI also felt {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_83_14:
	.string "Your Pokémon played its role very well.$"
gBwText_83_15:
	.string "It looked like your Pokémon was making\nan effort to live up to your\lexpectations.\pI will support your Pokémon on the side!$"
gBwText_83_16:
	.string "It was not highly noticeable...\nBut I liked it! Keep it up!$"
gBwText_83_17:
	.string "Thank you very much for participating\nin the musical today!\pPlease join another musical again!\nHave a great day!$"
