gBwText_84_0:
	.string "There is a football game in\nBig Stadium now!$"
gBwText_84_1:
	.string "Football players are practicing in\nBig Stadium now.\pPeople can watch them practicing!$"
gBwText_84_2:
	.string "There is a baseball game\nin Big Stadium now!$"
gBwText_84_3:
	.string "Infielders are practicing\nin Big Stadium now.\pPeople can watch them practicing!$"
gBwText_84_4:
	.string "There is a soccer game\nin Big Stadium now!$"
gBwText_84_5:
	.string "Soccer players are practicing\nin Big Stadium now!\pPeople can watch them practicing!$"
gBwText_84_6:
	.string "You sure look up to athletes when\nyou're a kid.$"
gBwText_84_7:
	.string "I'm raising the same Pokémon as\nmy favorite athlete's Pokémon.$"
gBwText_84_8:
	.string "When I throw a Poké Ball, I copy the\nthrowing form of a quarterback!$"
gBwText_84_9:
	.string "When I throw a Poké Ball, I copy the\nform of a pitcher!$"
gBwText_84_10:
	.string "When I throw a Poké Ball, I copy the\nthrow-in of a keeper!$"
gBwText_84_11:
	.string "Ha ha! I am a football player!\pI injured my hand, so I can't sign\nautographs! I'm sorry about that.\pSo, what does the autograph on your\nTrainer Card look like?$"
gBwText_84_12:
	.string "Yeah! I am an Infielder!\pI hurt my hand, so I can't write\nan autograph! Sorry!\pSay, how did you sign your Trainer Card?$"
gBwText_84_13:
	.string "Bwa ha ha! I am a Striker!\pMy hand got hurt, so I won't be able to\nsign any autographs! Regrets!\pWhat does your Trainer Card signature\nlook like?$"
gBwText_84_14:
	.string "I am sorry.\pBut you cannot go onto the field\nbecause a game is in progress.$"
gBwText_84_15:
	.string "I am sorry.\pBut you cannot go onto the field\nbecause a game is in progress.$"
gBwText_84_16:
	.string "I am sorry.\pBut you cannot go onto the field\nbecause a game is in progress.$"
