gBwText_85_0:
	.string "Professional athletes look so\nattractive during a game!$"
gBwText_85_1:
	.string "We can tell how good these\nprofessionals are just by watching\lthem practice.$"
gBwText_85_2:
	.string "I want to be a person who is good at\nfootball and Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_85_3:
	.string "I want to be a person who is good at\nbaseball and Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_85_4:
	.string "I want to be a person who is good at\nsoccer and Pokémon battles!$"
gBwText_85_5:
	.string "On the field, they play games in\nearnest!$"
gBwText_85_6:
	.string "Just one ball can make people and\nPokémon smile.\pSports are wonderful things!$"
gBwText_85_7:
	.string "Eeeee! Turn this waaaaay!$"
gBwText_85_8:
	.string "There!\nThere, turn like that!$"
gBwText_85_9:
	.string "Following a ball right and left\nmakes me feel woozy.$"
gBwText_85_10:
	.string "Yahooooooo!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_85
