gBwTextCount_85:
	.4byte 11
gBwText_86_0:
	.string "Athletes who score points, and\nathletes who support them...\pDetermining their different roles is\nthe key to building a team!$"
gBwText_86_1:
	.string "Football is a fun sport that is divided\ninto offense and defense.$"
gBwText_86_2:
	.string "His... Those eyes...\pIt looks like he's coming\nright at me!$"
gBwText_86_3:
	.string "The helmet and pads weigh\n15 to 18 pounds!$"
gBwText_86_4:
	.string "I've trained and built up my muscles\nby tackling Pokémon!\pNothing can move me!$"
gBwText_86_5:
	.string "OK! I will defend to the end with moves\nlike Protect and Detect!$"
gBwText_86_6:
	.string "My favorite moves?\p...Hmm.\nI'd say Tackle and Take Down.$"
gBwText_86_7:
	.string "Reading your opponent's attack and\ndeciding your next move...\pBoth Pokémon battles and football have\nthe same thrill!$"
gBwText_86_8:
	.string "The appeal of football?\nLet me see...\pFirst, just watch a game without\nthinking about the rules!$"
gBwText_86_9:
	.string "I'll protect my team with my whole body\nto avoid our opponents' interference!$"
gBwText_86_10:
	.string "In football, the quarterback is the\nathlete who decides a strategy and\lcarries it out.\pHe's kind of like a Pokémon Trainer!$"
gBwText_86_11:
	.string "In football, you have to learn each and\nevery formation by heart!$"
gBwText_86_12:
	.string "The ball used in football is oval-shaped\nand hard to throw, isn't it?\pBut once you get the hang of it, you can\nthrow it perfectly!$"
gBwText_86_13:
	.string "I am a greeeeeat secret weapon!\pThe only problem is, I am so secret that\nI've never been in a game...$"
gBwText_86_14:
	.string "Yoo-hoo! Pass me the ball!$"
gBwText_86_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_86_16:
	.string "Bodies crashing into other bodies!\nGo, go, go!\pI am the owner. That's what\nI like to see.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_86
