gBwTextCount_86:
	.4byte 17
gBwText_87_0:
	.string "To be good at something, you have to do\nit repeatedly, day after day after day.\pThat's how you get results.\nOtherwise, you won't get better at it.$"
gBwText_87_1:
	.string "When I was a kid, I played catch with\nmy Pokémon!$"
gBwText_87_2:
	.string "It's not bad to grow up.\pBut it's bad to forget what it felt like\nto be a child.$"
gBwText_87_3:
	.string "I have baseball, and I have Pokémon...\nHow happy I am!$"
gBwText_87_4:
	.string "If you don't swing a bat, you can't hit\na ball.\pIf you don't do things, you won't fail...\nbut you won't succeed, either.$"
gBwText_87_5:
	.string "I give 100 percent of my energy all the\ntime! That is the only thing I can do.$"
gBwText_87_6:
	.string "What I brag about is my bat!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_87
gBwTextTable_87:
	.4byte gBwText_87_0
	.4byte gBwText_87_1
	.4byte gBwText_87_2
	.4byte gBwText_87_3
	.4byte gBwText_87_4
	.4byte gBwText_87_5
	.4byte gBwText_87_6
	.global gBwTextCount_87
gBwTextCount_87:
	.4byte 7
gBwText_88_0:
	.string "Everybody makes mistakes.\pBut goalkeepers cannot afford a\nmistake, because they cannot score\lgoals to make up for it.\pIf one Pokémon on a team makes a\nmistake, however, the other Pokémon\land their Trainer can cover for it!$"
gBwText_88_1:
	.string "If a Striker catches a teammate's eye,\nthey understand each other.\pA Pokémon and its Trainer are the same.\nDon't you agree?$"
gBwText_88_2:
	.string "Really strong Trainers thoroughly do\nwhatever they can do!$"
gBwText_88_3:
	.string "Soccer is beautiful and fun!\nPokémon are also beautiful and fun!$"
gBwText_88_4:
	.string "Soccer with Pokémon is Pokémon soccer.\nThe abbreviation is...Poccer?$"
gBwText_88_5:
	.string "Throw a sound pass to a team member!\pAfter that, to receive a sound pass,\nyou'll need to move swiftly.$"
gBwText_88_6:
	.string "Run! Run!\nJust think about running!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_88
