	.4byte 9
gBwText_91_0:
	.string "Pokémon tennis is wonderful!\pPlayers are never alone.\nTheir Pokémon are always with them!$"
gBwText_91_1:
	.string "Tennis is all about rackets and balls.\nThere's nothing profound about it.$"
gBwText_91_2:
	.string "I am a ball boy who collects\ntennis balls.\pYou are a Pokémon Trainer who\ncollects Pokémon.$"
gBwText_91_3:
	.string "To become ball boys,\nwe gotta practice.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_91
gBwTextTable_91:
	.4byte gBwText_91_0
	.4byte gBwText_91_1
	.4byte gBwText_91_2
	.4byte gBwText_91_3
	.global gBwTextCount_91
gBwTextCount_91:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_92_0:
	.string "A fight against your opponent can end\nin the blink of an eye!\pThe important thing is how much you\nprepare before the fight.$"
gBwText_92_1:
	.string "I don't play basketball just because\nI'm tall.\pMaybe I grew tall because I wanted to\nplay basketball so badly?!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_92
gBwTextTable_92:
	.4byte gBwText_92_0
	.4byte gBwText_92_1
	.global gBwTextCount_92
gBwTextCount_92:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_93_0:
	.string "You! Experience feeling like a\npowerful man!$"
gBwText_93_1:
	.string "A Pokémon that can use Strength can\npush a big rock even when it is\lnot fighting!\pIf you want to push some rocks around,\ngo to Route 16!\pThump! Thump!$"
gBwText_93_2:
	.string "Have you seen the musical?\pMy own Pokémon up on the stage...\pThat is an indescribably\nmoving experience.$"
gBwText_93_3:
	.string "Castelia City is the heart of business.\nNimbasa City is the heart of leisure.\pVarious people and Pokémon gather\nall over Unova, and the region is\lbecoming more and more lively.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_93
gBwTextTable_93:
	.4byte gBwText_93_0
	.4byte gBwText_93_1
	.4byte gBwText_93_2
	.4byte gBwText_93_3
	.global gBwTextCount_93
gBwTextCount_93:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_94_0:
	.string "A sports game, like baseball or football,\nstarts at a certain time every day.\pThat's in Big Stadium!$"
gBwText_94_1:
	.string "In the Small Court, you can find games\nof basketball and tennis.$"
gBwText_94_2:
	.string "Oh...?\pOh, my!\pYour {STR_VAR_1} seems to like you!\pThat's so nice to see. Makes me want\nto give you this!$"
gBwText_94_3:
	.string "If a Pokémon holds a Soothe Bell, it will\nbecome more friendly to you.$"
gBwText_94_4:
	.string "Oh...?\pOh, my!\pYour {STR_VAR_1}'s feelings\ntoward you seem to be neutral.\pIf you can win its friendship,\nI will give you something nice!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_94
gBwTextTable_94:
	.4byte gBwText_94_0
	.4byte gBwText_94_1
	.4byte gBwText_94_2
	.4byte gBwText_94_3
	.4byte gBwText_94_4
	.global gBwTextCount_94
gBwTextCount_94:
	.4byte 5
gBwText_95_0:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Hello, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_95_1:
	.string "Cheren: Come here.$"
gBwText_95_2:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Elesa called and was\nasking me all about Electric-type\lPokémon, and I thought about you guys.\pThat's why I wanted to see you.\nTa-da! Freebies for you!$"
gBwText_95_3:
	.string "Here, Cheren!$"
gBwText_95_4:
	.string "You, too, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_95_5:
	.string "If you see a Pokémon that\nyou want to have join you,\lbe sure to use a good type of Poké Ball.\pBecause this could be the first and\nlast time you see that Pokémon!$"
gBwText_95_6:
	.string "I know it might seem strange for me to\nsay this, since I'm the one who asked\lyou to complete the Pokédex, but\lplease, remember to enjoy your journey!$"
gBwText_95_7:
	.string "Of course, I'm not saying you can just\nneglect the Pokédex. But you know\lthat!\pNow, if you'll please excuse me,\nI have to go meet Bianca.$"
gBwText_95_8:
	.string "Cheren: It seems the Professor\ngave us the Pokédex as a reason\lto send us on a journey.\pAt least, that's what my mom told me.\pThey wanted us to go out and see the\nworld, so my mom, Bianca's mom, and your\lmom made a request to Professor\lJuniper.$"
gBwText_95_9:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, what should we do now?\pI think I'd like to show the professor\nmy thanks by going to Route 4 and\lcatching some Pokémon I haven't yet\lcaught.$"
gBwText_95_10:
	.string "If you've come from Route 4,\nNimbasa City is ahead.\pNext! If you've come from Nimbasa City,\nRoute 4 is ahead!$"
gBwText_95_11:
	.string "Look at the electric bulletin board to\nsee what's happening in Nimbasa City!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_95
