	.4byte gBwText_97_4
	.global gBwTextCount_97
gBwTextCount_97:
	.4byte 5
gBwText_98_0:
	.string "The Battle Test...\pThis woman of mystery will show you\nthe ropes.\pBattle effectively and keep your\nPokémon from fainting!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_98
gBwTextTable_98:
	.4byte gBwText_98_0
	.global gBwTextCount_98
gBwTextCount_98:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_99_0:
	.string "Shiny Krokorok...\nI wonder what colors they are!$"
gBwText_99_1:
	.string "People say Shiny Pokémon\nlook like they're gleaming when\lthey come out of the grass!$"
gBwText_99_2:
	.string "Nuha nuha nuhaha!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_99
gBwTextTable_99:
	.4byte gBwText_99_0
	.4byte gBwText_99_1
	.4byte gBwText_99_2
	.global gBwTextCount_99
gBwTextCount_99:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_100_0:
	.string "If I compared the glow of Nimbasa to\nsomething, it would be the sun!\pYes, the sun!\nIt inspires me to give you this!$"
gBwText_100_1:
	.string "Sun Stones are stones that make\ncertain Pokémon evolve!\pI gave it to Petilil as a present!$"
gBwText_100_2:
	.string "Sun Stones are stones that make\ncertain Pokémon evolve!\pI gave it to Cottonee as a present!$"
gBwText_100_3:
	.string "If you love your Pokémon, even if it\nchanges its appearance, you'll stay\lconnected with your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_100_4:
	.string "When a Pokémon evolves, it gets\nstronger and its appearance changes\lsignificantly.\pA Pokémon that you keep from evolving\nwill learn moves more quickly!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_100
gBwTextTable_100:
	.4byte gBwText_100_0
	.4byte gBwText_100_1
	.4byte gBwText_100_2
	.4byte gBwText_100_3
	.4byte gBwText_100_4
	.global gBwTextCount_100
gBwTextCount_100:
	.4byte 5
gBwText_101_0:
	.string "Hrmph! So yer the Trainers Elesa was\ntalkin' about, huh.\pI'm Clay. I'm the Gym Leader 'round\nthese parts.\pDon't be expectin' no welcome, now.\p'Cause when we lowered that bridge,\nthe Team Plasma guys we'd caught\ldone escaped in all the ruckus!$"
gBwText_101_1:
	.string "Cheren: What a bother.\pWe're grateful that you lowered the\nbridge, but how is it our fault that\lthey escaped?$"
gBwText_101_2:
	.string "Clay: Ya can say whatever ya want.\pBut what's important is y'all showed\nup, and then Team Plasma escaped.\pMaybe it's a little heavy-handed, but\nyou oughtta start lookin' for\lTeam Plasma, too.\pYer both talented Trainers, aren't ya?$"
gBwText_101_3:
	.string "Tell ya what...\pIf ya find Team Plasma, I'll let ya\nchallenge my Gym!\pLife's all about give and take!$"
gBwText_101_4:
	.string "Cheren: Well, I suppose that's fair.\pBut really, we would have looked for\nTeam Plasma even if he hadn't asked.\pI can get stronger while beating that\nbothersome bunch...$"
gBwText_101_5:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\nI'll go on ahead.$"
gBwText_101_6:
	.string "Ghetsis: Clay.\nIt's a pleasure to meet you.\pI am Ghetsis, of Team Plasma.\pI've come to pick up my associates\nwho are in your care.$"
gBwText_101_7:
	.string "Clay: I don't need no thanks, now.\pYer buddies were tryin' to steal\nsome folks' Pokémon.$"
gBwText_101_8:
	.string "Ghetsis: What's this? It seems as if\nthere has been some misunderstanding.\pWe only free Pokémon from wicked\npeople.$"
gBwText_101_9:
	.string "Clay: Well, that sounds real nice,\nif it's true.\pI may not talk purty, but at least\nI'm an honest man.\pYou talk real nice, but what yer sayin'\nkinda sounds like lyin'.\pSo tell me plain, what are ya tryin'\nto say?$"
gBwText_101_10:
	.string "Ghetsis: Team Plasma also has an\ninterest in Driftveil City.\pAnd we have many, many more members\nbesides those who are here...$"
gBwText_101_11:
	.string "Clay: ...Well, I can't tell if yer lyin' or\nnot, but I reckon you've won this\lwithout a fight.\pHrrmph. Fine. Take 'em and git!$"
gBwText_101_12:
	.string "Ghetsis: A decision worthy of a\nbusinessman called the Miner King.\pYour grasp of the situation\nis outstanding.\pWell then, we will be taking\nour colleagues off your hands...$"
gBwText_101_13:
	.string "Zinzolin: Ghetsis...\nThank you very much...$"
gBwText_101_14:
	.string "Ghetsis: Don't worry, my fellow servant\nof the king...\pWe are two of the Seven Sages,\nare we not?\pWell then, everyone, I expect that we\nwill meet again somewhere.$"
gBwText_101_15:
	.string "Clay: Sorry to let Team Plasma go after\nyou tracked 'em down, fellas.\pSay, why don't we cheer ourselves up\nwith a Pokémon battle?\pDon't keep me waitin'!$"
gBwText_101_16:
	.string "Cheren: Well, we avoided a fight in\nthe middle of the city, anyway.\pStill, I can't help but think Ghetsis\nisn't just an ordinary person.\pI'm off to go make my Pokémon stronger.\pI really don't want to lose\nto that Clay guy.\pActually, I'm going to win my\nGym Badge in a flawless victory!$"
gBwText_101_17:
	.string "$"
gBwText_101_18:
	.string "Our Gym Leader, Clay, is in the\nmiddle of something right now.\lPlease come again later.$"
gBwText_101_19:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, hi, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_101_20:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}!!\nGuess what, guess what?$"
gBwText_101_21:
	.string "Hey, were you at the Gym just now?\pOh, hey! That's Driftveil's Gym Badge!\nOh, that's totally cool. That's amazing.$"
gBwText_101_22:
	.string "No, no, no! I can't get distracted being\nall impressed with your shiny new Badge!\pI'm also a Trainer!\nAt times like this you battle, right?$"
gBwText_101_23:
	.string "Bianca: I haven't had a Pokémon battle\nwith you in a while, {STR_VAR_1}.\pYou've become totally strong, huh?\pI'm not that strong, so I don't know\nhow to say it, but I think you're way\ltuned in to how your Pokémon feel!\pOh, you know what! I want to share this\nHM with you, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_101_24:
	.string "Bianca: My papa gave it to me after\nhe tried to take me home that time.\pI'm sure it's so I can come home\nanytime he wants, though...\pOh, hey, I have to share this with\nCheren, too...\pSee you, {STR_VAR_1}! Buh-bye!$"
gBwText_101_25:
	.string "So how about this city's pride and joy,\nthe drawbridge?\pWe also call it the Charizard Bridge\ndue to its elegant form!$"
gBwText_101_26:
	.string "Hey there, Trainer!\pHave you ever battled the Elite Four\nof the Pokémon League?\pYou can't battle them unless you\nhave eight Gym Badges, right?$"
gBwText_101_27:
	.string "Oh, ocean...\pI wonder if the tears I've cried\nwill flow all the way to Olivine City.$"
gBwText_101_28:
	.string "Those Team Plasma meanies forced me\nto battle them.\pAnd when I lost, they stole my Pokémon!$"
gBwText_101_29:
	.string "When I win, it's because of my Pokémon.\nWhen I lose, it's because of me.\pThat's how I always think. If you get\nconceited, you get sloppy fast.$"
gBwText_101_30:
	.string "The reason I'm hangin' around is\nbecause I want to hang around!\pAww! If my Pokémon just knew the move\nSurf, I could go on top of the water!$"
gBwText_101_31:
	.string "Some kids are catching and training\nPokémon close to the Cold Storage.$"
gBwText_101_32:
	.string "The Pokémon of lightning and the\nPokémon of wind are both known to come\land go as they please.$"
gBwText_101_33:
	.string "On the other side of the ocean, there\nare a lot of different people and a lot\lof different Pokémon, aren't there?$"
gBwText_101_34:
	.string "The old guy on Route 6 is searching for\nlegendary Pokémon.\pIf you're interested, go talk to him!$"
gBwText_101_35:
	.string "Bridges are amazing. 'Cause they are a\nsymbol of connecting the world.\pBut the guy on Route 5 is saying the\nsame thing, isn't he?$"
gBwText_101_36:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI wanted to get the attention of a girl\nI like, so I learned a new style of\lPokémon battling.\pIts name... Triple Battle!\nWant to learn about it?$"
gBwText_101_37:
	.string "Oh, man! Getting someone's attention is\nreally hard.$"
gBwText_101_38:
	.string "In Triple Battles, you send out three\nPokémon at a time and battle!\pThe rules are simple: just make all of\nyour opponent's Pokémon faint.\pAnd that's a rough explanation\nof Triple Battles.$"
gBwText_101_39:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pHey! If you're a Trainer, how about a\nTriple Battle?$"
gBwText_101_40:
	.string "You've got a good attitude, don't you!\pI'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI'm always at full throttle.$"
gBwText_101_41:
	.string "I hate to burst your bubble when you're\nall fired up, but...\pIn Triple Battles, you need three or\nmore Pokémon to battle.$"
gBwText_101_42:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI have some advice for you.\nChallenge is the essence of life!$"
gBwText_101_43:
	.string "Sheesh. That's embarrassing. Getting\nschooled when I was planning to teach.\pStill, you have potential!\pYou have to understand your Pokémon\nto win in a Triple Battle.\pIf you want more Triple Battles, you\nshould go to Opelucid City.$"
gBwText_101_44:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pRiding a bike and becoming the wind fits\na bad boy like me.$"
gBwText_101_45:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI wanted to get the attention of a girl\nI like, so I learned a new style of\lPokémon battling.\pIts name... Rotation Battle!\nWant to learn about it?$"
gBwText_101_46:
	.string "Oh, man! Getting someone's attention is\nreally hard.$"
gBwText_101_47:
	.string "In Rotation Battles, you send out three\nPokémon at a time and battle!\pOne Pokémon takes the lead position,\nand the other two stand on each side.\pThe trick is, each turn you can change\ntheir positions...\pAnd that's a rough explanation\nof Rotation Battles.$"
gBwText_101_48:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pHey! If you're a Trainer, how about a\nRotation Battle?$"
gBwText_101_49:
	.string "You've got a good attitude, don't you!\pI'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI'm always at full throttle.$"
gBwText_101_50:
	.string "I hate to burst your bubble when you're\nall fired up, but...\pIn Rotation Battles, you need three or\nmore Pokémon to battle.$"
gBwText_101_51:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pI have some advice for you.\pChallenge is the essence of life!$"
gBwText_101_52:
	.string "Sheesh. That's embarrassing. Getting\nschooled when I was planning to teach.\pStill, you have potential!\pYou have to understand your Pokémon\nto win in a Rotation Battle.\pIf you want to have more\nRotation Battles, go to Opelucid City.$"
gBwText_101_53:
	.string "I'm a heartbreaker...\nMy name... Charles.\pRiding a bike and becoming the wind fits\na bad boy like me.$"
gBwText_101_54:
	.string "Driftveil Drawbridge$"
gBwText_101_55:
	.string "Welcome to Driftveil City!$"
gBwText_101_56:
	.string "Driftveil City\nA City of Billowing Sails$"
gBwText_101_57:
	.string "Driftveil Market$"
gBwText_101_58:
	.string "Driftveil City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Clay\lThe Underground Boss$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_101
