	.4byte 59
gBwText_102_0:
	.string "Well...\pThink it's about time to see fer myself\nwhat it is about yer skills that made a\lGym Leader like Elesa take such a\lshine to ya.$"
gBwText_102_1:
	.string "Mrrrmph. I see. But I sure don't like it!\pFer such a young 'un, ya have an\nimposin' battle style.\pI know ya got people who can dig up\nyer potential.\pMrmph.\nHere! Take this!$"
gBwText_102_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the Quake Badge\nfrom Clay!$"
gBwText_102_3:
	.string "So this is yer fifth Badge, huh?\pIf that's so, Pokémon up to Lv. 60\nwill obey ya.\pAlso, I'll give ya this TM.\p...Well, that was the plan, but I just\nremembered there's somethin' I want.\pWait in front of the cave at the end of\nRoute 6, wouldja?$"
gBwText_102_4:
	.string "Clay: What's the problem?\pGo wait in front of the cave at the end\nof Route 6!$"
gBwText_102_5:
	.string "I don't know how much potential ya got,\nbut if ya think ya can go, go wherever,\land if ya think ya can do somethin',\lkeep doin' it.\pDo things how ya want!\nDecide yer own limits.$"
gBwText_102_6:
	.string "Clay: Mrrmph! You, huh?\nRemember what I done told ya?\pIf ya think ya can go, go wherever,\nand if ya think ya can do somethin',\lkeep doin' it.\pDo things how ya want!\nDecide yer own limits.$"
gBwText_102_7:
	.string "This elevator can't go any higher!$"
gBwText_102_8:
	.string "This elevator can't go any lower!$"
	.align 2
