gBwText_103_0:
	.string "I'm sure it was tough dealing with all\nthat right after you arrived here.\pFor now, I'll just give you this!$"
gBwText_103_1:
	.string "The Gym Leader Clay uses\nGround-type Pokémon!\pWell, just between you and me,\nGround-type Pokémon aren't good\lagainst Water-type attacks.\pKinda makes me wonder why Clay is living\nnext to water.$"
gBwText_103_2:
	.string "Every now and again, I hope you look at\nthe Gym Badge you won here and\lremember the battle!$"
gBwText_103_3:
	.string "Welcome to the Driftveil Pokémon Gym!\pIn this Gym, elevators are provided for\nyour use.$"
gBwText_103_4:
	.string "This elevator can't go any higher!$"
gBwText_103_5:
	.string "Driftveil Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Clay\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_103_6:
	.string "Driftveil Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Clay\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_103_7:
	.string "Driftveil Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Clay\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_103
