	.4byte 3
gBwText_105_0:
	.string "TV programs can sometimes teach you\nabout Pokémon's moves and Abilities.$"
gBwText_105_1:
	.string "There are Pokémon that evolve when\nthey're traded!\pAwesome! But why do they evolve?!$"
gBwText_105_2:
	.string "Skee!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_105
gBwTextTable_105:
	.4byte gBwText_105_0
	.4byte gBwText_105_1
	.4byte gBwText_105_2
	.global gBwTextCount_105
gBwTextCount_105:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_106_0:
	.string "Hoo ha!\nYou have a Pokédex.\pHow many Pokémon have you found?\pIf you find 50 or more, I'll give you\nsomething sure to delight!$"
gBwText_106_1:
	.string "Ha hoo!\nYou have a Pokédex.\pHow many Pokémon have you found?\pHoo ha! You've found 50 or more!\nNow we're talking! This is for you!$"
gBwText_106_2:
	.string "A Pokémon holding a Shell Bell recovers\nits HP a little bit if it inflicts damage\lduring a battle.\pBut what's more important is this. Have\nyou shown the Pokédex to a professor?$"
gBwText_106_3:
	.string "Hey, hey! Let's jump on this! We'll\ntrade my {STR_VAR_2} with your\l{STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_106_4:
	.string "Let's start the Pokémon trade!$"
gBwText_106_5:
	.string "Please take good care of my\n{STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_106_6:
	.string "What I want is {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_106_7:
	.string "Oh...\nYou must love your Pokémon.\pWell, if you ever change your mind,\nlet's trade!$"
gBwText_106_8:
	.string "I'll raise the Pokémon you traded me!\pIf you become extra strong, I just\nmight let you have a battle with me!$"
gBwText_106_9:
	.string "Hey, hey! Let's jump on this! \nMy {STR_VAR_1} and your Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_106_10:
	.string "I trained and trained the {STR_VAR_1}\nthat you traded me! Don't be surprised\lif it's too strong for you to handle!$"
gBwText_106_11:
	.string "Oh... You don't feel like having a\nbattle?\pWell, if you ever change your mind, come\nback and battle me!$"
gBwText_106_12:
	.string "When I train {STR_VAR_1}, it reminds me\nof you...\pThanks for the trade!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_106
