	.4byte gBwText_107_1
	.global gBwTextCount_107
gBwTextCount_107:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_108_0:
	.string "I work... ?\nin the Cold Storage... ?\pHm? The Cold Storage is in the\nsouthernmost part of the city.$"
gBwText_108_1:
	.string "A terrific Trainer!\nLet me share a training tip with you.\pDuring a battle with a Trainer, even if\nyour Pokémon's items are taken away,\ldon't worry.\pThey will be returned to you safely\nafter the battle.\p...But disposable items seem\nto disappear.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_108
gBwTextTable_108:
	.4byte gBwText_108_0
	.4byte gBwText_108_1
	.global gBwTextCount_108
gBwTextCount_108:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_109_0:
	.string "Do you think all people in the world can\nunderstand one another?$"
gBwText_109_1:
	.string "I see. I think so, too!$"
gBwText_109_2:
	.string "Well...but you and your Pokémon\nunderstand each other.\pIsn't that right?$"
gBwText_109_3:
	.string "This happened to me once after\nI crossed a bridge.\pWhen I was at a loss, the person who\nhelped me was a total stranger...\pAfter all, helping each other is\nimportant in life.$"
gBwText_109_4:
	.string "What is a strong mind?\nWhat is kindness?\pAre there any Trainers and Pokémon\nwho possess those qualities?$"
gBwText_109_5:
	.string "When I go to the Entralink next time,\nI'd like to register a Pass Power and\lmake everyone smile!$"
gBwText_109_6:
	.string "People who visited the Entralink\nhid items somewhere...\lThe Entralink is unique, isn't it?$"
gBwText_109_7:
	.string "I want other people to like me...\nThere is a reward...\pIt's OK to help people with\nsuch motivations.\lBecause helping is itself a great thing!$"
gBwText_109_8:
	.string "Living is using time given to you.\nYou cannot recall lost time.\pDon't forget that...$"
gBwText_109_9:
	.string "Happiness is here today, gone tomorrow.\pThere is no everlasting happiness, so\ndon't be greedy.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_109
