gBwTextCount_109:
	.4byte 10
gBwText_110_0:
	.string "There are medicinal herbs that make\nPokémon healthy.$"
gBwText_110_1:
	.string "The medicinal herbs imported from\nanother region work very well!\pBut Pokémon don't seem to like them,\nbecause they taste a little bitter.$"
gBwText_110_2:
	.string "Welcome! This is straight from the farm!\pMoomoo Milk--one bottle for $500.\nWould you like some for your trip?$"
gBwText_110_3:
	.string "Here it is! Your Moomoo Milk!$"
gBwText_110_4:
	.string "Oh, my!\nYour Bag is full!$"
gBwText_110_5:
	.string "Oh, my!\nYou don't have enough money!$"
gBwText_110_6:
	.string "Please buy it next time!\pJust so you know, our Moomoo Milk\nis straight from the farm.\pIt's super fresh!$"
gBwText_110_7:
	.string "A dozen! That's 12 bottles.\nHere it is, your Moomoo Milk!$"
gBwText_110_8:
	.string "One bottle$"
gBwText_110_9:
	.string "One dozen$"
gBwText_110_10:
	.string "No thanks!$"
gBwText_110_11:
	.string "Oh, I'm sorry. I'm all sold out.\pThat Charles guy bought\neverything I had.$"
gBwText_110_12:
	.string "You! Glad you came!\nYou want something good?$"
gBwText_110_13:
	.string "Then, show me a Pokémon Lv. 30 or more!$"
gBwText_110_14:
	.string "Oh! Strong!\pYou, great!\nTake this!$"
gBwText_110_15:
	.string "Oh! You--not so good yet!\pAfter training Pokémon,\ncome back here again!$"
gBwText_110_16:
	.string "You, modest!\nYou should just want something good!$"
gBwText_110_17:
	.string "You! Glad you came!\nGet good at Expert Belts! \pIf a Pokémon has an Expert Belt, the\npower of its moves is slightly boosted\lwhen they are super effective!$"
gBwText_110_18:
	.string "There must be a convenient town where\neverything is imported and everything\lis available.$"
gBwText_110_19:
	.string "Somewhere, there's a laid-back town\nwhere people value the year's seasons.\pI heard we've imported a lot of goods\nfrom that town!$"
gBwText_110_20:
	.string "Looking at seasonal vegetables is fun.\pBecause when the seasons change,\nthe vegetables available change!$"
gBwText_110_21:
	.string "Whenever we come to the market,\nvegetables of all seasons are\lavailable. Isn't that a marvel?$"
gBwText_110_22:
	.string "Goods carried away from Driftveil\narrive in a town somewhere else...\pYeah. The world is connected.$"
gBwText_110_23:
	.string "Goods carried away from a town\nsomewhere else arrive in Driftveil...\pYeah. The world is connected.$"
gBwText_110_24:
	.string "I used to be part of Team Plasma.\nI have various kinds of incense.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_110
