	.4byte 25
gBwText_111_0:
	.string "I am grateful that you came all this\nway! Are you a Trainer?\pOoh, you have a Pokédex!\nIt's so marvelous!\pI wonder if you'd please do me a favor.$"
gBwText_111_1:
	.string "Oh, Trainer. I'm so pleased that you\ncame all the way here!\pI'm wondering if you would do me a favor\ntoday, too.$"
gBwText_111_2:
	.string "I would like to see a Pokémon that has\nlearned a move called {STR_VAR_1}.\pTo be clear, that's {STR_VAR_1}.\nPlease show it to me today.$"
gBwText_111_3:
	.string "I would like to see a Pokémon that\nlearned a move called {STR_VAR_1}.\pTo be clear, that's {STR_VAR_1}.\nPlease show it to me today.\pOh, my, my, my!\pYour {STR_VAR_2} can\nuse {STR_VAR_1}!\pDid you go to the trouble of teaching it\nto your Pokémon? Marvelous!\pThis is a small token of my\nappreciation. Please don't hesitate to\laccept this.$"
gBwText_111_4:
	.string "I'm touched that you came all the way\nhere, yet you are being so unkind.$"
gBwText_111_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_111_6:
	.string "Oh, my goodness. Your {STR_VAR_2} can\nuse {STR_VAR_1}!\pYou went to all the trouble of teaching\nit to your Pokémon? That's so\ltouching!\pThis is a small token of my\nappreciation. Please don't hesitate to\laccept this.$"
gBwText_111_7:
	.string "I wonder what {STR_VAR_1} looks like\nwhen it is actually used.\pI am sure you can use it skillfully!$"
gBwText_111_8:
	.string "You know there are many kinds\nof Pokémon?\pDifferent kinds of Pokémon can learn\ndifferent kinds of moves.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_111
