gBwText_112_0:
	.string "Oh! Hey!\n{STR_VAR_1}, right?$"
gBwText_112_1:
	.string "Let me see your Pokédex for a moment.\pWhat do we have here?\pSo, you've found {STR_VAR_1} Pokémon,\neh?$"
gBwText_112_2:
	.string "Staggering! You've seen a Klink!\nYou're becoming quite the Trainer.$"
gBwText_112_3:
	.string "Hmmm...\nYou haven't seen a Klink yet, eh?\pStill, that's a great Pokédex!$"
gBwText_112_4:
	.string "Excuse me! I was a little excited\nand forgot my manners.\pMy name is Juniper, too! Cedric Juniper.\pHeh! The professor who gave you\nthe Pokédex is my daughter!\pThat girl has told me a lot about you.\pIt really makes my day to meet you!$"
gBwText_112_5:
	.string "In honor of our meeting,\nI'm going to upgrade your Pokédex!$"
gBwText_112_6:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s Pokédex has\nbeen upgraded!$"
gBwText_112_7:
	.string "Cedric: Some Pokémon can change forms\neven when it's the same individual.\pIf you have already seen a form, you\ncan check it with this whenever you\lwant.\pI also added a function to make\nsearching easier.$"
gBwText_112_8:
	.string "???: Professor, who's that Trainer?$"
gBwText_112_9:
	.string "Cedric: Oh! I forgot my introductions!\nSkyla, this is a friend of my\ldaughter's.\p{STR_VAR_1} is traveling around\nUnova to complete the Pokédex.$"
gBwText_112_10:
	.string "Skyla: Oh, I see! So that means you'll\nbe challenging the Gym!\lOh boy! I'm really looking forward to it!$"
gBwText_112_11:
	.string "Cedric: That's right, {STR_VAR_1}.\nYou should challenge this Gym!\pIf nothing else, this Gym\nis really out there!$"
gBwText_112_12:
	.string "See you, Skyla. If something comes\nup again, I'll let you know!$"
gBwText_112_13:
	.string "Skyla: Professor, my plane\nis a cargo plane!\pIt carries cargo, not people!\pAnd you're talking as if places like\nKanto and Sinnoh are right around the\lcorner!$"
gBwText_112_14:
	.string "Cedric: Aww, Skyla.\nIf you keep frowning, your face might\lfreeze like that, and that'd be a shame.\pPeople and Pokémon, we all have\nto help each other out!\pSee you later!$"
gBwText_112_15:
	.string "Skyla: Sheesh!\pIt's hard to believe a happy-go-lucky\nguy like that could be a world-renowned\lPokémon professor.$"
gBwText_112_16:
	.string "Heads-up, {STR_VAR_1}.\pAs a Gym Leader, I'd be happy to have\nyou challenge the Gym, but there's\lsomething I need to take care of first.$"
gBwText_112_17:
	.string "Heads-up, {STR_VAR_1}.\pAs a Gym Leader, I'd be happy to have\nyou challenge the Gym, but there's\lsomething I need to take care of first.$"
gBwText_112_18:
	.string "Just now, as I was flying the\ncargo plane, I saw something\lon top of the Celestial Tower.$"
gBwText_112_19:
	.string "I'm sure that it is a sick Pokémon!\nIf it is, I can't just leave it there!\pI have to look into this right away.\pI'm leaving for Route 7's Celestial\nTower. You can come along if you want.$"
gBwText_112_20:
	.string "Skyla completed her cargo-plane run.\nShe must have gone somewhere after.\pMaybe to the Celestial Tower on Route\n7?$"
gBwText_112_21:
	.string "N: They may say it is for understanding\none another better, but what Trainers\lreally use battles for is to compete...\lAnd they hurt each other's Pokémon!\pAm I the only one who finds this\nterribly painful?\pWhatever...\nI'm going to talk to your Pokémon.\pI've been living with Pokémon\nsince I was born, so it's easier for\lme to talk with them than with people.\p...Because Pokémon never tell lies.$"
gBwText_112_22:
	.string "Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\pWould you tell me what kind of Trainer\n{STR_VAR_2} is?$"
gBwText_112_23:
	.string "OK, OK, got it.\pSo {STR_VAR_2} was born in Nuvema Town,\nlives with Mom, and was given the\lPokédex to start off a journey to see\lthe world.$"
gBwText_112_24:
	.string "Still, this {STR_VAR_2} trusts you\nfor some reason. That's good!\pIf every person and Pokémon cared\nabout one another like you two do, I\lcould watch over the future of people\land Pokémon without having to liberate\lPokémon from people who just use them.$"
gBwText_112_25:
	.string "Ghetsis is using Team Plasma\nto search for some special stones--\pthe Light Stone and the Dark Stone...$"
gBwText_112_26:
	.string "These stones hold the essence of two\nlegendary Pokémon. It is said that when\lthey lost their physical form, they fell\linto a slumber and were transformed.\pNow, they wait for the hero's arrival...\pI shall resurrect a legendary\nDragon-type Pokémon from one of\lthese stones, and become its friend.\pThat will show the world that\nI am the new hero.\lEveryone will follow what I say!$"
gBwText_112_27:
	.string "My vision is to change the world\nwithout using force.\pTrying to change the world by force\nwill just make others resist.\pIf people resist, the ones that will be\nhurt are the innocent Pokémon\lused by foolish Trainers.\pYou understand.\pPokémon are not just tools\nfor people to use!$"
gBwText_112_28:
	.string "As a result...\pPokémon and Trainers who care about\none another, like you and your Pokémon,\lwill be separated.\lAnd that does break my heart a little. $"
gBwText_112_29:
	.string "Planes! Their shapes!\nThey are perfectly designed to fly!\pThere is no excess in the\nmechanics for flying!$"
gBwText_112_30:
	.string "The only planes that fly out of\nMistralton Airport are cargo planes.\pIf Trainers want to fly, they can go\nwith a Pokémon that knows the move Fly.$"
gBwText_112_31:
	.string "Skyla's grandfather was\na legendary Pilot.\pSkyla is our city's Gym Leader.\nShe's a really nice person!$"
gBwText_112_32:
	.string "Pokémon and people worked together\nto open up desolate land and make\la place where everyone could live.\pI'm certain that this cooperative\nspirit will remain unchanged.$"
gBwText_112_33:
	.string "It's dangerous to play in a landing\nstrip, but you should be OK on ours.\pWe only have one cargo flight a day.$"
gBwText_112_34:
	.string "I hear many people have had their\nPokémon stolen by Team Plasma...$"
gBwText_112_35:
	.string "If you want to eat delicious\nvegetables, the ones grown in the wild\lare the best.\pAs the weather and the seasons change,\nwild vegetables get more and more\ltasty.\pEven Pokémon like to eat wild\nvegetables!$"
gBwText_112_36:
	.string "Vegetables grown in a greenhouse\nare the best.\pThe temperature and their nutrients\nare all managed systematically.\pVegetables grown in a completely\nefficient way taste extra delicious!$"
gBwText_112_37:
	.string "Oh! You found our treasure!$"
gBwText_112_38:
	.string "Found it!$"
gBwText_112_39:
	.string "Just kidding.\pWe don't have a Pokémon, so we planned\nto hide this TM until we got one.\pBut that would be a waste, so--here!\nYou can use it!\pWe'll get another one from Skyla.$"
gBwText_112_40:
	.string "Just kidding.\pWe don't have a Pokémon, so we planned\nto hide this TM until we got one.\pBut that would be a waste, so--here!\nYou can use it!\pWe'll get another one from Skyla.$"
gBwText_112_41:
	.string "Yoooo-ooou can uuu-uuuuuse it!$"
gBwText_112_42:
	.string "See you! Bye-bye!$"
gBwText_112_43:
	.string "Mistralton City\nStrewn with Windblown Leaves$"
gBwText_112_44:
	.string "Mistralton Cargo Service\nOur slogan is “Quick and Safe!“$"
gBwText_112_45:
	.string "Mistralton City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Skyla\lThe Highflying Girl$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_112
