gBwText_113_0:
	.string "Hee-hee!\nI've been waiting for you.\pDid you enjoy flying with the help of\nthe Mistralton Gym cannons?\pThey're my pride and joy!\pThis time, let's try something else!$"
gBwText_113_1:
	.string "You're an amazing Pokémon Trainer.\pMy Pokémon and I are happy,\nbecause for the first time in a while,\lwe could fight with our full strength.\pThis is an official League Gym Badge.\nI think it will look good on you.$"
gBwText_113_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the\nJet Badge from Skyla.$"
gBwText_113_3:
	.string "Wow, hot stuff!\pWith that many Gym Badges,\nPokémon up to Lv. 70 will obey you.\pAlso, as thanks for a Pokémon battle\nthat made me very happy,\lI want you to have this TM.$"
gBwText_113_4:
	.string "My present to you is Acrobatics.\nIf the user doesn't have a held item,\lits power doubles.\lIt's a pretty technical move.\pBe sure to compensate for the\nlack of a held item!\pBy the way, when I flew over\nTwist Mountain on the way\lto Icirrus City...\pTeam Plasma--is that the name?\nAnyway, they were heading for the city.\pWhat kind of people are they?$"
gBwText_113_5:
	.string "Icirrus City, where you'll find the next\nGym, is past Route 7, just after you\lcross Twist Mountain.\pIt's a hop, skip, and a jump when flying,\nbut it's a really challenging walk.\pHeads up! Make sure you're ready for\nit!$"
gBwText_113_6:
	.string "Skyla: Are you and your Pokémon well?\nOur battle together was so much fun.\pNow, my Pokémon and I have started\ntraining again.\pI don't usually let people travel in my\ncargo plane, but battling with you was\lsuch a blast that I'd make an\lexception.$"
gBwText_113_7:
	.string "Please take this Fresh Water!$"
gBwText_113_8:
	.string "Just between you and me...\pRock, Electric, Ice... Flying types have\nmore weaknesses than people know\labout.\pIf you use Pokémon and moves of those\ntypes, victory is practically yours!\pBy the way, to proceed in this Gym, you\nclimb in the cannons to move forward.\pThe cannons go up, down, left, and right.\nYou can get in them from anywhere!$"
gBwText_113_9:
	.string "Woo! Not many people look that good\nbeing shot out of a cannon...\lYou make it look easy!\pAnd congratulations on your victory\nagainst the Gym Leader.$"
gBwText_113_10:
	.string "Mistralton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Skyla\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_113_11:
	.string "Mistralton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Skyla\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_113_12:
	.string "Mistralton Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Skyla\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_113
