gBwText_114_0:
	.string "When a Pokémon learns the move\nHidden Power, somehow I can tell\lwhat type that move will be!\pShould I tell you what type of\nHidden Power your Pokémon will learn?$"
gBwText_114_1:
	.string "Now that I'm aware of my hidden power,\nI can tell you what type of Hidden\lPower your Pokémon will learn! Do you\lwant to know?$"
gBwText_114_2:
	.string "If this Pokémon were to learn\nHidden Power, the move's type\lwould be {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_114_3:
	.string "The type of this Pokémon's\nHidden Power would be {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_114_4:
	.string "If you want to know, ask me, and I'll\nactivate my hidden power for you!$"
gBwText_114_5:
	.string "It's not possible for an Egg to use\nHidden Power!$"
gBwText_114_6:
	.string "I'm sorry, but this Pokémon can't learn\nto use Hidden Power.$"
gBwText_114_7:
	.string "The Entree and Pass Power...\nWhat in the world is the Entralink?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_114
