gBwText_115_0:
	.string "There are a lot of greenhouses\naround the runway!\pFreshly picked vegetables can be sent\nto faraway regions very quickly!$"
gBwText_115_1:
	.string "You see field after field located near\nthe runway!\pFreshly picked vegetables can be sent\nto faraway regions very quickly!$"
gBwText_115_2:
	.string "Cannons! Cannons!\nSkyla's Gym is full of cannons!$"
gBwText_115_3:
	.string "Ruuunwaaaay! Ruuunwaaaay! A Technical\nMachine on the ruuuunwaaaay!$"
gBwText_115_4:
	.string "Ruuunwaaaay! Ruuunwaaaay!\nRacing there is so much fun!\pHey, hey, which one is the fastest\nPokémon in a race?$"
gBwText_115_5:
	.string "If you have a Gym Badge from\nMistralton, I'll tell you something\lcool!$"
gBwText_115_6:
	.string "Wow! A Jet Badge! You won against\nSkyla! OK, I'll tell you something cool!\pWe left our treasure at the edge of\nthe runway!$"
gBwText_115_7:
	.string "Please use our Technical Machine\nwith extra care!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_115
