	.4byte 8
gBwText_116_0:
	.string "When you use the move Fly, you can\nreturn to a Pokémon Center\lyou've already visited.\pBut if Pokémon don't know their\ndestinations, they cannot fly there!$"
gBwText_116_1:
	.string "Because I know a lot about planes,\nI can maintain them!\pBecause I know a lot about Pokémon,\nI can be strong!$"
gBwText_116_2:
	.string "For the places that I cannot reach,\nI ask Flying- or Psychic-type Pokémon\lfor help sometimes.\pI cannot even imagine everyday life\nwithout Pokémon.$"
gBwText_116_3:
	.string "Chulululuwa!$"
gBwText_116_4:
	.string "Because of this control tower, planes\ncan fly safely in the sky where there\lare no roads.\pFrom that, I take this lesson:\nIf Trainers lead Pokémon correctly,\lPokémon will feel safe and fight well.$"
gBwText_116_5:
	.string "My dream was to become a Pilot and\nfly away, far away...\lI still have that dream in my heart.$"
gBwText_116_6:
	.string "Welcome to the sky city, Mistralton!\nTake this as a keepsake!$"
gBwText_116_7:
	.string "If a Pokémon holds an item called\nSharp Beak, its Flying-type\lmoves will be powered up!$"
gBwText_116_8:
	.string "Hello!\pDeliver a lot of cargo quickly!\nThis is Mistralton Cargo Service.$"
gBwText_116_9:
	.string "Sweets, lovely Sweet Heart! ?\nCheck feelings between two people.\pIf you are a great match, you can\nget sweet on Sweet Heart! ?\lMeltingly sweet Sweet Heart! ?$"
gBwText_116_10:
	.string "Oh, uh, you?\nYou have Sweet Heart!\pWill you trade ten pieces of your\nSweet Heart for my Heart Scale?$"
gBwText_116_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_116_12:
	.string "If you bring a lot of Sweet Heart\npieces, I will trade you for something\lhappy!$"
gBwText_116_13:
	.string "Yaaaay!\nI have a lot of your heart!$"
gBwText_116_14:
	.string "Oh... What a pity.\nWhat a great pity!\pYou must have a lot of\nHeart Scales already.$"
gBwText_116_15:
	.string "OK...\nAww...that's too bad.$"
gBwText_116_16:
	.string "Gave the Sweet Hearts and received\na {STR_VAR_1} in return.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_116
