gBwText_117_0:
	.string "Trading Sweet Hearts you receive\nthrough Feeling Checks is one way\lto get Heart Scales. \pIf you show off your Pokémon\nto a lady in Driftveil City, you\lcan get Heart Scales, too.$"
gBwText_117_1:
	.string "Our family is very fussy about\nPokémon moves.$"
	.align 2
