gBwText_118_0:
	.string "Cedric: Hello, {STR_VAR_1}!\nHow is {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_118_1:
	.string "Ah! This {STR_VAR_2} has really taken\na shine to you.$"
gBwText_118_2:
	.string "I can tell you're paying a lot of\nattention to training {STR_VAR_2}.\lCareful not to be too strict!$"
gBwText_118_3:
	.string "The Pokédex is important, but time\nspent having fun together is also\limportant.\pSay, I just had a thought--\nhave you heard of Dragonspiral Tower?$"
gBwText_118_4:
	.string "Really?\nQuite impressive.$"
gBwText_118_5:
	.string "Eh... I'm not surprised you haven't\nheard of it.$"
gBwText_118_6:
	.string "OK. Give this story a listen.\pDragonspiral Tower is said to be\nthe Unova region's oldest building.\pStories say it's the place where\nlegendary Pokémon came to life or\lwhere they remain in deep slumber.$"
gBwText_118_7:
	.string "OK. Give this story a listen.\pDragonspiral Tower is said to be\nthe Unova region's oldest building.\pStories say it's the place where\nlegendary Pokémon came to life or\lwhere they remain in deep slumber.$"
gBwText_118_8:
	.string "I know it's just past Icirrus City,\nbut that's all I know about it.\pThat's all anyone knows,\nbecause no one has ever been inside.$"
gBwText_118_9:
	.string "My daughter has wanted to investigate\nthat tower for a long time.\p“What! There's something I don't\nknow?!“ That kind of feeling is pure\ladventure.\pAnd I'm not too old for some\nadventuring. Away I go to have a look at\lDragonspiral Tower! Catch you later!$"
gBwText_118_10:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, I've been talking\nwith Bianca, and I'm wondering...\pSince we left Nuvema Town, has\nsomething about me...changed?\pThinking about what I want to do...\nThinking about what I should do...\pIt felt like there was nothing...\pHave I really become stronger?\nOr is it just my Pokémon that have?\pI don't know anymore!$"
gBwText_118_11:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, hey. Cheer up, Cheren...\nIsn't it nice to see everyone?!\p{STR_VAR_1}! Know what? This time,\nI'll go to the Pokémon Fan Club.\pI'm really searching...\nfor what I want to do and what I can do!$"
gBwText_118_12:
	.string "Brycen: Who are you?$"
gBwText_118_13:
	.string "Bianca: Who? Us?\pI'm Bianca, and this is Cheren...$"
gBwText_118_14:
	.string "Brycen: I know you are there!\nWhy don't you show yourselves?$"
gBwText_118_15:
	.string "... \pImpressive, Gym Leader of Icirrus City.\pWe, the Shadow Triad, are beings of the\nshadows...and not easily noticed.$"
gBwText_118_16:
	.string "Our mission was to speak only\nwith {STR_VAR_1}, but so be it.\pGhetsis has a message for you:\ncome to Dragonspiral Tower.$"
gBwText_118_17:
	.string "It is there that our lord N\nwaits for you.\p...Now, our mission is complete.$"
gBwText_118_18:
	.string "Brycen: Dragonspiral Tower?!\nWhat's going on?\pHey! Tell me...$"
gBwText_118_19:
	.string "Brycen: Now, hang on.\pYoung man, if you're here for\na Gym challenge, hang on for a bit.\pI've got to head to Dragonspiral Tower!$"
gBwText_118_20:
	.string "Cheren: I'm going, too.\pDragonspiral Tower is to the north\nof here, right?$"
gBwText_118_21:
	.string "Bianca: Whoooooa! Whoa.\nWh-what should I do?\pF-for now, I have to go to\nDragonspiral Tower...\lOK! I'm heading north!$"
gBwText_118_22:
	.string "Bianca: Whoa, whoa, whoa!\nWh-what should I do?\pF-for now, I have to go to\nDragonspiral Tower...\lOK! I'm heading north!$"
gBwText_118_23:
	.string "$"
gBwText_118_24:
	.string "The legendary Pokémon Reshiram\nshared its wisdom with the hero\land defied foes with columns of fire.\pThe hero and that Pokémon were as\nclose as a parent and child.\pPeople were filled with awe and looked\nup to them, and that is said to be the\lbeginning of what became ancient\lUnova.$"
gBwText_118_25:
	.string "The legendary Pokémon Zekrom\nshared its wisdom with the hero\land defied foes with fierce lightning.\pThe hero and that Pokémon were as\nclose as a parent and child.\pPeople were filled with awe and looked\nup to them, and that is said to be the\lbeginning of what became ancient\lUnova.$"
gBwText_118_26:
	.string "Always, the tower looms,\ndisdainful of the wind and snow.\pPerhaps its presence has\na special meaning for people.$"
gBwText_118_27:
	.string "The legendary Pokémon gave help to\nthe hero who sought truth.\lBecause of that, a region was created.\pThen, when its physical form was lost,\nthe Pokémon became the Light Stone,\lwaiting patiently for a new hero.\pI heard that story when I was little.$"
gBwText_118_28:
	.string "The legendary Pokémon gave help to\nthe hero who sought ideals.\lBecause of that, a region was created.\pThen, when its physical form was lost,\nthe Pokémon became the Dark Stone,\lwaiting patiently for a new hero.\pI've heard that story since I was\nlittle.$"
gBwText_118_29:
	.string "The Gym Leader Brycen\nis the strong and silent type.\pI can understand why some people\ncall him a fighting machine.$"
gBwText_118_30:
	.string "Dance, dance!\nTwo dragons!$"
gBwText_118_31:
	.string "Spin! ? Spin! ?\nTurn and spin! ?$"
gBwText_118_32:
	.string "Spin apart!\nMix and twirl!$"
gBwText_118_33:
	.string "Mix it up, day and night!\n'Cause today, everything's all right! ?$"
gBwText_118_34:
	.string "If you walk in the wetlands, you might\nsurprise wild Pokémon into popping out!$"
gBwText_118_35:
	.string "When the wetlands freeze, it's\nslippery. I wonder how wetland Pokémon\lmanage?$"
gBwText_118_36:
	.string "Icirrus City\nSky Glittering with Flowers of Snow$"
gBwText_118_37:
	.string "Fans of Everything Pokémon\nThe Pokémon Fan Club$"
gBwText_118_38:
	.string "$"
gBwText_118_39:
	.string "Icirrus City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Brycen\lIce Mask$"
	.align 2
