gBwText_119_0:
	.string "You appear ready to face a Gym Leader.\nThen...\pBring it!$"
gBwText_119_1:
	.string "In honor of your stout heart,\nI will give you this.$"
gBwText_119_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received\nthe Freeze Badge from Brycen!$"
gBwText_119_3:
	.string "You have seven Badges.\pThat means Pokémon up to Lv. 80\nwill obey you.\pThis TM will convey my regard\nfor your accomplishments.$"
gBwText_119_4:
	.string "A move that always results in\na critical hit: Frost Breath.$"
gBwText_119_5:
	.string "No matter how many battles I fight,\nI don't know what strength is.\pPerhaps you can find the answer.$"
gBwText_119_6:
	.string "Only those who are weak need to\nflaunt their strength.$"
gBwText_119_7:
	.string "Brycen: In the past, when I was hurt and\ndepressed, Alder shared this with me...\pThere is strength in being with other\npeople and Pokémon. Receiving their\lsupport makes you stronger.\pThe young man named Cheren\nalso seems to understand this now.$"
gBwText_119_8:
	.string "Please take this Fresh Water!$"
gBwText_119_9:
	.string "Ice can be melted with Fire\nor shattered with Fighting.\pOr you might want to smash it\ninto dust with Rock or Steel.$"
gBwText_119_10:
	.string "From Brycen, I've learned how to\nsay more with fewer words.$"
gBwText_119_11:
	.string "Icirrus Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Brycen\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_119_12:
	.string "Icirrus Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Brycen\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_119_13:
	.string "Icirrus Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Brycen\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
	.align 2
