gBwText_120_0:
	.string "Everybody has a different reason for\ntheir trips, and the same can be said\lfor gift giving. I'll give you this to\lcommemorate this encounter with you.$"
gBwText_120_1:
	.string "The move Brick Break can remove the\nprotective effects of Reflect and\lLight Screen.\pTee hee hee. Are you surprised?\pI may not look like it, but this old lady\nused to be a Battle Girl!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_120
