gBwText_122_0:
	.string "Wye: Hi!\nThis way, pleeeeease!$"
gBwText_122_1:
	.string "Wye: Exciting! Thrilling! Zippy! Chilling!\nIt's “Pep Quiz“!\pToday's challenger is--this person!$"
gBwText_122_2:
	.string "Aha: Hiya, welcome!\p“Pep Quiz“ starts NOW!\pAnswer lots of quizzy questions,\nand watch your brain get brainier!\pLet's start...with...a question!$"
gBwText_122_3:
	.string "Ditoh: Good luck!$"
gBwText_122_4:
	.string "Aha: A question!$"
gBwText_122_5:
	.string "Wye: Oh, my! It's tremendously\ndifficult! Can the challenger answer\lthis?$"
gBwText_122_6:
	.string "Ditoh: H-i-n-t! H-i-n-t!$"
gBwText_122_7:
	.string "Aha: Oh-oh. The audience\nis asking for a hint!$"
gBwText_122_8:
	.string "Wye: OK.\nI'll give you a hint!$"
gBwText_122_9:
	.string "Aha: Ha ha, this is a good hint!\nChallenger, please answer!$"
gBwText_122_10:
	.string "Aha: Woo-hoo!\nThat is c-o-r-r-e-c-t!$"
gBwText_122_11:
	.string "Wye: You go! Yeah, you do!$"
gBwText_122_12:
	.string "Ditoh: Yeah! Yeah! Good hustle!$"
gBwText_122_13:
	.string "Aha: Congratulations!\pNow--THIS is a prize.\nIt's an Antidote!$"
gBwText_122_14:
	.string "Aha: Oh, no. Too bad!\nThat's not right, 'cause you are wrong!$"
gBwText_122_15:
	.string "Wye: Aww... Sadness...$"
gBwText_122_16:
	.string "Ditoh: Good hustle!\nGustle! Gustle!$"
gBwText_122_17:
	.string "Aha: Yeah, you gustle!\pHere ya go... Take this memento.\nIt's a Parlyz Heal!$"
gBwText_122_18:
	.string "Wye: Exciting! Thrilling! Zippy! Chilling!\nThat's “Pep Quiz“!\pSee ya tomorrow!$"
gBwText_122_19:
	.string "Aha: Do you like quiz shows?$"
gBwText_122_20:
	.string "Wye: I want to be on TV soon!$"
gBwText_122_21:
	.string "Ditoh: Gussssssssstle!$"
gBwText_122_22:
	.string "What's the name of the mysterious\ncreatures that inhabit our world?$"
gBwText_122_23:
	.string "What do you say when someone does\na good job?$"
gBwText_122_24:
	.string "What is the opposite of analog?$"
gBwText_122_25:
	.string "What do you pay with when you shop?$"
gBwText_122_26:
	.string "How do you describe people who are\nmadly in love?$"
gBwText_122_27:
	.string "What do you call your father's brother?$"
gBwText_122_28:
	.string "Who helps you learn things at school?$"
gBwText_122_29:
	.string "Which one can a Pokémon hold,\nMail or Marill?$"
gBwText_122_30:
	.string "What is a vehicle you pedal?$"
gBwText_122_31:
	.string "What is a two-on-two\nPokémon battle called?$"
gBwText_122_32:
	.string "What is a tool you use\nwhen you take pictures?$"
gBwText_122_33:
	.string "What do you take to get clean?$"
gBwText_122_34:
	.string "Where do you go to heal your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_122_35:
	.string "Which base stat goes up when Protein\nis used?$"
gBwText_122_36:
	.string "What is the unevolved Pokémon that\nchanges its Form seasonally?$"
gBwText_122_37:
	.string "What is the Electrified Pokémon that\ndischarges electricity from its mane?$"
gBwText_122_38:
	.string "What is the Pokémon that has two\ngears?$"
gBwText_122_39:
	.string "What is the Sky Squirrel Pokémon\nthat has huge ears?$"
gBwText_122_40:
	.string "What is the Attaching Pokémon?$"
gBwText_122_41:
	.string "What is the Wild Pigeon Pokémon?$"
gBwText_122_42:
	.string "What is the Grass Monkey Pokémon\nthat grows a leaf from its head?$"
gBwText_122_43:
	.string "What is the Hearing Pokémon\nthat can hear very well?$"
gBwText_122_44:
	.string "What is the Coffin Pokémon?$"
gBwText_122_45:
	.string "What will Woobat be when it evolves?$"
gBwText_122_46:
	.string "What will Darumaka be when it evolves?$"
gBwText_122_47:
	.string "What is the Caring Pokémon that wraps\na weak Pokémon with its fins?$"
gBwText_122_48:
	.string "What is the Drowsing Pokémon?$"
gBwText_122_49:
	.string "What is the White Bird Pokémon\nwith beautiful wings?$"
gBwText_122_50:
	.string "What is the Trap Pokémon\nthat hides in the mud?$"
gBwText_122_51:
	.string "What is the move that lets you\ncross water on a Pokémon's back?$"
gBwText_122_52:
	.string "What day is it today?$"
gBwText_122_53:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not Kémons!$"
gBwText_122_54:
	.string "Hint! \nThoroughly cooked meat!$"
gBwText_122_55:
	.string "Hint! \nIt's not golana!$"
gBwText_122_56:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's inside your wallet!$"
gBwText_122_57:
	.string "Hint!\nIt starts with L!$"
gBwText_122_58:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not big brother!$"
gBwText_122_59:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's a grown-up person!$"
gBwText_122_60:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not Marill!$"
gBwText_122_61:
	.string "Hint!\nIt has two wheels!$"
gBwText_122_62:
	.string "Hint! If it's a one-on-one battle, it's\nSingle!$"
gBwText_122_63:
	.string "Hint!\nSay cheese!$"
gBwText_122_64:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not a shower!$"
gBwText_122_65:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not a convenience store!$"
gBwText_122_66:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not Beauty!$"
gBwText_122_67:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not from space!$"
gBwText_122_68:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not a Thunderbolt Pokémon!$"
gBwText_122_69:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's in Chargestone Cave!$"
gBwText_122_70:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's part Flying type!$"
gBwText_122_71:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's a very small Pokémon!$"
gBwText_122_72:
	.string "Hint!\nIt weighs about 33 pounds!$"
gBwText_122_73:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not Bulbasaur or Turtwig!$"
gBwText_122_74:
	.string "Hint!\nThink of “Audio“...$"
gBwText_122_75:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's a Ghost-type Pokémon!$"
gBwText_122_76:
	.string "Hint!\nHearts are charming features!$"
gBwText_122_77:
	.string "Hint!\nIt has a big toothy grin!$"
gBwText_122_78:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's not a Fire-type Pokémon!$"
gBwText_122_79:
	.string "Hint!\nIt evolved from a Dream Eater Pokémon!$"
gBwText_122_80:
	.string "Hint!\nI wanna, I wanna...$"
gBwText_122_81:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's an Electric and Ground type!$"
gBwText_122_82:
	.string "Hint!\nIt sounds like catching a wave!$"
gBwText_122_83:
	.string "Hint!\nIt's related to {STR_VAR_1}!$"
