gBwText_123_0:
	.string "Oh! Member of Team Rocket I was,\nlong time gone!\pBut Team Rocket bye-bye a go-go.\nI my region went home.\pMake new Team Rocket, I did!\nSo myself I pledged!\pBut now I married am. Now for\nTeam Rocket there is no time by me.\pBut happy family is big hooray!$"
gBwText_123_1:
	.string "My dad used to have a cool job in a\nfaraway region!$"
gBwText_123_2:
	.string "Welcome!\pHey! I have a lot of souvenirs that my\nsweetie's old coworker gave me.\pI don't mind giving you one.$"
gBwText_123_3:
	.string "I heard that the RageCandyBar is the\nfavorite of my sweetie's old coworker.$"
