gBwText_124_0:
	.string "Ahem!\pI am the chairman who loves Pokémon the\nmost among Pokéfans in the entire\lworld!$"
gBwText_124_1:
	.string "If you are a Trainer, will you show me\nhow you are raising your Pokémon\lwith loving care?$"
gBwText_124_2:
	.string "Oh, I understand!\nYou are a shy Trainer!$"
gBwText_124_3:
	.string "Oh!\nWhich Pokémon will you show me?$"
gBwText_124_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_124_5:
	.string "...Hmmm.\nIt's hard to tell...$"
gBwText_124_6:
	.string "Well...it's a bit hard to tell how much\nthat Egg has grown.$"
gBwText_124_7:
	.string "Oh! This {STR_VAR_1} was level\n{STR_VAR_2} when you met, but now it's\llevel {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_124_8:
	.string "You've raised it very well.\nIt's received a lot of love from you.$"
gBwText_124_9:
	.string "You've raised it quite well.\nI feel your love for this Pokémon.$"
gBwText_124_10:
	.string "You've raised it well.\nYou must be affectionate.$"
gBwText_124_11:
	.string "I see! Although it's just a smidgen,\nI can feel your love for your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_124_12:
	.string "That is a token of gratitude for\nshowing me your great love for your\lPokémon!$"
gBwText_124_13:
	.string "Well, you showed me good stuff!\pPlease keep raising your Pokémon\nwith loving care!$"
gBwText_124_14:
	.string "What? It has not grown at all.\pStill, if you travel with your Pokémon\nfrom now on, I am sure it will grow!$"
gBwText_124_15:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Fan Club.\pShall I check how friendly your Pokémon\nis toward you?$"
gBwText_124_16:
	.string "$"
gBwText_124_17:
	.string "I can't tell whether or not you and\nthe Egg are close friends.$"
gBwText_124_18:
	.string "Oh, my. Your {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_124_19:
	.string "It is super friendly to you!\nI'm a bit jealous!$"
gBwText_124_20:
	.string "It is quite friendly to you!\nYou must be a kind person!$"
gBwText_124_21:
	.string "It is friendly to you.\nIt must be happy with you.$"
gBwText_124_22:
	.string "It is a little friendly to you...\nThat's what I'm getting.$"
gBwText_124_23:
	.string "The relationship is neither good\nnor bad... It looks neutral.$"
gBwText_124_24:
	.string "Hmmm...\nIt may not like you very much.$"
gBwText_124_25:
	.string "By any chance, you...\pAre you a very strict person?\nI feel that it really doesn't like you...$"
gBwText_124_26:
	.string "Oh, you are so shy! Come on,\ndon't hide your Pokémon from me.$"
gBwText_124_27:
	.string "Muuun!$"
gBwText_124_28:
	.string "Glibalugga!$"
	.align 2
