gBwText_125_0:
	.string "Alder: Hello, {STR_VAR_1}.\nThis way.$"
gBwText_125_1:
	.string "Ghetsis... What a liar.\pDesperately trying to con\neveryone with his speech.$"
gBwText_125_2:
	.string "That's correct!\pOur lord N has combined his power with\nthe legendary Dragon-type Pokémon\land intends to create a new world.\pWe herald the return of the hero of\nUnova, founder of this region.$"
gBwText_125_3:
	.string "Hero?$"
gBwText_125_4:
	.string "Dragon?$"
gBwText_125_5:
	.string "Legend!$"
gBwText_125_6:
	.string "Pokémon are different from people.\pThey are living beings who contain\nunknown potential.$"
gBwText_125_7:
	.string "They are living beings from whom we\nhumans have much to learn.$"
gBwText_125_8:
	.string "They are beings whose greatness we\nshould acknowledge!\pBeings who should be freed\nfrom our oppression!$"
gBwText_125_9:
	.string "Freed?$"
gBwText_125_10:
	.string "Pokémon?$"
gBwText_125_11:
	.string "We, Team Plasma, invite you to join us!\pWe all want to create a new world where\npeople and Pokémon are both free!\pLadies and gentlemen, I ask you now...\nPlease, release your Pokémon.\pAnd so I end my plea to you today.\pThank you one and all for your\nattention.$"
gBwText_125_12:
	.string "Is it true?\pHave we been making Pokémon suffer?$"
gBwText_125_13:
	.string "Hmm...\pMaybe we should release our Pokémon\nlike Team Plasma says...$"
gBwText_125_14:
	.string "No way!\pWithout Pokémon, I'll be lonely and sad!$"
gBwText_125_15:
	.string "What was that about? That speech was\noff-the-charts strange!$"
gBwText_125_16:
	.string "The cooperation of people and Pokémon\nis how Unova came to exist to begin\lwith.\pIf a Pokémon really didn't want\nanything to do with humans,\lit would simply leave...\pCapturing a Pokémon in a Poké Ball\ndoesn't mean you've captured its\lheart.$"
gBwText_125_17:
	.string "Alder: Let's go, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_125_18:
	.string "Alder: It's been a while, Iris\nand Drayden.$"
gBwText_125_19:
	.string "Iris: Oh! Mr. Alder!\n...And the guy who helped out that time.$"
gBwText_125_20:
	.string "Iris: Oh! Mr. Alder!\n...And the girl who helped out that time.$"
gBwText_125_21:
	.string "Drayden: What's wrong?\pWhat does the wandering Champion who\nleft the Pokémon League need from us?$"
gBwText_125_22:
	.string "Alder: Briefly, my request is this.\pTell us about the legendary\nDragon-type Pokémon!$"
gBwText_125_23:
	.string "Iris: Are you talking about Reshiram?\nOr Zekrom?\lWhat's the sudden interest?$"
gBwText_125_24:
	.string "Iris: Are you talking about Zekrom?\nOr Reshiram?\lWhat's the sudden interest?$"
gBwText_125_25:
	.string "Drayden: Moments ago, a troublemaker\nknown as Ghetsis was here.\pHe said a Trainer named N has\nreawakened Reshiram...$"
gBwText_125_26:
	.string "Drayden: Moments ago, a troublemaker\nknown as Ghetsis was here.\pHe said a Trainer named N has\nreawakened Zekrom...$"
gBwText_125_27:
	.string "Alder: Yes!\pThat Trainer called N apparently told\n{STR_VAR_1} here to search for the\lother Dragon-type Pokémon!$"
gBwText_125_28:
	.string "Drayden: Let me check that I have\nthis straight.\pThis N, or what have you, presumes\nto set the two Dragon-type Pokémon\lagainst each other in battle\lto test his convictions?$"
gBwText_125_29:
	.string "Iris: Oh, no!\pThe Dragon-type Pokémon\nget along so well!$"
gBwText_125_30:
	.string "Alder: That's right, Iris.\pThe ones who make Pokémon battle\nare the Trainers...\pAnd it's so the Trainers and the\nPokémon can get to know each other\lbetter.$"
gBwText_125_31:
	.string "I'm going to the Pokémon League.\pNo, I guess in this case I should say\nI'm “returning“ to the Pokémon League!\pOf course, I'll defeat N!\pI'll teach him about the beauty of this\nworld, where Pokémon and Trainers\llive together in harmony!\pAlso, {STR_VAR_1}, I'll await your\narrival.\pOnce you've obtained the Opelucid\nBadge, come to the League!\pThe Opelucid Gym Leader is tough.\nTake care!$"
gBwText_125_32:
	.string "Farewell.\nI'm counting on you, Drayden and Iris!$"
gBwText_125_33:
	.string "Iris: Aww...\nHe's gone.\pIs he OK?\nHe looked kinda scary.$"
gBwText_125_34:
	.string "Drayden: Don't worry, Iris.\pHe is the strongest Trainer\nin all of Unova.$"
gBwText_125_35:
	.string "Well, {STR_VAR_1}, is it?\nCome to my home.\pAs Alder asked, I'll tell you\neverything I can about the\llegendary Dragon-type Pokémon.\pIris, child, please show the way.$"
gBwText_125_36:
	.string "Iris: You bet! If it's Opelucid City,\nI can take you anywhere.\pAs for the story of Reshiram and\nZekrom, we'll tell you all we know about\lit!\pThis way!$"
gBwText_125_37:
	.string "Iris: You bet! If it's Opelucid City,\nI can take you anywhere.\pAs for the story of Zekrom and\nReshiram, we'll tell you all we know\labout it!\pThis way!$"
gBwText_125_38:
	.string "Iris: That way!$"
gBwText_125_39:
	.string "Iris: Just a little farther!$"
gBwText_125_40:
	.string "Iris: This is it!$"
gBwText_125_41:
	.string "A challenger?\pI'm sorry, but currently,\nour Gym Leader is at home.$"
gBwText_125_42:
	.string "If all Pokémon are released, Trainers\nand Gym Leaders will no longer exist.\pFor better or worse, the world\nwould surely change...$"
gBwText_125_43:
	.string "The memories of everyone who has lived\nin this city have built up over the\lyears without changing much.$"
gBwText_125_44:
	.string "This city changes endlessly.\pAnd every change is engraved in the\nmemories of the people who live here.$"
gBwText_125_45:
	.string "I spent so many happy days training my\nPokémon as we grew stronger together...\pIf it will make my beloved Pokémon\na perfect being, however,\lI can't help but let it go.$"
gBwText_125_46:
	.string "Even if it is inconvenient, I think\nsome things shouldn't be changed.$"
gBwText_125_47:
	.string "Even if you love them, I think\nsome things have to be changed.$"
gBwText_125_48:
	.string "Hey hey! That person called N had the\nlegendary Pokémon with him, so he has\lto be the legendary hero, right?\pHe's going to change the world, isn't\nhe?$"
gBwText_125_49:
	.string "I like older things better than new\nones. They're just more relaxing!$"
gBwText_125_50:
	.string "I like newer things better than old\nones. They're just so cool!$"
gBwText_125_51:
	.string "...No way! Without Pokémon, I'll be too\nlonely and sad!\pBut am I only using my Pokémon, then...?$"
gBwText_125_52:
	.string "The Gym Leader Iris is still a child, but\nthe mayor Drayden has recognized\lher power!$"
gBwText_125_53:
	.string "The Gym Leader Drayden is the mayor who\nleads Opelucid.\pHe is always training by wrestling\nwith Pokémon.$"
gBwText_125_54:
	.string "So, have we really been making\nour Pokémon suffer...?$"
gBwText_125_55:
	.string "Yes, I will keep moving forward together\nwith my Pokémon.\pEven if I were to part ways with my\nPokémon, it wouldn't be because\lsomeone else said to, but because we\ldecided to.$"
gBwText_125_56:
	.string "I'll definitely keep moving forward\ntogether with my Pokémon.\pI won't take their company for granted.\nI'll appreciate how amazing that is!$"
gBwText_125_57:
	.string "The legendary Pokémon is the symbol\nof Unova.\pDoes that mean Team Plasma is right?\n...I don't know.$"
gBwText_125_58:
	.string "Pursuing ideals is different from\nperson to person and Pokémon to\lPokémon.\pIn this city, it seems the ideal is\nto cherish the past.$"
gBwText_125_59:
	.string "The truth people pursue is different\nfrom person to person and\lPokémon to Pokémon.\pIn this city, it seems the truth is\nconstant change.$"
gBwText_125_60:
	.string "The hopes of an ancient people are put\ninto this melody...\pI will bring them back to us now.$"
gBwText_125_61:
	.string "Our hopes are put into this melody...\nI will send them to the future.$"
gBwText_125_62:
	.string "Professor Juniper: ...Hello!\nHow was Iris doing?$"
gBwText_125_63:
	.string "Professor Juniper: ...Hello!\nWas Drayden as tough as ever?$"
gBwText_125_64:
	.string "Oh, I came to report on how to\nresurrect the legendary Zekrom.\pI thought it would be better to tell you\nin person than over the Xtransceiver.\pAnd as for the conclusion...\nWell, I haven't figured it out yet.\pI'm sure the Pokémon will wake up\nwhen it deems someone worthy.$"
gBwText_125_65:
	.string "Oh, I came to report on how to\nresurrect the legendary Reshiram.\pI thought it would be better to tell you\nin person than over the Xtransceiver.\pAnd as for the conclusion...\nWell, I haven't figured it out yet.\pI'm sure the Pokémon will wake up\nwhen it deems someone worthy.$"
gBwText_125_66:
	.string "More importantly, aren't you amazing!\pYou have all eight of Unova's Gym\nBadges now, right?\pYou've become so strong!\pYou probably don't even know it, but\nyou've changed a lot since you left\lNuvema Town.\pWell then, I'll show you where such a\nstrong Trainer should head next!$"
gBwText_125_67:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Pass through that\ngate, go down Route 10, and you'll\larrive at the Badge Check Gates!\pOnce you get through Victory Road,\nwhich is past the gates, you're finally\lat the Pokémon League!$"
gBwText_125_68:
	.string "Oh, that just made me think of when I\nwas showing you around the Pokémon\lCenter in Accumula Town.\p{STR_VAR_1}? Do you regret setting out\non your Pokémon journey?$"
gBwText_125_69:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Oh! That's OK,\ndon't worry! You don't have to tell\lme everything.\pBut I'm very happy that you three\nchose to train Pokémon!\pBecause they create chances to meet\nmore wonderful people and Pokémon!$"
gBwText_125_70:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Thanks! That's the\ngreatest answer you could give!\pI was really happy to be able to give\nyou three those Pokémon as a present!\pBecause Pokémon create chances to\nmeet more wonderful people and\lPokémon!$"
gBwText_125_71:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, this is a present for you!$"
gBwText_125_72:
	.string "Professor Juniper: This Master Ball is\nthe most powerful kind of Poké Ball.\pIt can catch any Pokémon without fail.\pThis is the only way I can support you,\nexcept to say...\lBe true to yourself.\pNo matter what happens, stay strong\nand keep going with your Pokémon!\pSee you!$"
gBwText_125_73:
	.string "Opelucid City\nTime's Dividing Line$"
gBwText_125_74:
	.string "Drayden's House$"
gBwText_125_75:
	.string "Battle House\nTriple Battle!$"
gBwText_125_76:
	.string "Battle House\nRotation Battle!$"
gBwText_125_77:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pMayor Drayden will teach you if he\nrecognizes you as a strong Trainer.\pVisit his home to learn the\nmost powerful Dragon-type move!$"
gBwText_125_78:
	.string "Opelucid City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Iris\lThe Girl Who Knows\lthe Hearts of Dragons$"
gBwText_125_79:
	.string "Opelucid City Pokémon Gym\nLeader: Drayden\lThe Spartan Mayor$"
	.align 2
