gBwText_126_0:
	.string "Hi! I'm Iris, the amazingly strong\nGym Leader!\pTell me... What Pokémon are you using?\nHow will you fight?\pOoh, I'm super curious, so let's just\nget started!$"
gBwText_126_1:
	.string "Whoooa!\nThat was so cool!\pI'm sooo happy I could battle a Trainer\nas strong as you!$"
gBwText_126_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the Legend Badge\nfrom Iris.$"
gBwText_126_3:
	.string "Hey, that's your eighth Badge, right?\nThat's so cool!\pNow every Pokémon will do what you ask,\nno matter how big they are!\pKnow what? I'll give you this TM, too!$"
gBwText_126_4:
	.string "Dragon Tail doesn't just do damage.\pIt sends the other Pokémon back to its\nPoké Ball, too!$"
gBwText_126_5:
	.string "Ooh, hey!\nI wonder how Mister Alder is doing?\pI wonder if he's battling that Trainer\ncalled N in the Pokémon League right\lnow?\pDo you know about the Pokémon League?\pIt's past Victory Road, at the end of\nRoute 10!$"
gBwText_126_6:
	.string "You've been on a journey and seen a lot\nof the world.\pI'm like that, too! I'm from way out in\nthe country.\pI'm really happy that I've gotten to\nmeet lots of different people\land Pokémon!!$"
gBwText_126_7:
	.string "You've been on a journey and seen a lot\nof the world.\pI'm like that, too! I'm from way out in\nthe country.\pI'm really happy that I've gotten to\nmeet lots of different people\land Pokémon!!$"
gBwText_126_8:
	.string "Welcome. Thank you for coming. I am\nOpelucid Pokémon Gym's Leader,\lDrayden.\pAs the mayor, I've given everything\nto developing the city.\pAs a Trainer, I've simply been pursuing\ngreater strength.\pBut what I'm searching for now is a\nyoung Trainer who can show me a bright\lfuture.\pPerhaps you can show me that future,\nthe way Iris has?$"
gBwText_126_9:
	.string "Wonderful.\pI'm grateful we had a chance to meet\nand battle.$"
gBwText_126_10:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the Legend Badge\nfrom Drayden!$"
gBwText_126_11:
	.string "Well, now. You've obtained all of the\nGym Badges in Unova.\pNow, all Pokémon will obediently follow\nyour commands.\pI also want you to have this.\nIt's a TM I'm particularly fond of.\pIt's called Dragon Tail.$"
gBwText_126_12:
	.string "Dragon Tail is a move that returns the\ndamaged Pokémon to its Poké Ball.\pIn other words, it switches your\nopponent's Pokémon.$"
gBwText_126_13:
	.string "Now, I have something to ask of you.\pHead for the Pokémon League and\ngo after Alder.\pThe Pokémon League is past Route 10,\nwhich runs from Opelucid City\lto Victory Road.\pI know Alder's strength, but I don't\nknow the depths of N's power...$"
gBwText_126_14:
	.string "Pokémon and people do not age because\nof the passage of time.\pThey get old when the energy flowing in\ntheir hearts dries up.\pThis energy in our hearts is powered by\ntruth, ideals, or maybe dreams...\pThat probably changes with what you\nmost hope for in your life.$"
gBwText_126_15:
	.string "Thanks for coming!\nI happily welcome you!\pBut...\nI may be a little rough on you!$"
gBwText_126_16:
	.string "Advancing or retreating is up to you.\nBut if you proceed, prepare yourself!\pMoving forward halfheartedly is\ndisrespectful to your Pokémon!$"
gBwText_126_17:
	.string "Welcome to the Opelucid Gym, the Unova\nregion's strongest and biggest trial!\pFirst off, please take this Fresh Water.\nIt'll help you in the challenge ahead.$"
gBwText_126_18:
	.string "Let me give you a brief explanation of\nthe trick to the Opelucid Gym!\pThe path around this Gym is shaped like\ntwo dragons.\pThis path changes when you step on\nthe switches on the dragons' arms.\pPay attention to how the dragons'\nnecks move!$"
gBwText_126_19:
	.string "You beat the Gym Leader?\nWow, that's amazing!\pOh, by the way, since I gave you all that\nFresh Water...\lDon't you owe me some of your winnings?\p...I'm kidding! It's just a joke!\nNo, seriously, congratulations!$"
gBwText_126_20:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Iris\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_126_21:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Iris\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_126_22:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Iris\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
gBwText_126_23:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Drayden\nCertified Trainers:$"
gBwText_126_24:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Drayden\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_126_25:
	.string "Opelucid Pokémon Gym\pGym Leader: Drayden\nCertified Trainers:\l{STR_VAR_1}\lCheren\lBianca$"
