gBwText_127_0:
	.string "The slow passage of time in\nOpelucid City...\lIt fits an old woman like me perfectly.$"
gBwText_127_1:
	.string "In Opelucid City, you can spend your\ndays in leisure and opulence...$"
gBwText_127_2:
	.string "Sometimes, I think this...\pThere could be another world, where\na person who looks just like me\llives in a completely different way...$"
gBwText_127_3:
	.string "I imagine that even the exact same\nperson would change a lot by living in a\ldifferent world.$"
