gBwText_128_0:
	.string "Drayden: I'll explain.\pWhat you are holding is the Dark Stone.\pZekrom, who will likely awaken from the\nDark Stone, and Reshiram, who is already\lawake, were once the same Pokémon.$"
gBwText_128_1:
	.string "Drayden: I'll explain.\pWhat you are holding is the Light Stone.\pReshiram, who will likely awaken from\nthe Light Stone, and Zekrom, who is\lalready awake, were once the same\lPokémon.$"
gBwText_128_2:
	.string "Iris: That single Dragon Pokémon,\nalong with twin heroes,\lbrought a new region into being.\pAnd people and Pokémon had happy lives!$"
gBwText_128_3:
	.string "Drayden: One day, however...\pThe twin heroes, the older brother\nwho sought the truth, and the\lyounger brother who sought ideals,\lbegan to argue about how to decide\lwhich one of them was right...\pThe single Dragon-type Pokémon\nthat had been with them all that time\lsplit its body into two.\pOne sided with the older brother,\nand the other with the younger brother.$"
gBwText_128_4:
	.string "Drayden: One day, however...\pThe twin heroes, the older brother\nwho sought the truth, and the\lyounger brother who sought ideals,\lbegan to argue about how to decide\lwhich one of them was right...\pThe single Dragon-type Pokémon\nthat had been with them all that time\lsplit its body into two.\pOne sided with the older brother,\nand the other with the younger brother.$"
gBwText_128_5:
	.string "Iris: In its pursuit of truth, the white\nDragon-type Pokémon sought to usher\lin a new and better world...\pIts name was Reshiram.\pAnd the other, the black Dragon-type\nPokémon, sought ideals and to usher in\la new world--a world of hope.\pIts name was Zekrom.$"
gBwText_128_6:
	.string "Iris: In its pursuit of ideals, the black\nDragon-type Pokémon sought to usher\lin a new and better world...\pIts name was Zekrom.\pAnd the other, the white Dragon-type\nPokémon, sought truth, and to\lusher in a new world--a world of good...\pIts name was Reshiram.$"
gBwText_128_7:
	.string "Drayden: Because the two of them\nwere once the same entity,\ltheir battle raged endlessly\land neither one could be\ldeclared the winner.\lThey simply exhausted themselves.\pThe twin heroes proclaimed that there\nwas no one side that was right\land ceased the conflict.$"
gBwText_128_8:
	.string "Iris: But, but...\pThe two heroes' sons started the\nbattle again! And an instant later,\lReshiram and Zekrom destroyed\lUnova with fire and lightning!\pThen, they disappeared!\pBut, but... If people work with Pokémon\nin the right way, we don't have to worry\lanymore about the world being\ldestroyed.\pI mean, Reshiram and Zekrom\nworked hard for everyone\land made a new region!\pSo, it should be all right, I think.$"
gBwText_128_9:
	.string "Iris: But, but...\pThe two heroes' sons started the \nbattle again! And an instant later,\lZekrom and Reshiram destroyed\lUnova with lightning and fire!\pThen, they disappeared!\pBut, but... If people work with Pokémon\nin the right way, we don't have to worry\lanymore about the world being\ldestroyed.\pI mean, Zekrom and Reshiram\nworked hard for everyone\land made a new region!\pSo, it should be all right, I think.$"
gBwText_128_10:
	.string "Drayden: True.\nPokémon cannot speak.\pPeople may hurt Pokémon even more by\nimposing their selfish thoughts on\lthem.\pBut, no matter what, Pokémon and people\nbelieve in each other, need each other,\land will continue to live together...$"
gBwText_128_11:
	.string "Iris: Yeah!\pSo I'm never gonna forgive Team Plasma\nfor trying to separate Pokémon and us!$"
gBwText_128_12:
	.string "Drayden: Sorry.\nWe got a little off topic at the end.\pThat is everything we know.\pUnfortunately, we don't know how\nto wake up the legendary Pokémon...$"
gBwText_128_13:
	.string "Drayden: I made a promise to Alder.\pYou must win the Gym Badge from\nthe Opelucid Pokémon Gym.$"
gBwText_128_14:
	.string "Iris, you go and be {STR_VAR_1}'s\nopponent at the Pokémon Gym.$"
gBwText_128_15:
	.string "Iris: Yay!\pLook out! I'm really, really strong,\njust like Drayden!$"
gBwText_128_16:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, I'll be waiting for\nyour challenge at the Pokémon Gym!$"
gBwText_128_17:
	.string "Drayden: What will it accomplish\nto separate the worlds of people\land Pokémon?\pThe way we live now, with different\nbeings understanding and forgiving\leach other, is much richer. That's my\lbelief.$"
gBwText_128_18:
	.string "Iris: Everyone, people and Pokémon can\nget along and be happy. That's\lawesome!$"
gBwText_128_19:
	.string "$"
gBwText_128_20:
	.string "$"
gBwText_128_21:
	.string "$"
