gBwText_129_0:
	.string "I am coaching Iris.\pBut, honestly, she's been stronger\nthan me ever since she came here!$"
gBwText_129_1:
	.string "The move Draco Meteor that Drayden\nteaches us is the strongest\lDragon-type move.\pHowever, it will sharply reduce\nSpecial Attack after use.$"
gBwText_129_2:
	.string "The move Draco Meteor that Iris\nteaches us is the strongest\lDragon-type move.\pHowever, it will sharply reduce\nSpecial Attack after use.$"
gBwText_129_3:
	.string "Concerned about your Pokémon's\nweight?\pYou don't need to put it on a diet!\nJust let it hold this.$"
gBwText_129_4:
	.string "The weight of a Pokémon holding a\nFloat Stone will be halved!\pThat way, you can reduce the damage\ncaused by weight-based moves such as\lLow Kick and Grass Knot.$"
gBwText_129_5:
	.string "I have an item that I don't know how to\nuse. Would you give it a try and see if\lyou can make it work?$"
gBwText_129_6:
	.string "I know... You'll also have trouble\nfiguring it out.$"
gBwText_129_7:
	.string "You may be able to master it. Here it is!$"
gBwText_129_8:
	.string "If a Pokémon holds a Ring Target, it can\nbe hit even by a move that would usually\lhave no effect.\pFor example, a Normal-type move would\nhit a Ghost-type Pokémon.\pMastering this item is a bit tough...\nActually, it's very tough, but think\lhow useful it could be!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_129
