gBwText_130_0:
	.string "Welcome! Glad to see you here at the\nTriple Battle House. As the name\lsuggests, if you want to enjoy Triple\lBattles, you've come to the right spot.\pMay I explain how Triple Battles work?$"
gBwText_130_1:
	.string "May I explain how Triple Battles work?$"
gBwText_130_2:
	.string "Triple Battle is a battle format in\nwhich each side uses three Pokémon.\pA Trainer who makes all of the\nopponent's Pokémon faint will win.$"
gBwText_130_3:
	.string "This doesn't intrigue you? It's fun.\nPlease allow me to explain how it works.$"
gBwText_130_4:
	.string "Welcome! Glad to see you here at the\nRotation Battle House.\pAs the name suggests, this is the place\nto enjoy Rotation Battles.\pMay I explain how Rotation Battles\nwork?$"
gBwText_130_5:
	.string "May I explain how Rotation Battles\nwork?$"
gBwText_130_6:
	.string "Rotation Battle is a battle format in\nwhich each side uses three Pokémon.\pOne Pokémon takes the lead position,\nand the other two stand off to the\lsides.\pBut this position will change every\nturn!$"
gBwText_130_7:
	.string "Don't you want to know more? It's fun.\nPlease allow me to explain how it works.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_130
