gBwText_132_0:
	.string "Know what? I am a huge musical fan! ?\pOh, you have a Prop Case! You must be\na huge musical fan, too! ?\pWould you like a new Prop to use\nin the musical?$"
gBwText_132_1:
	.string "I am so glad! ? You are also a huge\nmusical fan! ?\pYou should try putting various Props\non your Pokémon! That would be fun. ?$"
gBwText_132_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_132_3:
	.string "What?\pDon't you know how cute Pokémon\nwith Props are?!$"
gBwText_132_4:
	.string "You know what? I'm a huge musical fan!\n?\pIf you come see me again tomorrow,\nI'll give you a different Prop! ?$"
gBwText_132_5:
	.string "You know what? I'm a huge musical fan!\n?\pI want people all over the world\nto enjoy musicals. ?$"
gBwText_132_6:
	.string "If you have a lot of Props, it makes you\nwant to put them on Pokémon.\pIf you put Props on Pokémon, it makes\nyou want to participate in a musical!\pDon't you agree?$"
gBwText_132_7:
	.string "63... 64...\pOh, I was counting all the kinds of\nProps for musicals.\pI think there are about 100\ndifferent kinds!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_132
gBwTextTable_132:
	.4byte gBwText_132_0
	.4byte gBwText_132_1
	.4byte gBwText_132_2
	.4byte gBwText_132_3
	.4byte gBwText_132_4
	.4byte gBwText_132_5
	.4byte gBwText_132_6
	.4byte gBwText_132_7
	.global gBwTextCount_132
gBwTextCount_132:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_133_0:
	.string "This is just between you and me, OK?\nI used to be part of Team Plasma.\pBut it's strange when everyone around\nyou thinks the same way, isn't it?\pSo I left Team Plasma to think for\nmyself about what I want to do.\pDon't tell this story to the guy on the\nopposite side.$"
gBwText_133_1:
	.string "This is just between you and me, OK?\nI'm really not very good as a Trainer.\pSo I think Team Plasma might have the\nright idea when they take Pokémon away\lfrom weak Trainers.\pI do feel sorry for the people who were\nrobbed, though.\pDon't tell this story to the guy on the\nopposite side.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_133
gBwTextTable_133:
	.4byte gBwText_133_0
	.4byte gBwText_133_1
	.global gBwTextCount_133
gBwTextCount_133:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_134_0:
	.string "The more this city develops, the more\nfuturistic it will become.\pI'm sure of this!\nI want to grow up quickly!$"
gBwText_134_1:
	.string "If I had cherished old things, they\ncould have reminded me of old days...\pI totally forgot what I was like when I\nwas a child.\pI think I was hoping to grow\nup quickly...$"
gBwText_134_2:
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_134_3:
	.string "put in a great effort!$"
gBwText_134_4:
	.string "looks like it can try a little harder.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_134
gBwTextTable_134:
	.4byte gBwText_134_0
	.4byte gBwText_134_1
	.4byte gBwText_134_2
	.4byte gBwText_134_3
	.4byte gBwText_134_4
	.global gBwTextCount_134
gBwTextCount_134:
	.4byte 5
gBwText_135_0:
	.string "I want to know the future!\nI am very worried...\pI wonder how my child, Thyme, will spend\nthe future.\pI'm making a machine that connects the\nfuture and the present, but electricity\lis desperately short.$"
gBwText_135_1:
	.string "I've heard that in another world,\nthere's another Opelucid City that\llooks very futuristic.\pIf there is a Pokémon from that world\nthat knows the move Charge, the\lmachine may work.\pIf you're able, would you be willing to\nlend me a Pokémon like that?$"
gBwText_135_2:
	.string "I...I see. What a pity.\nIf you change your mind, please return.$"
gBwText_135_3:
	.string "Th-thank you!\nNow my machine will work!$"
gBwText_135_4:
	.string "I appreciate the thought, but...you\ndon't have a Pokémon that meets the\lconditions I need.$"
gBwText_135_5:
	.string "I appreciate the thought, but although\nyour Pokémon knows Charge, it's not\lfrom that other world...$"
gBwText_135_6:
	.string "Now, please show me the future!$"
gBwText_135_7:
	.string "Whirrr, whirrr, whirrr...$"
gBwText_135_8:
	.string "Oh! So that's what the future is like!\pMy precious Thyme is growing up as such\na good kid!$"
gBwText_135_9:
	.string "Oh, it returned to normal...\pBut what an experience!\nI can't stop trembling!\pAnd even though I know the future,\nI guess my present time won't change.$"
gBwText_135_10:
	.string "I will return your Pokémon to you.\nThis is my thank-you gift.$"
gBwText_135_11:
	.string "Rather than worrying about the future,\nit is important to live in the present,\lwhich connects to the future, as best\lyou can.\pOK, Thyme! Let's go out later!\nToday, let's play as hard as we can!$"
gBwText_135_12:
	.string "Thyme: I, I...\nWhat will I be when I grow up?$"
gBwText_135_13:
	.string "I want to return to the past!\nI want to do many things over again!\pMy father, Bach, created a machine to\nsee the future.\pI am making a machine to connect with\nthe past.\p...But I don't have enough electricity.$"
gBwText_135_14:
	.string "I've heard that in another world,\nthere's another Opelucid City that\llooks very old-timey.\pIf there is a Pokémon from that world\nthat knows the move Charge, the\lmachine may work.\pIf you're able, would you be willing to\nlend me a Pokémon like that?$"
gBwText_135_15:
	.string "Ah... What a pity.\nThere is no other way...$"
gBwText_135_16:
	.string "Yes!\nNow, the machine will work.$"
gBwText_135_17:
	.string "You're nice to offer, but I'm afraid\nyou don't have a Pokémon that meets\lthe conditions I need.$"
gBwText_135_18:
	.string "That's nice of you, but although your\nPokémon knows Charge, it's not from\lthat other world...$"
gBwText_135_19:
	.string "Now, we can connect with the past!$"
gBwText_135_20:
	.string "We connected with the past!\pFather! It's me, Thyme!\nI owe you an apology...$"
gBwText_135_21:
	.string "It returned to normal...\nIt seems to have run out of electricity.\pI connected with the past...but I guess\nmy present time won't change.$"
gBwText_135_22:
	.string "Oh!\nI will return your Pokémon to you.\pThank you.\nThis is my thank-you gift.$"
gBwText_135_23:
	.string "Rather than regretting the past...\nit is important to live in the present,\lwhich connects from the past,\las best as you can.\pOK!\nI'll live positively!$"
gBwText_135_24:
	.string "I heard that my father had a fight with\nmy Grandpa Bach a long, long time ago!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_135
