gBwText_136_0:
	.string "Welcome to Opelucid City,\nwhere people value history!\p...Have you heard this before?$"
gBwText_136_1:
	.string "Welcome to Opelucid City,\nwhere people like changes!\p...Have you heard this before?$"
gBwText_136_2:
	.string "Munch, munch...\pI heard that a guy with a legendary\nPokémon was visiting Opelucid City...\pMunch, munch...$"
gBwText_136_3:
	.string "Munch, munch...\nI am happy when I am eating!\pMunch, munch...\nBut when I don't get food, I am angry!\pThe words hungry and angry are similar.\nDon't you think?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_136
gBwTextTable_136:
	.4byte gBwText_136_0
	.4byte gBwText_136_1
	.4byte gBwText_136_2
	.4byte gBwText_136_3
	.global gBwTextCount_136
gBwTextCount_136:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_137_0:
	.string "This way leads to Victory Road.\pBut if you don't have eight Badges,\nyou cannot reach the end.$"
gBwText_137_1:
	.string "Hi, Trainer!\nDo you have a minute?$"
gBwText_137_2:
	.string "I just heard this on the Xtransceiver.\nThere's a big storm on Route 7!\pAnd the storm seems to be different\nfrom a natural phenomenon!\pSo strange!$"
gBwText_137_3:
	.string "I heard the storm on Route 7 was caused\nby a Pokémon!$"
gBwText_137_4:
	.string "The trembling before the Pokémon\nLeague is a tremor of excitement!$"
gBwText_137_5:
	.string "Victory Road stands in the way of a\nchallenge to the Pokémon League.\pYou need to have serious skills\nto get through it.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_137
