	.4byte gBwText_137_5
	.global gBwTextCount_137
gBwTextCount_137:
	.4byte 6
gBwText_138_0:
	.string "Trainer who came to Opelucid City!\nHello!\pTrainer who is going to Route 11!\nPlease come again!$"
gBwText_138_1:
	.string "Trainer who came to Opelucid City!\nHello!\pTrainer who is going to Route 11!\nPlease come again!$"
gBwText_138_2:
	.string "There is something ahead, and\nthe road is closed now.$"
gBwText_138_3:
	.string "There is something ahead, and\nthe road is closed now.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_138
gBwTextTable_138:
	.4byte gBwText_138_0
	.4byte gBwText_138_1
	.4byte gBwText_138_2
	.4byte gBwText_138_3
	.global gBwTextCount_138
gBwTextCount_138:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_139_0:
	.string "The Battle House, where you can have\na Triple Battle, is next door.$"
gBwText_139_1:
	.string "The Battle House, where you can have\na Rotation Battle, is next door.$"
gBwText_139_2:
	.string "Whether or not you are troubled by the\nPokémon move Attract, take this!$"
gBwText_139_3:
	.string "When a Pokémon holding the Destiny\nKnot is affected by the move Attract,\lthe opponent will also fall in love.\pIt's a bit difficult to use, but I hope\nit will be useful!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_139
gBwTextTable_139:
	.4byte gBwText_139_0
	.4byte gBwText_139_1
	.4byte gBwText_139_2
	.4byte gBwText_139_3
	.global gBwTextCount_139
gBwTextCount_139:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_140_0:
	.string "It doesn't matter if we win or lose,\nas long as we have Pokémon with us!$"
gBwText_140_1:
	.string "You need to have eight Gym Badges\nto challenge the Pokémon League.\pHowever, even with such skills, it's\nhard to defeat the Elite Four who are\lwaiting!$"
gBwText_140_2:
	.string "Glubaaa!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_140
gBwTextTable_140:
	.4byte gBwText_140_0
	.4byte gBwText_140_1
	.4byte gBwText_140_2
	.global gBwTextCount_140
gBwTextCount_140:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_141_0:
	.string "The Pokémon League is a place where you\nboth pursue strength and express it.\pThe way to express it is simple...\pYou just have to beat the Elite Four\nand the Champion!\pYou can start your challenge by\nbattling any of the Elite Four, and if\lyou defeat them all, you can challenge\lthe Champion!\pHowever! I warn you, once you start\nyour challenge, there's no turning\lback.\pYou must keep battling until you defeat\nthem all...or are defeated yourself.\pDo you want to go in?$"
gBwText_141_1:
	.string "Once you start your challenge, you\ncannot leave until you win against all\lor lose! Do you want to go in?$"
gBwText_141_2:
	.string "Then, proceed!$"
gBwText_141_3:
	.string "Don't neglect preparation!\pGo through the entrance there, and\nprepare as much as possible. Make sure\lyour Pokémon are fully recovered!$"
gBwText_141_4:
	.string "The Pokémon League is a place where you\nboth pursue strength and express it.\pThe way to express it is simple...\pYou just have to beat the Elite Four\nand the Champion!\pYou can start your challenge by\nbattling any of the Elite Four, and if\lyou defeat them all, you can challenge\lthe Champion!\pHowever! I warn you, once you start\nyour challenge, there's no turning\lback.\pIf you enter, you must keep battling\nuntil you defeat them all...\lor are defeated yourself.$"
gBwText_141_5:
	.string "The Pokémon League is every Trainer's\ngreatest challenge!$"
gBwText_141_6:
	.string "You might want to prepare here.\pBecause if you lose even once,\nyou have to start all over again!$"
gBwText_141_7:
	.string "My apologies, young Trainer.\pBut you may not enter the\nPokémon League at this time.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_141
