gBwText_142_0:
	.string "Words are engraved on the statue:\p“Four great warriors form\n this Pokémon League.\p To the southwest is one who\n does not fear the Ghost type.\pTo the southeast is one who channels\nthe power of the Fighting type.\p To the northwest is one who\n has mastered the Dark type.\p To the northeast is one who\n knows the mind of the Psychic type.\p If you can defeat these warriors with\n your courage and wisdom,\l you shall be led to the summit,\l where the strongest Champion awaits.“$"
gBwText_142_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_142_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_142_3:
	.string "$"
