gBwTextCount_144:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_145_0:
	.string "“Eyes brimming with dark flame, this man\nrejected everything other than himself\lin order to bring about one singular\ljustice...“\pThat's part of a novel I'm writing. I\nwas inspired by the challenger who was\ljust here, and somehow I got a little\lsad...\pExcuse me.\nYou're a challenger, right?\pI'm the Elite Four's Ghost-type\nPokémon user, Shauntal, and I\lshall be your opponent.$"
gBwText_145_1:
	.string "S-sorry!\nFirst, I must apologize to my Pokémon...\pI'm really sorry you had a bad\nexperience because of me!\pOh! It's not your fault!\nThis is how battles always are.\pEven in light of that, I'm still one of\nthe Elite Four!$"
gBwText_145_2:
	.string "Every person who works with Pokémon\nhas a Pokémon story to tell.\pI've found that stories where people\nand Pokémon help each other out are far\lmore interesting than stories about\lonly people, or only Pokémon!$"
gBwText_145_3:
	.string "Challenger, if you defeat the entire\nElite Four of the Pokémon League, you\lcan go on to challenge the Champion.\pAnd you have earned that right.\pReturn to the plaza in the center\nand check the statue.$"
gBwText_145_4:
	.string "“The Trainer's thoughts joined with\nthe Pokémon's mind, and a lustrous Aqua\lRing unfurled...“\pThat's part of a novel I wrote.\pI absolutely love writing about the\nclose bonds between the Trainers who\lcome here and the Pokémon they train.\pCould I use you and your Pokémon as\na subject?$"
gBwText_145_5:
	.string "“'Do you know Thunderbolt?' was\n  his first greeting to me.\p  It wasn't until after we battled that\n  I learned his name was Volkner.“\pThat's part of a novel I wrote.\pI absolutely love writing about the\nclose bonds between the Trainers who\lcome here and the Pokémon they train.\pCould I use you and your Pokémon as\na subject?$"
gBwText_145_6:
	.string "“The tiny but strong Pokémon looked up\n  at its Trainer and saw the seeds\l  of doubt taking root as together they\l  faced their toughest opponent yet.\p  The Pokémon sounded a soft cry of\n  reassurance, and the battle began...“\pThat was part of a novel I wrote.\pI absolutely love writing about the\nclose bonds between the Trainers who\lcome here and the Pokémon they train.\pCould I use you and your Pokémon as\na subject?$"
gBwText_145_7:
	.string "“This world doesn't exist just for you.\n  And I'll tell you why...“\pThat was part of a novel I wrote.\pI absolutely love writing about the\nclose bonds between the Trainers who\lcome here and the Pokémon they train.\pCould I use you and your Pokémon as\na subject?$"
gBwText_145_8:
	.string "“I have no idea what day it\n  is today, but I will never forget it\l  for the rest of my life.“\pThat was part of a novel I wrote.\pI absolutely love writing about the\nclose bonds between the Trainers who\lcome here and the Pokémon they train.\pCould I use you and your Pokémon as\na subject?$"
gBwText_145_9:
	.string "S-sorry!\nFirst, I must apologize to my Pokémon...\pI'm really sorry you had a bad\nexperience because of me!\pOh! It's not your fault!\nThis is how battles always are.\pEven in light of that, I'm still one of\nthe Elite Four!$"
gBwText_145_10:
	.string "Every person who works with Pokémon\nhas a Pokémon story to tell.\pI've found that stories where people\nand Pokémon help each other out are far\lmore interesting than stories about\lonly people, or only Pokémon!$"
gBwText_145_11:
	.string "Challenger, if you defeat the entire\nElite Four of the Pokémon League, you\lcan go on to challenge the Champion.\pAnd you have earned that right.\pYour story is yours and yours alone.\nPlease weave a wonderful tale!$"
	.align 2
