gBwTextCount_146:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_147_0:
	.string "Greetings, challenger.\nMy name is Marshal.\pIn order to master the art of fighting,\nI'm training under my mentor, Alder.\pMy mentor sees your potential as a\nTrainer and is taking an interest in\lyou.\pIt is my intention to test you--to take\nyou to the limits of your strength. Kiai!$"
gBwText_147_1:
	.string "Whew! Well done!\pAs your battles continue,\naim for even greater heights!$"
gBwText_147_2:
	.string "Representing the Pokémon League in the\nabsence of the Champion has been my\lduty as Alder's student.\pHowever, there is nothing as empty as\nwords not backed up by strength.\pA word in your ear, strong challenger...\nThe other members of the Elite Four\lare far more powerful than I am.\pDo not underestimate them!$"
gBwText_147_3:
	.string "Now... You have become the strongest\nTrainer in this Pokémon League.\pThe statue in the central chamber will\ntake you to the Champion's room.\pWe, the Elite Four of Unova, are sworn\nto follow the Champion's order to be\lneutral.\pSo the rest is up to you!$"
gBwText_147_4:
	.string "I thank you deeply for the chance for\nanother round of combat against you.\pIn myself, I seek to develop\nthe strength of a fighter.\pAnd shatter any weakness in myself!\pPrevailing with the force of\nmy convictions!\pVictory, decisive victory, is my\nintention! Challenger, here I come!$"
gBwText_147_5:
	.string "There are still many strong Trainers\nin this Pokémon League.\pYou should deepen your bonds with\nyour Pokémon by battling with them.$"
gBwText_147_6:
	.string "In times past, I wandered all the\nregions of the world in pursuit of\lstrength...\pOne day, I met my mentor and began to\ngrasp the wisdom of making strength\lan internal quality...\pAnd one day, I decided to become part\nof the Elite Four of Unova...\pFor some reason, the battle we just had\nbrought those fateful times back to\lmind.$"
gBwText_147_7:
	.string "The strength shown by you and your\nPokémon has deeply impressed me...\pPlease, continue to the next room\nto face the strongest Trainer\lof the Unova region!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_147
