	.4byte 8
gBwText_148_0:
	.string "Who are you? How impudent you are to\ndisturb my sleep.\pHmf...\pYou appear to possess a combination of\nstrength and kindness. Very well.\pMake your best effort not to bore me\nwith a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?$"
gBwText_148_1:
	.string "You haven't faced all of the members\nof the Elite Four yet, have you?\pDon't concern yourself about me.\nGo on ahead.$"
gBwText_148_2:
	.string "In the past, when I battled, the force\nof my emotions shook me greatly.\pWhen my power awoke, I came close to\ndestroying everything around me.\pThat weak person no longer exists...\nStill, sometimes, my determination fails.\pAlways, I aspire to wrap up a victory\nwith elegance and grace.\pI invite you to be my opponent\nagain in the future, if you wish.$"
gBwText_148_3:
	.string "Somehow, you managed to defeat the\nentire Elite Four of the Pokémon\lLeague.\pCheck the statue in the center of the\nplaza for the way to the Champion's\lroom.$"
gBwText_148_4:
	.string "Who's there? Who is so uncouth as to\ndisturb my sleep?\pHmf... It's you again.\pStill, you possess that combination of\nkindness and strength. Yet you seem\lstronger than before...\pDo be sure not to bore me with a\nsnooze-inducing battle, is that clear?$"
gBwText_148_5:
	.string "Alas! Even with the knowledge and skill\npassed down in my family of Trainers,\lI still can't win.\pThe reason I came here in the first\nplace was to encounter Trainers like\lyou...$"
gBwText_148_6:
	.string "In the past, my untrained heart made my\npower run wild.\lI was forbidden to battle.\pAll I craved then was to experience the\npure excitement of battling like this.\pHee hee...\nAlthough I'm embarrassed, I can't help\lsmiling right now.$"
gBwText_148_7:
	.string "You have defeated the\nPokémon League's Elite Four.\pYou have earned the right to\nproceed to the Champion's room.\pMaking an entrance is not the point.\pOnce you're there, you'll need to\nunleash your power to the fullest!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_148
