gBwText_149_0:
	.string "N: It's over!\pNever again will Pokémon be made to\nsuffer or be held captive by humans.\pIt's all thanks to my friend, Reshiram!$"
gBwText_149_1:
	.string "N: It's over!\pNever again will Pokémon be made to\nsuffer or be held captive by humans.\pIt's all thanks to my friend, Zekrom!$"
gBwText_149_2:
	.string "You may have the title of Champion...\nBut you can't stop me with just a title.\lYour soft heart has left you weak.\pYears ago, you lost your Pokémon,\nyour partner, to sickness.\pIn order to forget the pain in your\nheart, you wandered Unova...\pWho knows how long it's been since\nyou've had to fight with your full\lstrength?\pI actually kind of like that\nabout you, though.$"
gBwText_149_3:
	.string "As a Trainer who far outmatches\nthe Champion,\lI shall issue an order across Unova:\pTrainers of the world,\nfree your Pokémon!$"
gBwText_149_4:
	.string "Alder: I beg you!\pSeparating people from Pokémon...\nDo anything but that!$"
gBwText_149_5:
	.string "N: You and I both put our beliefs on the\nline and fought with all our strength.\pAnd I won.\pDo not say another word.$"
gBwText_149_6:
	.string "...I've been waiting.$"
gBwText_149_7:
	.string "In the future I envisioned, you\nobtained a stone. And, indeed, you have.\pThat Dark Stone...\nReshiram is responding to it.$"
gBwText_149_8:
	.string "In the future I envisioned, you\nobtained a stone. And, indeed, you have.\pThat Light Stone...\nZekrom is responding to it.$"
gBwText_149_9:
	.string "Stop.\pThis is not a suitable place\nfor the legendary dragons!$"
gBwText_149_10:
	.string "From the ground, rise up!\nThe castle of Team Plasma!\lSurround the Pokémon League!$"
gBwText_149_11:
	.string "N: What has just appeared is\nTeam Plasma's castle.\pThe king's words will resound\nfrom the heights to all below.$"
gBwText_149_12:
	.string "You must come to the castle, as well.\nEverything will be decided there.\pWhether Pokémon will be liberated\nfrom people,\lor whether Pokémon and people\lwill live together...\pWe will see whose belief is stronger...\nAnd our result will change the world.$"
gBwText_149_13:
	.string "Cheren: Mr. Alder, you're a wreck.\nIt's not fitting for the Champion.$"
gBwText_149_14:
	.string "Alder: You did well to get this far.$"
gBwText_149_15:
	.string "Cheren: Somehow, I beat the\nPokémon League, but it wasn't easy.$"
gBwText_149_16:
	.string "Alder: Er... I have to congratulate you.$"
gBwText_149_17:
	.string "Cheren: I became stronger because\nI understood what I want to do.$"
gBwText_149_18:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\nTell N this...\pSome people grow stronger by being\nwith Pokémon.\pMy Pokémon and I are proof. Together,\nwe learned and became stronger.$"
gBwText_149_19:
	.string "Cheren: I'll look after Alder. You go on.$"
gBwText_149_20:
	.string "Alder: I... I lost.\pI should have been able to demonstrate\nthe bond between me and my Pokémon.\pThat would have shown that brat the\nworthlessness of his outrageous\ldreams.\pSo, his convictions were the real\nthing... Be careful.\pThe ones who change the world are\nalways the ones who pursued their\ldreams.\p{STR_VAR_1}, I ask this of you.\pEven if Pokémon and people are\nseparated, nothing good will come of it.\lPlease let him know that!$"
gBwText_149_21:
	.string "Alder: I... I lost.\pI should have been able to demonstrate\nthe bond between me and my Pokémon.\pThat would have shown that brat the\nworthlessness of his outrageous\ldreams.\pSo, his convictions were the real\nthing... Be careful.\pThe ones who change the world are\nalways the ones who pursued their\ldreams.\p{STR_VAR_1}, I ask this of you.\pEven if Pokémon and people are\nseparated, nothing good will come of it.\lPlease let him know that!$"
gBwText_149_22:
	.string "Alder: I am grateful for\nwhat you did about N.\pI don't know what he's thinking now,\nbut I'm sure he realizes\lthat different people and Pokémon\lhave their own paths to follow.\pSay now, how about a match with the\nstrongest Trainer in the Unova region?$"
gBwText_149_23:
	.string "Alder: I've really been looking forward\nto deciding who's the strongest\lPokémon Trainer in the Unova region!\pKiai!$"
gBwText_149_24:
	.string "Alder: Well done!\nYou certainly are an unmatched talent!\pCome with me!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_149
