gBwText_150_0:
	.string "Alder: This room is the Hall of Fame.\pIt exists to commemorate the Trainers\nand Pokémon who have demonstrated\ltheir stellar strength and kindness of\lheart.$"
gBwText_150_1:
	.string "Alder: No matter how many times I visit,\nI always feel a little awed by the names\lengraved here.$"
gBwText_150_2:
	.string "Well, now, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_150_3:
	.string "Well, now, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_150_4:
	.string "With your skill and persistence, you\nhave earned your place in this Hall of\lFame.\pYour name, the account of your journey,\nand the history of your battles will all\lbe recorded here.\pI hope all of this becomes a support\nto you and helps you grow stronger.\pNow, Trainer, you and the Pokémon\nwho fought by your side will be recorded\lin this machine!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_150
