gBwText_153_0:
	.string "Hello, and welcome to Unity Tower!\nWould you like to go upstairs?$"
gBwText_153_1:
	.string "Indeed.\nPlease step inside the elevator.$"
gBwText_153_2:
	.string "Please come again.$"
gBwText_153_3:
	.string "This is Unity Tower.\pTrainers from all over the world cross\nborders and oceans to gather here.\pVisit whichever floor you like!\pThe more people you know worldwide,\nthe more floors you can visit.\pPlease enjoy all that we have to offer!$"
gBwText_153_4:
	.string "Right now, the number of visitors in\nUnity Tower is {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_153_5:
	.string "Wow! So you like\n{STR_VAR_3}, then!$"
gBwText_153_6:
	.string "Awesome! The ceiling is sooo high!\pI wonder how many of me\nyou'd have to stack up to reach it?$"
gBwText_153_7:
	.string "Coming to Unity Tower always\ngets me excited!\pBeing here always reminds me of how big\nthe world really is!$"
gBwText_153_8:
	.string "You're a new face.\nIs this your first time here?\pUnity Tower is the place where\nTrainers come from all over the world.\pThat's why I work hard every day doing\nsecurity checks to protect those\lyoung Trainers.\pDon't loiter around here\nand cause trouble.\l...'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_153_10:
	.string "Seems like I've met you somewhere...\nAnyway, don't get too wound up and\lfall.\pWhen guests get hurt, it causes me\nno end of trouble.\p...'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_11:
	.string "Oh! So you're a Trainer, then!\pI see. You're far from family\nand traveling the world, huh?\pI suppose it's fine if you contact them\nonce in a while.\p'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_12:
	.string "Oh, it's you.\pHmm... You like trading, do you now?\pWell, that's all right, isn't it. You're\nactive--just like a young person\lshould be.\p'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_13:
	.string "Oh, it's you.\pSeems like you come here a lot.\nDo you have friends all over the world?\pI'd never have imagined a world like\nthis when I was young.\p'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_14:
	.string "Oh, it's you, {STR_VAR_3}!\pLately, lots of Trainers have been\nlooking for you. You're just like a\lmovie star, aren't ya?\pWhen I was your age, the ladies\nused to get worked up over me. Ha ha.\p'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_15:
	.string "Hey, it's you, {STR_VAR_3}!\pRecently, it looks like there have been\nlots of global Trainers like you.\pThat means--how do I put it--world\npeace can't be far off! Should I get my\lhopes up?\p'Kay, pass on through!$"
gBwText_153_16:
	.string "Oh, it's you, {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt feels like since you've started\ncoming, Unity Tower has gotten busier.\pThere's been a lot more work for this\nold guy, but that's a problem I'm\lhappy to have.\pKeep up the good work!$"
gBwText_153_17:
	.string "Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pYou've managed to trade with folks in\neven more places, huh?\pThat's really something!\nI'd imagine your Pokédex is getting\lpretty full, then?\pWow, you're amazing!\n'Kay, pass on through.$"
gBwText_153_18:
	.string "Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pUnity Tower is as lively as ever\nwith people who come here to see you.\pWell, enjoy yourself today!$"
gBwText_153_19:
	.string "Why, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}!\nWhat? F-fifty countries?!\pI've never seen a Trainer who has\ntraded with folks in over 50 countries!\pHow in the world did you manage that?\p'Kay, please pass through--and feel\nfree to wander around!$"
gBwText_153_20:
	.string "Hey, it's you, {STR_VAR_3}.\pAfter trading with this many people,\nyou must have friends all over the\lworld!\pHa ha. If you go on a trip, no worries\nabout not knowing anyone, huh?\p'Kay, please pass through!$"
gBwText_153_21:
	.string "Why, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}!\pI almost feel like I don't need to\nbother with a security check for you\lanymore. You can go ahead and pass.\p...Gotcha! I've been a security guard\nfor 30 years!\pI know trouble just waits for you\nto let your guard down.\l...'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_22:
	.string "Why, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}.\pI'll just do a brief security check.\p...W-what's this? Ooh, it's a kind of gum\nI've never seen! Is it a new brand?\lMaybe I'll buy some later.\p'Kay, you can pass.$"
gBwText_153_23:
	.string "Why, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}.\pJust a little more, and you'll have\ntraded with every place here, huh?\pIt's really reassuring to me that kids\nlike you are going to be the ones\lrunning the world! Just a little more to\lgo. You can do it!\p'Kay, you can pass!$"
gBwText_153_24:
	.string "It's you, {STR_VAR_3}!\nI already heard!\pYou've finally managed to trade with\npeople from every location, right?\pIt might just be me, but Unity Tower\nfeels more exciting when you visit.\lI'm sure it's happy to see you.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}, I'd like to give my\nthanks as the Unity Tower guard for\lmaking this building out in the middle\lof nowhere so lively.\p'Kay, you can pass. Think of this place\nas your own backyard and feel free to\lgo where you please.$"
gBwText_153_25:
	.string "Please select a floor.$"
gBwText_153_26:
	.string "Hey, you over there!\nCome here for a second.$"
gBwText_153_27:
	.string "Don't just loiter around\nand cause trouble.$"
gBwText_153_28:
	.string "Don't get too wound up.\pIf you run around, fall, and get hurt,\nit'll cause me no end of trouble.$"
gBwText_153_29:
	.string "I suppose it's fine if you contact them\nonce in a while.\pI'm sure it'll make your folks happy.$"
gBwText_153_30:
	.string "That's all right. You're active--just\nlike a young person should be.\pDo your best!$"
gBwText_153_31:
	.string "Do you know people all over the world?\pI never would've imagined a world\nlike this when I was young.$"
gBwText_153_32:
	.string "When I was your age, the ladies\nused to get worked up over me. Ha ha!$"
gBwText_153_33:
	.string "Recently, it looks like there have been\nlots of global Trainers like you.$"
gBwText_153_34:
	.string "It feels like since you started coming,\nUnity Tower has gotten busier.\pKeep up the good work!$"
gBwText_153_35:
	.string "I'd imagine your Pokédex is getting\npretty full, then?\pWell, that's really something.$"
gBwText_153_36:
	.string "Unity Tower is as lively as ever\nwith people who come here to see you.\pWell, hope you enjoy yourself today.$"
gBwText_153_37:
	.string "How in the world did you manage to trade\nwith so many different places?$"
gBwText_153_38:
	.string "You must know a lot of people in\ndifferent places in the world.\pHa ha. Even if you go on a trip, no\nworries about not knowing anyone, huh?$"
gBwText_153_39:
	.string "I've been a guard for 30 years.\nToday, all is well, too.\lMmm... That's great!$"
gBwText_153_40:
	.string "I think I'll try buying that new gum\nnext time.$"
gBwText_153_41:
	.string "When I see you, I suddenly feel very\nsure that the future will be full of\lhope.$"
gBwText_153_42:
	.string "When you visit, Unity Tower gets\nexciting!\pThink of this place as your own\nbackyard and feel free to go where you\lplease.$"
