gBwText_154_0:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}F. This is the floor for\n{STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_154_1:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}F. This is the floor for\n{STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_154_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}F. This is the floor for\n{STR_VAR_1}.\pThe guests have already gone home.$"
gBwText_154_3:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}F. This is the floor for\n{STR_VAR_1}.\pThe guests have already gone home.$"
gBwText_154_4:
	.string "???: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\nRemember me?\pIt's {STR_VAR_3}, from\n{STR_VAR_2}\lin {STR_VAR_1}!\pHow's {STR_VAR_3}?\pThe {STR_VAR_3} you gave me is\ndoing great!\pIf you want, let's trade Pokémon\nagain sometime!$"
gBwText_154_5:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I like {STR_VAR_3}\nas a hobby! What do you like to do?\pI've traded Pokémon with people in\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pI like the feeling of being connected\nto the world when I trade Pokémon.$"
gBwText_154_6:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pI've traded Pokémon with people in\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBy trading with people around the world,\nyou come to understand that people in\ldifferent places have different\lhobbies.\pFor example, my hobby\nis {STR_VAR_3}!\pDo you think you might someday visit\n{STR_VAR_2}?\pI'm sure you'd have fun.$"
gBwText_154_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pHave you traded Pokémon with people\nfrom lots of different places? My grand\ltotal is {STR_VAR_3}!\pOne day I would like to visit\nthose places in person!\pSomeday, you should totally come to\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pThen we can enjoy\n{STR_VAR_3} together!$"
gBwText_154_8:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: {STR_VAR_3}, listen to this!\pRecently, I've been hooked\non {STR_VAR_3}.\pAnd I've also traded Pokémon with\npeople from this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pIt seems like a lot of people\nenjoy {STR_VAR_3}!\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you ever come to\n{STR_VAR_2},\lwhere I live, let's play for sure, OK?$"
gBwText_154_9:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: In the past, when\n{STR_VAR_3} was in\l{STR_VAR_2},\lwe often enjoyed\l{STR_VAR_3} together.\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you don't mind, would\nyou enjoy {STR_VAR_3} with it\lsometimes? That will remind it of me!\pBy the way, are you trading Pokémon\nwith a lot of different people?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\lLet's trade again sometime, OK?$"
gBwText_154_10:
	.string "???: Oh, {STR_VAR_3}?\nIt is {STR_VAR_3}, right?\pHow've you been?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}! Remember me? From\l{STR_VAR_2}\lin {STR_VAR_1}.\pThank you for giving me {STR_VAR_3}\nthat time! It's doing great!\pHow is {STR_VAR_3} doing?\pWell, since it's with you, {STR_VAR_3},\nI'm sure there's nothing to worry\labout!$"
gBwText_154_11:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pAnd even though we live in different\nplaces, I found other people\lenjoy {STR_VAR_3} as much\las I do!\pHee hee! It's a little amazing that\npeople who could be clear across the\locean could enjoy the same things as\lme.$"
gBwText_154_12:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3},\nhave you ever been to where I live,\l{STR_VAR_2}?\pIf you come visit, let's enjoy\n{STR_VAR_3} together!\pI'm sure it will be fun!$"
gBwText_154_13:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pHave you been trading Pokémon with\npeople from lots of different places?\pI've traded Pokémon with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}! And some\lpeople like {STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\pIt somehow makes me happy that people\nin other places like the same things I\ldo.\pI hope you meet people with the same\nhobbies, too, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_14:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: What's your\nhobby, {STR_VAR_3}?\pI like {STR_VAR_3}, but I wonder what\nother people in the world like to do.\pI've traded with people from this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pI want to trade more and learn about\nmany more people's hobbies.$"
gBwText_154_15:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}.\pI've traded Pokémon with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pSeems like people's hobbies vary\ngreatly. {STR_VAR_3}, have you traded\lPokémon with people from many\ldifferent places?\pDo you think hobbies vary according to\nwhere people live?$"
gBwText_154_16:
	.string "???: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}!\nYou remember me, eh?\p{STR_VAR_3}! You know, {STR_VAR_3}, the\nguy who came from\l{STR_VAR_2}\lin {STR_VAR_1}.\pThanks for giving me {STR_VAR_3}!\nIt's really awesome!$"
gBwText_154_17:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: 'Sup, {STR_VAR_3}!\pTrading Pokémon with folks from lots of\ndifferent places?\pI've already traded with folks from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pSome even liked\n{STR_VAR_3}, too.\pEven though they were raised in\ndifferent places, we have the same\lhobby. Kinda awesome!$"
gBwText_154_18:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: My hobby?\n{STR_VAR_3}, but why?\pAre hobbies different in\n{STR_VAR_2}\land the place where you live?\pI've traded with people from this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBut I want to trade more and ask a lot\nof people about their hobbies!$"
gBwText_154_19:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Heeey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pKnow what? I've traded Pokémon with\npeople from this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pTrading sure is fun!\pDid you know that in the world, people\nhave many different hobbies?\pWhat? My hobby? It's\n{STR_VAR_3}, of course!\pThat said, make my {STR_VAR_3}\nstronger! I'm counting on you!$"
gBwText_154_20:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: You've traded Pokémon\nwith folks from how many places?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pThe trade I like best of all is the\n{STR_VAR_3} that you traded me!\pThanks, yo!\pEvery once in a while, {STR_VAR_3}\nand I enjoyed {STR_VAR_3}.\pI hope you'll enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\nwith {STR_VAR_3} sometimes. All right?$"
gBwText_154_21:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Know what? I've traded\nPokémon with people in this\lmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pWhen you get to know people from\nfaraway places, you want to visit far\laway!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}, have you been to\n{STR_VAR_2},\lwhere I live?\pIt's awesome, so try to visit sometime.\n{STR_VAR_3} there is great!$"
gBwText_154_22:
	.string "???: Hello, {STR_VAR_3}. Remember me?\pIt's me, it's me! {STR_VAR_3}! From\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pWe traded {STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_3},\nright? I want to say thanks again!\pI really adore {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_23:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: {STR_VAR_3}, I'll bet\nyou've traded with people in a lot of\lplaces, eh?\pHee hee, you know what? I've traded\nwith people in this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pIt was really fun. Quite a few of them\nliked {STR_VAR_3}, too!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}! You should come to\n{STR_VAR_2}\lsometime soon!\lIt would definitely be a blast!$"
gBwText_154_24:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, listen!\pI've traded Pokémon with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt feels really strange to trade with\npeople so far away!\pBy the way, {STR_VAR_3}, what's\nyour hobby?\pMine's {STR_VAR_3}!\pI want to trade more and ask people all\nover the world about their hobbies!$"
gBwText_154_25:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Yoo hoo, {STR_VAR_3}!\nI've traded with people from this\lmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt was inspiring to meet people with so\nmany hobbies.\pHm? My hobby? {STR_VAR_3}!\nHee hee. Fits me well, doesn't it?\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you have time, come visit\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pIt's a wonderful place, and I'm sure\nyou'll like it!$"
gBwText_154_26:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Guess what!\nI've traded with people from this\lmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBut people's hobbies are way\ndifferent!\pMy hobby is {STR_VAR_3}, and knowing\nthat someone clear on the other side of\lthe world has the same hobby as me gets\lme psyched!\pSomeday, I'll really go to all these\ndifferent places!\pCome to\n{STR_VAR_2}\lsometime, OK, {STR_VAR_3}?\pIt's a super place!$"
gBwText_154_27:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}!\nHow are you?\pI didn't think there were many people\nwho liked {STR_VAR_3}.\pI found several people with the same\nhobby after trading with Trainers from\lthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\p{STR_VAR_2}\ndidn't have so many.\pHmm. I guess the rest of the\nworld is definitely a little different!$"
gBwText_154_28:
	.string "???: Y-y-you! {STR_VAR_3}!\pMeeting you in a place like this, what\na surprise!\p...Huh? Don't you remember me?\n{STR_VAR_3}! From\l{STR_VAR_2}!\pCome on! We traded your {STR_VAR_3} and\nmy {STR_VAR_3}, you know?\lBoy, oh boy! {STR_VAR_3} is really great!\pIt's great that we met up again! Let's\ntrade again sometime, if you don't mind!$"
gBwText_154_29:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: How many places are the\npeople you've traded with from?\pAmazingly, I've traded with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pWhat did you ask? My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt's so much fun! Anyway, if you come\nto {STR_VAR_2} one day, we should\ldefinitely meet up!\pUntil then, later!$"
gBwText_154_30:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: The world is wide! It's\nabsolutely huge!\pBut whatever ocean you cross, there\nare people who enjoy {STR_VAR_3}. Like\lme! Is it some kind of miracle?\pI've traded with people from this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBut I want to trade more and more and\nget to know lots of people who like\l{STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_3}!\pWe should trade again someday, my\nfriend!$"
gBwText_154_31:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Do you like\n{STR_VAR_3}?! I love it!\pWhere I live, in\n{STR_VAR_2},\lmany people share my hobby, but I never\lwould have suspected\l{STR_VAR_3} fans could be found\lin so many places.\pI've traded with people from this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pAnd if I trade more, I'll bet there will\nbe plenty more people with the same\lhobby!\pYeeeaaah! That gets me pumped!$"
gBwText_154_32:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: The {STR_VAR_3} I got\nfrom you!\p...It's awesome! Thank you!\pI've traded Pokémon with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}! But\l{STR_VAR_3} is special!\p{STR_VAR_3}! Someday, we should enjoy\n{STR_VAR_3} together in\l{STR_VAR_2}!\pUntil we meet again, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_33:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Get a load of\nthis, {STR_VAR_3}!\pI've traded Pokémon with amazing\nTrainers in this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pAnd many of them also like\n{STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_3}!\pWe may live in different places, but we\nlike the same things! And...\pWe may have been raised in different\nplaces, but we like the same things!\pThat's astonishing, don't you think?\nThe world's a magical place!\lOur meeting is also magical!\pLet's trade again sometime,\n{STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_34:
	.string "???: Hey! I remember you!\nYou're {STR_VAR_3}, right?\pDo you remember me?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}! Hee hee!\pRemember? I'm from\n{STR_VAR_2}!\pThanks for trading me\n{STR_VAR_3} that time!\pIs {STR_VAR_3} doing well?\nTrading Pokémon with you\lwas really inspiring!\pIt's really nice to see you again,\n{STR_VAR_3}! Let's trade again\lsometime!$"
gBwText_154_35:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh!\nHi, {STR_VAR_3}!\pHee hee. Know what?!\nI've traded with people in\lthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIsn't it awesome? Great? Hee hee!\nOh! Oh!\pSome of the people I traded with\nlike {STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\p{STR_VAR_3}, how many people\nlike {STR_VAR_3}\lwhere you live?\p{STR_VAR_2}\nhas quite a few.\pWell, I'll see you later, {STR_VAR_3}!\nSee you when we trade next!$"
gBwText_154_36:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hee hee!\nI've traded with people\lfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}!\nWhat's your hobby?\pMine is {STR_VAR_3}!\nHee hee, what do you think about that?\pOh! {STR_VAR_3}!\pHave you ever been to\n{STR_VAR_2},\lwhere I live?\pIt's a really cool place,\nso come visit!$"
gBwText_154_37:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hello, {STR_VAR_3}!\pWhere do the people you've traded\nwith come from?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pConnecting with people in other places\nwithout stepping out of\l{STR_VAR_2}\lis amazing!\pThat's technology for you!\pBy the way, {STR_VAR_3},\nwhat is your hobby?\pMine is\n{STR_VAR_3}! Hee hee!\pI hope we can share our\nhobbies with people all over the world!\pAah! I've gotten myself all worked up!\nLet's trade again sometime,\l{STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_38:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Know what? I thought this\nafter trading with people from\lthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt's normal for people to be different!\pIf the things you like are different,\nyour hobbies will be different, too!\pThere's no reason for everyone\nto like {STR_VAR_3}.\pI think that's interesting!\pBecause when you do something\ndifferent, doesn't it feel like your\lworld has become larger somehow?\pStepping out of\n{STR_VAR_2}\lsometime will be good for sure!$"
gBwText_154_39:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}. Have you\never been to\l{STR_VAR_2}?\pYou can enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\nthere, and it's a pretty nice place.\pBut I thought this after I tried\ntrading with people from this many\lplaces: {STR_VAR_3}!\pI'm sure there are just as many\nnice things in other places.\pDon't you get super excited\nwhen you think about that?\pOK, I'll see you later, {STR_VAR_3}!\nLet's trade again, OK!$"
gBwText_154_40:
	.string "???: Y-you, you're, um,\n{STR_VAR_3}, right?\l...Do I remember you?\pWhat? M-me?\nI'm {STR_VAR_3} from\l{STR_VAR_2}.\pTh-thank you very much for trading\n{STR_VAR_3} that one time.\lYour Pokémon... It's really nice.\p...{STR_VAR_3} is pretty nice, right?\pI'm surprised to see you here!\n...But I'm happy, too... A-hyuk hyuk!$"
gBwText_154_41:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Ah hyuk hyuk!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pEveryone has different hobbies.\nIt's really interesting...\pWha--? My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}. Ah yup!\pIf you ever feel like coming\nto my home,\l{STR_VAR_2},\lyou should!\pI'm sure it'll be a fun trip for you.$"
gBwText_154_42:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: M-my hobby is\n{STR_VAR_3}...but have you met other\lpeople through trading who like it?\pI've traded with people from\n{STR_VAR_3} places, but everyone has\ldifferent hobbies.\pIf you live somewhere different,\nyour hobbies must be different, too.\p...Well, anyway. That's good, too.$"
gBwText_154_43:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: M-my hobby is\n{STR_VAR_3}, but...\lWhat about you?\p...Phew.\pT-truth is, I'm not very comfortable\ntalking with people.\pDespite that, I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}...\pAnd I also got your {STR_VAR_3}...\nHyuk hyuk.\pI-I think I want to trade some more.\nThank you.\pHope we can trade again sometime.$"
gBwText_154_44:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I-I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pAnd some of them liked\n{STR_VAR_3}, too...\pEven on the other side of the world,\nsome people have the same hobby as me...\pBy the way, have you ever been to\n{STR_VAR_2},\lwhere I live?\pIt's a fun place, so I think you\nmight like to visit...$"
gBwText_154_45:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: H-have you traded Pokémon\nwith people from a lot of places?\pF-for me, I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}...\pUm, err...\nHave you ever been to where I live,\l{STR_VAR_2}?\pTh-there are people\nwho like {STR_VAR_3}.\pOh, of course I like that, too!\pI-it's a very nice place,\nso come visit sometime...$"
gBwText_154_46:
	.string "???: You... You're...\n{STR_VAR_3}, right?\pIt's me! You know, {STR_VAR_3} from\n{STR_VAR_1} in\l{STR_VAR_2}!\l...Do you remember me? Tee hee!\lI'm happy to see you again.\pThanks for giving me {STR_VAR_3}\nthat time.\pIs {STR_VAR_3} doing well?\pMeeting again must be fate! Tee hee!\nLooking forward to seeing you again!$"
gBwText_154_47:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Come on, how many places\nare the people you've\ltraded Pokémon with from?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt's a little scary trading\nwith strangers...\l...But it also makes my heart race a bit.\pSometimes I meet people\nwho love {STR_VAR_3}, too!\l..Tee hee!\pTrading has become a little more\nfun, hasn't it?$"
gBwText_154_48:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Umm...\nHow is {STR_VAR_3}?\pNo, if they're fine,\nthat's all that matters.\p{STR_VAR_3} is doing great...\nVery good... Yes.\pWould you come to\n{STR_VAR_2}\lsometime soon?\pIt's a nice place where you can\nenjoy {STR_VAR_3}.\l...\l...Come for sure, OK! Tee hee!$"
gBwText_154_49:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Tee hee! Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\nWhat is your hobby?\pMine is {STR_VAR_3}.\n...What do you think?\pHow many places have the people\nyou traded with come from?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pI'm going to trade more and more,\nso I can find people who like\l{STR_VAR_3}... Tee hee hee.\pWell, I'll see you again, {STR_VAR_3}.\nLet's trade again sometime...$"
gBwText_154_50:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Have you ever been to\n{STR_VAR_2}?\pIt's a lovely place.\nI hope you come sometime.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\lI've worked hard...huh?\pYou can learn about the hobbies\nof the Trainers you trade with.\lKind of fun, isn't it?\p...Me? I like {STR_VAR_3}. Expecting\nsomething different? Tee hee.$"
gBwText_154_51:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Tee hee.\nHow many places are the people\lyou've traded Pokémon with from?\pRight now for me it's this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}...\lBut, I want to trade more and more...\pBecause if I do, I might meet\nsomeone who likes {STR_VAR_3}\land {STR_VAR_3}, too!\l...It feels like destiny! Tee hee.\pAnd someday, I'll have them come visit\n{STR_VAR_2}...\lIt's a very nice place... Tee hee.\p...Oh, sorry!\nMy imagination was running wild.\p...Let's trade again sometime,\n{STR_VAR_3}... Hee hee!$"
gBwText_154_52:
	.string "???: Oh!\p{STR_VAR_3}, isn't it?\nI'm {STR_VAR_3}.\pHey, do you remember me?\nI'm the one from\l{STR_VAR_2}!\pRecently we traded your {STR_VAR_3}\nand my {STR_VAR_3}, right!\pHey, well, I'm happy to see you!\nIf you'd like, let's have a nice\lchat one of these days!$"
gBwText_154_53:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}.\pLately, I've gotten hooked\non {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's just so much fun. Come to\n{STR_VAR_2}\lsometime, and let's hang out!\pBy the way, how many places are the\npeople you've traded Pokémon with\lfrom?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pYeah, I'd sure like to trade\nwith people from even more places.$"
gBwText_154_54:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}. And\lman, everyone has a lot\lof different hobbies.\pWhat? My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}, I suppose.\lI enjoy it for some reason.\pDo a lot of people near you\nlike {STR_VAR_3}?\pIn {STR_VAR_2},\nwhere I live, there are a few.\pWell, at any rate, {STR_VAR_3},\nlet's trade again sometime!$"
gBwText_154_55:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pHow many places are the people you've\ntraded Pokémon with from?\pI've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}! And\lthere were some people who like\l{STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\pSomehow trading with people\nin a lot of different places\lmakes even the other side\lof the world feel closer.\pSometime, come to\n{STR_VAR_2}!\lIt's a pretty nice place!$"
gBwText_154_56:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, {STR_VAR_3}!\nNice to see you again!\lHow are you doing?\pWell, I've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pHeh heh. It's fun, and you can learn\nabout your trading partner's hobbies.\pWhat, me?\nI enjoy {STR_VAR_3}.\pBy the way, have you ever been to\n{STR_VAR_2}?\pIt's a pretty nice place.\nCome visit sometime.$"
gBwText_154_57:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: You know, when I'm\nenjoying {STR_VAR_3}\lI lose track of time.\p...But I guess that's what hobbies\nare all about.\pHow many places are the people you've\ntraded with from? I've traded with\lpeople in this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pWhen I'm trading, I often lose track\nof time, like with a hobby.\pThanks to that, I'm late for\neverything. ...Well, I suppose fun things\lare always like that.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}. Come to\n{STR_VAR_2},\lall right?\pWe'll have so much fun,\nyou'll lose track of time!$"
gBwText_154_58:
	.string "???: So we meet again, {STR_VAR_3}.\nDo you remember me?\pI'm {STR_VAR_3} from\n{STR_VAR_1} in\l{STR_VAR_2}!\pCome on now. We traded your\n{STR_VAR_3} and\lmy {STR_VAR_3}\lrecently, right!\pI'm really happy to meet\nyou again!$"
gBwText_154_59:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, it's {STR_VAR_3}!\pKnow what? I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pThere were a lot of people\nwho also like {STR_VAR_3}\land live in different places.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3},\nif you'd like, come to\l{STR_VAR_2}\lsomeday, hee hee.$"
gBwText_154_60:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh! {STR_VAR_3}! Hi!\nHey, listen to this!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pSome other people liked\n{STR_VAR_3}, and\lI was pretty happy about that.\p...Hey, {STR_VAR_3},\nif you have a chance, come to\l{STR_VAR_2},\land we can enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\ltogether. I'm sure it will be fun!$"
gBwText_154_61:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: ...\p...\pHuh? What?\nI'm sorry, I was spacing out.\pMy hobby.\nWeeeelll.\l...{STR_VAR_3}, I guess?\lHow about you, {STR_VAR_3}?\pSpeaking of hobbies, I've traded\nPokémon with people from this many\lplaces: {STR_VAR_3}. I finally found a\lperson with the same hobby.\pHa ha!\nThose things make me happy.\lI want to trade again, soon.\p{STR_VAR_3}, let's trade again\nsometime if you want!$"
gBwText_154_62:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Why, {STR_VAR_3}!\nHello!\pAre you here because you've\ntraded Pokémon with\lpeople living far away?\pHee hee!\nMy Pokémon are cute, but\lPokémon you've received from\lother people have a special cuteness.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lI want to start trading with\lmore and more people.\pYou see, lots of people\nlike {STR_VAR_3}, too.\pTalking to Trainers is\nquite a bit of fun.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pLet's trade again sometime, OK!\nPromise!?$"
gBwText_154_63:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, hi, {STR_VAR_3}!\pYou know what!? You know what!?\nI've traded Pokémon with people\lin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\lNot bad, eh? Hee hee!\lAnd I'm going to keep trading!\pHm? My hobby?\nWell...\lUmmm...\p{STR_VAR_3}, I guess! It's fun!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}.\nTake care of {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's a very sweet Pokémon,\nso be sure to give it extra care!$"
gBwText_154_64:
	.string "Return to the entrance?$"
gBwText_154_65:
	.string "Return to the Entrance$"
