gBwText_154_68:
	.string "???: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\nRemember me?\pIt's {STR_VAR_3}, from\n{STR_VAR_1}!\pHow's {STR_VAR_3}?\p{STR_VAR_3} is doing great!\pIf you want, let's trade Pokémon\nagain sometime!$"
gBwText_154_69:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I like {STR_VAR_3}\nas a hobby! What do you like to do?\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pI like that feeling of being connected\nto the world when you trade Pokémon.$"
gBwText_154_70:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBy trading with people around the world,\nyou come to understand that people in\ldifferent places have different\lhobbies.\pFor example, my hobby\nis {STR_VAR_3}!\pYou should come to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime! I'm sure you'd have fun.$"
gBwText_154_71:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pHave you traded Pokémon with people\nfrom lots of different places?\lMy grand total is {STR_VAR_3}!\pOne day, I would like to visit a lot of\nthose places in person!\pYou should totally come to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime, and then we can enjoy\l{STR_VAR_3} together!$"
gBwText_154_72:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: {STR_VAR_3}, listen to this!\nI'm all about {STR_VAR_3} now.\pI've also traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt seems like a lot of people\nenjoy {STR_VAR_3}!\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you come to\n{STR_VAR_1},\lwhere I live, let's play, OK?$"
gBwText_154_73:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: In the past, when\n{STR_VAR_3} was in\l{STR_VAR_1},\lwe often enjoyed\l{STR_VAR_3} together.\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you could, please\nenjoy {STR_VAR_3} with it.\lIt will really like that!\pAre you trading Pokémon\nwith a lot of different people?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}!\lLet's trade again sometime, OK?$"
gBwText_154_74:
	.string "???: Oh, {STR_VAR_3}?\nIt is {STR_VAR_3}, right?\pHow've you been?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}! Remember me?\pI'm from\n{STR_VAR_1}.\pThank you for giving me {STR_VAR_3}\nthat time! It's doing great!\pHow is {STR_VAR_3}?\pWell, since it's with you, {STR_VAR_3},\nI'm sure there's nothing to worry\labout!$"
gBwText_154_75:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}! And\leven though we live in different places,\lI found other people enjoy\l{STR_VAR_3} as much as I do!\pHee hee!\nIt's a little amazing that people who\lcould be clear across the ocean\lenjoy the same things as me.$"
gBwText_154_76:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3},\nhave you ever been to\l{STR_VAR_1},\lwhere I live?\pIf you come visit,\nlet's enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\ltogether!\lI'm sure it will be fun!$"
gBwText_154_77:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}. Have you\nbeen trading Pokémon with people from\llots of different places?\pI've traded Pokémon with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}! Some\lpeople like {STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\pIt makes me happy somehow that\npeople in different countries like the\lsame things as I do.\pI hope you meet people with the same\nhobbies too, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_78:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: What's your hobby,\n{STR_VAR_3}?\pI like {STR_VAR_3}, but I wonder\nwhat people all over the world\llike to do...\pI've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pI want to trade more and learn\nabout many more people's hobbies.$"
gBwText_154_79:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}.\pI've traded Pokémon with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pSeems like hobbies vary greatly\nfrom person to person.\p{STR_VAR_3}, have you\ntraded Pokémon with people \lfrom a lot of different places?\pDo you think hobbies vary by\nwhere people live?$"
gBwText_154_80:
	.string "???: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}!\nYou remember me, right?\p{STR_VAR_3}!\pYou know, {STR_VAR_3}, the guy\nfrom {STR_VAR_1}.\pThanks for giving me {STR_VAR_3}!\nIt's really awesome!$"
gBwText_154_81:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: 'Sup, {STR_VAR_3}!\pYou trading Pokémon with folks\nfrom all over?\pI've already traded with folks from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pSome even liked\n{STR_VAR_3}, too.\pEven though they were raised in\ndifferent places, we have the same\lhobby. Kinda awesome!$"
gBwText_154_82:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: My hobby?\nSure, it's {STR_VAR_3}, but why?\pAre hobbies different in\n{STR_VAR_1}\land the place where you live?\pI've traded with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}. But\lI want to trade more and\lask a lot of people about their hobbies!$"
gBwText_154_83:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Heeey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pYou know what?\nI've traded Pokémon with people\lfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lTrading sure is fun!\pDid you know that people have\nmany different hobbies?\pWhat? Me?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}, of course!\pWell, keep\nmy {STR_VAR_3} strong!\lI'm counting on you!$"
gBwText_154_84:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Have you traded Pokémon\nwith people from a lot of places?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pOf those trades, I really like\n{STR_VAR_3},\lwhich you traded to me!\lThanks, yo!\pEvery once in a while, {STR_VAR_3} and\nI enjoyed {STR_VAR_3}.\pEnjoy {STR_VAR_3} with\n{STR_VAR_3} sometime, all right?$"
gBwText_154_85:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Know what?!\nI've traded Pokémon with people\lin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pWhen you chat with people\nfrom different places,\lyou want to actually go there!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3},\nhave you been to\l{STR_VAR_1},\lwhere I live?\pIt's awesome, so be sure\nto come 'round sometime.\l{STR_VAR_3} there is great!$"
gBwText_154_86:
	.string "???: What's up, {STR_VAR_3}!\nRemember me?\pIt's me! {STR_VAR_3}!\nI'm from\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pWe traded {STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_3}\nrecently, right! Thanks!\pI absolutely adore {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_87:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: How many different places\nare the people you've traded with from,\l{STR_VAR_3}?\pHee hee! Guess what? I've traded with\npeople in this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt's interesting because many of them\nalso enjoy {STR_VAR_3}!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}, you should\ncome to\l{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime soon!\lIt would definitely be fun!$"
gBwText_154_88:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, listen!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt feels really strange to trade\nwith people so far away!\pBy the way, {STR_VAR_3},\nwhat's your hobby?\pMine's {STR_VAR_3}!\pI want to trade more and more\nand ask people all over the world\labout their hobbies!$"
gBwText_154_89:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Yoo hoo, {STR_VAR_3}!\nI've traded with people from this\lmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt was inspiring to meet people\nwith so many hobbies.\pHm? My hobby?\n{STR_VAR_3}!\pHee hee. Fits me well, doesn't it?\p{STR_VAR_3}, if you ever have a chance,\ncome visit\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pI'm sure you'll love it,\nbecause it's a fantastic place!$"
gBwText_154_90:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Guess what!\pI've traded with people from this many\nplaces: {STR_VAR_3}. But people's\lhobbies are way different!\pMy hobby is {STR_VAR_3}, and\nknowing that someone clear\lon the other side of the world\lhas the same hobby as me,\lthat gets me psyched!\pSomeday, I'll actually go to\nall these different places!\pCome to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime, OK, {STR_VAR_3}?\pIt's a super place!$"
gBwText_154_91:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, if it isn't\n{STR_VAR_3}. How are you?\pI didn't think there were many\npeople who liked {STR_VAR_3}.\pBut after trading with Trainers\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3},\lI found several people\lwith the same hobby!\p{STR_VAR_1}\ndidn't have so many.\pHmm. I guess the rest of the\nworld is definitely a little different!$"
gBwText_154_92:
	.string "???: Y-y-you!!\nWhy, if it isn't {STR_VAR_3}!\pMeeting you in a place like this!\nWhat a miracle!\p...Huh? Me? Don't you remember?\n{STR_VAR_3}!\lI'm from\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pCome on! We traded your\n{STR_VAR_3} and my {STR_VAR_3}, right?\pBoy, oh boy!\n{STR_VAR_3} is really great!\pI'm sure there is some reason for\nour reunion here!\pLet's definitely trade again one day,\nOK?$"
gBwText_154_93:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: How many places are\nthe people you've traded with from?\pAmazingly, I've traded with people from\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pWhat did you ask? My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}!\pIt's so much fun!\pAnyway, if you come to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lone day, we should\ldefinitely meet up!\pMwa ha ha! Until then, adieu!$"
gBwText_154_94:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: The world is wide!\nIt's absolutely huge!\pBut whatever ocean you cross,\npeople enjoy {STR_VAR_3}.\pLike me. Is it some kind of miracle?\pI've traded with people from this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pBut I want to trade more and more and\nget to know lots of people who like\l{STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_3}!\pWe should trade again someday, my\nfriend!$"
gBwText_154_95:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Do you like\n{STR_VAR_3}?!\pI love {STR_VAR_3}!\pWhere I live in\n{STR_VAR_1},\lmany people share my hobby, but I never\lwould have suspected\l{STR_VAR_3} fans could be found\lin so many places.\pI've traded with people from this many\nplaces: {STR_VAR_3}. And if I trade more,\lI'll bet I find plenty of people with\lthe same hobby!\pYeeeaaah! That gets me pumped!$"
gBwText_154_96:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: The {STR_VAR_3}\nI got from you!\p...\n...\pIt's awesome!\nThank you!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}. But\l{STR_VAR_3} is special!\p{STR_VAR_3}!\nSomeday, in\l{STR_VAR_1},\lwe should enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\ltogether!\pUntil we meet again, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_97:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Would you get a load of\nthis, {STR_VAR_3}!\pI've traded Pokémon with amazing\nTrainers in this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pAmong them, many people\nalso like {STR_VAR_3} and\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pWe were raised in different places,\nbut we like the same things! And...\pThat's astonishing, don't you agree?\nThe world's a magical place!\lOur meeting is also magical!\pLet's trade again sometime,\n{STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_98:
	.string "???: Hey! I remember you!\nYou're {STR_VAR_3}, right!\pDo you remember me?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}! Hee hee!\lI'm from\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pThanks for trading me\n{STR_VAR_3} that time!\pIs {STR_VAR_3} doing well?\nTrading Pokémon with you\lwas really inspiring!\pIt's really nice to see you again,\n{STR_VAR_3}! Let's trade again\lsometime!$"
gBwText_154_99:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh!\n{STR_VAR_3}! Hi, {STR_VAR_3}!\pHee hee. Know what?!\nI've traded with people\lin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pIsn't it awesome? Great? Hee hee!\nOh! Oh!\pSome of the people I traded with\nlike {STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\p{STR_VAR_3}, how many people\nlike {STR_VAR_3}\lwhere you live?\p{STR_VAR_1}\nhas quite a few.\pWell, I'll see you later, {STR_VAR_3}!\nSee you when we trade next!$"
gBwText_154_100:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hee hee!\nI've traded with people from\lthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}!\nWhat's your hobby?\pMine is {STR_VAR_3}!\nHee hee, what do you think about that!\pOh! {STR_VAR_3}!\nHave you ever been to\l{STR_VAR_1},\lwhere I live?\pIt's a really cool place,\nso come visit!$"
gBwText_154_101:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hello, {STR_VAR_3}!\pHave you traded with people\nfrom many different places?\pI've traded with Trainers\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pBeing able to connect with\npeople in other places without\lstepping out of\l{STR_VAR_1}\lis amazing!\lThat's technology for you!\pBy the way, {STR_VAR_3},\nwhat is your hobby?\pMine is\n{STR_VAR_3}! Hee hee!\pI hope we can enjoy our hobbies with\npeople all over the world! Aah! I've\lgotten myself all worked up! Let's\ltrade again sometime, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_154_102:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: You know what? I thought\nthis up after trading with people from\lthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's normal for people to be different!\pIf the things you like are different,\nyour hobbies will be, too!\pThere's no reason for everyone\nto like {STR_VAR_3}.\pI think that's interesting!\pBecause when you are doing something\ndifferent, doesn't it feel like your\lworld has become larger?\pStepping out of\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometimes is good for sure!$"
gBwText_154_103:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\nHave you ever been to where I live\lin {STR_VAR_1}?\pYou can enjoy {STR_VAR_3} here,\nand it's a pretty nice place.\pAt least I think so, after I tried\ntrading with people from this many\lplaces: {STR_VAR_3}.\pI'm sure there are just as many\nnice things in other places.\pDon't you get super worked up\nwhen you think about that?\pOK, I'll see you later, {STR_VAR_3}!\nLet's trade again, OK!$"
gBwText_154_104:
	.string "???: Y-you're, um, {STR_VAR_3}, right?\n...I remember you?\pWhat? M-me?\nI'm {STR_VAR_3} from\l{STR_VAR_1}.\pTh-thank you very much\nfor trading me {STR_VAR_3} that time.\lYour Pokémon... It's nice.\p...{STR_VAR_3} is pretty nice, right?\pI'm surprised to see you here!\nBut I'm happy, too... Hyuk hyuk.$"
gBwText_154_105:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Ah hyuk hyuk!\nI've traded Pokémon with people\lin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pEveryone has different hobbies.\nIt's really interesting...\pWha--? My hobby?\pIt's {STR_VAR_3}. Ah hyuk!\pIf you ever feel like coming\nto my home,\l{STR_VAR_1},\lyou should!\pI'm sure it'll be a fun\ntrip for you. Hyuk hyuk...$"
gBwText_154_106:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: M-my hobby is {STR_VAR_3},\nbut have you met anyone through\ltrading who likes {STR_VAR_3}? I've\ltraded with people from this many\lplaces: {STR_VAR_3}. And everyone has\ldifferent hobbies.\pIf you live somewhere different,\nyour hobbies must be different, too.\p...\n...\pUh, whatever.\nThat's good, too.$"
gBwText_154_107:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: M-my hobby is\n{STR_VAR_3}, but...\lWhat about you?\p...Phew.\pT-truth is, I'm not very comfortable\ntalking with people.\pDespite that, I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}...\pAnd I also got your {STR_VAR_3}...\nHyuk hyuk.\pI-I think I want to trade some more.\nThank you.\pHope we can trade again sometime.$"
gBwText_154_108:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: I-I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pAnd then, some of those people\nliked {STR_VAR_3}, too...\pEven on the other side of the world,\nthere are people who share my hobby...\pBy the way, have you ever been to\n{STR_VAR_1},\lwhere I live?\pIt's a fun place, so I think you\nmight like to come... Hyuk hyuk.$"
gBwText_154_109:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: H-how many different\nplaces are the people you've traded\lPokémon with from? F-for me, it's this\lmany places: {STR_VAR_3}...\pUm, err... Have you ever been to\nwhere I live,\l{STR_VAR_1}?\pTh-there are people who like\n{STR_VAR_3}.\pOh, of course I like that, too!\pI-it's a very nice place,\nso come visit sometime...$"
gBwText_154_110:
	.string "???: You... You're...\n{STR_VAR_3}, right?\pIt's me! You know,\n{STR_VAR_3} from\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pDo you remember me? Tee hee!\nI'm happy to see you again.\pThanks for giving me {STR_VAR_3}\nthat time.\pIs {STR_VAR_3} doing well?\pMeeting here again must be fate! Tee\nhee! Looking forward to seeing you\lagain!$"
gBwText_154_111:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: What's that?\nHow many places have you\ltraded Pokémon with?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's a little scary trading\nwith strangers...\l...But it also makes my heart race a bit.\pSometimes I meet people\nwhose hobby is {STR_VAR_3}, too!\l...Tee hee!\pTrading has become a little more\nfun, hasn't it?$"
gBwText_154_112:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Umm...\nHow is {STR_VAR_3}?\pNo, um, if it's fine,\nthat's all that matters.\p{STR_VAR_3} is doing great.\nVery good... Yes.\pAny chance you might come to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime?\pIt's a nice place where you can\nenjoy {STR_VAR_3}.\p...\n...Come for sure, OK! Tee hee!$"
gBwText_154_113:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Tee hee! Hey, {STR_VAR_3}.\nWhat is your hobby?\pMine is {STR_VAR_3}.\n...What do you think?\pHow many places have the people\nyou traded with come from?\pAs for me... Tee hee!\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pI'm going to trade more and more,\nso I can find people who like\l{STR_VAR_3}... Tee hee hee!\pWell, I'll see you again, {STR_VAR_3}.\nLet's trade again sometime...$"
gBwText_154_114:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Have you ever been\nto {STR_VAR_1}?\pIt's a lovely place.\nI hope you come sometime.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lI've worked hard...huh?\pYou can learn about the hobbies\nof Trainers you trade with.\lKind of fun, isn't it?\p...Me? I like {STR_VAR_3}. Expecting\nsomething different? Tee hee!$"
gBwText_154_115:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Tee hee!\nHow many places do they come from,\lthese people you've traded with?\pFor me, it's this many places:\n{STR_VAR_3}... But, I want to trade more\land more...\pBecause if I do, I might meet\nsomeone who likes {STR_VAR_3}\land {STR_VAR_3}, too!\l...It feels like destiny! Tee hee!\pAnd someday, I'll have them come visit\n{STR_VAR_1}...\lIt's a very nice place... Tee hee!\pOh, sorry!\nMy imagination was running wild.\pLet's trade again sometime,\n{STR_VAR_3}... Hee hee!$"
gBwText_154_116:
	.string "???: Oh!\p{STR_VAR_3}, isn't it?\nI'm {STR_VAR_3}.\pHey, do you remember me?\nThe one from\l{STR_VAR_1}!\pRecently we traded your {STR_VAR_3}\nand my {STR_VAR_3}, remember?\pHey, well, I'm happy to see you!\nIf you'd like, let's have a nice\lchat one of these days!$"
gBwText_154_117:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}.\pRecently, I've gotten quite hooked\non {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's just so much fun! Come to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime, and let's hang out!\pBy the way, how many places\nare your traded Pokémon from?\pI've traded with people in this\nmany places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pYeah... I'd sure like to trade\nwith a lot more places.$"
gBwText_154_118:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey there, {STR_VAR_3}.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lWhoa, people sure do have a lot\lof different hobbies!\pWhat? My hobby?\nIt's {STR_VAR_3}, I suppose.\lI enjoy it for some reason.\pAre there a lot of people near you\nwho like {STR_VAR_3}?\pIn {STR_VAR_1},\nwhere I live,\lI suppose there are a few.\pWell, {STR_VAR_3},\nlet's trade again sometime!$"
gBwText_154_119:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\pHow many places are the people you've\ntraded Pokémon with from?\pI've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lSome people among them\llike {STR_VAR_3}, just like me!\pSomehow, trading with people in a lot of\ndifferent places makes even the far\lside of the world feel closer.\pCome to\n{STR_VAR_1}\lsometime, if you want to!\lIt's a pretty nice place!$"
gBwText_154_120:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Hey, {STR_VAR_3}!\nNice to see you again!\lHow are you doing?\pWell, I've traded Pokémon with people in\nthis many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pHeh heh. It's fun, and you can learn\nabout your trading partner's hobbies.\pWhat, me?\nI guess I enjoy {STR_VAR_3}.\pBy the way, have you ever been\nto{STR_VAR_1}?\pIt's a pretty nice place.\nCome visit sometime.$"
gBwText_154_121:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: You know,\nwhen I'm enjoying {STR_VAR_3},\lI lose track of time.\pBut I guess that's what hobbies\nare all about.\pHow many places are the people you've\ntraded with from? I've traded with\lpeople from this many places:\l{STR_VAR_3}!\pWhen you're trading, you lose track\nof time, just like with a hobby.\pThat's why I'm late for everything.\nYou believe me, right?\pAw, I suppose fun things\nare always like that.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}. Come to\n{STR_VAR_1},\lall right!?\pWe'll have so much fun, you'll lose\ntrack of time!$"
gBwText_154_122:
	.string "???: So we meet again, {STR_VAR_3}.\nDo you remember me?\pI'm {STR_VAR_3}\nfrom {STR_VAR_1}!\pCome on, now. We traded your\n{STR_VAR_3} and\lmy {STR_VAR_3}\lrecently, right?\pI'm really happy to meet you again!$"
gBwText_154_123:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh, it's {STR_VAR_3}!\pYou know what? I've traded with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}!\pAnd a lot of people who also like\n{STR_VAR_3} live all over\lthe world.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3},\nif you'd like, come to\l{STR_VAR_1}\lsomeday, hee hee!$"
gBwText_154_124:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh! {STR_VAR_3}! Hi!\nHey, listen to this!\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\pSome other people liked {STR_VAR_3},\nand I was pretty happy about that.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}, if you\nhave a chance to come to\l{STR_VAR_1},\llet's enjoy {STR_VAR_3}\ltogether. I'm sure it will be fun!$"
gBwText_154_125:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: ...\p...\pHuh? What?\nSorry, I was spacing out.\pMy hobby. Weeeelll.\n...{STR_VAR_3}, I guess?\lHow about you, {STR_VAR_3}?\pSpeaking of hobbies, I've traded\nPokémon with people from this many\lplaces: {STR_VAR_3}. And I finally\pfound a person with the same hobby.\nHa ha!\lThose things make me happy.\lI want to trade again, now.\p{STR_VAR_3}, let's trade again\nsometime!$"
gBwText_154_126:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Why, {STR_VAR_3}!\nHello!\pAre you here because you've\ntraded Pokémon with\lpeople living far away?\pHee hee!\nMy Pokémon are cute, but there is a\lspecial cuteness about Pokémon\lyou've traded with other people.\pI've traded Pokémon with people\nfrom this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lI want to trade with still more people.\pYou see, there are lots of people\nwho like {STR_VAR_3}, too.\pTalking to Trainers has become\nquite a bit of fun.\pHey, {STR_VAR_3}.\pLet's trade again sometime, OK?\nPromise!$"
gBwText_154_127:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}: Oh! {STR_VAR_3}! Hi!\pKnow what?! Know what?!\nI've traded Pokémon with people\lin this many places: {STR_VAR_3}.\lNot bad, eh? Hee hee!\lAnd I'm going to keep trading!\pHm? My hobby?\nWell...\lUmmm...\p{STR_VAR_3}, I guess! It's fun!\pHey, {STR_VAR_3},\ntake care of {STR_VAR_3}.\pIt's very sweet, so be sure\nto take extra good care of it!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_154
