gBwText_159_0:
	.string "I may walk fast, but I live a slow and\nrelaxing life.$"
gBwText_159_1:
	.string "I'm going home early today to have\nPokémon battles with my sisters.$"
gBwText_159_2:
	.string "Hello!\nGreeting is important, isn't it?$"
gBwText_159_3:
	.string "They say time is money. But when you\nspend time, you can't get it back.$"
gBwText_159_4:
	.string "There are always so many people here...$"
gBwText_159_5:
	.string "Even when I loaf, I do it all-out.\nI am always serious!$"
gBwText_159_6:
	.string "This city is a sleepless city...\nBut I need my beauty sleep.$"
gBwText_159_7:
	.string "I wish there were shoes\nthat recharge energy by walking!$"
gBwText_159_8:
	.string "My big customer must be waiting...$"
gBwText_159_9:
	.string "I just keep walking...today, tomorrow,\nand the day after tomorrow.$"
gBwText_159_10:
	.string "Good luck! Me!\nGood luck! You!$"
gBwText_159_11:
	.string "I will watch a baseball game\nthis weekend.$"
gBwText_159_12:
	.string "I am having a battle called a job! This\nis quite tough. That's why it's fun!$"
gBwText_159_13:
	.string "Hmmm... It may be a good idea\nto Dress Up your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_159_14:
	.string "Have you had a Pokémon battle\nwith the Gym Leader, Burgh?\pHe's a strange one, but he likes\nPokémon very much.$"
gBwText_159_15:
	.string "I haven't traveled with my Pokémon\nfor a long time. I feel like doing that...$"
gBwText_159_16:
	.string "I will go to the Kanto region\nfor business.$"
gBwText_159_17:
	.string "People from different countries\ngather here in Castelia City.$"
gBwText_159_18:
	.string "Everyone is a professional walker!$"
gBwText_159_19:
	.string "Even in the crowd of people,\ndon't lose sight of yourself!$"
gBwText_159_20:
	.string "Every day, everybody goes their own\nway.$"
gBwText_159_21:
	.string "My business card has a picture of\nthe Pokémon I like best.$"
gBwText_159_22:
	.string "I always walk here, so\nI am good at dodging people.$"
gBwText_159_23:
	.string "Argh! You distracted me! I was trying\nto count all the pedestrians!$"
gBwText_159_24:
	.string "Hey, hey, kid!\nIt's dangerous!$"
gBwText_159_25:
	.string "Will you become a motorbike rider\nwhen you grow up?$"
gBwText_159_26:
	.string "The night wind is piercing right through\nme... My motorbike is freezing, too...$"
gBwText_159_27:
	.string "Zowieee!$"
gBwText_159_28:
	.string "Wooooo!$"
gBwText_159_29:
	.string "Is that so?$"
gBwText_159_30:
	.string "Yes.$"
gBwText_159_31:
	.string "Huh?$"
gBwText_159_32:
	.string "Oh, no!$"
gBwText_159_33:
	.string "What's up?$"
gBwText_159_34:
	.string "Sorry.$"
gBwText_159_35:
	.string "Bye-bye!$"
gBwText_159_36:
	.string "Nah.$"
gBwText_159_37:
	.string "Eep!$"
gBwText_159_38:
	.string "I see!$"
gBwText_159_39:
	.string "How is it?$"
gBwText_159_40:
	.string "Hello!$"
gBwText_159_41:
	.string "...?$"
gBwText_159_42:
	.string "Ouch...$"
gBwText_159_43:
	.string "Hi!$"
gBwText_159_44:
	.string "!!$"
gBwText_159_45:
	.string "Hungry...$"
gBwText_159_46:
	.string "One, two...$"
gBwText_159_47:
	.string "What?$"
gBwText_159_48:
	.string "10Q!$"
gBwText_159_49:
	.string "Zooom!$"
gBwText_159_50:
	.string "Yahooo!$"
gBwText_159_51:
	.string "Bleah.$"
gBwText_159_52:
	.string "Move it!$"
gBwText_159_53:
	.string "Yuck!$"
gBwText_159_54:
	.string "Wait!$"
gBwText_159_55:
	.string "Fffweee!$"
gBwText_159_56:
	.string "Faster!$"
gBwText_159_57:
	.string "Wahaha!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_159
