gBwText_160_0:
	.string "Hey! Hey, you! What was the first\nPokémon you received?\p...\n...\p{STR_VAR_1}! Really?\nThen {STR_VAR_2} could be a big help!$"
gBwText_160_1:
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} does not do well\nagainst {STR_VAR_3}-type Pokémon!\pSay, do you want this {STR_VAR_2} of\nmine?$"
gBwText_160_2:
	.string "Oh? You can only have six Pokémon\nat a time with you, that's all.\pIf you want this Pokémon, you'll have\nto store one of your others in the PC\lat the Pokémon Center.$"
gBwText_160_3:
	.string "My, my. If you want it, come back and\ntalk to me again, OK?$"
gBwText_160_4:
	.string "OK. Here you go!\pIt can use Fire-type moves, so that\nmakes it hot against Grass types!$"
gBwText_160_5:
	.string "OK. Here you go!\pIt can use Water-type moves, so that\nmakes it cool against Fire types!$"
gBwText_160_6:
	.string "OK. Here you go!\pIt can use Grass-type moves, so that\nmakes it great against Water types!$"
gBwText_160_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_160_8:
	.string "Give a nickname to the {STR_VAR_2}\nyou received?$"
gBwText_160_9:
	.string "If you have many types of Pokémon,\nsomething will work out, no matter\lwhat kind of Pokémon you have to face.$"
gBwText_160_10:
	.string "Bianca: Hi, {STR_VAR_1}! Are you looking\nfor the mysterious Pokémon, too?$"
gBwText_160_11:
	.string "Bianca: I'm just really, really\nwondering how showing dreams works...$"
gBwText_160_12:
	.string "Bianca: Hey!\pDid you hear a sound coming\nfrom the other side of that wall?\pCome on! Let's go see!$"
gBwText_160_13:
	.string "Muuuun...$"
gBwText_160_14:
	.string "Bianca: Oh! Wait!$"
gBwText_160_15:
	.string "???: We found you, Munna!$"
gBwText_160_16:
	.string "???: Come on! Come on!\nMake some Dream Mist!$"
gBwText_160_17:
	.string "Munna: ...Mu!$"
gBwText_160_18:
	.string "Bianca: Huh?\pWho are you?!\pWhat are you doing?$"
gBwText_160_19:
	.string "???: Are you talking about us?\nWe're Team Plasma.\pWe battle day and night to liberate\nPokémon from foolish humans!$"
gBwText_160_20:
	.string "Team Plasma: What are we doing?\pThe Pokémon Munna and Musharna emit a\nmysterious vapor called Dream Mist,\lwhich shows people's dreams.\pWe're going to use that to make people\nwant to release their Pokémon...\pWe'll show them dreams\nto manipulate their hearts.$"
gBwText_160_21:
	.string "Munna: Mu... Naa...$"
gBwText_160_22:
	.string "Team Plasma: Come on!\nSpit out that Dream Mist!$"
gBwText_160_23:
	.string "Bianca: You're kicking a Pokémon\nto make it give off Dream Mist?\pThat's mean! Why?\nYou're Trainers too, right?$"
gBwText_160_24:
	.string "Team Plasma: That's right.\pWe're Pokémon Trainers too, but\nwe're fighting for a different reason.\pUnlike you two, we're fighting for\nthe freedom of Pokémon!$"
gBwText_160_25:
	.string "Team Plasma: And setting Pokémon free\nmeans that we win Pokémon battles and\ltake Pokémon by force!\pSo, on that note, we are going to rescue\nyour Pokémon from you!$"
gBwText_160_26:
	.string "Bianca: Whaaat!\nDon't hurt {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_160_27:
	.string "Team Plasma: Were you not taking them\nseriously because they're kids?\pWell, whatever, I'm next!$"
gBwText_160_28:
	.string "Team Plasma: ...I can't\nbelieve we lost!\pBut we have to \nobtain the Dream Mist!$"
gBwText_160_29:
	.string "Come on!\nMake with the Dream Mist!$"
gBwText_160_30:
	.string "Bianca: Knock it off!$"
gBwText_160_31:
	.string "Ghetsis: What are you two doing\ngoofing off?$"
gBwText_160_32:
	.string "Ghetsis: We, Team Plasma,\nshall separate Pokémon\lfrom foolish people!$"
gBwText_160_33:
	.string "Ghetsis: If you cannot\nfulfill your duties...$"
gBwText_160_34:
	.string "Team Plasma: T-this isn't...\pGhetsis when he is gathering\nfollowers... Or Ghetsis when he is trying\lto control people by tricking them with\lspeeches!$"
gBwText_160_35:
	.string "Team Plasma: Yeah...\pThis is Ghetsis when a plan has failed,\nand he is about to issue punishment...$"
gBwText_160_36:
	.string "Team Plasma: At any rate, let's hurry\nand say we're sorry so he forgives us!$"
gBwText_160_37:
	.string "???: Shaaar!$"
gBwText_160_38:
	.string "Bianca: ...What was that just now?\pThat person called Ghetsis\nappeared all over the place, and\lit wasn't real, right?!\p...Could it have been a dream?$"
gBwText_160_39:
	.string "And that Pokémon...$"
gBwText_160_40:
	.string "Oh!$"
gBwText_160_41:
	.string "Fennel: I couldn't wait, so I came over!\p...Is that Musharna?!$"
gBwText_160_42:
	.string "Musharna: Musha?$"
gBwText_160_43:
	.string "Munna: Munii!$"
gBwText_160_44:
	.string "Fennel: Did something happen?$"
gBwText_160_45:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, Fennel.\pWell, you see, Munna was here...\nBut Team Plasma and Munna...\pAnd Musharna came... And it showed us\nsomething like a dream? And then, Team\lPlasma...$"
gBwText_160_46:
	.string "Fennel: I think I followed that...\pSee, Musharna evolves from Munna.\nSo, seeing Munna in trouble, it\lused its power--making dreams\linto reality--to save Munna.\pWhich means...wait a second!$"
gBwText_160_47:
	.string "Is this Dream Mist?!$"
gBwText_160_48:
	.string "With this, I can complete my research!\nYou two come to my house later, OK?$"
gBwText_160_49:
	.string "Bianca: Phew. How random was that?\p{STR_VAR_1}, why don't you go\nto Fennel's house?\pMe? Well, I'm going to go look\nfor the Pokémon we saw just now.$"
gBwText_160_50:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, why don't you go\nto Fennel's house?\pMe? Well, I'm going to go look\nfor the Pokémon we saw just now.$"
gBwText_160_51:
	.string "Gorm: Boo!$"
gBwText_160_52:
	.string "Were you surprised?\pOh, Trainer-who-destroyed-our-castle,\nI was quite surprised by you!$"
gBwText_160_53:
	.string "If you surprise them, both Pokémon\nand people leave themselves open.\pWhile they're in a state of surprise,\nthey can't use their powers\llike they normally would.\pOur intention was to surprise people\nby making our castle appear and\lshowing off the legendary Pokémon...\pAt that moment, we planned to deeply\nimpress people's hearts with the\lawesome power of Team Plasma\land the brilliance of our new world.$"
gBwText_160_54:
	.string "Now that I've seen the strength of\nspirit in you and the Gym Leaders,\lI wonder how effective that strategy\lwould have been, after all.\pMaybe that strength of spirit\nis what's needed to take Pokémon\lto the next level?\pHm... I'm sorry to have wasted your time\nwith this silly conversation.\lTake this with you.$"
gBwText_160_55:
	.string "Gorm: My lord N's dream... You were the\none who put a stop to that. Please\ldon't ever forget that.$"
gBwText_160_56:
	.string "Looker: Ah... And now,\nabout Team Plasma...\pI am an officer of the\nInternational Police, and there are so\lmany things you must tell me at once!$"
gBwText_160_57:
	.string "Gorm: Musharna is said to appear here.\pIts Dream Mist makes you see dreams,\nbut they are nothing but illusions.\pThe dreams you realize with your\nown abilities are the real dreams.$"
gBwText_160_58:
	.string "Looker: Accept my thanks!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pWhat it is they are thinking,\nwhat it may be they are hoping,\lthis is the information I pursue.\lUntil we meet again!$"
gBwText_160_59:
	.string "Looker: A thousand thanks!\pEh, {STR_VAR_1}...\nOn a topic I must speak to you.\pHaving received such a report, of\nsomeone far from here, who has seen\la person like N and...a dragon Pokémon.\pI am on my way to ascertain the\ncertainty of this information.\lWe will meet again one day!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_160
