gBwText_162_0:
	.string "If you go straight, it doesn't take\nlong. But if you go the wrong way, it's a\lmaze.\pIs Pinwheel Forest a\npath or a maze for you?$"
gBwText_162_1:
	.string "Burgh: This leads to Pinwheel Forest.\pIf they manage to scuttle off into the\nforest, we might have trouble.$"
gBwText_162_2:
	.string "Yo! Traveling Trainer!\nAre your Pokémon getting stronger?\lHere! This might come in handy!$"
gBwText_162_3:
	.string "Rock Smash is a move that sometimes\nreduces your foe's Defense stat.\pIt is super effective against\nNormal-type Pokémon, which Gym Leader\lLenora likes!$"
gBwText_162_4:
	.string "It's a challenge rock.\pWould you like to have {STR_VAR_1}\nsmash the rock?$"
gBwText_162_5:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} tried to smash the\nchallenge rock.\pA piece of the rock broke away!$"
gBwText_162_6:
	.string "It's a challenge rock.$"
gBwText_162_7:
	.string "Pinwheel Forest\nDid you remember to pack an Antidote?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_162
