gBwText_163_0:
	.string "In order to eliminate the old-fashioned\nways of looking at things...$"
gBwText_163_1:
	.string "We will steal Pokémon!\nYou'll never play together again!$"
gBwText_163_2:
	.string "If their Pokémon are liberated,\nTrainers will no longer be Trainers!$"
gBwText_163_3:
	.string "We are in the right!$"
gBwText_163_4:
	.string "Everyone else is wrong!$"
gBwText_163_5:
	.string "If you don't think the same way we\nthink, we'll use all our power to\leliminate you!$"
gBwText_163_6:
	.string "Burgh: Well, you see...\pThere are two ways out of\nPinwheel Forest--\pthe road that goes straight and the\npath that winds through the woods.$"
gBwText_163_7:
	.string "I will take the straight road after\nthem!$"
gBwText_163_8:
	.string "If they're not there,\nI'll block the exit.$"
gBwText_163_9:
	.string "Would you please take the other way\nand check whether Team Plasma\lis hiding in there somewhere?\pYou'll run into a lot of Trainers,\nbut it's basically a single path,\lso I'm sure you won't get lost.$"
gBwText_163_10:
	.string "Come on!\nLet's do this for Lenora's sake!$"
gBwText_163_11:
	.string "Burgh: Mm-hmm?\pTeam Plasma hasn't come\nin this direction...\pThe forest's bug Pokémon are quiet,\ntoo.$"
gBwText_163_12:
	.string "Burgh: Mm-hmm?\pTeam Plasma hasn't come\nin this direction...\pThe forest's bug Pokémon are quiet,\ntoo.$"
gBwText_163_13:
	.string "Team Plasma: You stubborn brat!\pWhen I'm through with you,\nyou won't be able to chase us anymore!$"
gBwText_163_14:
	.string "Team Plasma: Too bad!\nI haven't got anything!\pIf you want to get it back,\nyou're just gonna have\lto look for my associates!$"
gBwText_163_15:
	.string "Team Plasma: My, my.\nCould you be looking for something?$"
gBwText_163_16:
	.string "Team Plasma: Sorry!\nI'm empty handed.\pDo I look like the kind of girl\nto carry a heavy load?\pBetter try somewhere else!$"
gBwText_163_17:
	.string "Team Plasma: So you made it this far!\pI'll hold you here so my friends\ncan get away!$"
gBwText_163_18:
	.string "Team Plasma: Yep! I'm here to buy time!\pAnd if you don't step lively,\nwe're going to get away!$"
gBwText_163_19:
	.string "Team Plasma: A pursuer?\pUh, ha ha. A kid like you--\nbeat some of us?!\pThat can't be helped, but...\nI'll take you on now!$"
gBwText_163_20:
	.string "Team Plasma: Fine.\nTake your stupid skull!$"
gBwText_163_21:
	.string "Team Plasma: So the dream our king\nhad-- the dream we had--won't come\ltrue...$"
gBwText_163_22:
	.string "Gorm: How are you holding up,\nfellow subject of our king?$"
gBwText_163_23:
	.string "Team Plasma: Gorm of the Seven Sages!\pI'm mortified that this skull, which we\nwent to so much trouble to obtain,\lwas stolen from us so easily.$"
gBwText_163_24:
	.string "Gorm: It's not important.\pWe can afford to abandon\nthe Dragon Skull.\pAccording to the results of our\nresearch, this is not the legendary\lPokémon for which Team Plasma is\llooking. It is completely unrelated.$"
gBwText_163_25:
	.string "But we will not allow anyone to disrupt\nour plans and get away with it.\pWe will fix it so you never interfere\nwith us again.$"
gBwText_163_26:
	.string "Burgh: Oh, sweet!\pThe bug Pokémon were getting\nall worked up, so here I come,\land what do I spy with my little eye?\pThis important-looking guy!\pAre you here to help your friends,\nwhom I defeated?$"
gBwText_163_27:
	.string "Lenora: {STR_VAR_1}!\nBurgh!\pThe others didn't have anything...\pAnd who are you supposed to be?\pIs this guy the big boss?$"
gBwText_163_28:
	.string "Gorm: I am one of the Seven Sages\nof Team Plasma.\pGhetsis, another of the Seven Sages,\nwill liberate Pokémon with words alone!\pThe remainder of the Seven Sages have\nordered their compatriots to take\lPokémon with full force!\pBut the odds are a little against us\nnow.\pTo you, the Bug Pokémon user Burgh and\nthe Normal Pokémon user Lenora, I say...\pKnow your enemies, know yourself,\nand you need not fear the result\lof a hundred battles...\lThis time, we shall retreat quietly.$"
gBwText_163_29:
	.string "To secure the liberation of Pokémon,\nwe will steal Pokémon from Trainers!\pEven though you are Gym Leaders,\nwe will not tolerate any further\lobstruction from you.\pIn any case, we will settle this\nsomeday.\pI hope you are looking forward\nto that time as much as I...$"
gBwText_163_30:
	.string "Lenora: They're a speedy bunch.\pWhat are you planning to do, Burgh?\nAre you going to chase them?$"
gBwText_163_31:
	.string "Burgh: Hmmm...\pWe got back the stolen skull,\nand if we corner them, there's\lno telling what they might do.\pI think I'll be heading back, Lenora...$"
gBwText_163_32:
	.string "Well, now. Well...\nI'll be waiting for your challenge at\lCastelia City's Pokémon Gym.\pYes, indeed.\nI'm certainly looking forward to it!$"
gBwText_163_33:
	.string "Lenora: {STR_VAR_1}!\pYou're holding the Dragon Skull you\nworked so hard to get back, right?$"
gBwText_163_34:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} gave the\n{STR_VAR_2} to Lenora!$"
gBwText_163_35:
	.string "Lenora: {STR_VAR_1}, thank you so much.\pWith a kind Trainer like you\ntaking care of them, the Pokémon\lwith you must be happy.\pHere is a token of my gratitude.\nPlease use it carefully!$"
gBwText_163_36:
	.string "Lenora: This is a Moon Stone!\pSome Pokémon evolve when you\nuse this item on them.\pNow, I must take the Dragon Skull\nback to the museum!\pSee you! Take care of yourself!$"
gBwText_163_37:
	.string "I run every day!\nMy goal is to be the marathon champion\lof the Unova region!$"
gBwText_163_38:
	.string "The trees cut on this forest road are\nsent from Driftveil City to the world.$"
gBwText_163_39:
	.string "Have you heard of phytoncides?\pI don't really understand, but I heard\nthat the reason forests make you\lfeel good is phytoncides!$"
gBwText_163_40:
	.string "Hmm... I can feel it...\nThe presence of fierce Pokémon.$"
gBwText_163_41:
	.string "The surface is covered with moss.\nTouching it feels good somehow.$"
gBwText_163_42:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pA forest is likely to contain many\nwell-hidden items!\pThey may be hard to find,\nso look carefully!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_163
