gBwText_165_0:
	.string "I'm going to see the ruins, but I'm\nafraid I might get lost in the desert.\pIt's really big, and sometimes you run\ninto Pokémon.\pWill I be in trouble if I am not strong?$"
gBwText_165_1:
	.string "I hear you can find the newly\ndiscovered entrance of the ruins if you\lgo through the gate and just head\lstraight.$"
gBwText_165_2:
	.string "Desert Resort Ahead\nIt's nicer than the average desert!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_165
