gBwText_166_0:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Hi there,\n{STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_166_1:
	.string "I heard about these Pokémon statues,\nand I came to look into their origins!$"
gBwText_166_2:
	.string "I've learned that each of these\nPokémon statues is actually a real\lPokémon!\pIt's called Darmanitan. It's sleeping,\nso it's become like a stone.$"
gBwText_166_3:
	.string "When I quickly measured how long\nthey've existed...\pIt was amazing! Around 2,500 years!\nSeems like they went to sleep that\llong ago.\pThat means they've been here since\nbefore this place was in ruins, when\lthe Relic Castle was flourishing.\pPerhaps they were guarding the city.$"
gBwText_166_4:
	.string "These Pokémon...\pThey are either in a state of\nhibernation or meditation, so if you\lwake them, they will become active once\lagain.\pAnd the item that wakes up Darmanitan\nis actually...this RageCandyBar!\pThat's why I will share one with you,\ntoo, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_166_5:
	.string "Well, I'm headed back to the\nPokémon Research Lab.\lBe seeing you!$"
gBwText_166_6:
	.string "It appears to be a statue of a Pokémon.$"
gBwText_166_7:
	.string "Give the RageCandyBar to the\nPokémon statue?$"
gBwText_166_8:
	.string "The ancient Pokémon statue responded\nto the RageCandyBar.\pThe Pokémon was a sleeping Darmanitan!\pThe awakened Darmanitan attacked!$"
gBwText_166_9:
	.string "Cheren: Stop, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_166_10:
	.string "Cheren: That's the entrance to the\nRelic Castle.\pYou're impressive, {STR_VAR_1},\nmaking it here before I did.$"
gBwText_166_11:
	.string "Dealing with the Desert Resort's\nPokémon took longer than I would've\lthought.\pI only made it all the way out here\nthanks to my Pokémon.$"
gBwText_166_12:
	.string "Alder went on ahead. Let's hurry.$"
gBwText_166_13:
	.string "Cheren: It's hard to put into words...\nbut I'll never forgive them for this!$"
gBwText_166_14:
	.string "Alder: What could that guy called\nN possibly want?\pCould he be trying to prove he is\nright by winning the battle of the\ltwo dragons?$"
gBwText_166_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_166_16:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_166_17:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_166_18:
	.string "Alder: I could hear Professor Juniper's\nvoice from clear over here!\lSeems like something big is happening.\pI wonder what is waiting at the museum\nin Nacrene City.\lI'll go on ahead!$"
gBwText_166_19:
	.string "Cheren: I'll look around here once more.\pI don't want to believe what\nthat Ghetsis says...\pYou should head for the\nNacrene City Museum.$"
gBwText_166_20:
	.string "I came clear out to the Desert Resort\nto train, but...\pThere are so many Ground-type Pokémon,\nand I'm already in tatters...$"
gBwText_166_21:
	.string "You're the first person to come\nclear out here to talk to me!\pI'm so moved!\nSo, I'll give you this!$"
gBwText_166_22:
	.string "If a Pokémon holds this Soft Sand, the\npower of its Ground-type moves goes\lup!$"
gBwText_166_23:
	.string "According to what I've heard, that\nRelic Castle is the ruins of a city built\lby the hero of old and the dragon\lPokémon that accompanied the hero.$"
gBwText_166_24:
	.string "$"
gBwText_166_25:
	.string "Oh! A sea of sand! I don't need\nGo-Goggles here!\pOh, I've come here all the way from\nthe Hoenn region.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_166
