gBwText_167_0:
	.string "The Desert Resort is especially known\nfor the Relic Castle.$"
gBwText_167_1:
	.string "I'm a School Kid, so I know this!\pJust like in caves, you can run into\nPokémon almost anywhere in the desert.\pBut they don't like hiding in the pale\nsand. So if you walk there, you won't\lhave to worry about battling.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_167
gBwTextTable_167:
	.4byte gBwText_167_0
	.4byte gBwText_167_1
	.global gBwTextCount_167
gBwTextCount_167:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_168_0:
	.string "I've been carrying two Pokémon Fossils,\nbut they're just so heavy...\pWould you take one of them off my\nhands?$"
gBwText_168_1:
	.string "Oh, you like the Cover Fossil?\pI heard it is the Fossil of a Pokémon\nthat used to swim in the ancient sea!$"
gBwText_168_2:
	.string "Oh, you like the Plume Fossil?\pIt is the Fossil of a bird Pokémon\nthat lived in an ancient forest.\l...But they say it couldn't fly.$"
gBwText_168_3:
	.string "Oh, won't you please take one?\nThey're really weighing me down.$"
gBwText_168_4:
	.string "Oh, did you change your mind? Great!\nYou can have your choice of Fossils!$"
gBwText_168_5:
	.string "The museum in Nacrene City...\pI hear Pokémon can be restored from\nFossils there.\p'Cause Lenora loves bones and Fossils!$"
gBwText_168_6:
	.string "Cover Fossil$"
gBwText_168_7:
	.string "Plume Fossil$"
gBwText_168_8:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_168_9:
	.string "Trainer! You still can't move ahead\n'cause there is so much sand!\pI will do my best to remove the sand.\nGive me a second!$"
gBwText_168_10:
	.string "Trainer! You still can't move ahead\n'cause there is so much sand!\pI will do my best to remove the sand.\nGive me a second!$"
gBwText_168_11:
	.string "There! The sand is cleared away, so now\nyou can proceed.$"
gBwText_168_12:
	.string "There are two things I've learned\nabout quicksand!\pIf you try to walk through the middle,\nyou'll fall.\pAnd if you try to run through it,\nyou'll fall.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_168
