gBwText_169_0:
	.string "Ryoku: Ghetsis told us that once again\nwe should test how much power you have.\pWe will see if you can defeat Team\nPlasma!$"
gBwText_169_1:
	.string "Ryoku: Go! Hurry and fall through the\nflowing sands!$"
gBwText_169_2:
	.string "$"
