gBwText_173_0:
	.string "Cheren: Whew! I finally caught up.$"
gBwText_173_1:
	.string "Alder: You two. Come here...\nCome to my side.$"
gBwText_173_2:
	.string "Ghetsis: It looks like everyone is here.\pIt seems you are working hard\nto resurrect Zekrom, the other\lDragon-type Pokémon, aren't you?\pBut it appears the Dark Stone you seek\nis not here.$"
gBwText_173_3:
	.string "Ghetsis: It looks like everyone is here.\pIt seems you are working hard\nto resurrect Reshiram, the other\lDragon-type Pokémon, aren't you?\pBut it appears the Light Stone you seek\nis not here.$"
gBwText_173_4:
	.string "Well then, congratulations are in order!\n{STR_VAR_1}, you were chosen by our\lking.\pIf you truly desire to keep the world as\nit is, where Pokémon live alongside\lpeople, you must bring the other\lDragon-type Pokémon spoken of\lin legend and battle with our king.\pOtherwise, Team Plasma will steal every\nPokémon from every person in the world\land release them all!$"
gBwText_173_5:
	.string "Alder: Release them, you say?\pDo the Pokémon who live with their\nTrainers actually want that?\pIs the liberation you talk about really\njust stealing Pokémon from people?$"
gBwText_173_6:
	.string "Ghetsis: What's this?\pChampion Alder, even though illness\ntook the Pokémon that had been your\lpartner for many years, and you\lhaven't had a serious battle in all that\ltime...\pEven you, who ordered the Elite Four to\nprotect the Pokémon League and left to\lwander the Unova region alone...\pEven a Champion like you now wants to\nprotect a world where Pokémon and\lpeople live together?$"
gBwText_173_7:
	.string "Team Plasma's king will show the people\nof Unova that he is stronger than a\lChampion who keeps Pokémon bound!\pAnd just like the hero who founded\nUnova, he will be accompanied by the\llegendary Pokémon.\pHe will give this order!\n“Trainers, release your Pokémon!“\pFor this, we have prepared a suitable\ncastle for the legendary Reshiram and\lour king!$"
gBwText_173_8:
	.string "Team Plasma's king will show the people\nof Unova that he is stronger than a\lChampion who keeps Pokémon bound!\pAnd just like the hero who founded\nUnova, he will be accompanied by the\llegendary Pokémon.\pHe will give this order!\n“Trainers, release your Pokémon!“\pFor this, we have prepared a suitable\ncastle for the legendary Zekrom and\lour king!$"
gBwText_173_9:
	.string "Alder: I won't lose!\pI'll fight for all Trainers who love\ntheir Pokémon, and for all Pokémon who\lbelieve in their Trainers!$"
gBwText_173_10:
	.string "Ghetsis: Our king has no interest in\nyou.\pHe has already determined that victory\nagainst you is assured.$"
gBwText_173_11:
	.string "Alder: So you stayed behind just to\ntell me that? Just to make a fool of me?$"
gBwText_173_12:
	.string "Ghetsis: Of course not.\pI'm doing this out of kindness.\nYes, kindness.\pI'm making sure the Champion doesn't\nget hurt for no reason.\pGranted, the moment when\nsomeone loses all hope...\pI really do love to watch\nthat moment.\pWell then, farewell.$"
gBwText_173_13:
	.string "Cheren: Alder...\nWhat are you going to do now?$"
gBwText_173_14:
	.string "Alder: Hmmm...\pIt seems my only choice is to return to\nthe Pokémon League and battle N.\pBut it bothers me to do exactly what\nGhetsis wants...\pMore importantly, what should we do\nabout the Dark Stone?$"
gBwText_173_15:
	.string "Alder: Hmmm...\pIt seems my only choice is to return to\nthe Pokémon League and battle N.\pBut it bothers me to do exactly what\nGhetsis wants...\pMore importantly, what should we do\nabout the Light Stone?$"
gBwText_173_16:
	.string "Cheren: Alder...\nWhy don't we go outside for now?$"
gBwText_173_17:
	.string "Alder: Yes...that's a good idea.\nIt's hard to breathe in here!$"
	.align 2
