gBwText_175_0:
	.string "Team Plasma: Arggghhhhh!$"
gBwText_175_1:
	.string "Team Plasma: Ryoku of the Seven Sages\nis looking for a Pokémon inside Relic\lCastle.\pI was his lookout so he\nwouldn't be interrupted...\pStupid, stupid, stupid me!\nPlus, weak... And did I mention stupid?\pIt all adds up to nincompoop!$"
