gBwText_189_0:
	.string "Ryoku: I was planning to catch the\nPokémon called Volcarona that lives\lin this Relic Castle and present it\lto Ghetsis.\pBut the Shadow Triad said that Ghetsis\nhas gone somewhere, right?$"
gBwText_189_1:
	.string "The Seven Sages...\pWe always said we were complete when\nthe seven of us were together.\pNow I don't know the meaning of those\nwords anymore.\pI guess I don't mind, even if we were\nbeing used, but the dream is over.$"
gBwText_189_2:
	.string "I no longer need this.\pGhetsis gave it to me, but I have no use\nfor it.$"
gBwText_189_3:
	.string "Ryoku: This Relic Castle and our own\ncastle are both crumbling...\pBut what's different is that this Relic\nCastle is the remains of a civilization.\pAnd our castle left nothing behind...$"
gBwText_189_4:
	.string "Looker: Regarding Team Plasma...\pI am an officer of the International\nPolice, and you must satisfy my request\lfor certain information!$"
gBwText_189_5:
	.string "Ryoku: Understood.\pBut we don't know much about Ghetsis\nor our lord N!\pWe haven't even figured out if they are\nfather and son...$"
gBwText_189_6:
	.string "Looker: Accept my thanks!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pThey are thinking--upon what topics?\nThey are hoping--upon what chances?\pThis is of the utmost urgency.\nAt once! On the way!$"
gBwText_189_7:
	.string "Looker: I thank you profoundly!\pCuriously, {STR_VAR_1}...\nThere is a topic on which we must speak.\pA report has reached my ears of\nsomeone far from here. Indeed, this\lsomeone has spotted a person like N and\la... dragon Pokémon.\pI depart to validate the validity of\nthis information. We shall meet again,\lso until then, adieu.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_189
