gBwText_199_0:
	.string "You want to know about this place?\nThis is the Cold Storage.\pInside, there are Workers\nwith their Pokémon!$"
gBwText_199_1:
	.string "The reason why Clay is having you look\nfor Team Plasma is 'cause he is testing\lyour abilities.$"
gBwText_199_2:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}...\pDo you think Team Plasma could be\nin there?\pI don't like cold places, but we have\nto check. What a bother.$"
gBwText_199_3:
	.string "Cheren: All right, {STR_VAR_1}.\nLet's get this over with.$"
gBwText_199_4:
	.string "You can get to the Cold Storage\nthrough the gap between the fence and\lthe container over there.$"
gBwText_199_5:
	.string "For a few loads, send it by Pokémon.\nFor a lot of loads, send it by ship.\pUse the best method for your needs!$"
gBwText_199_6:
	.string "A helmet is an important tool for\nshock protection!\pIt's good to let your Pokémon\nhave one, too!$"
gBwText_199_7:
	.string "If you let a Pokémon hold a Rocky\nHelmet, the foe will also be damaged if\lthat foe's move makes physical\lcontact.$"
	.align 2
