gBwText_200_0:
	.string "Cheren: Well... Still.\pIs there anything more important\nthan strength for Trainers,\llike the Champion said?$"
gBwText_200_1:
	.string "Oh, I'll never understand just by\nthinking about it.\pWhat a bother.\nLet's hurry up and check the inside.$"
gBwText_200_2:
	.string "Cheren: Oh... Is someone in there?$"
gBwText_200_3:
	.string "Shall we go, then?$"
gBwText_200_4:
	.string "But the only place in the Cold Storage\nwe haven't searched is here, right?$"
gBwText_200_5:
	.string "What's wrong?\nAren't you going to check the inside?$"
gBwText_200_6:
	.string "When you walk through the containers,\nsome places are frozen, so you go\lsliding around!$"
gBwText_200_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_8:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_12:
	.string "$"
gBwText_200_13:
	.string "$"
