	.4byte 14
gBwText_201_0:
	.string "Zinzolin: All of you--huddle around me!\nI can't take this cold...$"
gBwText_201_1:
	.string "Cheren: Whatever.\nI can't believe you were really hiding.\pIt's a bother, but if you're cold,\nshall I show you outside?$"
gBwText_201_2:
	.string "Zinzolin: Pokémon are our king's\nfriends.\pWhile we're taking care of them, we\ncan't let any harm come to them here.\pEveryone, drive these intruders away!$"
gBwText_201_3:
	.string "Team Plasma: Understood,\nZinzolin of the Seven Sages!\pPut 'em up, 'cause here we come!$"
gBwText_201_4:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}!\nLet's each take care of one side!$"
gBwText_201_5:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, you take\ncare of those guys over there!$"
gBwText_201_6:
	.string "Team Plasma: I'm one of the tougher\nmembers of Team Plasma here!$"
gBwText_201_7:
	.string "Team Plasma: How am I supposed to win\nwhen I'm shaking 'cause of the cold?$"
gBwText_201_8:
	.string "Team Plasma: S-s-so cold... How can I win\nwhen I'm shivering so hard?$"
gBwText_201_9:
	.string "Team Plasma: For this group, I'm pretty\nstrong. I hope you know that!$"
gBwText_201_10:
	.string "Team Plasma: In the middle of the night,\nwe gathered all the Pokémon we stole\lin front of the container, so we could\ltransport them all at the same time.\pThen Clay, that old guy, found us.\nWe had been captured!$"
gBwText_201_11:
	.string "Team Plasma: In the middle of the night,\nwe gathered all the Pokémon we stole\lin front of the container, so we could\ltransport them all at the same time.\pThen Clay, that old guy, found us.\nWe had been captured!$"
gBwText_201_12:
	.string "Team Plasma: In this group,\nI'm fairly strong, and that's a fact!$"
gBwText_201_13:
	.string "Team Plasma: The Pokémon that work with\npeople may look like they're having fun,\lbut the truth is they're suffering.\pThere's no doubt about it!$"
gBwText_201_14:
	.string "Team Plasma: The Pokémon that work with\npeople may look like they're having fun,\lbut the truth is they're suffering.\pThere's no doubt about it!$"
gBwText_201_15:
	.string "Team Plasma: In my own way, I'm a strong\npart of this Team Plasma group!$"
gBwText_201_16:
	.string "Team Plasma: Hmm-mmm... I wonder why...\nI'm getting sleepy for some reason.$"
gBwText_201_17:
	.string "Team Plasma: I wonder why...\nI'm getting sleepy for some reason.$"
gBwText_201_18:
	.string "$"
gBwText_201_19:
	.string "Team Plasma: Um.\nRunning into the Cold Storage,\lthinking it was a regular container...\lHow cold life can be...$"
gBwText_201_20:
	.string "Team Plasma: Me?\nLosing to a Trainer like this?!$"
gBwText_201_21:
	.string "Team Plasma: Achoo! Why did I end up\nhere when I'm allergic to the cold!$"
gBwText_201_22:
	.string "Clay: Well, I'll be!\pHidin' in a chilly old place like this...$"
gBwText_201_23:
	.string "You guys take these\nPokémon robbers!$"
gBwText_201_24:
	.string "Worker: Roger!$"
gBwText_201_25:
	.string "Come on!$"
gBwText_201_26:
	.string "Eek!$"
gBwText_201_27:
	.string "Ugh!$"
gBwText_201_28:
	.string "Clay: You guys ain't so bad!\pYup, a promise is a promise.\nCome on an' challenge my Gym!$"
gBwText_201_29:
	.string "Cheren: Whatever...\nTeam Plasma's ideal...\pSeparating people and Pokémon...\pIt's exactly the same as not having\nPokémon in this world at all.\lThat bunch is a waste of oxygen.\p{STR_VAR_1}...\nIt's cold, so I'm getting out of here.$"
gBwText_201_30:
	.string "Zinzolin: So, you returned?\nYou're an odd Trainer.\pAll right. I've got time enough\nto satisfy your curiosity.$"
gBwText_201_31:
	.string "...Breathing.\nHaving a heart that beats.\pThat is simple existence and\nnothing more for a living being.\pThat may be the definition of living,\nbut I don't think that defines life.$"
gBwText_201_32:
	.string "The experiences of joy and suffering\nare a vital part of being alive.\pGhetsis gave me the sensation\nof being truly alive...\pWhat did he mean to accomplish?\nThat isn't what's important.$"
gBwText_201_33:
	.string "Right now, I'm shivering.\nI'm suffering, but I'm alive.$"
gBwText_201_34:
	.string "Pokémon and people live by being\ntogether and relying on one another.\lThat might be how you feel.\pIf that's so, is it necessary to\nseparate people and Pokémon?\pBy talking to you, I've discovered that\nthere's much I need to think about...\pI wish I had more to give you in\nthanks... Here, take this.$"
gBwText_201_35:
	.string "Zinzolin: My lord N said that he wanted\nto make Pokémon perfect...\pBut, even if the relationship between\nPokémon and people stayed as it now is,\lPokémon can aspire to perfection...$"
gBwText_201_36:
	.string "Looker: Indeed! I am an officer of the\nInternational Police, and I demand to\lhear all you know about Team Plasma!$"
gBwText_201_37:
	.string "Zinzolin: It's too cold and I'm already\ntired of shivering in here.\pIf you'll give me some time to think,\nI'll tell you what I know.\lSo...take me with you.$"
gBwText_201_38:
	.string "Looker: Thanks many times over!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pThe thoughts they are contemplating,\nthe hopes they are anticipating,\lthese--these are what I want to know!\lUntil our next meeting!$"
gBwText_201_39:
	.string "Looker: Thank you!\p{STR_VAR_1}, of something we must\nspeak.\pA report has reached my ears of\nsomeone far from here. Indeed, this\lsomeone has spotted a person like N and\la... dragon Pokémon.\pI plan to examine the exactitude\nof this information. \lI hope to see you again!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_201
