	.4byte 40
gBwText_202_0:
	.string "Something that looks like a Pokémon\nnest is blocking the entrance.$"
gBwText_202_1:
	.string "Clay: Thanks fer waitin'.$"
gBwText_202_2:
	.string "Looks like th' nest of an Electric-type\nPokémon called Galvantula.\pDon't know why there's a nest here, but\nif there are folks havin' problems, th'\lGym Leader's th' one ta fix it.$"
gBwText_202_3:
	.string "Krokorok! Take it out!$"
gBwText_202_4:
	.string "And this here TM's yours. It's my\nfavorite TM, so ya can teach it ta all of\lyer Pokémon!$"
gBwText_202_5:
	.string "It's called Bulldoze. This move does\ndamage and lowers the Speed of any\lPokémon it hits.\pSome Ground-type Pokémon move a little\nslower than ya'd like.\pIf ya use Bulldoze right, ya can cover\nthat weakness!$"
gBwText_202_6:
	.string "I don't know how good you really are,\nbut if ya think ya can go, go wherever,\land if ya think ya can do somethin',\lkeep doin' it.\pDo things how ya want!\nDecide yer own limits.$"
gBwText_202_7:
	.string "Chargestone Cave\nA shocking experience!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_202
