gBwTextCount_202:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_203_0:
	.string "...\p...Come.$"
gBwText_203_1:
	.string "...\pMy lord N, we brought the one\nyou wanted.$"
gBwText_203_2:
	.string "N: Ah, yes.\pThat was the Shadow Triad, just now.\nGhetsis enlisted them in Team Plasma.\pApparently, they were the ones who\nprepared the Galvantula nest\lat the cave entrance.$"
gBwText_203_3:
	.string "N: Chargestone Cave...\nI like this place.\pFormulas express electricity and\nits connection to Pokémon...\pIf people did not exist,\nthis would be an ideal place.\pYou have been chosen, you know.\nDoes it surprise you I said that?$"
gBwText_203_4:
	.string "Of course.\nSuch news should be a surprise.$"
gBwText_203_5:
	.string "Hmph.\pIf you don't understand what that\nmeans, it's not likely to surprise you.$"
gBwText_203_6:
	.string "I told Ghetsis about you\nand your friends.\pAfter I did, he apparently used the\nShadow Triad to find out about you.\pCheren is pursuing the ideal of\nstrength.\pPoor Bianca has faced the sad truth\nthat not everyone can become stronger.\pAnd you are not swayed either way--\nmore of a neutral presence.\lWhich is apparently a good thing.\pTeam Plasma will be waiting for you\nahead.\pGhetsis wants to see what kind of\nPokémon Trainer you really are.$"
gBwText_203_7:
	.string "Heeey!$"
gBwText_203_8:
	.string "Guess what!$"
gBwText_203_9:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pThe floating stones move\nwhen you touch them!$"
gBwText_203_10:
	.string "Right, Professor?$"
gBwText_203_11:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Hi there!\nHow are you, {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_203_12:
	.string "This place is always charged with\nlots of electricity that Pokémon like!\pThe electric charges react from one\nstone to another, and that's why\lsome of the stones are floating!\pBut not all of the stones can be\npushed.$"
gBwText_203_13:
	.string "My father asked me to research Klink,\nwhich is a Pokémon that looks like a\lgear, because I'm researching the\lorigins of Pokémon and the era they\lappeared.\pHe knows how to get what he wants from\npeople, but I was already interested in\lthis anyway, so it's a lot of fun!\pOh, yeah! {STR_VAR_1}, this is for you!$"
gBwText_203_14:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Giving that Lucky\nEgg to a Pokémon to hold increases the\lamount of Exp. Points received in\lbattle by a lot!\pHaving strong Pokémon will make\nit easier to fill your Pokédex pages!$"
gBwText_203_15:
	.string "Professor Juniper: {STR_VAR_1}!\nAre you working on your Pokédex?\pKeep encountering lots of Pokémon,\nso you can keep filling in those pages!$"
gBwText_203_16:
	.string "Bianca: I'm the professor's bodyguard!\pWell, that's probably not necessary,\nbut you have to protect important\lthings!$"
gBwText_203_17:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Hi there!\nDid you find something?\pI think we're just about\ndone collecting data.$"
gBwText_203_18:
	.string "This cave has been around since the\ndistant past, but...\pData to prove that Klink existed more\nthan a hundred years ago can't be\lfound.\pSo that must mean...\pKlink suddenly appeared a hundred\nyears ago!$"
gBwText_203_19:
	.string "Where Pokémon came from\nand where they are going...\pIf we can learn that, I believe\nwe can get along even better!$"
gBwText_203_20:
	.string "Bianca: Know what, {STR_VAR_1}?\nPokémon are mysterious!\pI wonder why these amazing\nlittle guys stay by our sides.$"
gBwText_203_21:
	.string "Where Pokémon came from\nand where they are going...\pIf we can learn that, I believe\nwe can get along even better!$"
gBwText_203_22:
	.string "Bianca: I plan on staying here and\ncatching Pokémon! Traveling is about\lencounters, you know!$"
gBwText_203_23:
	.string "...\p...Come.$"
gBwText_203_24:
	.string "...\pThere are stairs going down ahead.\nTeam Plasma is waiting for you there.$"
gBwText_203_25:
	.string "N: Many different values mix together,\nand the world becomes gray...\lThat is unforgivable!\pI will separate Pokémon and people, and\nblack and white will be clearly distinct!\pOnly then will Pokémon become\nperfect beings!\pYes, that is my dream!\nThat is the dream I must fulfill!\p{STR_VAR_1}, do you have a dream\nof your own?$"
gBwText_203_26:
	.string "You have a dream...\nThat's wonderful.\pI'll learn just what kind of dream\nyou have--in battle!$"
gBwText_203_27:
	.string "As if a person without a dream\ncould ever understand me!\pEh... I guess...\nI have to crush your will here!$"
gBwText_203_28:
	.string "$"
gBwText_203_29:
	.string "N: Tsk! Why?\pIs it impossible for me to win while\nfeeling bad about being a Trainer?\pAs if I could pursue the truth with\nsomething as meaningless as a battle!\pAs if that could make me worthy to\nbecome friends with the legendary\lPokémon!$"
gBwText_203_30:
	.string "N: Tsk! Why?\pIs it impossible for me to win while\nfeeling bad about being a Trainer?\pAs if I could pursue my ideals with\nsomething as meaningless as a battle!\pAs if that could make me worthy to\nbecome friends with the legendary\lPokémon!$"
gBwText_203_31:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_203_32:
	.string "Just a little further to Mistralton\nCity!$"
gBwText_203_33:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Bianca,\nyou have good ears.\pI can't believe you heard\n{STR_VAR_1}'s voice from that far away.\p{STR_VAR_1}, who is this Trainer?$"
gBwText_203_34:
	.string "N: Professor Juniper,\nwhat are you thinking?\pYou appear to have no qualms about the\nrelationship between Pokémon and\lpeople.\pYou put Pokémon into categories using\narbitrary rules and think you can\lunderstand them like that...\lThe very idea of a Pokédex revolts me.\pWhat do you have to say for yourself?$"
gBwText_203_35:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Oh, my.\nLooks like you're not my biggest fan.\pYour opinion is understandable.\nIt happens to be different from mine,\lwhich is equally understandable.\pHow about if all people get to decide\nfor themselves how to relate to\lPokémon?$"
gBwText_203_36:
	.string "N: You're saying I should just allow\npeople to think whatever they want and\ltreat Pokémon however they want,\lno matter whether the Pokémon suffer?\pI refuse to tolerate the existence\nof a world like that!$"
gBwText_203_37:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Well, I didn't expect\nhim to change his mind right away.\pBut I hope he'll spend a little time\ntrying to understand how others feel.$"
gBwText_203_38:
	.string "Now, then... I think I'll go collect a\nlittle more data.\pFor Pokémon and people to get\nalong better, we need to take steps\lto learn more about them!$"
gBwText_203_39:
	.string "Bianca: Umm, {STR_VAR_1}!\pI'm gonna go with Professor Juniper\nnow 'cause I'm her bodyguard!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_203
