	.4byte 6
gBwText_205_0:
	.string "Bronius: When I saw you in Castelia,\nI did not care about your existence.\pHere in the Chargestone Cave,\nGhetsis tested your ability...\pOnce more, we will test you to learn\nwhat it is you are.\pTeam Plasma, come out!$"
gBwText_205_1:
	.string "Team Plasma: Bronius of the Seven\nSages, I will bring this kid down!$"
gBwText_205_2:
	.string "Team Plasma: This kid is the real thing!$"
gBwText_205_3:
	.string "Team Plasma: Because of you,\nI'm now ex-Team Plasma.\pBeing an ex doesn't sound cool, does\nit? How are you going to make it up to\lme?$"
gBwText_205_4:
	.string "Team Plasma: An ex-Team Plasma member\nbecomes an ordinary Pokémon Trainer...\lThis was that moment.$"
gBwText_205_5:
	.string "Bronius: The Pokémon of our Team Plasma\nare also fighting for their Trainers.\pIt was so obvious that I overlooked\nit... Thank you for reminding me of that.\pHere, I'd like you to take this.$"
gBwText_205_6:
	.string "Bronius: Pokémon do their best for\ntheir Trainers even when they are\linjured.\pI wonder whether my lord N understands\nwhat that means?$"
gBwText_205_7:
	.string "Looker: On the topic of Team Plasma...\pI am an officer of the\nInternational Police,\lso you would be wise\lto share all you know.$"
gBwText_205_8:
	.string "Bronius: Those who left Team Plasma and\nare behaving with respect and\lunderstanding toward Pokémon...\pThem, please forgive!\nHowever, those who won't interact with\lPokémon in a kind and honest way...\lEven I will never forgive them!$"
gBwText_205_9:
	.string "Looker: Truly, I thank you!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pTheir innermost thoughts,\ntheir uttermost hopes...\lThese I must and shall discover!\lOnce more, a brief farewell!$"
gBwText_205_10:
	.string "Looker: Thank you!\p{STR_VAR_1}, there is something\nof which we must speak.\pA report has been received. By me.\nFar from here, a sighting occurred of a\lperson like N and--a dragon Pokémon.\pI must instantly go to confirm the\ncomplete confirmation of this report.\lI will see you again, and soon!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_205
