	.4byte gBwText_205_10
	.global gBwTextCount_205
gBwTextCount_205:
	.4byte 11
gBwText_206_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}!\pSince we both hold the Jet Badge now,\nlet's see which of us is stronger!$"
gBwText_206_1:
	.string "Alder: That was a fine Pokémon battle!\pI'm happy to see you are both growing\nas Trainers!$"
gBwText_206_2:
	.string "Cheren: If it isn't the Champion, Alder.\nI'm weak, so I lost!\p...And, honestly, it bothers me when you\ncall it a fine battle despite that.$"
gBwText_206_3:
	.string "Alder: Oh, honestly, Cheren.\pJust accept the compliment without the\nstinging remark.\pI've asked you this before, but what do\nyou plan to do after becoming strong?$"
gBwText_206_4:
	.string "Cheren: If I get strong and become a\nChampion, that will be the reason for\lmy existence.\lI want to prove that I'm really living.$"
gBwText_206_5:
	.string "Alder: Hmmm...\nYou remind me of Marshal.\pOf course, having something you want\nto become is important.\pBut what is even more important is\nwhat you do with your newfound power.\pAnyway, take this!$"
gBwText_206_6:
	.string "Here--you, too.$"
gBwText_206_7:
	.string "Alder: If you use the move Surf, you can\ntravel over water.\pI shall see you again, young Trainers.\pDon't forget about the needs of the\nPokémon at your side!$"
gBwText_206_8:
	.string "Cheren: What I do with my power...\pI don't know that answer yet. First, I\nwant to become a strong Trainer so\leveryone will acknowledge that power!$"
gBwText_206_9:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}...\nNext time, I will win!$"
gBwText_206_10:
	.string "You are {STR_VAR_1}, aren't you?\pAre you surprised that I know?\nClay told me.\pUh-oh! To go inside Twist Mountain,\nyou need to have a Gym Badge from the\lMistralton Gym!\pThe wild Pokémon here are tougher, and\nwe want to be sure you're ready!$"
gBwText_206_11:
	.string "Twist Mountain ahead.\nWatch out for wild Pokémon.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_206
