gBwText_207_0:
	.string "In winter, the appearance of\nTwist Mountain changes.\pWhen I see that, I feel a sense of\nrelief.$"
gBwText_207_1:
	.string "Snow is so amazing...\nIt's like a clean slate for the world.$"
gBwText_207_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_207_3:
	.string "When I can stand firm, even though the\nground beneath me is slanted, it makes\lme feel even more alive!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_207
