gBwText_208_0:
	.string "Cheren: Oh... {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_208_1:
	.string "Clay: What a surprise. Seein' ya here\nwhile I was inspectin' Twist Mountain.\pTh' two of ya seem a bit more rugged\nthan the last time I saw ya.\pA li'l bit, anyway...$"
gBwText_208_2:
	.string "Cheren: Is that so.$"
gBwText_208_3:
	.string "Clay: By th' by... You folks seen that\nTeam Plasma crowd lately?\pAfter all the trouble, we Gym Leaders\nmet up and had a chat.\pBut we've got no clue where they are.\nIt's like they're hidin' under a rock.\pWell, not much to do but wait for 'em\nto move.\pAnyhow, this's none o' yer concern.\pSquirts like the two of ya should just\nenjoy travelin' with yer Pokémon.$"
gBwText_208_4:
	.string "Twist Mountain's a fine place\nto explore!\pYou'll have some fun if you just leave\nthis here path...\pWeeell... Better ya just see it yerself,\n'stead o' listenin' to me yammer.$"
gBwText_208_5:
	.string "Be seein' ya, sprouts!\pFeel free to train yerselves on my\nmountain fer as long's ya like.$"
gBwText_208_6:
	.string "Cheren: I thought he was going to get\nus involved in all that bother again, so\lI was bracing myself before I knew it.\pI'm going in first, but I'll be seeing\nyou.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_208
