gBwTextCount_209:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_210_0:
	.string "Team Plasma: Huh. Pretty strong...\pBut you're only strong because you\nTrainers are controlling Pokémon!$"
gBwText_210_1:
	.string "Cheren: So if you want to set\nPokémon free...\pIf that's what you want, you should\nstart with your own.\pBut taking people's Pokémon by force\nis not right.\pThat is not real strength!$"
gBwText_210_2:
	.string "Team Plasma: Hey, there you are!\pWe found that thing we were looking for.\nWe should head for the tower now!$"
gBwText_210_3:
	.string "Get this! Team Plasma has obtained\nthe power to change this world\land end people's control over Pokémon.$"
gBwText_210_4:
	.string "Team Plasma: That's right!\pWe must use force in order to right\nthe wrongs of the world.\pNow, let's gather around our king.\nOur lord N!$"
gBwText_210_5:
	.string "Cheren: Those guys... I don't know what\nthey've found, but they go the extra\lmile to gain power and cause trouble.\lWhat a bothersome bunch...$"
gBwText_210_6:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}... I'm going to stay here\nfor a while.\pI want to think a little bit about what\nthe Champion asked me...\pWhat do I want to do with my power\nafter I get strong?\pAnd why do I want to be strong in the\nfirst place?$"
gBwText_210_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}... I'm going to stay here\nfor a while.\pI want to think a little bit about what\nthe Champion asked me...\pWhat do I want to do with my power\nafter I get strong?\pAnd why do I want to be strong in the\nfirst place?$"
gBwText_210_8:
	.string "If you look for something in an empty\nplace like this, you can discover\lthings!$"
gBwText_210_9:
	.string "If you look for something in an empty\nplace like this, you can discover\lthings!\pLike this Fossil I just found! Take\nthis!$"
gBwText_210_10:
	.string "If you come again tomorrow, you might\nbe able to find a Fossil of your own. So\lcome on out and play if ya want!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_210
