gBwText_213_0:
	.string "Cedric: That building serenely towering\nover everything is Dragonspiral Tower.\pFrom far in the past, before Unova was\nfounded, it still stands tall today.\pOn the top floor, so it's been told,\nthe legendary Pokémon is waiting for\la person seeking the truth to appear.$"
gBwText_213_1:
	.string "Cedric: That building serenely towering\nover everything is Dragonspiral Tower.\pFrom far in the past, before Unova was\nfounded, it still stands tall today.\pOn the top floor, so it's been told,\nthe legendary Pokémon is waiting for\la person pursuing ideals to appear.$"
gBwText_213_2:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_213_3:
	.string "Cedric: Oh, {STR_VAR_1}!\pAnd you must be Bianca.\pI'm the other Professor Juniper.\pThe Professor Juniper who gave you\nthe Pokédex is my daughter.$"
gBwText_213_4:
	.string "Bianca: Nice to meet you, professor!\pThanks to Professor Juniper,\nI got to go on a journey and start\lfiguring out possibilities for my life.\pI'm very, very grateful to her!$"
gBwText_213_5:
	.string "Cedric: Is that right? Grand, grand.\nActually, we should chat later.\p{STR_VAR_1}, Bianca,\nhere's the situation.\pSome members of Team Plasma--quite\na large group--broke through the\ltower wall and went inside.\pBrycen and that young man--\nI believe his name is Cheren--\lthe two of them went after\lTeam Plasma, but...$"
gBwText_213_6:
	.string "Bianca: Professor, what's the\nDragonspiral Tower?$"
gBwText_213_7:
	.string "Cedric: Ha! I guess you would be\ncurious. Well, I'll explain briefly.\pDragonspiral Tower has stood tall since\nlong before Unova was founded.\pOn the top floor, the legendary\nDragon-type Pokémon waits for\la person seeking truth to appear...\pThat's what is said.$"
gBwText_213_8:
	.string "Cedric: Ha! I guess you would be\ncurious. Well, I'll explain briefly.\pDragonspiral Tower has stood tall since\nlong before Unova was founded.\pOn the top floor, the legendary\nDragon-type Pokémon waits for\la person pursuing ideals to appear...\pThat's what is said.$"
gBwText_213_9:
	.string "Are you going to go after Team Plasma\nlike your friend did?\pIt's admirable of you to join the fight\nagainst Team Plasma, but it's risky,\ltoo.$"
gBwText_213_10:
	.string "Bianca: Don't worry!\p{STR_VAR_1} and Cheren are both\nreally, really strong, and they've\lbeaten Team Plasma before.\pBut...I'm not all that strong, actually.\nI admit it. I'm not very strong, so\lI was thinking...\pIt would be nice if, maybe, I could...\nStay here and be your bodyguard?$"
gBwText_213_11:
	.string "Cedric: Why, thank you!\nThat makes me feel much safer!\pWell, {STR_VAR_1}!\nIt's up to you! Climb the tower!$"
gBwText_213_12:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_13:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_14:
	.string "This is all I can give you,\nbut it might help you rest!$"
gBwText_213_15:
	.string "Cedric: Still...\nWhat could Team Plasma be after?$"
gBwText_213_16:
	.string "Cedric: Still...\nWhat could Team Plasma be after?$"
gBwText_213_17:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}...\nPlease don't do anything crazy.$"
gBwText_213_18:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_19:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_20:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_21:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_22:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_23:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_24:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_25:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_26:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_27:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_28:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_29:
	.string "Cedric: Astounding...\pI never would have imagined the\nlegendary Dragon-type Pokémon would\lreturn now...$"
gBwText_213_30:
	.string "Cheren: That guy called N...\pTeam Plasma's boss apparently\nreawakened the legendary Pokémon.\pHe told {STR_VAR_1} to look for the\nother legendary Pokémon, then flew\laway...$"
gBwText_213_31:
	.string "Bianca: Huh?\pThere are two legendary\nDragon-type Pokémon?$"
gBwText_213_32:
	.string "???: Yes! Yes, there are!$"
gBwText_213_33:
	.string "Cedric: Why, if it isn't Alder!\nIt's been a while! Have you been well?$"
gBwText_213_34:
	.string "$"
gBwText_213_35:
	.string "Alder: No time for chitchat!\pThat fearsome column of fire that\nshot from the tower...\pThat Pokémon has the power to\ndestroy the world!\pIf it's on Team Plasma's side, and\nTeam Plasma tells everyone\lto release their Pokémon...\pNo matter whether it comes from fear\nor admiration...\pThe world can't help but change.\pIt will become a world where we are\nseparated from Pokémon...$"
gBwText_213_36:
	.string "Alder: No time for chitchat!\pThose violent flashes of lightning\nthat shot from the tower...\pThat Pokémon has the power to\ndestroy the world!\pIf it's on Team Plasma's side, and\nTeam Plasma tells everyone\lto release their Pokémon...\pNo matter whether it comes from fear\nor admiration...\pThe world can't help but change.\pIt will become a world where we are\nseparated from Pokémon...$"
gBwText_213_37:
	.string "Cedric: Right...\pMoreover, the boss of Team Plasma,\nN, who reawakened Reshiram,\lapparently said to look for the\lother Pokémon, Zekrom.$"
gBwText_213_38:
	.string "Cedric: Right...\pMoreover, the boss of Team Plasma,\nN, who reawakened Zekrom,\lapparently said to look for the\lother Pokémon, Reshiram.$"
gBwText_213_39:
	.string "Alder: If I remember the myth,\nReshiram's fiery breath, along with the\lother Pokémon, devastated ancient\lUnova in an instant.\pEven knowing that, N is still\nwanting to awaken the other?!$"
gBwText_213_40:
	.string "Alder: If I remember the myth, Zekrom's\npowerful electricity, along with the\lother Pokémon, devastated ancient\lUnova in an instant.\pEven knowing that, N is still\nwanting to awaken the other?!$"
gBwText_213_41:
	.string "Bianca: H-huh?!\pIsn't it dangerous to bring back\na Pokémon that powerful?$"
gBwText_213_42:
	.string "Alder: Miss, you are a very kind person.\pStill, I don't know if other Pokémon\nwill be able to stand up to it.\pBecause, no matter what,\nit is a legendary being...\pI don't like the idea of taking orders\nfrom N, but searching for the dragon--\lthe stone--might not be a bad plan.\pWe certainly can't let Team Plasma\nreawaken both of them!\pSince I've traveled all over Unova,\nI have an idea of where it might be.\pLet's head to the Relic Castle.\n{STR_VAR_1}, everyone, I'm going!$"
gBwText_213_43:
	.string "Cedric: I see. We'll leave that to you.\pI'm going to investigate inside the\ntower. Hopefully, I'll find something.$"
gBwText_213_44:
	.string "Brycen: Then, I will go with you.$"
gBwText_213_45:
	.string "Cheren: I think I understand better\nnow.\pBeing able to do something for\nPokémon-- for somebody at a time like\lthis--is strength... I'm sure of it.\pAnd my strength is something that is\ngiven to me by Pokémon.\pOK, Champion, let's hurry!$"
gBwText_213_46:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1},\nthis has turned into a big deal.\pSo confusing... I dunno what to do...\pAre you gonna go to the\nRelic Castle, {STR_VAR_1}?\pPast Route 4, in the Desert Resort... I\nhear that's where the Relic Castle is...$"
gBwText_213_47:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, look for the Desert\nResort past Route 4. I hear that's\lwhere the Relic Castle is...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_213
