gBwText_215_0:
	.string "Is...\pIs something...going wild\nat the top of the tower?$"
gBwText_215_1:
	.string "Cedric: Maybe I should have my daughter\nlook into when this tower was built.\pIf you want someone to investigate\nthe origin of Pokémon, she's the best.$"
gBwText_215_2:
	.string "Brycen: So, this is Dragonspiral Tower.\nThere's a certain heaviness to the air.\pDid Reshiram, who woke up here,\nsee something in N?$"
gBwText_215_3:
	.string "Brycen: So, this is Dragonspiral Tower.\nThere's a certain heaviness to the air.\pDid Zekrom, who woke up here,\nsee something in N?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_215
