gBwText_218_0:
	.string "Brycen: {STR_VAR_1}!\nWe'll hold them here!\pYou go on ahead!$"
gBwText_218_1:
	.string "Brycen: I'm fine, but there's no time!$"
gBwText_218_2:
	.string "Cheren: This is nothing! But there sure\nare a lot of them...\pOh, what a complete bother!$"
gBwText_218_3:
	.string "Cheren: Why do you make that\nextra push?\pWhat is the source of that strength?$"
gBwText_218_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_218_5:
	.string "Team Plasma: So this is the\ntrue strength of a Gym Leader!$"
gBwText_218_6:
	.string "Team Plasma: This strength...\nCould it be equal to the Seven Sages?$"
gBwText_218_7:
	.string "Team Plasma: No one!\nI won't let anyone get in our way!$"
gBwText_218_8:
	.string "Team Plasma: Why do you get in our way\neven though you don't understand\lour sublime goal?!$"
gBwText_218_9:
	.string "Team Plasma: So young, but so tough!$"
gBwText_218_10:
	.string "Team Plasma: Yeah, all right. If I have\nto lose, at least it's to the Gym\lLeader.$"
gBwText_218_11:
	.string "Team Plasma: Right now,\nour king is upstairs...\pThere's nothing you can do!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_218
