gBwText_220_0:
	.string "Burn, baby, burn!$"
gBwText_220_1:
	.string "It's shocking!!$"
gBwText_220_2:
	.string "It sounds like something is on a\nrampage at the top of the tower!$"
gBwText_220_3:
	.string "Giallo: It's finally time.\nOur lord N will become the hero!$"
gBwText_220_4:
	.string "What?!\nSomeone made it clear up here?!\pNow! Stop that Trainer!\nFor our lord N!$"
gBwText_220_5:
	.string "Giallo: Everyone who isn't Team Plasma\nis an enemy!\lUse all your powers to take them out!$"
gBwText_220_6:
	.string "Giallo: The hero will open up the\nway to a new world!\pWhich means you Trainers can all\nprepare to lose your Pokémon!$"
gBwText_220_7:
	.string "Team Plasma: No one can interfere\nwith Unova's new dawn!$"
gBwText_220_8:
	.string "Team Plasma: Sheesh...\nLosing to a kid...\pBut Team Plasma is\nmore than one person!$"
gBwText_220_9:
	.string "Team Plasma: Sheesh...\nLosing to a kid...\pBut Team Plasma is\nmore than one person!$"
gBwText_220_10:
	.string "Team Plasma: Our dream is about\nto come true!\pNo one will be able to stop us!$"
gBwText_220_11:
	.string "Team Plasma: You may have stopped me,\nbut my teammate will stop you here!$"
gBwText_220_12:
	.string "Team Plasma: So your Pokémon have\ngotten used to being your weapons...$"
gBwText_220_13:
	.string "Team Plasma: Here I come!\nPlasmaaaa!!$"
gBwText_220_14:
	.string "Team Plasma: Our king will create\na new world.$"
gBwText_220_15:
	.string "Team Plasma: Our king will create\na new world.$"
gBwText_220_16:
	.string "Team Plasma: Bring it on!\nCan you take on four in a row?$"
gBwText_220_17:
	.string "Team Plasma: I don't understand...\nWhy do you keep trying so hard?\pW-well, we'll let you through for now!$"
gBwText_220_18:
	.string "Team Plasma: I don't understand...\nWhy do you keep trying so hard?$"
