gBwText_221_0:
	.string "N: What do you think, {STR_VAR_1}?\pHow do you like the beautiful form of\nthe Pokémon who appears before and\lfights beside the hero that will lead\lthe way to a new world?$"
gBwText_221_1:
	.string "N: What do you think, {STR_VAR_1}?\pHow do you like the powerful form of the\nPokémon who appears before and fights\lbeside the hero that will lead the way\lto a new world?$"
gBwText_221_2:
	.string "Now, Reshiram and I will head to the\nPokémon League and defeat the\lChampion!\pThis will be the last of the Pokémon\nbattles that hurt Pokémon so.\pA world for Pokémon alone...\nIt's finally going to be a reality.$"
gBwText_221_3:
	.string "Now, Zekrom and I will head to the\nPokémon League and defeat the\lChampion!\pThis will be the last of the Pokémon\nbattles that hurt Pokémon so.\pA world for Pokémon alone...\nIt's finally going to be a reality.$"
gBwText_221_4:
	.string "If you want to stop me, you must become\na hero as well!\pThat's right! When Reshiram's\ncounterpart, Zekrom, recognizes you, we\lwill finally be even, and then you can\ltry to stop us!$"
gBwText_221_5:
	.string "If you want to stop me, you must become\na hero as well!\pThat's right! When Zekrom's\ncounterpart, Reshiram, recognizes you,\lwe will finally be even, and then you can\ltry to stop us!$"
gBwText_221_6:
	.string "Well, what will you do?\pMy prediction... If the future that I\nsee is true, you will meet Zekrom.\pThe Pokémon with you believe in you so\nstrongly... Will you be the one\lwho interferes with my formula\lfor changing the world?\pIf you want to protect the bonds\nbetween Pokémon and people, you must\lsearch for Zekrom!\pI'm sure it is waiting for you in the\nform of the Dark Stone.$"
gBwText_221_7:
	.string "Well, what will you do?\pMy prediction... If the future that I\nsee is true, you will meet Reshiram.\pThe Pokémon with you believe in you so\nstrongly... Will you be the one\lwho interferes with my formula\lfor changing the world?\pIf you want to protect the bonds\nbetween Pokémon and people, you must\lsearch for Reshiram!\pI'm sure it is waiting for you in the\nform of the Light Stone.$"
gBwText_221_8:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, did you see what\nflew off just now?$"
gBwText_221_9:
	.string "Brycen: How could this happen?$"
gBwText_221_10:
	.string "Cheren: Why? That was that guy N,\nright? Why was he with the legendary\lPokémon?\pHe couldn't really be the hero,\ncould he?!\pAlso, did I hear him tell you to search\nfor the other legendary Pokémon?$"
gBwText_221_11:
	.string "Brycen: Calm down! First, we go back!\pIt's more important to decide what to\ndo next than analyze what just\lhappened.$"
gBwText_221_12:
	.string "Preeeeaah!$"
gBwText_221_13:
	.string "Reshiram went flying off somewhere...$"
gBwText_221_14:
	.string "Bazzazzazzash!$"
gBwText_221_15:
	.string "Zekrom went flying off somewhere...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_221
