gBwText_222_0:
	.string "Listen. You can slide down the cliffs\nhere! Watch me!$"
gBwText_222_1:
	.string "Now, you try it!$"
gBwText_222_2:
	.string "You can slide down the cliffs here at\nVictory Road!\pIt takes some nerve the first time, but\nit's fun!$"
gBwText_222_3:
	.string "Aiiieee! That's a long way down!\nI can't do it!$"
gBwText_222_4:
	.string "Aiiieee! That's a long way down!\nI can't do it!$"
gBwText_222_5:
	.string "It looks like there's an item\ndown there...\pBut it's such a long way!\nDo you have the courage?$"
	.align 2
