gBwText_236_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, it's difficult,\nisn't it?\pWhen you confront yourself, you have\nto notice things about yourself that\laren't too flattering...$"
gBwText_236_1:
	.string "???: Of course! And no one can get away\nfrom themselves.$"
gBwText_236_2:
	.string "Cheren: ...Marshal?$"
gBwText_236_3:
	.string "Marshal: My mentor told me you were\nhere, so I came to see.\pListen. Even if you lose in battle, if\nyou surpass what you've done before,\lyou have bested yourself.\pTake the opportunity of a battle to\nlook at your opponent,\llook at the Pokémon involved,\land look at yourself!$"
gBwText_236_4:
	.string "Cheren: Are those Alder's words?$"
gBwText_236_5:
	.string "Marshal: Maybe. But I'm borrowing them.\pWhat I want are battles with Trainers\nwho believe in themselves like that...\pWhen I mix it up with a Trainer like\nthat, both my Pokémon and I\lget even stronger.\pWell then, I'll be waiting for your\nchallenge in the Pokémon League.$"
gBwText_236_6:
	.string "Cheren: I guess that's that.\pOK, {STR_VAR_1}!\nAccept this Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_236_7:
	.string "Cheren: I'll keep battling many\nTrainers and Pokémon like this, and if I\lcan learn what kind of person I am, it\lwill open up my path.\pI'm sure this path will lead me to\nbecome the person I'm meant to be.\pPokémon will always be with you and me\nas we go down our own paths.\pOur important friends, Pokémon...$"
gBwText_236_8:
	.string "Cheren: Oh, you showed up, {STR_VAR_1}.\pIn order to surpass myself up to this\npoint, and to beat a purely strong\lPokémon Trainer such as yourself, I'm\lchallenging you to a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_236_9:
	.string "Cheren: I'll keep battling many\nTrainers and Pokémon like this, and if I\lcan learn what kind of person I am, it\lwill open up my path.\pI'm sure this path will lead me to\nbecome the person I'm meant to be.\pPokémon will always be with you and me\nas we go down our own paths.\pOur important friends, Pokémon...$"
	.align 2
