gBwText_243_0:
	.string "Do you want to go back to Castelia\nCity?$"
gBwText_243_1:
	.string "We are just about to leave, so please\nget on board and wait a moment.$"
gBwText_243_2:
	.string "Just come talk to me when you want\nto return to Castelia City!$"
gBwText_243_3:
	.string "That Team Plasma...\pThey sure do terrible things!$"
gBwText_243_4:
	.string "The smell of the ocean is so soothing!$"
gBwText_243_5:
	.string "Waaah! I'm scared!$"
gBwText_243_6:
	.string "You sure took care of\nthose bad guys, mister!$"
gBwText_243_7:
	.string "You sure took care of\nthose bad guys, miss!$"
gBwText_243_8:
	.string "Making my grandchild cry!\pIf they are underestimating me because\nI'm old... Grrr!$"
gBwText_243_9:
	.string "Thank you very much for\nsaving my grandchild.$"
gBwText_243_10:
	.string "Shut your trap!\pIf you stay here quietly,\nwe won't be rough.$"
gBwText_243_11:
	.string "What do they hope to accomplish\nby occupying the island?\lWhat a sketchy group!$"
gBwText_243_12:
	.string "If I had known this island's secret\nearlier, I would've...\pWhat? No! Nothing!\nJust talking to myself!$"
gBwText_243_13:
	.string "What are they doing in this little\nmemorial park? There's nothing here\lbut an old lighthouse...$"
gBwText_243_14:
	.string "Too many people use Pokémon\nfor bad deeds!$"
gBwText_243_15:
	.string "This officer's Pokémon couldn't stand\nup to them! That blasted Team Plasma!$"
gBwText_243_16:
	.string "I'm really glad a strong Trainer\nlike you is around!$"
gBwText_243_17:
	.string "Recently, I've been bored because\nthe number of tourists has decreased.$"
gBwText_243_18:
	.string "Two hundred years ago, an ultra-rich\nfamily bought this island and named it\lLiberty Garden.\pIt's a place where people and Pokémon\ncould live freely.$"
gBwText_243_19:
	.string "Dock 2\nTo board the tour boat, go to Dock 1.$"
gBwText_243_20:
	.string "This lighthouse shines with the light\nof freedom.\pOnly authorized personnel may enter.$"
gBwText_243_21:
	.string "My fellow officers rushed here by\npolice boat!\pThanks to them, we rounded up\nthese baddies!$"
gBwText_243_22:
	.string "How's that Pokémon doing?\pThe island sure has been quiet since\nthat incident.$"
gBwText_243_23:
	.string "Team Plasma forever!$"
gBwText_243_24:
	.string "We won't give up!$"
gBwText_243_25:
	.string "You're irredeemable!$"
gBwText_243_26:
	.string "Get moving!$"
gBwText_243_27:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Thanks to you,\n{STR_VAR_1}, this group that was\lup to no good has been captured!$"
gBwText_243_28:
	.string "Victini is a mythical Pokémon that is\nsaid to radiate energy from its body...\pWhen Pokémon or people come into\ncontact with that energy, it fills up\ltheir bodies, and they exhibit more\lpower than usual.\pThat's why there was no end to the\npeople who wanted to use Victini for\ltheir own evil ends...\pI'm sure the rich person who built this\nunderground room for Victini was\lsincerely trying to help it.\pBut I think shutting the poor thing up\nin this room was a mistake.\pThanks to you, Victini has a new destiny\nthat does not involve being used in\lTeam Plasma's schemes.\pMaking sure no one misuses Victini's\npowers is now your duty!$"
gBwText_243_29:
	.string "Also...\pIn the Unova Pokédex, Victini was\nassigned a special number: zero.\pI've heard the special number was\nassigned in the hope that Victini's\lpower to bring victory would be shared\lwith the Trainer who travels with this\lPokédex...$"
gBwText_243_30:
	.string "Professor Juniper!\pWe cornered the crooks with our\nhigh-speed police boat!\pWe will return to Castelia City!\nPlease come on board, too!$"
gBwText_243_31:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Thank you!\nI'll be right there!$"
gBwText_243_32:
	.string "I can't believe it when people are led\nastray by Pokémon's astounding\labilities and try to misuse them...\pBut it's only when we face Pokémon with\na good heart that we can make a\lbrighter future!$"
gBwText_243_33:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_243
