gBwText_244_0:
	.string "It makes me feel better knowing\nthere's a strong Trainer like you!\pWould you like me to help\nby healing your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_244_1:
	.string "Please stop Team Plasma's tyranny!$"
gBwText_244_2:
	.string "When your Pokémon are hurt in\nbattle, let me know!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_244
gBwTextTable_244:
	.4byte gBwText_244_0
	.4byte gBwText_244_1
	.4byte gBwText_244_2
	.global gBwTextCount_244
gBwTextCount_244:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_245_0:
	.string "The one who obtains this Pokémon is\nsaid to be victorious in any type of\lcompetition...\pWe can obtain a power that would make\nus invincible!\pThat is the value of this mythical\nPokémon, Victini!$"
gBwText_245_1:
	.string "This is a secret room meant\nto hide Victini!\pTwo hundred years ago, a certain rich\nperson bought this entire island and\lhid Victini in this underground room.\pAfter that, no one saw Victini, and it\nbecame a mythical Pokémon...$"
gBwText_245_2:
	.string "We, Team Plasma, will liberate Victini\nfrom this room and use its powers to\lmake our goal a reality!\pWe won't let a brat like you get in\nour way!$"
gBwText_245_3:
	.string "It looks like I underestimated\nyour strength.\pBut Victini won't be so simple!\nLook!$"
gBwText_245_4:
	.string "Looks like it's waiting to test your\nstrength. You'd better get ready!$"
gBwText_245_5:
	.string "Living with Victini means accepting\nVictini's cruel destiny...\pSomeday we will test you to see if you\nare truly ready for that.$"
gBwText_245_6:
	.string "Victini is still close by and watching\nyour movements...\pIf you exit this room and come back, it\nmight return...$"
gBwText_245_7:
	.string "Ta-ta-ta-tah!$"
gBwText_245_8:
	.string "Victini vanished from the\nunderground room...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_245
