gBwText_247_0:
	.string "Oh, it's just a kid...$"
gBwText_247_1:
	.string "You... It couldn't be...\pThe fact that you are here means you\ncame to learn about the secret\lof Genesect!$"
gBwText_247_2:
	.string "We, Team Plasma, revived Genesect from\na Fossil.\pThen we enhanced the Pokémon with the\npower of science!$"
gBwText_247_3:
	.string "It is the strongest Pokémon in\nhistory!!$"
gBwText_247_4:
	.string "But, our lord N was not interested in\nthis Genesect that was modified by the\lpower of science!$"
gBwText_247_5:
	.string "“Science damages the natural beauty\nof Pokémon! They're perfect beings!“$"
gBwText_247_6:
	.string "That's what he said...\pSo our research was halted, and this\nfacility was closed...$"
gBwText_247_7:
	.string "However!!\nThe Genesect research is all mine!\pSo if you want to know Genesect's\nsecret, you'll have to beat me in\lbattle!$"
gBwText_247_8:
	.string "Battle the Scientist?$"
gBwText_247_9:
	.string "I've lost everything...\pI forgot my duty as a Scientist is\nto make the world happy.\pSo, this must be what I get for trying\nto make a Pokémon into a tool for\lfighting...$"
gBwText_247_10:
	.string "I'm going to wash my hands of this\nGenesect matter...\pI don't need this anymore...\nI'll give it to you.$"
gBwText_247_11:
	.string "There was another one in my\nother pocket...$"
gBwText_247_12:
	.string "The item I just gave you was made\nfor Genesect.\pWhen it holds an item like this, it\nchanges the type of the move called\lTechno Blast, so it can always have\lan advantage.$"
gBwText_247_13:
	.string "There sure are some very cowardly\nTrainers, aren't there!$"
gBwText_247_14:
	.string "So you want to battle me?!$"
gBwText_247_15:
	.string "I've given you all of the Drives.\nUse them how you wish...$"
gBwText_247_16:
	.string "There is a memo stuck to the\nside of the monitor.\pRead it?$"
gBwText_247_17:
	.string "My lord N apparently rejected\nmy research...\pBut my research is necessary for\nTeam Plasma to reach its goal...\lThe strongest Pokémon...\pThe rest of the memo is torn and\nimpossible to read.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_247
