gBwText_267_0:
	.string "Hello! If you cross the Skyarrow Bridge\nfrom here, you'll reach Castelia City.$"
gBwText_267_1:
	.string "In battles, striking first is essential!\nSo, here!$"
gBwText_267_2:
	.string "If you give it to a Pokémon to hold,\nmaybe it will let that Pokémon use its\lmove before its opponent can.\pThat's what I gave you.\nIt's called Quick Claw!$"
gBwText_267_3:
	.string "There are people who are obsessed with\ncertain items.\pThey'll even buy your items for a lot\nof money!\pYou might even be able to sell items you\ncan't use to these people, so maybe you\lshould hang on to them.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_267
