	.4byte 9
gBwText_269_0:
	.string "Sometimes, above the bridge, you can\nsee the shadows of bird Pokémon, right?\pTheir feathers drift to the ground\nhere!\pAnd when you try to pick them up,\noccasionally, you'll run into a Pokémon.$"
gBwText_269_1:
	.string "When a ship passes, the bridge raises\nand lowers.\pBut Clay controls when the ships run\nfrom the start, so when the bridge\lraises and lowers is up to Clay.$"
gBwText_269_2:
	.string "When Driftveil is mentioned, what comes\nto mind is the Cold Storage...\land Charles!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_269
gBwTextTable_269:
	.4byte gBwText_269_0
	.4byte gBwText_269_1
	.4byte gBwText_269_2
	.global gBwTextCount_269
gBwTextCount_269:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_270_0:
	.string "...\p...Come.$"
gBwText_270_1:
	.string "...\pGhetsis. We brought the one you wanted.$"
gBwText_270_2:
	.string "Ghetsis: Excellent. It seems that\nyou have obtained the Dark Stone.\pI congratulate you on a job well done.$"
gBwText_270_3:
	.string "Ghetsis: Excellent. It seems that\nyou have obtained the Light Stone.\pI congratulate you on a job well done.$"
gBwText_270_4:
	.string "It is my lord N's thought that the two\nholders of the legendary Pokémon\lshould put their beliefs on the line and\lstrive to find which is the true hero.$"
gBwText_270_5:
	.string "This is not necessary, however.\pFrom his infancy, I provided him with\nthe education required to become the\lhero of legend. Indeed, he has been so\lacknowledged by the legendary Pokémon.\p...Such purity of purpose is his.$"
gBwText_270_6:
	.string "The liberation of Pokémon of which I...\nOf which Team Plasma speaks is the\lseparation of Pokémon from foolish\lpeople!\pThat's the truth! All Trainers will\nbecome helpless to resist us!\pWe alone will be able to use Pokémon!$"
gBwText_270_7:
	.string "The preparations are complete!\pWhen my perfect plan is set in motion,\nfirst a few gullible Pokémon Trainers\lwho are unable to resist Team Plasma\lwill release their Pokémon.\pThen that number will become a hundred,\nthen a thousand...\pIn no time, even the Gym Leaders and\nthe Champion will become unable to\lfight us.\pHaving a Pokémon will be considered\na bad thing!\pEven people like the sad little Bianca,\nwhose Pokémon was stolen in Castelia,\lwill be unable to face public opinion\land will release their Pokémon!\pThat's the kind of world we'll make!$"
gBwText_270_8:
	.string "You may have the Stone, but there's no\nchance whatsoever that the legendary\lPokémon will accept you as the hero.\pSo, if you're not willing to hand over\nyour precious Pokémon, I suggest you\lsearch for some courage--\lbecause you're going to need it!$"
gBwText_270_9:
	.string "When I was running around trying\nto outrun the trains,\lI got overheated. Phew!\pAnyway, please take this!$"
gBwText_270_10:
	.string "This TM contains Flame Charge!\nIf the move lands, the user's Speed\lgoes up! You'll blow by everyone!$"
gBwText_270_11:
	.string "Hey, you!\pIt's just my opinion, but it's best if\nyou avoid this area on weekend\levenings.\pThe brats who live around here\noften get up to something stupid.$"
gBwText_270_12:
	.string "Hey! Who said ya can pass through here?\pWhen Friday night rolls around, this\nplace belongs to us, the Black\l{STR_VAR_1}! It's like our Gym, kid!\pSo scram! Toddle off home to your ma, ya\nperfect little goody-two-shoes punk!$"
gBwText_270_13:
	.string "What didja say, ya little creep?\pI'll teach ya to take the Black\n{STR_VAR_1} seriously!\pI'll pummel your pretty Pokémon\nright down to the ground! With relish!$"
gBwText_270_14:
	.string "Ha! Fine!\nBrats like you with a future so bright...\pJust go on back home and be nice to\nyour parents. Don't forget your baby\lbottle!$"
gBwText_270_15:
	.string "Ha! Fine!\nBrats like you with a future so bright...\pJust go on back home and be nice to\nyour parents. Don't forget your baby\lbottle!$"
gBwText_270_16:
	.string "Don't get all high and mighty because\nyou beat me!\pIf you really want to pick a fight with\nthe Black {STR_VAR_1},\lgo duke it out with our leader!\lHe's somewhere on this bridge!$"
gBwText_270_17:
	.string "Don't get all feeling good because\nyou beat me!\pIf you really want to start a fight\nwith the Black {STR_VAR_1},\lgo duke it out with our leader!\lHe's somewhere on this bridge!$"
gBwText_270_18:
	.string "Hey! Yeah, you, the little brat there!\nGet over here!$"
gBwText_270_19:
	.string "What do you think you're up to, brat?\pThis is the Black {STR_VAR_1}'s\nultimate paradise...\pA little pest like you has no\nbusiness here...\pIt couldn't be that you think you can\nstand up to me, the head of the\lBlack {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_270_20:
	.string "Gwa ha ha ha! Bring it!\nYou've got your share of guts, kid!\pI'll show you what the guy who holds\nthe Black {STR_VAR_1} together can\lreally do!$"
gBwText_270_21:
	.string "That all you got?\nNah, you got one option left--get lost!\pThis is our place, the Black {STR_VAR_1}.\pWe got no place else to go, and we\ndon't want nobody gettin' in our way.$"
gBwText_270_22:
	.string "You ain't half bad, kid...\nI like ya.\pGet a load of this... \pFrom now on, our team's name is gonna\nbe the Black {STR_VAR_1}!\pYeah! We're taking the name of\nyour rough-and-tough Pokémon!\pIt's a wilder name for a wilder team!\pThe Black {STR_VAR_1}!\nGwa ha ha ha! That's awesome!$"
gBwText_270_23:
	.string "The Black {STR_VAR_1}!\nSpeed's our only friend!$"
gBwText_270_24:
	.string "The Black {STR_VAR_1}!\nAt a breakneck pace until dawn breaks!$"
gBwText_270_25:
	.string "The Black {STR_VAR_1}!\nNever stop, and never look back!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_270
