gBwText_271_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_3:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_6:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_8:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_11:
	.string "My favorite thing to do nowadays\nis walking under the bridge!$"
gBwText_271_12:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_13:
	.string "During the day, I sunbathe.\nDuring the night, I moonbathe...\lNature sinks into my body.$"
gBwText_271_14:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_15:
	.string "I will cross all the bridges in Unova!$"
gBwText_271_16:
	.string "$"
gBwText_271_17:
	.string "Derleth: Fweet fweet...\nFweeeeeet fweet fweet...$"
gBwText_271_18:
	.string "Derleth: What is piercing my mind is\na sad sound.\pWhat is piercing my heart is\na cold night wind.$"
gBwText_271_19:
	.string "Derleth: Fwee... Fwee...\nFffweeet fweet...$"
gBwText_271_20:
	.string "Derleth: The only things that come out\nof my mouth are my whistle tunes and\lcomplaints about my life.\pThis bridge is a meeting place for\npeople like me who like to complain.$"
gBwText_271_21:
	.string "Aickman: How about this? This sound!\nDoesn't it get to your heart? Your\lmind?$"
gBwText_271_22:
	.string "Aickman: I know my sound doesn't fit\nthis city, this town.\pBut I... I cannot change\nmy life, my style.$"
gBwText_271_23:
	.string "Aickman: This is my best friend, my pal.\nIt knows all my sorrow, all my tears.$"
gBwText_271_24:
	.string "Aickman: Y-you have great sparkles...\nSparkles in your eyes.\pPlease make our hopes, our dreams,\ncome true for us.\pGo grab the glory--go take on the\nworld!$"
gBwText_271_25:
	.string "Russo: La la la la la...$"
gBwText_271_26:
	.string "Russo: Ahem, ahem!\nNow, something's not quite right.\pThis here microphone's all screwy.\nI can sing real good, promise!$"
gBwText_271_27:
	.string "Russo: Testing...\nCheck one, check two, check, check, yup.$"
gBwText_271_28:
	.string "Russo: Now, you're the first person in\nan awful long time who's hung around to\llisten and hear what I was singin'\labout.\pMuch obliged!$"
gBwText_271_29:
	.string "Koontz: Singing gives life to my spirit.\nWill you listen to the voice of my\lspirit?$"
gBwText_271_30:
	.string "Koontz: Huh? Are you leaving already?\nI am always here.$"
gBwText_271_31:
	.string "Koontz: Oh, you want to listen to my\nsong after all! Yes!$"
gBwText_271_32:
	.string "Koontz: My song...\nDon't you like it?$"
gBwText_271_33:
	.string "Welcome!\pThank you for making a reservation\nfor a battle!$"
gBwText_271_34:
	.string "You are great!\nI want to hire you.\pWhat do you think?\nWill you work here as a Waitress?$"
gBwText_271_35:
	.string "You are great!\nI want to hire you.\pWhat do you think?\nWill you work here as a Waiter?$"
gBwText_271_36:
	.string "You should work here! What do you\nthink?$"
gBwText_271_37:
	.string "Aww... That's too bad, but I understand!$"
gBwText_271_38:
	.string "That's great! I'm so glad!\pThat said, do you already know\nwhat you'll be doing?$"
gBwText_271_39:
	.string "This shop is a special sandwich shop.\nYou'll take orders from customers.\pThen, I'll make sandwiches to fill\ntheir orders.$"
gBwText_271_40:
	.string "You'll serve the sandwiches to the\ncustomers who ordered them.\pPlease be careful, and don't serve them\nto the wrong customers!$"
gBwText_271_41:
	.string "Thank you! I hope you'll do a great job!$"
gBwText_271_42:
	.string "Thank you! I hope you'll do a great job!$"
gBwText_271_43:
	.string "What kind of sandwich does customer\nnumber {STR_VAR_1} want?$"
gBwText_271_44:
	.string "Well done! Thank you! Give me a second\nto make the sandwiches.$"
gBwText_271_45:
	.string "The sandwiches are ready! Please\nserve them to the correct customers.$"
gBwText_271_46:
	.string "I think you missed a couple of people.\nPlease take everyone's order!$"
gBwText_271_47:
	.string "Let me give you a review!\nYour work was...\pPerfect! The customers seem to\nbe satisfied, too.$"
gBwText_271_48:
	.string "I have a review for you.\nYour work was...\pWell, you still need some practice.\nBut you'll get used to it soon!$"
gBwText_271_49:
	.string "This is a thank-you gift.\nYou've worked really hard!$"
gBwText_271_50:
	.string "That's it for today. I would be happy if\nyou could come back again tomorrow!$"
gBwText_271_51:
	.string "You're quitting? Well, that's OK.\nToday is not busy, so it should be fine.$"
gBwText_271_52:
	.string "Oh! You're leaving the park. Are you\ngoing to quit your Waitress job?$"
gBwText_271_53:
	.string "Oh! You're leaving the park.\nAre you going to quit your Waiter job?$"
gBwText_271_54:
	.string "I'd like a {STR_VAR_1} sandwich.\nThat's my Pokémon's favorite!$"
gBwText_271_55:
	.string "You can eat here with your Pokémon.\nIt's a really good sandwich shop!$"
gBwText_271_56:
	.string "Munch, munch...yummy!\nMy Pokémon is also happy.$"
gBwText_271_57:
	.string "Munch, munch...? Hmmm.\nIt tastes a little different this time...$"
gBwText_271_58:
	.string "We're really hungry today. So, a large\n{STR_VAR_1} sandwich, please!$"
gBwText_271_59:
	.string "My Pokémon has a big appetite,\njust like me!$"
gBwText_271_60:
	.string "Gobble, gobble...delicious!\nThis is the highlight of my day!$"
gBwText_271_61:
	.string "Gobble, gobble...delicious! But I don't\nthink this is what I ordered...$"
gBwText_271_62:
	.string "My Pokémon has gourmet tastes.\nI'd like a {STR_VAR_1} sandwich, please.$"
gBwText_271_63:
	.string "A Berry dish for people and Pokémon!\nThe chef can show off her skill with it.$"
gBwText_271_64:
	.string "Nibble, nibble...\nOh, the flavors are simply divine!$"
gBwText_271_65:
	.string "Nibble, nibble...\pOh dear. It's lovely, but this is not\nmy order.$"
gBwText_271_66:
	.string "Both my Pokémon and I are craving\na {STR_VAR_1} sandwich! Please!$"
gBwText_271_67:
	.string "I'm happy to be able to eat with\nmy Pokémon.$"
gBwText_271_68:
	.string "Munch, munch. Open wide.\nSo happy!$"
gBwText_271_69:
	.string "Munch, munch... Huh?\nIt tastes different.$"
gBwText_271_70:
	.string "Myu myuweee.$"
gBwText_271_71:
	.string "Skwee weep...$"
gBwText_271_72:
	.string "Pikaaaa!$"
gBwText_271_73:
	.string "Kroooko!$"
gBwText_271_74:
	.string "Cheri Berry$"
gBwText_271_75:
	.string "Persim Berry$"
gBwText_271_76:
	.string "Pecha Berry$"
gBwText_271_77:
	.string "Chesto Berry$"
gBwText_271_78:
	.string "Will you serve the {STR_VAR_1} sandwich\nto this customer?$"
gBwText_271_79:
	.string "Village Bridge$"
gBwText_271_80:
	.string "Village Bridge Restaurant\nVillage Sandwiches are our specialty!$"
