gBwText_272_0:
	.string "Wahaha. Isn't this a beautiful bridge?\pThis old bridge was built when my\ngreat-great-great-grandfather\lwas around.$"
gBwText_272_1:
	.string "My grandpa is a stonecutter for\nVillage Bridge!$"
gBwText_272_2:
	.string "Isn't this a unique sort of bridge?\pA long time ago, the river overflowed,\nand all the houses were washed away.\pSo people built new houses on top of\nthe bridge to keep them safe from\lflooding! It's a simple solution, but\lit's genius!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_272
