gBwText_275_0:
	.string "Soda Pop tastes even better\nwhen I drink it on the bridge.\lSo I often share one with Krokorok.$"
gBwText_275_1:
	.string "The uneven hills of Route 12 are great\nfor Pokéathlon training!\pThe Pokéathlon is a very popular\ncompetition in Johto, where I come\lfrom!$"
gBwText_275_2:
	.string "Buuuurp!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_275
