gBwText_279_0:
	.string "...\n...You, huh.$"
gBwText_279_1:
	.string "Ghetsis is gone.\pHe went off somewhere alone\nafter we rescued him from the castle.$"
gBwText_279_2:
	.string "From the day Ghetsis saved our lives,\nwe have sworn to be loyal to him.\pEven now, after he ordered\nus not to search for him.$"
gBwText_279_3:
	.string "Also, Ghetsis said to give you this...$"
gBwText_279_4:
	.string "As well as this...$"
gBwText_279_5:
	.string "And this, also.$"
gBwText_279_6:
	.string "Ghetsis...\nWhere did he find these?\lWhat was he planning to do with them?\lWhy did he give them to you?\lThere's no way to know now.\pIs he testing you?\nOr...using you?$"
gBwText_279_7:
	.string "We, the Shadow Triad, have always\nbeen and will always be the\lloyal servants of Ghetsis.\pAnd Ghetsis's ambitions will never\ncease!$"
gBwText_279_8:
	.string "Never shall we meet again.\pFarewell!$"
gBwText_279_9:
	.string "Will you come see the famous Patrat\nshow at Marvelous Bridge?$"
gBwText_279_10:
	.string "OK!\nI'm going to get all fired up!$"
gBwText_279_11:
	.string "Oh... I'm confident you will be greatly\nentertained, so come again sometime!$"
gBwText_279_12:
	.string "Ready all Patrat!\nEveryone gather up!$"
gBwText_279_13:
	.string "The Patrat that I will have you\nfollow today is...$"
gBwText_279_14:
	.string "This--the li'l Patrat with\nthe brightest smile!\pIt's holding a {STR_VAR_1}!\nReady, set, go!$"
gBwText_279_15:
	.string "This--the li'l Patrat with the\ncutest dimples!\pIt's holding a {STR_VAR_1}!\nReady, set, go!$"
gBwText_279_16:
	.string "This--the li'l Patrat with the\ntrendiest eyebrows!\pIt's holding a {STR_VAR_1}!\nReady, set, go!$"
gBwText_279_17:
	.string "This--the li'l Patrat with the\nbiggest belly!\pIt's holding a {STR_VAR_1}!\nReady, set, go!$"
gBwText_279_18:
	.string "OK! Find the Patrat that\nI asked you to follow!$"
gBwText_279_19:
	.string "That Patrat is holding\na {STR_VAR_1}, right?$"
gBwText_279_20:
	.string "You are...\n...\l...\l...\ltotally correct!\pReceive your prize, a {STR_VAR_1},\nfrom that Patrat!$"
gBwText_279_21:
	.string "You are...\n...\l...\l...\linconceivably incorrect! I'm sorry...$"
gBwText_279_22:
	.string "That marks the grand finale of\nour Patrat show!\lThank you, one and all!$"
gBwText_279_23:
	.string "You want to see the Patrat again?\pThere are a lot of preparations and\nsuch to make, so come back tomorrow!$"
gBwText_279_24:
	.string "Skreeet?$"
gBwText_279_25:
	.string "Man: Son!\nI have a deal for YOU! And for you alone.\pHere's your chance. I will sell you the\nsecret Pokémon Magikarp...\lFor an unbelievable $500!\pHow about it? Interested?$"
gBwText_279_26:
	.string "Man: Miss!\nI have a deal for YOU! And for you alone.\pHere's your chance. I will sell you the\nsecret Pokémon Magikarp...\lFor an unbelievable $500!\pHow about it? Interested?$"
gBwText_279_27:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} bought the Magikarp\nfor $500.$"
gBwText_279_28:
	.string "Would you like to give a\nnickname to this Magikarp?$"
gBwText_279_29:
	.string "Looks like you don't have enough\nmoney.$"
gBwText_279_30:
	.string "You have no room in your party!$"
gBwText_279_31:
	.string "Oh, that's too bad...$"
gBwText_279_32:
	.string "Man: Oh, yeah...\nReturns not accepted, got that?$"
gBwText_279_33:
	.string "Ahh...\nSuch magnificent scenery...$"
gBwText_279_34:
	.string "Huh... Wha...\nD-did she just disappear?$"
