gBwText_281_0:
	.string "How is your Pokédex coming along?\nCan I see it?$"
gBwText_281_1:
	.string "Let me see...\pOh, you've seen {STR_VAR_1} Pokémon in\nthe Unova region!$"
gBwText_281_2:
	.string "Let me see...\pOh, you've caught {STR_VAR_1} Pokémon\nin the Unova region!$"
gBwText_281_3:
	.string "This Pokédex is full of memories from\nyour journey. It's a treasure you can\lcherish for your entire life.$"
gBwText_281_4:
	.string "If you want to meet more Pokémon, you\nshould try walking through tall grass!$"
gBwText_281_5:
	.string "It seems a little more like a Pokédex\nnow! You're getting off to a good\lstart!$"
gBwText_281_6:
	.string "Some Pokémon are hard to find, but\ndon't give up! Keep checking the tall\lgrass.$"
gBwText_281_7:
	.string "Some Pokémon are only found in\ncertain caves!\pYou might want to go back and search\ncaves you've already passed through.$"
gBwText_281_8:
	.string "Trainers have a lot of different\nPokémon.\pSo battling them is a great way to fill\nup your Pokédex, too!$"
gBwText_281_9:
	.string "Wow, it's getting really full!\pI'm sure looking over your Pokédex will\nbring back memories of your journey.$"
gBwText_281_10:
	.string "Over 100 Pokémon...\pIt's so much fun looking over all their\ndifferent characteristics!$"
gBwText_281_11:
	.string "That is an excellent Pokédex!\nJust a little more and it will be full!$"
gBwText_281_12:
	.string "What a wonderful Pokédex! A little more\nwork, and it'll be complete!\pI'm really glad I asked you to do this!$"
gBwText_281_13:
	.string "Amazing! Truly amazing!\pYou've met all of the Pokémon in the\nUnova region!\pCongratulations!\pNow here's your next challenge: see how\nmany of those Pokémon you can catch!\lI'll keep evaluating for you!$"
gBwText_281_14:
	.string "It seems like you are meeting Pokémon\nat a good clip!\pI have something I want to give you!\nPlease come to the lab when you can.$"
gBwText_281_15:
	.string "It seems like you are meeting Pokémon\nat a good clip!\pHere! This is a gift to thank you for all\nyour hard work!$"
gBwText_281_16:
	.string "False Swipe is a move that is very\nhelpful for catching Pokémon, because\lit keeps the target from fainting!$"
gBwText_281_17:
	.string "Protect is a move that completely\nprevents an attack from hitting!\pWell, there are a few exceptions. Some\nmoves, like Feint, can still hit even if\lProtect is used.$"
gBwText_281_18:
	.string "Hidden Power is a mysterious move. Its\ntype and power change depending on the\lPokémon that learns it!$"
gBwText_281_19:
	.string "Try using this, too!$"
gBwText_281_20:
	.string "Keep up the good work!$"
gBwText_281_21:
	.string "Little by little, more detailed\ninformation is being entered into the\lPokédex! Do your best!$"
gBwText_281_22:
	.string "Are you trying out different kinds of\nPoké Balls for your captures?\pThey come in lots of varieties, so be\nsure to use the right one at the right\ltime!$"
gBwText_281_23:
	.string "If you read the Pokédex descriptions,\nyou can learn a lot of unexpected facts\labout Pokémon! It's fun!$"
gBwText_281_24:
	.string "Evolving Pokémon is another important\nway to fill up your Pokédex. It's not\ljust about catching them!$"
gBwText_281_25:
	.string "Trading Pokémon with friends also\ncounts as catching them!$"
gBwText_281_26:
	.string "When you've met this many Pokémon, do\nyou have trouble picking which ones to\ltravel with?$"
gBwText_281_27:
	.string "This is a very thorough Pokédex.\nIt will help my research, too!$"
gBwText_281_28:
	.string "You've caught so many Pokémon.\nYou might know more than me now!\pI'm rooting for you to complete\nyour Pokédex!$"
gBwText_281_29:
	.string "With just a little more effort, you will\ncomplete a perfect Pokédex!\lYou've come this far, so do your best!$"
gBwText_281_30:
	.string "Amazing! Absolutely amazing!\pYou've caught every Pokémon\nin the Unova region!\pCongratulations!!$"
gBwText_281_31:
	.string "So you're here to show me how your\nPokédex is coming along, right?$"
gBwText_281_32:
	.string "I see!\pYou've caught {STR_VAR_1} Pokémon,\nthen...$"
gBwText_281_33:
	.string "Oh, really...\pIf you want me to have a look at\nyour Pokédex, come here again!$"
gBwText_281_34:
	.string "Nationally, there are more than\n600 Pokémon!\pYou'll have to be persistent and\ncatch them at your own pace.$"
gBwText_281_35:
	.string "First, you might want to revisit places\nyou've already been.\pRetrace your steps in the Unova region\nand see what new Pokémon turn up!$"
gBwText_281_36:
	.string "Remember Rule No. 1! To catch a Pokémon,\nyou first have to reduce its HP.\pYou're pretty good at this now,\nbut don't forget the basics!$"
gBwText_281_37:
	.string "Are you going to the Day Care?\pI've heard that some Pokémon can only\nbe caught if they are hatched from\lEggs.$"
gBwText_281_38:
	.string "Do you have a fishing rod?\pThere are many Pokémon that live in the\nwater. Try searching rivers and oceans!$"
gBwText_281_39:
	.string "Do you know the move False Swipe?\pFalse Swipe always leaves a tiny bit of\nthe targeted Pokémon's HP.\pIt's great for catching, because it\ndoesn't make them faint!$"
gBwText_281_40:
	.string "Do you know the move Mean Look?\pIf you use Mean Look on a Pokémon,\nit can't run away!$"
gBwText_281_41:
	.string "There are several ways for Pokémon to\nevolve. Some Pokémon even evolve\lthrough friendship!$"
gBwText_281_42:
	.string "Have you heard of mass outbreaks?\pBig groups of Pokémon appear during a\nmass outbreak. It's a great chance to\lcatch them!$"
gBwText_281_43:
	.string "You've caught more than 400\ndifferent Pokémon?!\pThat's incredible!\nYou're an amazing Trainer!$"
gBwText_281_44:
	.string "Apparently, some Pokémon\nevolve when they are leveled up\lin a certain area.$"
gBwText_281_45:
	.string "You've caught 500 different Pokémon...\pMy, the variation of these beings called\nPokémon certainly is surprising!\pAnd the fact that you've caught so\nmany different kinds... That's pretty\lsurprising, too!$"
gBwText_281_46:
	.string "Have you been to the Poké Transfer Lab\non Route 15?\pMastering a facility like that is an\naccomplishment for a Pokémon Trainer.$"
gBwText_281_47:
	.string "Just a little more until you complete\nyour Pokédex, huh?\pCatching this many Pokémon must mean...\nYou really like Pokémon, don't you!$"
gBwText_281_48:
	.string "Oh! That's a wonderful Pokédex.\pHow about it? Would you research\nPokémon with me?$"
gBwText_281_49:
	.string "Oh! Just a little more until your\nPokédex is complete!\pMake sure you go after the roaming\nPokémon and trade with friends to get\lthe ones you're missing!$"
gBwText_281_50:
	.string "...\n...\pThis blows me away! It's so wonderful,\nI'm at a loss for words.\pYou... You've accomplished something\ntruly outstanding.\pFilling up the National Pokédex makes\nyou a Trainer among Trainers!\pI'm so happy I was able to meet a\nfantastic Trainer like you! I thank you\lfrom the bottom of my heart.$"
