gBwText_282_0:
	.string "Pokémon Trades help you connect with\nthe world!\lThe world will be bigger!\pIf you trade Pokémon with many people,\nyou will be happy!\pBecause I will give you something good!\pSo, Trainer, have you traded Pokémon\nwith many people?$"
gBwText_282_1:
	.string "Hello, Trainer!\pHave you traded Pokémon with\nmany people?$"
gBwText_282_2:
	.string "Oh, wonderful.\pThen, let me check how many people you\nhave traded Pokémon with.$"
gBwText_282_3:
	.string "...$"
gBwText_282_4:
	.string "Please trade Pokémon with many people!\pI will give you a present if you do.\nBesides, it's fun!$"
gBwText_282_5:
	.string "You've traded Pokémon with\n{STR_VAR_1}? The world is bigger than\lthat!\pPlease trade with your friends or use\nthe Global Trade Station!$"
gBwText_282_6:
	.string "Zero? You haven't traded with\nanybody?! But the world is so big!\pPlease trade with your friends or use\nthe Global Trade Station!$"
gBwText_282_7:
	.string "Wow! You have traded with {STR_VAR_1}\npeople!$"
gBwText_282_8:
	.string "Wow! Great! You have traded with\n{STR_VAR_1} people!$"
gBwText_282_9:
	.string "Wow! Impressive! You have traded with\n{STR_VAR_1} people!$"
gBwText_282_10:
	.string "Wow! Ecstatic! You have traded with\n{STR_VAR_1} people!$"
gBwText_282_11:
	.string "Wow! Surprising! You have traded with\n{STR_VAR_1} people!$"
gBwText_282_12:
	.string "Wow! Wonderful! You have traded with at\nleast {STR_VAR_1} people!$"
gBwText_282_13:
	.string "Great!\nI will give this to you!$"
gBwText_282_14:
	.string "You are really great! I'm happy, so I\nwill give this to you, too!$"
gBwText_282_15:
	.string "What are the Pokémon that I traded\ndoing now?\pWhat are the people who traded with me\nthinking about now?\pThinking about those things\nmakes me happy!$"
