gBwText_284_0:
	.string "You can call me the Judge.\pHeh heh, that's actually not my real\nname, but it's what everyone calls me.\pIt's because of this weird power I\nhave. It's a gift, really.\pI can discern--judge, you might\nsay--the overall potential of\lindividual Pokémon.\pIf you'd like, I could judge the\nintriguing potential of your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_284_1:
	.string "If you'd like, I could judge the\nintriguing potential of your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_284_2:
	.string "...Oh?\nYou don't need me to judge. I get it.$"
gBwText_284_3:
	.string "Judge an Egg?!\nThat's a tall order even for me!$"
gBwText_284_4:
	.string "I see, I see...\pThis Pokémon's potential is\ndecent all around.\pThat's my determination, and it's final.$"
gBwText_284_5:
	.string "I see, I see...\pThis Pokémon's potential is\nabove average overall.\pThat's my determination, and it's final.$"
gBwText_284_6:
	.string "I see, I see...\pThis Pokémon has\nrelatively superior potential overall.\pThat's my determination, and it's final.$"
gBwText_284_7:
	.string "I see, I see...\pThis Pokémon has\noutstanding potential overall.\pThat's my determination, and it's final.$"
gBwText_284_8:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its HP.$"
gBwText_284_9:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its Attack stat.$"
gBwText_284_10:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its Defense stat.$"
gBwText_284_11:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its Sp. Atk stat.$"
gBwText_284_12:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its Sp. Def stat.$"
gBwText_284_13:
	.string "Incidentally, I would say the best\npotential lies in its Speed stat.$"
gBwText_284_14:
	.string "And its Attack stat\nis also good.$"
gBwText_284_15:
	.string "I see. Its Defense stat\nis also good.$"
gBwText_284_16:
	.string "Its Sp. Atk stat\nis equally good.$"
gBwText_284_17:
	.string "Its Sp. Def stat\nis good as well.$"
gBwText_284_18:
	.string "Well, its Speed stat\nis also good.$"
gBwText_284_19:
	.string "It's rather decent in that regard.\nThat's how I judged it.$"
gBwText_284_20:
	.string "It's very good in that regard.\nThat's how I judged it.$"
gBwText_284_21:
	.string "It's fantastic in that regard.\nThat's how I judged it.$"
gBwText_284_22:
	.string "It can't be better in that regard.\nThat's how I judged it.$"
	.align 2
