gBwText_286_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Musical!\pHere you can participate in\na musical alone.\pWould you like to participate?$"
gBwText_286_1:
	.string "Great! Please walk this way!$"
gBwText_286_2:
	.string "Please visit us again.$"
gBwText_286_3:
	.string "Which show would you like\nto participate in?$"
gBwText_286_4:
	.string "Please choose the Pokémon that\nwill participate.$"
gBwText_286_5:
	.string "Oh, {STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_1}...\pI'm so very moved, I'm at a loss\nfor words...$"
gBwText_286_6:
	.string "Your Pokémon gleamed like a superstar!\pI want to follow in your\nstylish footsteps!$"
gBwText_286_7:
	.string "I'll come watch again, {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat was so wonderful...\nIt may have changed my life.$"
gBwText_286_8:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! That musical was the\nbest ever!\pIt made me feel so energetic! Please\ncome back and perform for us again!$"
gBwText_286_9:
	.string "Oh, that performance was so inspiring!\pIt was so full of hopes and dreams! It\nmade me feel like I could climb\lmountains!$"
gBwText_286_10:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! Great show today!\pI'm moved no matter how many\ntimes I see your performance!$"
gBwText_286_11:
	.string "Everyone's talking about the musical\nat work, and it's all thanks to you!\pWe all love your innovative Dress Up.\nYou're like our fashion muse!$"
gBwText_286_12:
	.string "I'm so glad I got to see your Pokémon\non stage. I'm overwhelmed with emotion!\pI'm not exaggerating!$"
gBwText_286_13:
	.string "Your performance... Before I knew what\nwas happening, I was drawn into it.\pIt's almost as if it had some\nstrange power...$"
gBwText_286_14:
	.string "Your performances are so very artistic!\pIf an artist like me tells you so,\nthere's no mistaking it!$"
gBwText_286_15:
	.string "Oh, {STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_1}...\pI'm so very moved, I'm at a loss\nfor words...\pPlease take this Prop\nas a token of my feelings!$"
gBwText_286_16:
	.string "Your Pokémon gleamed like a superstar!\pI want to follow in your\nstylish footsteps!\pPerhaps this Prop can enhance\nyour brilliance!$"
gBwText_286_17:
	.string "I'll come watch again, {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat was so wonderful...\nIt may have changed my life.\pI hope you like this Prop...$"
gBwText_286_18:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! That musical was the\nbest ever!\pIt made me feel so energetic! Please\ncome back and perform for us again!\pHey, maybe you can use this Prop\nnext time!$"
gBwText_286_19:
	.string "Oh, that performance was so inspiring!\pIt was so full of hopes and dreams! It\nmade me feel like I could climb\lmountains!\pHere, this is for you. Thank you for\nthe inspiration!$"
gBwText_286_20:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! Great show today!\pI'm moved no matter how many\ntimes I see your performance!\pI'd love to see you use this on stage!$"
gBwText_286_21:
	.string "Everyone's talking about the musical\nat work, and it's all thanks to you!\pWe all love your innovative Dress Up.\nYou're like our fashion muse!\pMaybe you could work this Prop into one\nof your fabulous Dress Up designs!$"
gBwText_286_22:
	.string "I'm so glad I got to see your Pokémon\non stage. I'm overwhelmed with emotion!\pI'm not exaggerating!\pHere, please take this small token of\nmy appreciation.$"
gBwText_286_23:
	.string "Your performance... Before I knew what\nwas happening, I was drawn into it.\pIt's almost as if it had some\nstrange power...\pI charmed this so that it will be useful.$"
gBwText_286_24:
	.string "Your performances are so very artistic!\pIf an artist like me tells you so,\nthere's no mistaking it!\pHere's a new Prop to use in your art!$"
gBwText_286_25:
	.string "In fact, this person does not exist...$"
gBwText_286_26:
	.string "Received the {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_286_27:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} put the {STR_VAR_2}\nin the Prop Case!$"
gBwText_286_28:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} put the {STR_VAR_2}\nin the Prop Case!$"
gBwText_286_29:
	.string "Stardom$"
gBwText_286_30:
	.string "Forest Stroll$"
gBwText_286_31:
	.string "A Sweet Soirée$"
gBwText_286_32:
	.string "Exciting Nimbasa$"
gBwText_286_33:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_286_34:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_286_35:
	.string "Yes$"
gBwText_286_36:
	.string "No$"
gBwText_286_37:
	.string "Info$"
gBwText_286_38:
	.string "Become leader$"
gBwText_286_39:
	.string "Join group$"
gBwText_286_40:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_286_41:
	.string "$"
gBwText_286_42:
	.string "$"
gBwText_286_43:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Musical!\pHere you and your friends can\nperform together!\pWould you like to participate?$"
gBwText_286_44:
	.string "I'm sorry, but you don't have an\neligible Pokémon in your party.\pPlease come back again with\ndifferent Pokémon!$"
gBwText_286_45:
	.string "$"
gBwText_286_46:
	.string "Would you like to use\nInfrared Communication or\lDS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_286_47:
	.string "Infrared Communication$"
gBwText_286_48:
	.string "DS Wireless Communications$"
gBwText_286_49:
	.string "$"
gBwText_286_50:
	.string "Would you like to launch\nInfrared Communication and\lDS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_286_51:
	.string "One of you will become the leader.\nThat person will get to choose the show\lyou'll perform!\pThe other members should select\n“Join group.“$"
gBwText_286_52:
	.string "Launch DS Wireless Communications?$"
gBwText_286_53:
	.string "Thank you for waiting.\nThis way, please!$"
gBwText_286_54:
	.string "Participate in the musical?$"
gBwText_286_55:
	.string "$"
gBwText_286_56:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Musical!\pThis is a changing room for Dress Up\nonly. Would you like to Dress Up your\lPokémon?$"
gBwText_286_57:
	.string "This way, please!$"
gBwText_286_58:
	.string "Would you like to Dress Up your\nPokémon?$"
gBwText_286_59:
	.string "What would you like me to explain?$"
gBwText_286_60:
	.string "What's the Pokémon Musical?$"
gBwText_286_61:
	.string "The Pokémon Musical is a show where\nPokémon wearing Props perform on\lstage. Anyone can participate!\pWe encourage all Trainers to show the\nworld how charming their Pokémon are!\pThe audience is looking forward to\nseeing how you Dress Up your Pokémon,\land how your Pokémon perform!$"
gBwText_286_62:
	.string "How to Participate$"
gBwText_286_63:
	.string "You can join the musical from any of the\nthree reception areas.\pThe reception area in the center is for\nparticipating alone.\pWhen you participate alone, you will\nbe joined by other Trainers from around\lthe Unova region.\pIf you want to put on a musical with\nyour friends, go to the left reception\larea.\pYou'll be asked to pick a Leader who\nwill choose which show to perform,\land the others will join the group.\pThe reception area to the right is\nwhere you go to Dress Up only.$"
gBwText_286_64:
	.string "Eligible Pokémon$"
gBwText_286_65:
	.string "The Pokémon that will participate in\nthe musical are chosen from your party\lat the reception area.\pBecause of their shape, some Pokémon\nhave a hard time wearing certain Props.\pYou might want to try Dress Up in the\nchanging room first if you're worried!$"
gBwText_286_66:
	.string "Dress Up$"
gBwText_286_67:
	.string "Oh, Dress Up is my favorite part! That's\nwhere you put the Props you've\lcollected on the Pokémon that will be\lperforming.\pDepending on the Pokémon, you can put\nthe Props in different places.\pWhen you use Props that fit the theme\nof the show you've chosen, the\laudience will notice your Pokémon more!\pSometimes a Prop that doesn't fit the\ntheme will also make your Pokémon\lstand out.\pIf you want to get an idea of how it's\ndone, you can watch how other people\lDress Up and then try it yourself!$"
gBwText_286_68:
	.string "Shows$"
gBwText_286_69:
	.string "You can choose which show to perform\nwhen you participate in the musical.\pThere is no need for Trainers to give\ncommands, but if your Pokémon is\lcarrying a Prop in its arms, it can use\lthat Prop to show off and appeal to the\laudience.\pDepending on how you Dress Up your\nPokémon, the reactions from the\laudience will change!$"
	.align 2
