	.4byte 70
gBwText_287_0:
	.string "Those in accord with Fate are\npreserved, and those who rebel against\lFate perish.$"
gBwText_287_1:
	.string "When the Way is forgotten,\nduty and justice appear.$"
gBwText_287_2:
	.string "One can lose the forest for the trees.$"
gBwText_287_3:
	.string "If you make a mistake and do not\ncorrect it, that is a second mistake.$"
gBwText_287_4:
	.string "Superior men understand what is right.\nInferior men understand what will sell.$"
gBwText_287_5:
	.string "There are not two suns in the sky,\nnor two sovereigns over the people.$"
gBwText_287_6:
	.string "Well...\pIf anything should happen to our king,\nit would be disastrous.\pIt would ruin Ghetsis's perfect plan!\pOur lord N will be disappointed, but\nthe six of us shall defeat you here!$"
gBwText_287_7:
	.string "???: Can ya manage that?$"
gBwText_287_8:
	.string "Clay: Still standin', are ya,\n{STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_287_9:
	.string "You...\nYou're Driftveil's...?!$"
gBwText_287_10:
	.string "Clay: Hrrmph! Ain't just me!$"
gBwText_287_11:
	.string "Lenora: So sorry...\pNot only are we stronger than you,\nbut there are a lot of us!$"
gBwText_287_12:
	.string "Accursed Gym Leaders!$"
gBwText_287_13:
	.string "Elesa: Ignoring Team Plasma...\pThat would be a terrible thing\nfor us Gym Leaders to do.$"
gBwText_287_14:
	.string "Burgh: Bianca asked us to come, too.$"
gBwText_287_15:
	.string "Brycen: ...$"
gBwText_287_16:
	.string "Skyla: I'm fine! Don't worry!$"
gBwText_287_17:
	.string "Iris: No need to worry!$"
gBwText_287_18:
	.string "Drayden: Holder of the Dark Stone,\nplease proceed!$"
gBwText_287_19:
	.string "Drayden: Holder of the Light Stone,\nplease proceed!$"
gBwText_287_20:
	.string "Giallo: Ghetsis called us the chosen\nones.\pHe chose us and gathered us here\nso we can change the world!\lFor us, defeat is impossible!$"
gBwText_287_21:
	.string "Bronius: You shall not interfere with\nTeam Plasma... Or our king!$"
gBwText_287_22:
	.string "Ryoku: We can only do our best and\nleave the rest to fate.\pWe've done everything in our power.\nAll we can do now is believe in our\llord N...and wait.$"
gBwText_287_23:
	.string "Gorm: A single fallen leaf signals the\nstart of autumn.\pWe know our history.\pThe emergence of this castle is\nthe harbinger of change in Unova...$"
gBwText_287_24:
	.string "Rood: Constant dripping wears away\nthe stone.\pI've been waiting in the abyss for\nthis day. No one shall interfere!$"
gBwText_287_25:
	.string "Zinzolin: It is the way of the universe\nto take from excess and fill emptiness.\pTaking Pokémon from people is restoring\nbalance to nature!$"
gBwText_287_26:
	.string "Lenora: We have been and will continue\nto be together with Pokémon.$"
gBwText_287_27:
	.string "Burgh: Your Pokémon, they are doing\ntheir best for you, right?\pWhy would you want to be separated\nfrom them like that?$"
gBwText_287_28:
	.string "Elesa: I do not appreciate\nstubborn people.$"
gBwText_287_29:
	.string "Clay: Things aren't gonna go th' way ya\nfellas think they are!\pI'm sure o' that!$"
gBwText_287_30:
	.string "Skyla: Now! Acrobatics!!$"
gBwText_287_31:
	.string "Brycen: ...$"
gBwText_287_32:
	.string "Iris: I won't lose!\nNo way! No way! No way!$"
gBwText_287_33:
	.string "Drayden: I can empathize with some of\nwhat you say, but I can't forgive the\lway you reject everything else!$"
	.align 2
