gBwText_288_0:
	.string "...\p...Come.$"
gBwText_288_1:
	.string "In this castle, you may rest your\nPokémon and access your PC.\lFear not.$"
gBwText_288_2:
	.string "First, have your Pokémon rest in\nthat room.\pWhen they are healed, it is our lord N's\nwish that you be moved to the innermost\lpart of this castle.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_288
gBwTextTable_288:
	.4byte gBwText_288_0
	.4byte gBwText_288_1
	.4byte gBwText_288_2
	.global gBwTextCount_288
gBwTextCount_288:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_289_0:
	.string "Our lord N proved that he is stronger\nthan the Champion!\pNow many Trainers will admire our lord N\nand follow his orders!\pIn other words, they will do whatever\nTeam Plasma says!$"
gBwText_289_1:
	.string "Ha ha! We, Team Plasma, were using the\nPokémon we took from others all along!\pAww, poor widdle Pokémon.\nThey had to do what we told them.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_289
gBwTextTable_289:
	.4byte gBwText_289_0
	.4byte gBwText_289_1
	.global gBwTextCount_289
gBwTextCount_289:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_290_0:
	.string "I am Anthea...\pTrainer. Before you go to confront my\nlord N, please take a moment to rest...$"
gBwText_290_1:
	.string "Ah, good. Both you and your Pokémon\nregained energy...\pTrainers battle to practice their skills\nand to grow in experience, but never\lto hurt their Pokémon.\pMy lord N has realized this, deep down in\nhis heart...but he has spent too much\lpainful time here in this castle to\ladmit it...$"
gBwText_290_2:
	.string "$"
gBwText_290_3:
	.string "I am Concordia.\nI give peace and comfort to N.\pN has been separated from people\nsince he was young. He was brought up\lwith Pokémon...\pPokémon that were betrayed, mistreated\nand hurt by bad people...\pGhetsis deliberately brought only\nthose poor Pokémon closer to N.\pN was touched by their plight, and\nstarted pursuing the truth,\lthinking only of Pokémon.\pN's heart is pure and innocent.\pBut there is nothing more beautiful\nand terrifying than innocence.$"
gBwText_290_4:
	.string "I am Concordia.\nI give peace and comfort to N.\pN has been separated from people\nsince he was young. He was brought up\lwith Pokémon...\pPokémon that were betrayed, mistreated\nand hurt by bad people...\pGhetsis deliberately brought only\nthose poor Pokémon closer to N.\pN was touched by their plight, and\nstarted pursuing his ideals,\lthinking only of Pokémon.\pN's heart is pure and innocent.\pBut there is nothing more beautiful\nand terrifying than innocence.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_290
gBwTextTable_290:
	.4byte gBwText_290_0
	.4byte gBwText_290_1
	.4byte gBwText_290_2
	.4byte gBwText_290_3
	.4byte gBwText_290_4
	.global gBwTextCount_290
gBwTextCount_290:
	.4byte 5
gBwText_291_0:
	.string "We had been secretly building this\ncastle for several years by overworking\lPokémon that we took away. Without\lbeing noticed by anyone...$"
gBwText_291_1:
	.string "Everything is going perfectly as\nGhetsis of the Seven Sages\lcalculated and planned.\pHe's been thinking about how he can\nmanipulate people's hearts as he\lwishes.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_291
gBwTextTable_291:
	.4byte gBwText_291_0
	.4byte gBwText_291_1
	.global gBwTextCount_291
gBwTextCount_291:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_292_0:
	.string "A battle between you and our lord N will\nreveal whether our lord N is a true hero.\pIt will also reveal how you feel about\nprotecting the current world,\lwhere people live with Pokémon.$"
gBwText_292_1:
	.string "A battle between you and our lord N\nwill reveal whether our lord N is\lan ideal hero.\pIt will also reveal how you feel about\nprotecting the current world,\lwhere people live with Pokémon.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_292
gBwTextTable_292:
	.4byte gBwText_292_0
	.4byte gBwText_292_1
	.global gBwTextCount_292
gBwTextCount_292:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_293_0:
	.string "Ah, our young wanderer!\nAre you surprised?\pThis castle is the hub of Team\nPlasma's-- no, Ghetsis of the Seven\lSages'-- scientific capability!\pA manifestation of knowledge!$"
gBwText_293_1:
	.string "Ha ha! Now we can even infiltrate the\nPokémon Storage System inside every\lTrainer's PC!\pIf our king wills it, we can steal every\nPokémon stored in a PC Box and release\lthem all!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_293
gBwTextTable_293:
	.4byte gBwText_293_0
	.4byte gBwText_293_1
	.global gBwTextCount_293
gBwTextCount_293:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_294_0:
	.string "As part of his plan to take Pokémon\naway from their people, my lord N\lentrusted some Pokémon to me.\pI've been spending time with them...\nand I don't think I want to let them go.\pI...may not be cut out for Team Plasma.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_294
gBwTextTable_294:
	.4byte gBwText_294_0
	.global gBwTextCount_294
gBwTextCount_294:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_295_0:
	.string "Skreeree...$"
gBwText_295_1:
	.string "This Pokémon has become attached to\nme.\pBut as far as I'm concerned, a Pokémon\nis just a simple tool.\pI don't understand...$"
gBwText_295_2:
	.string "Will you go to the Pokémon League?$"
gBwText_295_3:
	.string "Go!$"
gBwText_295_4:
	.string "I see.$"
gBwText_295_5:
	.string "I don't need an item to catch\nPokémon anymore...$"
gBwText_295_6:
	.string "Poké Balls...\pFrom my point of view, they are items\nthat keep Pokémon confined.\pBut for Trainers like you, they are a\nway to bond with Pokémon...\pIf you run out of Poké Balls,\ncome see me. I will give one to you.$"
gBwText_295_7:
	.string "You need a Poké Ball?\nOK. Take this.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_295
gBwTextTable_295:
	.4byte gBwText_295_0
	.4byte gBwText_295_1
	.4byte gBwText_295_2
	.4byte gBwText_295_3
	.4byte gBwText_295_4
	.4byte gBwText_295_5
	.4byte gBwText_295_6
	.4byte gBwText_295_7
	.global gBwTextCount_295
gBwTextCount_295:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_296_0:
	.string "That room was the world\nthat was provided to our lord N...$"
gBwText_296_1:
	.string "I don't feel anything, even when\nI go into the room...\lBut you may feel something.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_296
gBwTextTable_296:
	.4byte gBwText_296_0
	.4byte gBwText_296_1
	.global gBwTextCount_296
gBwTextCount_296:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_297_0:
	.string "It's a basketball that looks like\nit's been used a lot.\lIt says Harmonia on it...$"
gBwText_297_1:
	.string "It's a home-style basketball hoop...$"
gBwText_297_2:
	.string "This toy box is full of new toys...$"
gBwText_297_3:
	.string "A skateboard is resting on\na pile of wheels.$"
gBwText_297_4:
	.string "A halfpipe for skateboards...\pIt has Pokémon scratch marks\non it here and there...$"
gBwText_297_5:
	.string "An art panel with a\nprinted geometric pattern.$"
gBwText_297_6:
	.string "This panel has a dart stuck in it.$"
gBwText_297_7:
	.string "It's a set of trains and tracks.\nHas it been played with recently?$"
gBwText_297_8:
	.string "This toy box contains\npieces of a train set.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_297
gBwTextTable_297:
	.4byte gBwText_297_0
	.4byte gBwText_297_1
	.4byte gBwText_297_2
	.4byte gBwText_297_3
	.4byte gBwText_297_4
	.4byte gBwText_297_5
	.4byte gBwText_297_6
	.4byte gBwText_297_7
	.4byte gBwText_297_8
	.global gBwTextCount_297
gBwTextCount_297:
	.4byte 9
gBwText_298_0:
	.string "Somewhere far from here, Team Galactic\nand Team Rocket drew too much\lattention to themselves.\pThat's why their plans were thwarted.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_298
gBwTextTable_298:
	.4byte gBwText_298_0
	.global gBwTextCount_298
gBwTextCount_298:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_299_0:
	.string "A Trainer who loved Pokémon until\nyesterday...will release Pokémon today.\pTomorrow, another Trainer will let\nPokémon go...$"
gBwText_299_1:
	.string "If we use force to take Pokémon away\nfrom people, the people will rebel.\pBut, if we manipulate their hearts...\npeople will release Pokémon voluntarily.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_299
gBwTextTable_299:
	.4byte gBwText_299_0
	.4byte gBwText_299_1
	.global gBwTextCount_299
gBwTextCount_299:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_300_0:
	.string "Ghetsis: Welcome,\nholder of the Dark Stone.$"
gBwText_300_1:
	.string "Ghetsis: Welcome,\nholder of the Light Stone.$"
gBwText_300_2:
	.string "The castle that appeared as if it were\nenveloping the Pokémon League\lis a symbol.\lIt means Unova will change.$"
gBwText_300_3:
	.string "The king of this castle is the\nstrongest Trainer in the world.\pHe is accompanied by the\nlegendary Pokémon.\pHe has defeated the Champion.\pAdded to all that, his heart burns\nwith the desire to improve the world.\pIf that's not what makes a hero,\nwhat more do you need?$"
gBwText_300_4:
	.string "Now that the stage is set, we can\nseize people's minds and hearts.\pWe can bring into being the world\nthat I--no, that Team Plasma--desires\lmore easily than you can imagine!\pWe and only we will use Pokémon, and\nwe shall rule the powerless populace!$"
gBwText_300_5:
	.string "I've been waiting so long for this!\pI've kept my silence so no one\ncould piece together what I planned.\lNow, those painful days are at an end!$"
gBwText_300_6:
	.string "Go! Onward!$"
gBwText_300_7:
	.string "Discover whether you have what\nit takes to be a hero!$"
gBwText_300_8:
	.string "Ghetsis: Go!\nHolder of the Dark Stone!\pIn this room, you can learn whether\nyou, too, can be a hero!$"
gBwText_300_9:
	.string "Ghetsis: Go!\nHolder of the Light Stone!\pIn this room, you can learn whether\nyou, too, can be a hero!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_300
