gBwTextCount_300:
	.4byte 10
gBwText_301_0:
	.string "N: What I desire is a world for Pokémon,\nand Pokémon alone.\pI will separate Pokémon from people, so\nPokémon can regain their original power.$"
gBwText_301_1:
	.string "It's time to settle this once and for\nall!\pMy determination is absolute!\pI will prove the value of my beliefs\neven if it means my Pokémon friends get\lhurt!\pSince you've come this far,\nI believe you are equally determined.\pIf that's so, prove it to me! Show me\nthe depth of your determination!$"
gBwText_301_2:
	.string "N: What I desire is a world for Pokémon,\nand Pokémon alone.\pI will separate Pokémon from people, so\nPokémon can regain their original power.$"
gBwText_301_3:
	.string "It's time to settle this once and for\nall!\pMy determination is absolute!\pI will prove the value of my beliefs\neven if it means my Pokémon friends get\lhurt!\pSince you've come this far,\nI believe you are equally determined.\pIf that's so, prove it to me! Show me\nthe depth of your determination!$"
gBwText_301_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_6:
	.string "N: You came all this way to battle me...\nBut Zekrom is not responding.\pYou haven't yet been recognized\nas the hero, have you?\pHow disappointing.\pI actually kind of liked you a little.\pThrough our many battles, I got the\nfeeling that you might be a Trainer\lwho truly cares for Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_7:
	.string "N: You came all this way to battle me...\nBut Reshiram is not responding.\pYou haven't yet been recognized\nas the hero, have you?\pHow disappointing.\pI actually kind of liked you a little.\pThrough our many battles, I got the\nfeeling that you might be a Trainer\lwho truly cares for Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_8:
	.string "But I was kidding myself.\pThe idea of Trainers getting to know\neach other through battles is\lridiculous!$"
gBwText_301_9:
	.string "You have two options.\pChallenge me to a fight you can't win,\nor leave this place and watch the birth\lof a new world where Pokémon\lare free of people!$"
gBwText_301_10:
	.string "But I was kidding myself.\pThe idea of Trainers getting to know\neach other through battles is\lridiculous!$"
gBwText_301_11:
	.string "You have two options.\pChallenge me to a fight you can't win,\nor leave this place and watch the birth\lof a new world where Pokémon\lare free of people!$"
gBwText_301_12:
	.string "N: Reshiram! Come to me!$"
gBwText_301_13:
	.string "N: Zekrom! Come to me!$"
gBwText_301_14:
	.string "The Dark Stone...\nIt's trembling inside the Bag!$"
gBwText_301_15:
	.string "The Light Stone...\nIt's trembling inside the Bag!$"
gBwText_301_16:
	.string "N: Your Dark Stone is...\pI mean, Zekrom is...$"
gBwText_301_17:
	.string "N: Your Light Stone is...\pI mean, Reshiram is...$"
gBwText_301_18:
	.string "The Dark Stone draws in the aura of\nthe surroundings and converts it into\la powerful force, which is...now...\pBeing released!$"
gBwText_301_19:
	.string "The Light Stone draws in the aura of\nthe surroundings and converts it into\la powerful force, which is...now...\pBeing released!$"
gBwText_301_20:
	.string "N: Reshiram and Zekrom...\pThey were once one life.\nOne Pokémon.\pComplete opposites, yet the same.\pReshiram and Zekrom are Pokémon that\nappear before the hero they recognize.\pAh... I see.\nYou really are a hero, too.$"
gBwText_301_21:
	.string "N: Zekrom and Reshiram...\pThey were once one life.\nOne Pokémon.\pComplete opposites, yet the same.\pZekrom and Reshiram are Pokémon that\nappear before the hero they recognize.\pAh... I see.\nYou really are a hero, too.$"
gBwText_301_22:
	.string "I'll tell you what that\nPokémon is saying to you.\p“I want to battle with you.\nTry to make me your friend and ally.“\pIt plans to test you to see if you are\nreally pursuing ideals.\pI, also, am curious to see\nhow powerful you are.\pNow, catch Zekrom and make it your ally!$"
gBwText_301_23:
	.string "I'll tell you what that\nPokémon is saying to you.\p“I want to battle with you.\nTry to make me your friend and ally.“\pIt plans to test you to see if you are\nreally pursuing truth.\pI, also, am curious to see\nhow powerful you are.\pNow, catch Reshiram\nand make it your ally!$"
gBwText_301_24:
	.string "Bazzazzazzash!$"
gBwText_301_25:
	.string "Preeeeaah!$"
gBwText_301_26:
	.string "Zekrom is gazing at {STR_VAR_1} as if\nto say, “Try to catch me!“$"
gBwText_301_27:
	.string "Reshiram is gazing at {STR_VAR_1} as if\nto say, “Try to catch me!“$"
gBwText_301_28:
	.string "N: Ah... I see.\pZekrom, who is said to lend its power\nto the hero who searches for ideals,\lhas recognized your power\land now agrees to stand by your side...$"
gBwText_301_29:
	.string "N: Ah... I see.\pReshiram, who is said to lend its power\nto the hero who searches for truth,\lhas recognized your power\land now agrees to stand by your side... $"
gBwText_301_30:
	.string "N: Hold on. Your Pokémon are hurt.\pThere is no triumph to be gained in\nbattling a weakened opponent.$"
gBwText_301_31:
	.string "N fully restored {STR_VAR_1}'s Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_32:
	.string "N: Now, I will create the future I\ndesire!\pI shall sweep you before me!$"
gBwText_301_33:
	.string "N: ...\n...\pReshiram and I were beaten.\pYour ideals... Your feelings... They were\nstronger than mine, it seems...$"
gBwText_301_34:
	.string "N: ...\n...\pZekrom and I were beaten.\pYour truth... Your feelings... They were\nstronger than mine, it seems...$"
gBwText_301_35:
	.string "N: Zekrom and Reshiram...\pEach of them choosing a different\nhero... Is that even possible?\pTwo heroes living at the same time--\none that pursues ideals and\lone that pursues truth.\lCould...could they both be right?$"
gBwText_301_36:
	.string "I don't know.\pIt's not by rejecting different ideas,\nbut by accepting different ideas that\lthe world creates a chemical reaction.\pThis is truly the formula\nfor changing the world.$"
gBwText_301_37:
	.string "N: Reshiram and Zekrom...\pEach of them choosing a different\nhero... Is that even possible?\pTwo heroes living at the same time--\none that pursues truth and\lone that pursues ideals.\lCould... Could they both be right?$"
gBwText_301_38:
	.string "I don't know.\pIt's not by rejecting different ideas,\nbut by accepting different ideas that\lthe world creates a chemical reaction.\pThis is truly the formula\nfor changing the world.$"
gBwText_301_39:
	.string "Ghetsis: After all of that, do you think\nyou're still worthy of sharing the name\lHarmonia with me?\pYou good-for-nothing boy!$"
gBwText_301_40:
	.string "Ghetsis: To start with, I spurred N into\npursuing the truth. The reason we\lreawakened the legendary Pokémon now\lwas to give MY Team Plasma more power!\pPower to control the fearful masses!\nThat at least was well done.$"
gBwText_301_41:
	.string "Ghetsis: To start with, I spurred N into\npursuing ideals. The reason we\lreawakened the legendary Pokémon now\lwas to give MY Team Plasma more power!\pPower to control the fearful masses!\nThat at least was well done.$"
gBwText_301_42:
	.string "After saying you had to put your\nbeliefs on the line and battle to see\lwhich one chosen by the legendary\lPokémon was the true hero...\pYou lost to an ordinary Trainer! There\nis such a thing as being too stupid!\pAdd it up, and you are nothing more\nthan a warped, defective boy\lwho knows nothing but Pokémon...$"
gBwText_301_43:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! I never would have\nthought the legendary Pokémon\lwould choose a Trainer like you!\lIt caught me completely off guard.$"
gBwText_301_44:
	.string "This doesn't change my goal.\nMy plans have not been disturbed!\pIn order to rule this world utterly,\nin order to manipulate the hearts\lof people who know nothing,\lI will have N be the king of Team Plasma.\pBut, for that to work, you--\nsince you know the truth--\lYou must be eliminated!$"
gBwText_301_45:
	.string "Cheren: Rule the world??\pWasn't Team Plasma's goal to\nliberate Pokémon?$"
gBwText_301_46:
	.string "Ghetsis: That was just a convenient lie\nthat I needed to create Team Plasma.\pUse your head. What's to be gained from\nletting go of useful things like\lPokémon?\pCertainly, manipulating Pokémon\nhelps people expand their possibilities.\lThat much, I can agree with.\pSo it naturally follows that only I\nshould be able to use Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_47:
	.string "Alder: You fool!\nThat's a ridiculous idea!$"
gBwText_301_48:
	.string "Ghetsis: You can say whatever you want.\pA Pokémon, even if it's revered as a\ndeity, is still just a Pokémon.\p{STR_VAR_1}, so what if it chose you!\nThat doesn't mean you're a threat.\pCome on! Now you'll face ME in battle!\pI can't wait to see the look on your\nface when you've lost all hope!$"
gBwText_301_49:
	.string "N: {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_301_50:
	.string "N: {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_301_51:
	.string "Ghetsis: I won't allow anyone to stop\nme! No matter who does what!$"
gBwText_301_52:
	.string "Cheren: I'll never forgive you.\pUsing power for your selfish purposes...\nYour selfish and evil purposes!$"
gBwText_301_53:
	.string "Alder: You've taken shameful advantage\nof N and his sincere, heartfelt beliefs.$"
gBwText_301_54:
	.string "N: Was my formula incorrect?$"
gBwText_301_55:
	.string "Bzaaah...$"
gBwText_301_56:
	.string "Pweesh...$"
gBwText_301_57:
	.string "Ghetsis: What?!\pI created Team Plasma with my own\nhands. I'm absolutely perfect! I AM\lPERFECTION!\pI am the perfect ruler of\na perfect new world!$"
gBwText_301_58:
	.string "Alder: Now, N...\pDo you still think Pokémon\nand people should be separated?$"
gBwText_301_59:
	.string "Ghetsis: Mwa ha ha!\pSince I couldn't become the hero and\nobtain the legendary Pokémon myself...\pI prepared someone for that\npurpose--N!\pHe's nothing more than a freak\nwithout a human heart.\pDo you think you're going to get\nthrough to a warped person like that?!$"
gBwText_301_60:
	.string "Cheren: Alder, it's a waste of valuable\ntime listening to him ramble on.\pHe is the one without a human heart!$"
gBwText_301_61:
	.string "Alder: You're right.\nHe's truly pitiful.$"
gBwText_301_62:
	.string "N...\nI'm sure you have much to think about.\pI know you were not pursuing the truth\nbecause of Ghetsis's manipulation, but\lbecause your heart was truly inspired.\pThat is why you were able to meet the\nlegendary Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_63:
	.string "N...\nI'm sure you have much to think about.\pI know you were not pursuing ideals\nbecause of Ghetsis's manipulation, but\lbecause your heart was really inspired.\pThat is why you were able to meet the\nlegendary Pokémon!$"
gBwText_301_64:
	.string "N: But...I have no right to be the hero!$"
gBwText_301_65:
	.string "Alder: Is that so?\pWhat you and the legendary Pokémon\nare going to do from now on...\lThat's important, wouldn't you say?$"
gBwText_301_66:
	.string "N: Acting like you understand...\pUp till now, we've been fighting each\nother over our beliefs!\pYet, despite that... Why?!$"
gBwText_301_67:
	.string "Alder: N, even if we don't understand\neach other, that's not a reason\lto reject each other.\pThere are two sides to any argument.\pIs there one point of view that has all\nthe answers? Give it some thought.$"
gBwText_301_68:
	.string "N: I want to talk to you about\nsomething.$"
gBwText_301_69:
	.string "It's about when I first met\nyou in Accumula Town.\pI was shocked when I heard what\nyour Pokémon was saying.$"
gBwText_301_70:
	.string "I was shocked because that\nPokémon said it liked you.\pIt said it wanted to be with you.$"
gBwText_301_71:
	.string "I couldn't understand it.\pI couldn't believe there were\nPokémon that liked people.\pBecause, up until that moment,\nI'd never known a Pokémon like that.$"
gBwText_301_72:
	.string "The longer my journey continued,\nthe more unsure I became.\pAll I kept meeting were Pokémon and\npeople who communicated with one\lanother and helped one another.\pThat was why I needed to confirm my\nbeliefs by battling with you.\pI wanted to confront you hero-to-hero.\nI needed that more than anything.$"
gBwText_301_73:
	.string "There's no way a person like me,\nsomeone who understands only\lPokémon--\pNo, actually...\nI didn't understand them, either.\pNo way could I measure up to you,\nwhen you had met so many Pokémon\land were surrounded by friends...$"
gBwText_301_74:
	.string "N: The Champion has forgiven me, and...\pWhat I should do now is something\nI'll have to decide for myself.$"
gBwText_301_75:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_301_76:
	.string "You said you have a dream...\nThat dream... Make it come true!\pWonderful dreams and ideals give\nyou the power to change the world!\lIf anyone can, it's you! {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_301_77:
	.string "Dream your dream!\pThen, pursue the ideals to make that\ndream a reality, and someday you will\lachieve all that you dreamed of!$"
gBwText_301_78:
	.string "You said you have a dream...\nThat dream... Make it come true!\pMake your wonderful dream a reality,\nand it will become your truth!\l{STR_VAR_1}! If anyone can, it's you!$"
gBwText_301_79:
	.string "Dream your dream!\pFollow the path of truth to make that\ndream a reality, and someday you will\lachieve all that you dreamed of!$"
gBwText_301_80:
	.string "Well, then...$"
gBwText_301_81:
	.string "Farewell!$"
gBwText_301_82:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_83:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_84:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_85:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_86:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_87:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_88:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_89:
	.string "N: Get ready! Go after it!\pZekrom will bare its fangs at people\nwho fail to follow their ideals.$"
gBwText_301_90:
	.string "N: Get ready! Go after it!\pReshiram will incinerate people who\nfail to keep truth in their heart.$"
gBwText_301_91:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_92:
	.string "$"
gBwText_301_93:
