gBwText_302_0:
	.string "Hello, hello!\nI am the official Name Rater!\pWant me to rate the nicknames\nof your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_302_1:
	.string "Which Pokémon's nickname\nshould I critique?$"
gBwText_302_2:
	.string "Hmmm. {STR_VAR_1}, is it?\pThat sounds good! It's a very “you“\nsort of name.\pBut if you'd like to change it, I can\nhelp you do that. How about it?$"
gBwText_302_3:
	.string "Excellent! What would you like\nthe new nickname to be?$"
gBwText_302_4:
	.string "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\nshall be known as {STR_VAR_1}!\pYou're right, that does seem to fit it\nbetter. Nicely done!$"
gBwText_302_5:
	.string "OK! Come see me again if you\nchange your mind.$"
gBwText_302_6:
	.string "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\nshall be known as {STR_VAR_1}!\pIt looks no different from before, but\nwe both know this name is vastly\lsuperior! How fortunate for you!$"
gBwText_302_7:
	.string "Hmmm. {STR_VAR_1}!\nThat is a truly impeccable nickname!\pTake good care of {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_302_8:
	.string "Now, now...\nThat is merely an Egg!$"
