gBwText_313_0:
	.string "Hey, le Trainer fantastique! Want to be\npart of the experiment of the century?\pYou need two DS systems to play with\nPoké Transfer!\pDo you have a second DS system that\nyou can use?$"
gBwText_313_1:
	.string "If you decide that you want to play\nwith Poké Transfer sometime, you're\lwelcome to come back and ask me.$"
gBwText_313_2:
	.string "I'm sorry! Sumimasen! But you don't\nhave enough space in your PC Box.\pPlease make room for six Pokémon and\ntry again.$"
gBwText_313_3:
	.string "OK! But just remember! ¡Muy importante!\pOnce you bring a Pokémon here, you\ncan't send it back. Do you still want to\ldo it?$"
gBwText_313_4:
	.string "DS Wireless Communications will\nbe launched.$"
gBwText_313_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_313_6:
	.string "OK, OK. Come here. Stand right there!$"
gBwText_313_7:
	.string "Well, let's begin! Allons-y!$"
gBwText_313_8:
	.string "Great! Molto bene!$"
gBwText_313_9:
	.string "You're just as skillful as I expected!\nPoké Transfer is working!\pBut hey, {STR_VAR_1}, you can't fool me!\nI bet you can do even better than this.\pA Trainer of your caliber can make\nreally good use of Poké Transfer!$"
gBwText_313_10:
	.string "Wunderbar! Magnifique! Brilliant!\nYour skill is impressive!\pThis is the very reason why we\nscientists are doing research!\pBut, {STR_VAR_1}! I think a Trainer with\nyour experience can make use of it\leven more elegantly.\pPlease master your genius handling of\nPoké Transfer, and show us how\lit's done!$"
gBwText_313_11:
	.string "Great! Greeeeeeat!\pPoké Transfer is making\ntremendous progress!\pWell, it's unbelievable! ¡Es gigante!\nI owe everything to you!\pPlease assist our research in the\nfuture, too!\pPlease feel free to use Poké Transfer\nanytime you want!$"
gBwText_313_12:
	.string "...\nG...\pGreat!\nGreeeat!\pF--a--n--t--a--s--t--i--c!\pYour handling of Poké Transfer\nis reeeally exhilarating!\pOhhhh, our invention is\nnear completion!\pCome again very soon!\nCome again immediately!\pAnd please show us even more wonderful\nhandling of Poké Transfer!$"
gBwText_313_13:
	.string "Ohhhhhhhh.\nAny moment! Any moment!\pPoké Transfer is only one step away\nfrom going down in history as a\lfantastic invention!$"
gBwText_313_14:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\pAs I thought, my instinct was right...\nYou are a prodigy! A genius!\pThere won't be anyone else who can\nhandle Poké Transfer in such a\lprofessional manner.\pPlease use Poké Transfer anytime you\nwant in the future!\pWe will be here any time to continue to\ndo further research!\pIf you want to use Poké Transfer,\nplease let us know!$"
gBwText_313_15:
	.string "I put the Pokémon you caught\nin your PC Box.$"
gBwText_313_16:
	.string "But, it seems you could not\ncatch any Pokémon.$"
gBwText_313_17:
	.string "Ugh... There seems to be a communication\nerror.\pI'm afraid you have to try it again!$"
gBwText_313_18:
	.string "Hi, hello!\pYou came here.\nThat means you are a visitor?\pHuh? No?\nYou came all the way here?\pAh, you are a Trainer?\nAre you in the middle of your journey?\pAh, this is your Trainer Card?$"
gBwText_313_19:
	.string "W-w-what? You!\nYou have all the Gym Badges?!$"
gBwText_313_20:
	.string "Great!\nYou may be able to...$"
gBwText_313_21:
	.string "Professor Paaaaaark!$"
gBwText_313_22:
	.string "Quick, quick!$"
gBwText_313_23:
	.string "Oh, there you are!$"
gBwText_313_24:
	.string "Professor!\pDo you have a minute?\nI think you do. Listen!\pThis kid is a Trainer who has all the\nGym Badges. All of them!\pI am sure this Trainer can operate it!$"
gBwText_313_25:
	.string "I have told you many times.\pThis invention is great indeed, but\nwithout a professional Trainer...$"
gBwText_313_26:
	.string "What? You have the Gym Badges?\nALL of them?!$"
gBwText_313_27:
	.string "Fantastic!\pFantastico!$"
gBwText_313_28:
	.string "Yahoooooooooooooooo!$"
gBwText_313_29:
	.string "What a great day! Great! Unbelievable!\nHi, I am Professor Andrew Park!\pYou!\nEr...$"
gBwText_313_30:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_313_31:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}! Are you willing to\nparticipate in an ambitious experiment\lthat will make history?\pThis device is called Poké Transfer.\pIt connects...blah blah blah...\n...called DS system...meanwhile...\p...blah blah...of molecules...and then...\n...while evoking...blah blah...\p...ergo, energy particles will...\n...blah blah...and if the frequency...\p...as you see...with faraway Pokémon...\n...the Alpha waves...blah blah...\p...following which...reach convergence...\n...blah blah...spectacular results!$"
gBwText_313_32:
	.string "To put it more simply, if you use this\ndevice, you may be able to bring\lPokémon here from other regions.\pBut just for safety's sake, the\nPokémon you're transferring shouldn't\lbe holding anything! So make sure to\ltake their items first.$"
gBwText_313_33:
	.string "...So! You!$"
gBwText_313_34:
	.string "You are a fantastic Pokémon Trainer!\pWill you participate in the great\nexperiment of the century?\pYou need two DS systems to use\nPoké Transfer!\pWe will conduct the experiment with\nanother DS. Is that OK?$"
gBwText_313_35:
	.string "Your Pokémon can't be holding items\nwhen you transfer them. It's safer\lthat way.\pIn rare cases, there are Pokémon that\ncannot be transferred, but\lProfessor Park will explain it to you.$"
gBwText_313_36:
	.string "With this research of mine, I also want\nto have an impact on people in the\lfuture... people living 100 or 200 years\lfrom now!$"
gBwText_313_37:
	.string "Here, we are monitoring Poké Transfer.\pWe're keeping a careful eye to make\nsure all the Pokémon have safe travels!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_313
