gBwText_316_0:
	.string "My name is Loblolly.\nI'm a designer of Décor items.\pBut I'm stuck now... I just can't come\nup with a good design.\pI've been thinking about Décor\nso great that it will appear in a dream...$"
gBwText_316_1:
	.string "Loblolly: Hmmm... I still can't think of a\ngreat new Décor item.\pWill you come back again?$"
gBwText_316_2:
	.string "Loblolly: When I come up with some good\ndesigns, please help me again!$"
gBwText_316_3:
	.string "Loblolly: I finally came up with some new\ndesigns. I'm really proud of them!\pBut I'd like your opinion! Look at these\nDécor items and tell me which one you'd\ldream about!$"
gBwText_316_4:
	.string "I think I've finally designed Décor\nitems so great that people will dream\labout them!\pHere! Which one would you dream about?$"
gBwText_316_5:
	.string "Loblolly: Oh, are you going to help me\nwith my dream Décor design?\pGreat! Which of these Décor items would\nyou dream about?$"
gBwText_316_6:
	.string "Well, if you'd like to give me your\nopinion on my dream Décor, please come\lback!$"
gBwText_316_7:
	.string "Oh, you have impeccable taste!\pThat's it. This Décor is so great that\npeople will dream about it!\pYour advice was very helpful. Next time\nI come up with great designs, I'd love\lto bounce my ideas off you again!$"
gBwText_316_8:
	.string "Everybody is talking about Décor\nthey dream about. Do you know it?$"
gBwText_316_9:
	.string "Hello! My name is Loblolly, and I'm\na Décor designer.\pI am trying to design Décor items that\neverybody loves and dreams about.\pTables and chairs so great you can't\nstop thinking about them, even in\lyour sleep...\pThat's the kind of Décor I'm\ntalking about.$"
gBwText_316_10:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_316_11:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_316_12:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}$"
gBwText_316_13:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}$"
gBwText_316_14:
	.string "{STR_VAR_3}$"
gBwText_316_15:
	.string "Cancel$"
