gBwText_322_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_1:
	.string "Leo: Oh, I'm moving to Black City!\nThe excitement of the city is waiting\lfor me!$"
gBwText_322_2:
	.string "Leo: White Forest has a lot of nice\nplaces too, but...\lI'm bored with the lack of things to do!$"
gBwText_322_3:
	.string "Leo: There are a lot of nice things\nabout White Forest, but I'm craving the\lbright lights of the big city!$"
gBwText_322_4:
	.string "Leo: The place for a person craving\nexcitement, like me, is Black City!\lWould you mind taking me with you?$"
gBwText_322_5:
	.string "Really! No good, huh? Well, I'll be here\nif you change your mind.$"
gBwText_322_6:
	.string "Oh, sorry! I got an invitation\nfrom somewhere else.$"
gBwText_322_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_8:
	.string "What? Really?\pThat's great! New excitement\nis waiting for me!\lI'll be waiting in Black City, OK?$"
gBwText_322_9:
	.string "Silvia: I'm going to get out of this\nrut and move to Black City!\pI'm looking forward to the\nbig-city atmosphere.$"
gBwText_322_10:
	.string "Silvia: A new life in a new place, far\naway from everything you know! It's\lsomething every girl longs for.$"
gBwText_322_11:
	.string "Silvia: Girls all pine for the big city!$"
gBwText_322_12:
	.string "Silvia: A new life in a new place, far\naway from everything I know!\pYou, the one reflecting in my glasses,\ntake me to Black City!$"
gBwText_322_13:
	.string "So it's not going to work out? I'd sure\nlike it if you'd take me along, though...$"
gBwText_322_14:
	.string "I'm sorry!\pIt looks like my glinting glasses caught\nsomeone else's eye!$"
gBwText_322_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_16:
	.string "That someone who was reflected in my\nglasses is you!\lI'll be waiting in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_17:
	.string "Dave: Hey, sorry, yo!\nI'm movin' to Black City.\pEveryone's got a place\nthey're headin', right?$"
gBwText_322_18:
	.string "Dave: Wish I had someone 'round to drag\nme along. Man, I want to go to Black\lCity.$"
gBwText_322_19:
	.string "Dave: That Black City sure is\nshinin' bright.\lI want to go there too.$"
gBwText_322_20:
	.string "Dave: Nobody's 'round to drag me along.\pHey, why don'tcha take me to Black\nCity?$"
gBwText_322_21:
	.string "So that's it, huh...\pJust you watch. I'll make myself into\nthe kind of guy you want to take along.$"
gBwText_322_22:
	.string "Hey, sorry, yo. Someone else\nasked me to go.\lInvite me again sometime.$"
gBwText_322_23:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_24:
	.string "Thanks, yo! This Roughneck is going to\nbe the head of Black City!$"
gBwText_322_25:
	.string "Britney: I've done decided to\nhead over to the city!\pThe laid-back livin' is\nover fer now!$"
gBwText_322_26:
	.string "Britney: Windin' down sure is nice, but\nI like freewheelin' in the big city too!$"
gBwText_322_27:
	.string "Britney: Black City...\nThat's where I wanna be!$"
gBwText_322_28:
	.string "Britney: Won't somebody take\nme to Black City?\pHey there! I'd be much obliged if\nyou could take me to Black City...$"
gBwText_322_29:
	.string "Now, whyever not?!\nWell, take me next time, OK?$"
gBwText_322_30:
	.string "Oh, I'm sorry!\nSomeone else done invited me!$"
gBwText_322_31:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_32:
	.string "Thankee!\nI'll go on ahead to the city!$"
gBwText_322_33:
	.string "Robbie: Guess what? I'm moving to\nBlack City!\pWithout biiig buildings around, it's\nhard to settle in, right?!$"
gBwText_322_34:
	.string "Robbie: Aaah! Boooring! I'm so bored!\nI sure want to go to Black City!$"
gBwText_322_35:
	.string "Robbie: Hey! Over there!\nBlack City looks like so much fun.\lI sure wish I could go!$"
gBwText_322_36:
	.string "Robbie: Aaah! Boooring! I'm so bored!\nI sure want to go to Black City!\pI've got it! You can take me with\nyou! Come on!$"
gBwText_322_37:
	.string "Robbie: Aww. Why not?\nWell, if you change your mind...$"
gBwText_322_38:
	.string "Oh! I'm sorry!!\nI'm going to someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_39:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_40:
	.string "Thank you!\pI'm heading to Black City now.\nSee you there!$"
gBwText_322_41:
	.string "Miki: I decided to go to Black City.\pI'm a little laid back, so I'm worried\nI won't fit in.$"
gBwText_322_42:
	.string "Miki: It's comfortable here, but I\ncould use a little more excitement.$"
gBwText_322_43:
	.string "Miki: Black City...\pSounds like fun, doesn't it? If I had\nthe chance, I'd sure love to go.$"
gBwText_322_44:
	.string "Miki: Black City...\pSounds like fun, doesn't it? If I had\nthe chance, I'd sure love to go.\pHey, you wouldn't mind taking me\nalong, would you?$"
gBwText_322_45:
	.string "Sniff...\nDon't you want me to come?$"
gBwText_322_46:
	.string "Oh! I was invited by\nsomebody else. I'm sorry.$"
gBwText_322_47:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_48:
	.string "Thank you!\nI'll do my best in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_49:
	.string "Ryder: 'Sup! Hey, I'm moving\nto Black City.\pI'm gonna get stronger by going\nwhere stronger Trainers gather!$"
gBwText_322_50:
	.string "Ryder: Hyah! Hyah hyah...\nI'm having trouble getting pumped up!\pWhen I'm surrounded by nature,\nI sure do tend to calm down...$"
gBwText_322_51:
	.string "Ryder: Hyaaaah! Hyah!\pI've done well training--\nnow I want to test my abilities!$"
gBwText_322_52:
	.string "Ryder: I've been training hard.\nI want to test my abilities.\pWould you mind taking me to\nBlack City?$"
gBwText_322_53:
	.string "I see... That's too bad.\nTalk to me again sometime.$"
gBwText_322_54:
	.string "Oh... My apologies.\nAnother person invited me.$"
gBwText_322_55:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_56:
	.string "Thank you! I know where it is!\nI'll go on ahead to Black City!$"
gBwText_322_57:
	.string "Karenna: Ahhh... Bring it on!\nI've decided to go to Black City!\pPokémon battling is gonna be super hot!$"
gBwText_322_58:
	.string "Karenna: I've trained and trained. My\nPokémon and I might be a little tired...$"
gBwText_322_59:
	.string "Karenna: I wanna test the results\nof my training in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_60:
	.string "Karenna: I want to test the results of\nmy training in Black City!\pHey! Could you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_61:
	.string "No way...\nWell, next time then, OK?$"
gBwText_322_62:
	.string "Oh! I'm so sorry!\nI'm going to someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_63:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_64:
	.string "This will make me even stronger!\nThank you so much!\pOK then, I'll go on ahead and\nbe waiting in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_65:
	.string "Doug: Why, hello there!\pIt is my intention to take up residence\nin Black City.$"
gBwText_322_66:
	.string "Doug: Please excuse me.\pI was able to get enough rest,\nso perhaps I should head to Black City!$"
gBwText_322_67:
	.string "Doug: Why, hello there.\pI've been having trouble recently,\nbecause my work isn't going well.\pIf I were in Black City, I'm sure\nI could handle demanding jobs...$"
gBwText_322_68:
	.string "Doug: Why, hello there.\pI've been having trouble recently,\nbecause my work isn't going well.\pWould you be so kind as to\ntake me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_69:
	.string "Oh, I see. Do forgive the presumption.$"
gBwText_322_70:
	.string "Oh dear. Your timing is most\nunfortunate. I'm afraid I have already\laccepted another invitation.$"
gBwText_322_71:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_72:
	.string "Much obliged, much obliged!\pWell then, I shall be on my way.\nI shall see you there!$"
gBwText_322_73:
	.string "Vincent: Hey! It's you! Well, I'm off to\nshow my brilliance in Black City!\lThe beautiful buildings await!$"
gBwText_322_74:
	.string "Vincent: Living here is a little\nboring for a guy like me.$"
gBwText_322_75:
	.string "Vincent: Maybe I would be a good\nmatch for that Black City.$"
gBwText_322_76:
	.string "Vincent: I was considering favoring\nthat Black City with a visit, but what\ldo you think?$"
gBwText_322_77:
	.string "Sorry, I couldn't hear you.\nMaybe I'll ask again later.$"
gBwText_322_78:
	.string "Oooh. Sorry!\nI'm very popular!\lI'm already booked up.$"
gBwText_322_79:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_80:
	.string "Well, if you really want me\nto join you...\pI guess I'll have to go\nto Black City, then! Just for you!$"
gBwText_322_81:
	.string "Marie: I've had enough fresh air!\nI'm going to Black City.$"
gBwText_322_82:
	.string "Marie: I'm much more refreshed, and\nI want to go back to Black City.$"
gBwText_322_83:
	.string "Marie: Black City!\nHow nice! I want to go too.$"
gBwText_322_84:
	.string "Marie: Black City!\nHow nice! I want to go too.\pI've got it! Would you be a\ndear and take me there?$"
gBwText_322_85:
	.string "Oh my.\nAre you in a bad mood?$"
gBwText_322_86:
	.string "My oh my. I'm sorry.\nI was invited by someone else.$"
gBwText_322_87:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_88:
	.string "Thank you! Thank you!\nWell, I'll go on ahead, then.$"
gBwText_322_89:
	.string "Lena: Black City...\nI've decided to go there.$"
gBwText_322_90:
	.string "Lena: The forest doesn't\nrefuse anything.\lSometimes, I think that's scary.$"
gBwText_322_91:
	.string "Lena: Hmm... It's comfortable here,\nbut something's missing.$"
gBwText_322_92:
	.string "Lena: I want to go to that\nBlack City too...\lMind if I go with you?$"
gBwText_322_93:
	.string "I see...\nToo bad.$"
gBwText_322_94:
	.string "Sorry.\nI was invited by someone else...$"
gBwText_322_95:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_96:
	.string "Thank you.\nI'll be waiting in Black City...$"
gBwText_322_97:
	.string "Carlos: Heeey! I decided to give\nBlack City a try.\pIt'll be a laid-back, freewheeling trip!$"
gBwText_322_98:
	.string "Carlos: I enjoy looking at natural\nbeauty, but I want a big change.$"
gBwText_322_99:
	.string "Carlos: As a Backpacker, it's not good\nto stay in a place with no changes!$"
gBwText_322_100:
	.string "Carlos: There's not much left to\nsee here!\pThat's right! Could you please take me\nto Black City?$"
gBwText_322_101:
	.string "Hmmm... Isn't there any way I could go?\nI really want you to take me there...$"
gBwText_322_102:
	.string "Huh? I'm sorry. I'm going to go\nto someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_103:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_104:
	.string "Oh! Thanks!\nWell, I'll head to Black City then!\lSee you later, OK?$"
gBwText_322_105:
	.string "Molly: I'm going to Black City!\pI'd rather see lots of places\nthan stay in one spot!$"
gBwText_322_106:
	.string "Molly: I think I need a\nchange of scenery soon.\pI want to see lots of different places!$"
gBwText_322_107:
	.string "Molly: I want to go to\nsomewhere different soon.\lKnow any nice places?$"
gBwText_322_108:
	.string "Molly: OK, it's decided!\nI'm going to leave this place!\pThat's why I have something to ask you.\nCould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_109:
	.string "What? Even though I asked nicely!\nI'm crestfallen...$"
gBwText_322_110:
	.string "I was invited by someone else...\nSorry, but I'm going there.$"
gBwText_322_111:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_112:
	.string "Thank you!\nI'll head there right now!\pSee you in Black City!\nThanks again!$"
gBwText_322_113:
	.string "Frederic: Sorry, but I'm leaving for\nBlack City. I'm preparing for my move\lnow. If you need something, tell me in\lBlack City.$"
gBwText_322_114:
	.string "Frederic: The evolution of civilization!\nYou can feel it up close...\lI love that about Black City!$"
gBwText_322_115:
	.string "Frederic: I am so bored.\nI want to go to Black City, but...$"
gBwText_322_116:
	.string "Frederic: I am so bored.\nI want to go to Black City, but...\pOh, hey! I need a favor!\nCould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_117:
	.string "What? Have you no respect\nfor your elders? If you come around,\lI'll be waiting, young one.$"
gBwText_322_118:
	.string "Sorry!\pI'd completely forgotten, but my\ndestination has already been decided.$"
gBwText_322_119:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_120:
	.string "Well said. I'm grateful!\pWell then, I'm going to head\nto Black City. I'll be waiting!$"
gBwText_322_121:
	.string "Lynette: I'm going to Black City.\pAnd you were so kind as to talk to me\ntoo. I'm ever so sorry!$"
gBwText_322_122:
	.string "Lynette: I get bored because there\naren't any strong people in this town.$"
gBwText_322_123:
	.string "Lynette: I bet there are a lot of strong\nTrainers, and I'd never get bored in\lyour Black City...$"
gBwText_322_124:
	.string "Lynette: I've had my fill of\nsoothing nature.\pIf it's OK with you, could you take me\nto Black City?$"
gBwText_322_125:
	.string "My! I can't believe you are so\nrude as to refuse my request.$"
gBwText_322_126:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\pI found a different, wonderful\nperson...\lI'm ever so sorry.$"
gBwText_322_127:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_128:
	.string "I'd like to thank you.\nI'm looking forward to new encounters!$"
gBwText_322_129:
	.string "Pierce: I'm a-goin' to Black City.\nI'm looking forward to an\lexciting change of scenery.$"
gBwText_322_130:
	.string "Pierce: The slow life's gotten\na little blah...\pI want to live a more efficient life.$"
gBwText_322_131:
	.string "Pierce: Hmmm. Your Black City looks like\nan exciting place to live.\lI'm so jealous.$"
gBwText_322_132:
	.string "Pierce: The slow life's gotten\na little blah...\pWould you take me to your\nBlack City?$"
gBwText_322_133:
	.string "What a shame...\nAu revoir, city life!$"
gBwText_322_134:
	.string "Hey! Sorry!\pI decided to go to a different\nBlack City! Lo siento!$"
gBwText_322_135:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_136:
	.string "All riiight!\pExciting urban living, here I come! \nHey, thanks!$"
gBwText_322_137:
	.string "Gene: I'm going to move to Black City!\nTime to go see what I'm made of, eh?$"
gBwText_322_138:
	.string "Gene: I'd sure like to go to a place\nwhere I can test my skill as a Trainer.$"
gBwText_322_139:
	.string "Gene: Your Black City\nlooks pretty fun, eh?\lI'd like to go visit it.$"
gBwText_322_140:
	.string "Gene: I love Pokémon, and I'm\nwanting to test my skill as a\lTrainer with the Pokémon I've caught.\pCould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_141:
	.string "Whaaat! That's disappointing...\nI'll wait for the next opportunity!$"
gBwText_322_142:
	.string "Hmph! \nI've definitely changed my mind.\pI've decided to go to another Black\nCity.$"
gBwText_322_143:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_144:
	.string "Yahooo!\pI look forward to seeing how\ngood I am in a new environment.$"
gBwText_322_145:
	.string "Piper: I'm moving to Black City now!\nI'm looking forward to a fresh start!$"
gBwText_322_146:
	.string "Piper: Somehow I grew a little\ntired of taking it easy...\pI want to go to Black City.$"
gBwText_322_147:
	.string "Piper: I hear that your Black City\nis sophisticated and comfortable.\pI envy you...$"
gBwText_322_148:
	.string "Piper: I want to live a more\nfast-paced life!\pCould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_149:
	.string "Oh...\nThat's too bad.$"
gBwText_322_150:
	.string "I'm sorry. I've changed my mind.\pI've decided to go to a\ndifferent Black City.$"
gBwText_322_151:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_152:
	.string "Thank you!\pI'll try to show the world what I\ncan really do in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_153:
	.string "Miho: I'm going to move to Black City!\nTime for some serious shopping!$"
gBwText_322_154:
	.string "Miho: Recently, I've felt like\nsomething's missing. I want to do a lot\lmore shopping!\pI really want to go to Black City.$"
gBwText_322_155:
	.string "Miho: I'm jealous. That Black City\nis so gorgeous.$"
gBwText_322_156:
	.string "Miho: Your Black City\nis sparkling and wonderful!\pI want to live in Black City too.\nWould you take me?$"
gBwText_322_157:
	.string "What?! Cheapskate.$"
gBwText_322_158:
	.string "I'm such a flirt...\nTruth is: I found someone else.\pI decided to go to their Black City.\nI'm sorry.$"
gBwText_322_159:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_160:
	.string "Thank you!\nIn Black City, I will get even cuter!$"
gBwText_322_161:
	.string "Shane: I'm moving to Black City.\nI'm excited to see how I'll\ldo in the big city.\pMy heart's pounding! Buh-dup!$"
gBwText_322_162:
	.string "Shane: I want to see what people in\nBlack City will think of me.$"
gBwText_322_163:
	.string "Shane: I'm jealous of your Black City.\nI'd like to go too.$"
gBwText_322_164:
	.string "Shane: I wonder how I will be seen in\nBlack City.\lI'd like to see for myself.\pHey! Will you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_165:
	.string "Too bad. I wanted to go to your city.$"
gBwText_322_166:
	.string "Sorry! I decided to follow someone else.\nMy bad.$"
gBwText_322_167:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_168:
	.string "Thanks a lot!\pI'm going to see what I'm made of in\nBlack City!$"
gBwText_322_169:
	.string "Ralph: Yahoo!\pStarting now, I'm leaving for Black\nCity! I'll give it my best shot!$"
gBwText_322_170:
	.string "Ralph: Sigh...\nI want to communicate my\lfeelings more directly...\pI want to go to Black City.$"
gBwText_322_171:
	.string "Ralph: Your Black City...\pIt looks like everyone can express\nhow they feel directly. It looks fun...$"
gBwText_322_172:
	.string "Ralph: Recently, I've been thinking I\nwant to communicate my feelings\lmore directly...\pWould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_173:
	.string "What... I'm shocked you don't\nunderstand my feelings...$"
gBwText_322_174:
	.string "Oh!\pSomething came up, and my plans have\nchanged. Sorry!$"
gBwText_322_175:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_176:
	.string "Yahoo!\pI'm overflowing with emotions!\nI'm going to express them in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_177:
	.string "Eliza: I'm leaving for Black City!\nI want to buy a lot of different things!$"
gBwText_322_178:
	.string "Eliza: White Forest is rich in nature,\nbut it feels like something's missing.$"
gBwText_322_179:
	.string "Eliza: Black City...\nI bet you can buy many things there.\lI'm jealous...$"
gBwText_322_180:
	.string "Eliza: White Forest is rich in nature,\nbut something is missing.\pThat's it! Would you take me to\nBlack City?$"
gBwText_322_181:
	.string "Is that so...\nToo bad...$"
gBwText_322_182:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\nI'm going to a different Black City.$"
gBwText_322_183:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_184:
	.string "I'm so happy!\pI'm looking forward to living in\nBlack City.$"
gBwText_322_185:
	.string "Collin: Opportunity, opportunity!\nBusiness opportunities galore in\lBlack City! Piles of money, here I come!$"
gBwText_322_186:
	.string "Collin: I'm looking for a business doing\nsomething no one has done before.\pBut since no one's doing it, I can't\nfigure out what it is!$"
gBwText_322_187:
	.string "Collin: I've looked for business\nopportunities in this rural area, but\lnothing interesting is rolling my way...$"
gBwText_322_188:
	.string "Collin: Opportunities didn't exist here!\pGoing after big opportunities is more\nmy style!\pHate to be a bother, but can you take\nme to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_189:
	.string "A Clerk ? has to be patient.\nI'll wait until you are ready to take me!$"
gBwText_322_190:
	.string "Oh! I just thought of another business\nopportunity!\lSorry, but I'm going somewhere else!$"
gBwText_322_191:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_192:
	.string "All right!\pIn Black City, I'm going to make the\nbusiness opportunity mine!$"
gBwText_322_193:
	.string "Ken: I'm leaving for Black City!\pI'm going to become a master of\nPokémon battles in a new city!$"
gBwText_322_194:
	.string "Ken: In White Forest,\nI cannot master Pokémon battling...$"
gBwText_322_195:
	.string "Ken: Your Black City seems like\na bustling place for Pokémon battles.\lI'm jealous.$"
gBwText_322_196:
	.string "Ken: I want to live where\nI can become a master Pokémon battler.\pWill you please take me to your city?$"
gBwText_322_197:
	.string "Really.\nFine, I'll ask someone else.$"
gBwText_322_198:
	.string "I've changed my mind. I'm going to go\nto a different Black City.$"
gBwText_322_199:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_200:
	.string "I'm going to become the best Trainer\nI can be in Black City!$"
gBwText_322_201:
	.string "Jacques: I'm going to leave for\nBlack City to find a clear answer!$"
gBwText_322_202:
	.string "Jacques: Sigh...\pI want to do the kind of research\nwhere I get one clear answer.$"
gBwText_322_203:
	.string "Jacques: Your Black City...\pI'm jealous because it looks like\nyou can find a really excellent answer.$"
gBwText_322_204:
	.string "Jacques: It looks like I can do research\nto find clear, really excellent\lanswers in your Black City!\pWould you take me to your city?$"
gBwText_322_205:
	.string "I'm really disappointed by\nyour clear answer!$"
gBwText_322_206:
	.string "Oh, I've decided to go to a\ndifferent Black City!\pThe answer I'm looking\nfor is there!$"
gBwText_322_207:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_208:
	.string "Oh! The answer I wanted!\nThank you!$"
gBwText_322_209:
	.string "Rosa: I'm leaving for Black City!\nI'm looking forward to it, because\lit looks like it's never boring!$"
gBwText_322_210:
	.string "Rosa: Just living from day to day...\nI've had it with this life.\pI want to go someplace where\nI won't get so bored!$"
gBwText_322_211:
	.string "Rosa: Your Black City.\nIt looks exciting. I'm jealous.$"
gBwText_322_212:
	.string "Rosa: I want my everyday life to be\nmore fun!\pWon't you take me to your Black City?$"
gBwText_322_213:
	.string "My my!\nAren't you the selfish one!$"
gBwText_322_214:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\nI'm going to a different city!$"
gBwText_322_215:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_216:
	.string "Oh boy!\pA life without boredom!\nI'm looking forward to it!$"
gBwText_322_217:
	.string "Herman: Next, I'm going to Black City!\nAre you jealous?$"
gBwText_322_218:
	.string "Herman: Aaah...\nI want to go to Black City!\pJust staying in one place\nisn't like me!$"
gBwText_322_219:
	.string "Herman: Black City seems\nlike an interesting city.\lI'd like to go sometime!$"
gBwText_322_220:
	.string "Herman: I'm getting tired of\nliving here!\pCould you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_221:
	.string "Fine. Whatever.$"
gBwText_322_222:
	.string "Changed my mind!\nI'm setting off for a different city!$"
gBwText_322_223:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_224:
	.string "All right! Thanks!\nI'm looking forward to my next trip!$"
gBwText_322_225:
	.string "Emi: I'm setting off for my next city!\nBlack City! It looks like fun, right?$"
gBwText_322_226:
	.string "Emi: Oh, I want to set off for my\nnext city soon!$"
gBwText_322_227:
	.string "Emi: Black City sounds nice!\nI'd like to go there!$"
gBwText_322_228:
	.string "Emi: The goal of my next\ntrip is Pokémon battles!\pHey, will you take me to Black City?$"
gBwText_322_229:
	.string "What?!\nToo bad...$"
gBwText_322_230:
	.string "Uh, I've given up on that!\pI decided to go to a\ndifferent Black City!$"
gBwText_322_231:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_232:
	.string "Thank you!\nLooks like my next trip will be fun!$"
gBwText_322_233:
	.string "Grace: I'm searching for bold, new art!\nNext, I'm going to Black City!$"
gBwText_322_234:
	.string "Grace: I think only nature-made\nbeauty is not enough...\lDon't you feel that way?$"
gBwText_322_235:
	.string "Grace: Black City...\nNow, that is art created by people.\lI want to see it with my own eyes!$"
gBwText_322_236:
	.string "Grace: Black City...\nNow that is art created by people!\lI want to see it with my own eyes.\pYou...\nCould you take me there?$"
gBwText_322_237:
	.string "Your direct answer is\nalso beautiful.$"
gBwText_322_238:
	.string "Oh, what was that?\pOh, that's right.\nI'm going to a different Black City.\lSorry I changed my mind like that.$"
gBwText_322_239:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_240:
	.string "Thank you.\pI'm looking forward to the\nbeauty of Black City!$"
gBwText_322_241:
	.string "Leo: Oh, me?\nI'm moving to White Forest!\lI want to relax a little more!$"
gBwText_322_242:
	.string "Leo: Black City also has\nsome nice places, but\lit's a little too exciting for me.$"
gBwText_322_243:
	.string "Leo: White Forest...\nI'm really interested in it!$"
gBwText_322_244:
	.string "Leo: I'm starving for a little quiet, so\nI want to go to White Forest! If you\ldon't mind, would you take me there?$"
gBwText_322_245:
	.string "What! You won't...\nLet me know if you change your mind.$"
gBwText_322_246:
	.string "Oh! Sorry!\nI got an invitation from another place!$"
gBwText_322_247:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_248:
	.string "What? Really?\pThat's great! The gifts of\nthe forest are waiting for me!\lI'll wait for you in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_249:
	.string "Silvia: I'm moving to White Forest to\nget out of this rut!\pI'm looking forward to the fresh air!$"
gBwText_322_250:
	.string "Silvia: A new life in a place you've\nnever seen, far away from home... Every\lgirl dreams of this.$"
gBwText_322_251:
	.string "Silvia: All girls fall in love with\nbig, natural places!$"
gBwText_322_252:
	.string "Silvia: A new life in a place you've\nnever seen, far away from home!\pYou, the one reflected in my glasses,\ntake me to White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_253:
	.string "So, it's not going to work out? I'd sure\nlike it if you'd take me along, though...$"
gBwText_322_254:
	.string "I'm sorry!\pIt looks like my glinting\nglasses caught someone else's eye!$"
gBwText_322_255:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_256:
	.string "That someone who was\nreflected in my glasses is you!\lI'll be waiting in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_257:
	.string "Dave: Oh, sorry. I'm moving to\nWhite Forest!\pI've discovered that even a tough can\nbe too tough and get worn out!$"
gBwText_322_258:
	.string "Dave: 'Sup. I became the roughest\ntough in Black City.\pTime to aim for the top\nsomeplace new.$"
gBwText_322_259:
	.string "Dave: That White Forest...\nIt's really glittering.\lThat's also pretty interesting...$"
gBwText_322_260:
	.string "Dave: In Black City, I'm the\ntoughest tough who ever toughed.\lNo man alive can stop me here.\pHey, will you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_261:
	.string "Seriously...\pI'll polish myself into the kind of\nman you want to take with you.$"
gBwText_322_262:
	.string "Sorry, I got invited by someone\nelse. Invite me again sometime!$"
gBwText_322_263:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_264:
	.string "Thanks, yo!\nThis Roughneck is going to be the\lhead of White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_265:
	.string "Britney: I've done decided to\nhead to White Forest!\pNature is waitin' for me!$"
gBwText_322_266:
	.string "Britney: Freewheelin' is nice for sure,\nbut I also like windin' down!$"
gBwText_322_267:
	.string "Britney: White Forest...\nThat's where I wanna be!$"
gBwText_322_268:
	.string "Britney: Won't somebody take\nme to White Forest?\pWhy, hey! I'd be much obliged if\nyou could take me?$"
gBwText_322_269:
	.string "Now, whyever not?!\nWell, take me next time, OK?$"
gBwText_322_270:
	.string "Oh, I'm sorry!\nSomeone else done invited me!$"
gBwText_322_271:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_272:
	.string "Thankee!\nI'll go on ahead to the forest!$"
gBwText_322_273:
	.string "Robbie: Guess what?\nI'm moving to White Forest!\pWithout nature all around,\nit's hard to settle in, right?!$"
gBwText_322_274:
	.string "Robbie: Black City isn't a bad place,\nbut now I'm thinking White Forest might\lbe pretty nice too.$"
gBwText_322_275:
	.string "Robbie: Hey! Over there!\nWhite Forest looks so fun.\lI sure wish I could go!!$"
gBwText_322_276:
	.string "Robbie: Oh! That White Forest\nover there! It looks like fun!\pI've got it! You, take me with\nyou! Come on!$"
gBwText_322_277:
	.string "Robbie: Aww, why not?\nWell, if you change your mind...$"
gBwText_322_278:
	.string "Oh! I'm sorry!!\nI'm going to someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_279:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_280:
	.string "Thank you!\pI'm heading to White Forest now.\nSee you there!$"
gBwText_322_281:
	.string "Miki: I decided to go to White Forest.\pI'm a little quiet, and I'm worried\nI won't fit in.$"
gBwText_322_282:
	.string "Miki: It's comfortable here, but\nit's a little too exciting.$"
gBwText_322_283:
	.string "Miki: White Forest...\pSounds like fun, doesn't it. If I had\nthe chance, I'd sure love to go.$"
gBwText_322_284:
	.string "Miki: White Forest...\pSounds fun, doesn't it. If I had the\nchance, I'd sure love to go.\pHey, you wouldn't mind taking me\nalong, would you?$"
gBwText_322_285:
	.string "Sniff...\nDon't you want me to come?$"
gBwText_322_286:
	.string "Oh! I was invited by\nsomebody else. I'm sorry.$"
gBwText_322_287:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_288:
	.string "Thank you!\nI'll do my best in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_289:
	.string "Ryder: 'Sup! Well, I'm moving\nto White Forest.\pTraining amidst nature\nis a pretty good idea, right?$"
gBwText_322_290:
	.string "Ryder: Hyah! Hyah hyah...\nI'm having trouble getting pumped up!\pI wonder if my body can keep up\nwith continuous training.$"
gBwText_322_291:
	.string "Ryder: I've tested my abilities enough.\nI want to train soon...$"
gBwText_322_292:
	.string "Ryder: I've tested my abilities\nplenty now. I want to train!\pWould you mind taking me to\nWhite Forest?$"
gBwText_322_293:
	.string "I see... That's too bad.\nTalk to me again sometime.$"
gBwText_322_294:
	.string "Oh... My apologies.\nAnother person invited me.$"
gBwText_322_295:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_296:
	.string "Thank you!\nI know the location!\pI'll go on ahead to\nWhite Forest!$"
gBwText_322_297:
	.string "Karenna: Aaaahh... Bring it on!\nI've decided to go to White Forest!\pTraining is gonna be super hot!$"
gBwText_322_298:
	.string "Karenna: I've battled and battled.\nMy Pokémon and I\lmight be a little tired...$"
gBwText_322_299:
	.string "Karenna: To get the most\nout of my battling, I must train!$"
gBwText_322_300:
	.string "Karenna: I want to get the most from\nmy battles by training!\pHey! If you want, would you take\nme to White Forest?!$"
gBwText_322_301:
	.string "No way...\nWell, next time then, OK?$"
gBwText_322_302:
	.string "Oh! I'm so sorry!\nI'm going to someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_303:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_304:
	.string "This will make me even stronger!\nThank you so much!\pOK then, I'll go on ahead and\nbe waiting in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_305:
	.string "Doug: Why, hello there!\pIt is my intention to take up residence\nin White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_306:
	.string "Doug: Well hello!\pIt's very exciting here, but\nweariness tends to build up!$"
gBwText_322_307:
	.string "Doug: Why hello there.\pI've been having trouble recently,\nbecause my work isn't going well.\pIf I were in White Forest, I'm sure\nI could get a little relief!$"
gBwText_322_308:
	.string "Doug: Why hello there.\pI've been having trouble recently,\nbecause my work isn't going well.\pWould you be so kind as to\ntake me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_309:
	.string "Oh, I see. Do forgive the presumption.$"
gBwText_322_310:
	.string "Oh dear. Your timing is most\nunfortunate. I'm afraid I have already\laccepted another invitation.$"
gBwText_322_311:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_312:
	.string "Thank you very much!\pWell then, I shall be off.\nI shall see you there!$"
gBwText_322_313:
	.string "Vincent: Hey! It's you! Well, I'm off to\nshow my brilliance in White Forest!\lThe beautiful forest awaits!$"
gBwText_322_314:
	.string "Vincent: Living here is a little\nboring for a guy like me.$"
gBwText_322_315:
	.string "Vincent: Maybe I would be a good\nmatch for that White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_316:
	.string "Vincent: I was considering favoring\nthat White Forest with a visit. It seems\lfitting to me, but what do you think?$"
gBwText_322_317:
	.string "Sorry, I couldn't hear you.\nMaybe I'll ask again later.$"
gBwText_322_318:
	.string "Oooh. Sorry!\nI'm very popular!\lI'm already booked up.$"
gBwText_322_319:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_320:
	.string "Well if you really want me\nto join you...\pI guess I'll have to go to White Forest,\nthen. Just for you!$"
gBwText_322_321:
	.string "Marie: I'm full of enough energy now!\nI'm going to White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_322:
	.string "Marie: I'm really tired, and I want\nto go back to White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_323:
	.string "Marie: I'd like to stretch out my\nlegs in the spacious White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_324:
	.string "Marie: White Forest!\nHow nice! I want to go too.\pI've got it! Would you be a\ndear and take me there?$"
gBwText_322_325:
	.string "Oh my.\nAre you in a bad mood?$"
gBwText_322_326:
	.string "My oh my. I'm sorry.\nI was invited by someone else.$"
gBwText_322_327:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_328:
	.string "Thank you! Thank you!\nWell I'll go on ahead then.$"
gBwText_322_329:
	.string "Lena: White Forest...\nI've decided to go there.$"
gBwText_322_330:
	.string "Lena: The city refuses nature.\nIs that the right thing?\lI'd like to find out in the forest.$"
gBwText_322_331:
	.string "Lena: Hmm... It's so busy here.\nMy spirit can never rest.$"
gBwText_322_332:
	.string "Lena: I want to go to that\nWhite Forest too...\lMind if I go with you?$"
gBwText_322_333:
	.string "I see...\nToo bad.$"
gBwText_322_334:
	.string "Sorry.\nI was invited by someone else...$"
gBwText_322_335:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_336:
	.string "Thank you.\nI'll be waiting in White Forest...$"
gBwText_322_337:
	.string "Carlos: Heeey! I decided to give\ngoing to White Forest a try.\pIt'll be a laid-back, freewheeling trip!$"
gBwText_322_338:
	.string "Carlos: I enjoy looking at\nthe big city, but I miss nature!$"
gBwText_322_339:
	.string "Carlos: As a Backpacker, I want to go\nplaces where there is beautiful\lscenery!$"
gBwText_322_340:
	.string "Carlos: I've had plenty of big-city\nflavor. I think that's enough!\pHey, you! Could you please\ntake me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_341:
	.string "Hmmm... Isn't there any way I could go?\nI really want you to take me there...$"
gBwText_322_342:
	.string "Huh? I'm sorry. I'm going to go\nto someone else's place.$"
gBwText_322_343:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_344:
	.string "Oh! Thanks!\nWell, I'll head to White Forest then!\lSee you later, OK?$"
gBwText_322_345:
	.string "Molly: I'm going to White Forest!\pI'd rather see lots of places\nthan stay in one spot!$"
gBwText_322_346:
	.string "Molly: I think I need a\nchange of scenery soon.\pI want to see lots of different places!$"
gBwText_322_347:
	.string "Molly: I want to go somewhere\ndifferent soon.\lKnow any nice places?$"
gBwText_322_348:
	.string "Molly: OK, it's decided!\nI'm going to leave this place!\pThat's why I have something to ask you.\nCould you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_349:
	.string "What? Even though I asked nicely!\nI'm crestfallen...$"
gBwText_322_350:
	.string "I was invited by someone else...\nSorry, but I'm going there.$"
gBwText_322_351:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_352:
	.string "Thank you!\nI'll head there right now!\pSee you in White Forest!\nThanks again!$"
gBwText_322_353:
	.string "Frederic: Sorry, but I'm leaving for\nWhite Forest. I'm preparing for\lmy move now. If you need something,\ltell me in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_354:
	.string "Frederic: My Pokémon are\nstubbornly insisting we go\lto White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_355:
	.string "Frederic: White Forest, huh... My\nPokémon are noisily insisting on going.$"
gBwText_322_356:
	.string "Frederic: White Forest, huh... My\nPokémon are noisily insisting on going.\pOh hey, I need a favor!\pCould you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_357:
	.string "What? Have you no respect\nfor your elders? If you come around,\lI'll be waiting, young one.$"
gBwText_322_358:
	.string "Sorry!\pI'd completely forgotten, but my\ndestination has already been decided.$"
gBwText_322_359:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_360:
	.string "Well said. I'm grateful!\pWell then, I'm going to head\nto White Forest. I'll be waiting!$"
gBwText_322_361:
	.string "Lynette: I'm tired of searching\nfor strong people.\pFor now, I'm going to relax\nin White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_362:
	.string "Lynette: I'm tired of living like this.\nFor now, I just want to rest and\lrecover.$"
gBwText_322_363:
	.string "Lynette: Your White Forest seems\nreally charming. I'd like to live there.$"
gBwText_322_364:
	.string "Lynette: I'm tired of searching for\nmy destiny.\pIf it's OK with you, could you\ntake me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_365:
	.string "My! I can't believe you are so\nrude as to refuse my request.$"
gBwText_322_366:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\pI found a different, wonderful\nperson...\lI'm ever so sorry.$"
gBwText_322_367:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_368:
	.string "I'd like to thank you.\pI'll try to enjoy a leisurely\nlife with Pokémon.$"
gBwText_322_369:
	.string "Pierce: I'm a-goin' to White Forest.\nI'd like to live the slow life.$"
gBwText_322_370:
	.string "Pierce: Ah, the cultured life\nis restless and exhausting.$"
gBwText_322_371:
	.string "Pierce: Hmmm. Your White Forest seems\nto be a comfortable place. I'm jealous...$"
gBwText_322_372:
	.string "Pierce: I'm tired of this restless\nlife. I want life to be more laid back.\pWould you take me to your White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_373:
	.string "What a shame...\nAu revoir, lovely country life!$"
gBwText_322_374:
	.string "Hey! Sorry!\pI decided to go to a different\nWhite Forest! Lo siento!$"
gBwText_322_375:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_376:
	.string "Thank you for taking me with you.\pI'm going to enjoy the relaxed\nlife for awhile.$"
gBwText_322_377:
	.string "Gene: I'm going to move to White\nForest! I'm excited about the Pokémon\lI will encounter in nature!$"
gBwText_322_378:
	.string "Gene: Hmmm...\pI'm tired of testing myself as a\nTrainer. I want to live the kind of life\lwhere I meet Pokémon every day!$"
gBwText_322_379:
	.string "Gene: It looks like you can meet a lot\nof Pokémon in your White Forest!\pIt seems charming.$"
gBwText_322_380:
	.string "Gene: Testing my abilities was\nexciting, but I'm tired of it!\lI want to live while watching Pokémon.\pCould you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_381:
	.string "Whaaat! That's disappointing...\nI'll wait for the next opportunity!$"
gBwText_322_382:
	.string "Hmph! I've definitely changed my mind.\pI've decided to go to\na different White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_383:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_384:
	.string "Ha ha!\pI'm looking forward to a life where I\ncan leisurely encounter Pokémon! Hey,\lthanks!$"
gBwText_322_385:
	.string "Piper: I'm moving to White Forest now!\nI'm looking forward to a fresh start!$"
gBwText_322_386:
	.string "Piper: Somehow I grew a little\ntired of pursuing efficiency...\pI want to relax in White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_387:
	.string "Piper: I hear that your White Forest is\nrelaxing and has beautiful natural\lscenery. I envy you...$"
gBwText_322_388:
	.string "Piper: I want to live a more\nrelaxed life!\pCould you take me to White Forest\nso I can?$"
gBwText_322_389:
	.string "Oh...\nThat's too bad.$"
gBwText_322_390:
	.string "I'm sorry. I've changed my mind.\pI've decided to go to a\ndifferent White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_391:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_392:
	.string "Thank you!\pI'm looking forward to leisurely\npassing time in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_393:
	.string "Miho: I'm going to move to White Forest!\pI look forward to living\nwith cute Pokémon!$"
gBwText_322_394:
	.string "Miho: Recently, I'm tired of\ndecorating myself...\pI want to live the slow life\nin White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_395:
	.string "Miho: I'm jealous. That White Forest\nlooks like it has many cute Pokémon in\lit!$"
gBwText_322_396:
	.string "Miho: I'm tired of shopping and\nbeing fashionable.\pI want to go to White Forest where\nI can be more in my natural state.\lWould you take me?$"
gBwText_322_397:
	.string "What?! Cheapskate.$"
gBwText_322_398:
	.string "I'm such a flirt...\nTruth is: I found someone else.\pI decided to go to their White Forest.\nI'm sorry.$"
gBwText_322_399:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_400:
	.string "Thank you!\pIn White Forest, I'll just live\nnaturally. I won't try too hard to deck\lmyself out.$"
gBwText_322_401:
	.string "Shane: I'm moving to White Forest.\nI'm going to entrust myself to nature.\pI'm looking forward to it!$"
gBwText_322_402:
	.string "Shane: Recently, I've been thinking it\nwould be nice to live in White Forest\land just be as I am without worrying\labout how other people see me.$"
gBwText_322_403:
	.string "Shane: I'm jealous of your\nWhite Forest!\lI'd like to go too.$"
gBwText_322_404:
	.string "Shane: I've been thinking I just want\nto be myself and not worry about how\lother people judge me.\lWill you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_405:
	.string "Too bad. I wanted to go to\nyour city.$"
gBwText_322_406:
	.string "Sorry! I decided to follow\nsomeone else. My bad.$"
gBwText_322_407:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_408:
	.string "Thanks a lot!\pI think I can live just like I am\nin White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_409:
	.string "Ralph: I'm leaving for White Forest\nright now! I want to share my feelings\lwith a lot of different people and\lPokémon!$"
gBwText_322_410:
	.string "Ralph: Sigh...\nI want to share my feelings\lwith more people and Pokémon.\lI want to live like that...$"
gBwText_322_411:
	.string "Ralph: Your White Forest...\pSeems like everyone can communicate\ntheir feelings to each other.\lI'm jealous...$"
gBwText_322_412:
	.string "Ralph: Recently, I've been wanting to\nlive where I communicate what I'm\lfeeling not only to my opponent, but to\lmore people and Pokémon as well.\pPlease take me to your White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_413:
	.string "What... I'm shocked you don't\nunderstand my feelings...$"
gBwText_322_414:
	.string "Oh!\pI have another place I want to go\nbecause of a different thing that\lcame up! Sorry!$"
gBwText_322_415:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_416:
	.string "I'm really happy.\pNow, I can live a life where I\ncommunicate my feelings to many people\land Pokémon.$"
gBwText_322_417:
	.string "Eliza: I'm leaving for White Forest!\nI wonder what kind of place it is?$"
gBwText_322_418:
	.string "Eliza: You can get anything in\nBlack City, but it feels\llike something's missing.$"
gBwText_322_419:
	.string "Eliza: White Forest seems spiritually\nfulfilling. I'm jealous that you can live\llike that...$"
gBwText_322_420:
	.string "Eliza: In Black City, you can\nget whatever you want, but\lsomething is missing.\pThat's it! Would you take\nme to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_421:
	.string "Is that so...\nToo bad...$"
gBwText_322_422:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\nI'm going to a different White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_423:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_424:
	.string "I'm so happy!\pI'm looking forward\nto living in White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_425:
	.string "Collin: Opportunities! Business\nopportunities galore in White Forest! \lPiles of money, here I come!$"
gBwText_322_426:
	.string "Collin: Even if I think of something,\nusually someone has beaten me to it!\pMaking money isn't easy!$"
gBwText_322_427:
	.string "Collin: I've looked for business\nopportunities only found in the big\lcity, but nothing that interesting is\lrolling my way...$"
gBwText_322_428:
	.string "Collin: Opportunities\ndidn't exist here!\pGoing after business off the beaten\npath is more my style!\pHate to be a bother, but can you\ntake me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_429:
	.string "A Clerk ? has to be patient.\nI'll wait until you are ready to take me!$"
gBwText_322_430:
	.string "Oh! I just thought of another\nbusiness opportunity!\lSorry, but I'm going somewhere else!$"
gBwText_322_431:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_432:
	.string "All right!\pIn White Forest, I'm going\nto be a success!$"
gBwText_322_433:
	.string "Ken: I'm leaving for White Forest!\pI'm going to obtain a wide variety\nof knowledge in a new place!$"
gBwText_322_434:
	.string "Ken: In Black City, all I do\nis Pokémon battling...\pIf I think about it, there's something\nmissing for me as a Trainer.\pI want to spend time in an environment\nthat will give me a wider point of view.$"
gBwText_322_435:
	.string "Ken: Your White Forest seems like a\nplace with a lot of Pokémon.\pI'm jealous, because you can widen your\nhorizons.$"
gBwText_322_436:
	.string "Ken: As a Pokémon Trainer, I want to\nlook at Pokémon from a wider point of\lview.\pWill you please take me to your forest?$"
gBwText_322_437:
	.string "Really.\nI'll ask someone else.$"
gBwText_322_438:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\pI'm going to go to a\ndifferent White Forest.$"
gBwText_322_439:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_440:
	.string "OK! I'm going to widen my point\nof view as a Trainer in White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_441:
	.string "Jacques: I want to find a variety of\nanswers, so I'm going to White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_442:
	.string "Jacques: Sigh...\pI want research in an environment\nwhere I get many different answers...$"
gBwText_322_443:
	.string "Jacques: Your White Forest...\pIt's full of variations! It looks like\nI can do my research there!$"
gBwText_322_444:
	.string "Jacques: It seems like there is really\na lot of variation in your White Forest.\pIt seems like it might enhance\nmy research!\pWould you take me there?$"
gBwText_322_445:
	.string "I'm really disappointed by\nyour clear answer!$"
gBwText_322_446:
	.string "Oh, I've decided to go to a\ndifferent White Forest!\pThe answers I'm looking\nfor are there!$"
gBwText_322_447:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_448:
	.string "Oh!\nThank you!$"
gBwText_322_449:
	.string "Rosa: I'm leaving for White Forest!\nIt seems like there, I can live each\lday to the fullest!$"
gBwText_322_450:
	.string "Rosa: Just living, killing time\nfrom day to day...\pRecently, I've been wondering\nif this is a good way to live.$"
gBwText_322_451:
	.string "Rosa: Your White Forest looks like a\nplace where you can live to the fullest.\lI'm jealous.$"
gBwText_322_452:
	.string "Rosa: I want to treat every day with\nmore importance.\pWon't you take me\nto your White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_453:
	.string "My!\nAren't you the selfish one!$"
gBwText_322_454:
	.string "I've changed my mind.\nI'm going to a different place!$"
gBwText_322_455:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_456:
	.string "Oh boy!\pLiving life to the fullest!\nI'm looking forward to it!$"
gBwText_322_457:
	.string "Herman: Next, I'm going to White Forest!\nAre you jealous?$"
gBwText_322_458:
	.string "Herman: Aaah...\nI want to go to White Forest!\pI'm tired of this wandering life.$"
gBwText_322_459:
	.string "Herman: White Forest seems\nlike a place that's easy to live in.\lI'd like to go sometime!$"
gBwText_322_460:
	.string "Herman: I'm getting tired of\nliving here!\pCould you take me to White Forest?$"
gBwText_322_461:
	.string "Fine. Whatever.$"
gBwText_322_462:
	.string "Changed my mind!\nI'm setting off for a different place!$"
gBwText_322_463:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_464:
	.string "All right! Thanks!\nI'm looking forward to my next trip!$"
gBwText_322_465:
	.string "Emi: I'm setting off for my next place!\nWhite Forest! It looks like fun, right?$"
gBwText_322_466:
	.string "Emi: Oh, I want to set off for my\nnext destination soon!$"
gBwText_322_467:
	.string "Emi: White Forest sounds nice!\nI'd like to go there!$"
gBwText_322_468:
	.string "Emi: I don't have a goal for my\nnext trip! I want to relax.\pWhite Forest sounds nice.\nHey, will you take me there?$"
gBwText_322_469:
	.string "What?!\nToo bad...$"
gBwText_322_470:
	.string "Uh, I've given up on that!\pI decided to go to a\ndifferent White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_471:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_472:
	.string "Thank you!\pLooks like my next\ntrip will be fun!$"
gBwText_322_473:
	.string "Grace: I'm searching for bold, new art!\nNext, I'm going to White Forest!$"
gBwText_322_474:
	.string "Grace: I think beauty made\nonly by people is not enough...\lDon't you feel that way?$"
gBwText_322_475:
	.string "Grace: White Forest...\nNow, that is art created by nature.\lI want to see it with my own eyes!$"
gBwText_322_476:
	.string "Grace: White Forest...\nNow that is art created by nature!\lI want to see it with my own eyes.\pYou...\nCould you take me there?$"
gBwText_322_477:
	.string "Your direct answer is\nalso beautiful.$"
gBwText_322_478:
	.string "Oh, what was that?\pOh, that's right.\nI'm going to a different White Forest.\lSorry I changed my mind like that.$"
gBwText_322_479:
	.string "$"
gBwText_322_480:
	.string "Thank you.\pI'm looking forward to the\nbeauty of White Forest!$"
