gBwText_344_0:
	.string "It is believed that dreams and desires\nof people and Pokémon in Unova swirled\linto the center and were formed into\lPass Power.$"
gBwText_344_1:
	.string "Maybe people in the past created the\nlandscape of Unova that looks like a\lswirl in order to use Pass Power...$"
gBwText_344_2:
	.string "$"
