	.4byte 4
gBwText_345_0:
	.string "People say the ruins of the Entralink\nhave existed since long before we\lstarted living with Pokémon.\pIt's unbelievable that this power has\nexisted for such a long time.$"
gBwText_345_1:
	.string "Huh? Where did everybody go?\pI came to the sea with other people, and\nI was playing with them...$"
