gBwText_346_0:
	.string "Hello, and welcome to\nthe Pokémon Center.\pWe restore your tired Pokémon\nto full health.\pWould you like to rest your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_1:
	.string "Good morning! Welcome to\nthe Pokémon Center.\pWe restore your tired Pokémon\nto full health.\pWould you like to rest your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_2:
	.string "Hello, and welcome to\nthe Pokémon Center.\pWe restore your tired Pokémon\nto full health.\pWould you like to rest your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_3:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Center.\pHey! Is today your birthday?$"
gBwText_346_4:
	.string "Happy birthday!\pPlease keep visiting the Pokémon\nCenter for many years to come.\pNow, would you like to rest\nyour Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_5:
	.string "It isn't? Oh, I must have been\nconfused.\pWould you like to rest your Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_6:
	.string "OK, I'll take your Pokémon for\na few seconds.$"
gBwText_346_7:
	.string "Thank you for waiting.\pWe've restored your Pokémon\nto full health.$"
gBwText_346_8:
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"
gBwText_346_9:
	.string "Hello, and welcome to\nthe Pokémon Center.\pWe restore your tired Pokémon\nto full health.\pWould you like to...$"
gBwText_346_10:
	.string "Th-that Trainer Card!\nThat wonderful shade! That sparkle!\pI've seen several Trainers with\nSilver Trainer Cards already...\pBut you're the first to top them all\nwith that impressive Trainer Card.\pOh, {STR_VAR_1}, may I please heal\nyour Pokémon?$"
gBwText_346_11:
	.string "Great to see you, {STR_VAR_1}!\nYou want the usual, right?$"
gBwText_346_12:
	.string "Oh... It looks like your Pokémon may be\ninfected with the Pokérus.\pLittle is known about the Pokérus,\nexcept that it is a microscopic\llife-form that attaches to Pokémon.\pWhile infected, Pokémon are said to\ngrow exceptionally well.$"
gBwText_346_13:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Wireless\nClub Union Room.\pYou may interact directly with\nmany Trainers here.\pWould you like to enter the room?$"
gBwText_346_14:
	.string "The Trainers in the Union Room\nwill be those players around you\lwho have also entered the room.\pYou may trade your Pokémon here\nor have battles for two or four.\pAlso, you may exchange Eggs\nor draw pictures with other players.\pYou may also chat with other\nplayers in the room.\pOr you may find friends by touching\nthe spoken words.\pWould you like to enter the room?$"
gBwText_346_15:
	.string "DS Wireless Communications\nwill be launched.$"
gBwText_346_16:
	.string "I hope you enjoy your time in\nthe Union Room.$"
gBwText_346_17:
	.string "Please do visit again.$"
gBwText_346_18:
	.string "Enter the Union Room$"
gBwText_346_19:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_346_20:
	.string "Info$"
gBwText_346_21:
	.string "I am sorry...\nYou can't enter the Union Room yet.$"
gBwText_346_22:
	.string "You have at least one Pokémon\nthat can't be taken in.$"
gBwText_346_23:
	.string "Wait, Trainer!\pYour title on your Trainer Card is still\njust “Pokémon Trainer,“ isn't it?\pIf you change your title, you can easily\nproject your image to others when you\lgreet them in the Union Room.\pLet's see...\nHow about {STR_VAR_1}?\lWhat do you think?\pThat is the impression I got from you.\nFirst, let's change your title.\pIf you don't like the new one, you can\nchange it by selecting your Trainer\lCard.$"
gBwText_346_24:
	.string "It seems you can't use it yet.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_346
