gBwText_347_0:
	.string "Er...\nWho was I again?\p...\n...\p...Oh, that's right!\nI am the Move Deleter!$"
gBwText_347_1:
	.string "You've come to make me force your\nPokémon to forget some moves?$"
gBwText_347_2:
	.string "Which Pokémon should forget a move?$"
gBwText_347_3:
	.string "Remember me if there are moves that\nneed to be forgotten.$"
gBwText_347_4:
	.string "That Pokémon knows only one move,\nso it can't be forgotten...$"
gBwText_347_5:
	.string "What? That's an Egg.\nNo Egg should know any moves.$"
gBwText_347_6:
	.string "OK, then.\nWhich move should be forgotten?$"
gBwText_347_7:
	.string "Hm! The move {STR_VAR_1}?\nShould that move be forgotten?$"
gBwText_347_8:
	.string "It worked perfectly!\pYour Pokémon has forgotten the move\n{STR_VAR_1} completely.$"
gBwText_347_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_12:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_13:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_14:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_16:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_17:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_18:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_19:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_20:
	.string "Which move should\n{STR_VAR_1} remember?$"
gBwText_347_21:
	.string "Should the move {STR_VAR_2}\nbe remembered?$"
gBwText_347_22:
	.string "Give up trying to make \n{STR_VAR_1} remember a move?$"
gBwText_347_23:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} remembered the move\n{STR_VAR_2} it had forgotten!$"
gBwText_347_24:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} wants to remember\nthe move {STR_VAR_2}.\pBut {STR_VAR_1} can't learn more\nthan four moves.\pDelete an existing move to make \nroom for {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_347_25:
	.string "1, 2, and... ... ... Ta-da!\p\p{STR_VAR_1} forgot how to\nuse {STR_VAR_2}.\pAnd...$"
gBwText_347_26:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} remembered the move\n{STR_VAR_2} it had forgotten!$"
gBwText_347_27:
	.string "Give up on making the Pokémon\nremember {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_347_28:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} did not remember the\nmove {STR_VAR_2}.$"
gBwText_347_29:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} handed over one\nHeart Scale in exchange.$"
gBwText_347_30:
	.string "Is it OK to forget the\nmove {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_347_31:
	.string "Everybody calls me the reminder girl.\pI know every move that Pokémon learn\nwhile they're leveling up.\pAnd I can make Pokémon remember\nthose moves!\pIf you bring me a Heart Scale, I'll make\na Pokémon remember a move.$"
gBwText_347_32:
	.string "Should a move be remembered?$"
gBwText_347_33:
	.string "Which Pokémon should learn it?$"
gBwText_347_34:
	.string "If any of your Pokémon needs to\nremember a move, bring me a Heart Scale!$"
gBwText_347_35:
	.string "Eggs can't remember moves!$"
gBwText_347_36:
	.string "This Pokémon hasn't forgotten\nany moves.$"
gBwText_347_37:
	.string "$"
gBwText_347_38:
	.string "POWER$"
gBwText_347_39:
	.string "ACCURACY$"
gBwText_347_40:
	.string "PP$"
