gBwText_349_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_349_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_349_2:
	.string "Cheren: Professor Juniper, I'm sorry\nto have kept you waiting.$"
gBwText_349_3:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Now that everyone's\nhere, I'll explain.\pThe Pokédex's pages update\nautomatically whenever you meet a\lPokémon!\pMoreover, it's set up so that\nyou obtain even more information\lwhen you catch a Pokémon!\pTo make this clear, I'm going to\ndemonstrate how to catch a Pokémon!$"
gBwText_349_4:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Did you see that,\njust now?\pHere's how it goes, step by step.\nFirst, reduce the Pokémon's HP!\pPokémon that still have all of\ntheir energy are difficult to catch.\pIf you can, use your Pokémon's moves\nto make the Pokémon you want to catch\lfall asleep. Or paralyze it!\pAnd to wrap this up in the best way,\nI have a gift for you--some Poké Balls!$"
gBwText_349_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_349_6:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Poké Balls are used\nfor catching Pokémon and for carrying\lthe Pokémon you catch!\pI'm going on ahead. I'll be waiting for\nyou in Accumula Town!$"
gBwText_349_7:
	.string "Cheren: She forgot to say that Pokémon\njump out at you in the tall grass.$"
gBwText_349_8:
	.string "I'm heading to Accumula Town, too.$"
gBwText_349_9:
	.string "Bianca: I think I'll go, too.\pI'm looking forward to the next town\nso I can go shopping for Poké Balls!$"
gBwText_349_10:
	.string "Bianca: Wait a minute!\pHey, listen!\n{STR_VAR_1}, Cheren,\lI thought of something fun!$"
gBwText_349_11:
	.string "Cheren: But we need to get going! I'd\nimagine the professor's waiting, too.$"
gBwText_349_12:
	.string "Bianca: Would you just listen a sec?\nSeriously!\pWhy don't we see who can catch\nthe most Pokémon?\pThe person carrying the most Pokémon,\nincluding the one received from\lProfessor Juniper, is the winner!$"
gBwText_349_13:
	.string "Cheren: Huh.\nActually, that sounds interesting.\pIt will fill up Pokédex pages, so I'm\nsure it will please the professor, too.\pOK, then. Until we reach Accumula Town,\ntake care of healing your Pokémon\lat your own house.$"
gBwText_349_14:
	.string "Bianca: Me and {STR_VAR_1}\nwill do the best for sure!$"
gBwText_349_15:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, are you going to\ncompare yourself with Bianca?\pBoth Bianca and I have two Pokémon\nwith us.$"
gBwText_349_16:
	.string "Bianca: How about it, {STR_VAR_1}?\pDo you want to compare which one\nof us has the most Pokémon with them?$"
gBwText_349_17:
	.string "Bianca: Hmm...\nGuess I'll be waiting here, then.$"
gBwText_349_18:
	.string "Bianca: Wow, {STR_VAR_1}?! That's\nawesome!\pAre you excited to have that many\nPokémon with you?$"
gBwText_349_19:
	.string "Bianca: Seems the number of Pokémon\n{STR_VAR_1} has is...\pTwo!\nWe all have the same number, then!$"
gBwText_349_20:
	.string "Bianca: What? What? What?\nYou only have {STR_VAR_1}?!\pIf you don't catch any Pokémon, won't\n{STR_VAR_1} get lonely?$"
gBwText_349_21:
	.string "Cheren: Incidentally, if you check your\nPokédex, you'll see how many Pokémon\lyou've found and how many\lyou've caught.\pI'm off to Accumula Town!\nThe professor is waiting.$"
gBwText_349_22:
	.string "$"
gBwText_349_23:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_349_24:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_349_25:
	.string "Cheren: Well, I'm going on ahead.$"
gBwText_349_26:
	.string "Is your Pokémon's HP all right?\pWhen your Pokémon's HP decreases while\nyou're on the road, it can be\la big problem, so I'll give you this.\pPut it in your Bag's Medicine Case.$"
gBwText_349_27:
	.string "When your Pokémon's HP decreases, they\nno longer have the energy to fight.\pSo, don't push your Pokémon too hard,\nand let them rest often.$"
gBwText_349_28:
	.string "Wild Pokémon are hiding in the tall\ngrass. What does this mean for you?\pIt means when you want to battle\nor capture wild Pokémon,\lyou should go walk in the tall grass.$"
gBwText_349_29:
	.string "Route 1$"
gBwText_349_30:
	.string "Route 1$"
gBwText_349_31:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pMake an effort to talk to all the\npeople you meet during your journey!\pChances are they will have something\nuseful to tell you.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_349
