gBwText_351_0:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_351_1:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_351_2:
	.string "Mom: {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_351_3:
	.string "I finally caught up with you...\nAnd look how far you've come already!\pProfessor Juniper said that you were\nprobably headed for Striaton City by\lnow.\pI have another present for you.\n{STR_VAR_1}! Try these on!$"
gBwText_351_4:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received a pair of\nRunning Shoes!$"
gBwText_351_5:
	.string "When you're wearing the Running Shoes,\nyou can go anywhere in a flash!\pLet me read you the instructions...\p“Hold the B Button to run faster than\nnormal. Put on the Running Shoes and\ltear around to your heart's content!“\pThat's what it says.\pI bought these a long time ago\nand stashed them away somewhere.\pI found them when I was cleaning up.\nGuess it's good to clean occasionally!$"
gBwText_351_6:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, you understand that\nyou're never really alone, right?\pYou're with Pokémon, you have friends,\nand you're always in my thoughts.\pThat's all right, then. Enjoy your trip!$"
gBwText_351_7:
	.string "Bianca: Ohhhhh! Hi, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_351_8:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}! C'mon, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_351_9:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, listen!\nLet's have a Pokémon battle!\pPleeeease? The Pokémon I caught\nhave become a little stronger!\pReady or not, here I come!$"
gBwText_351_10:
	.string "Bianca: Woo-hoo!\pYou are a tough cookie, {STR_VAR_1}.\pI'm gonna work hard on training my\nPokémon so we won't lose anymore!\lOK, bye-bye!$"
gBwText_351_11:
	.string "Hey, you!\pI'm gonna do something amazing!\nWanna watch?$"
gBwText_351_12:
	.string "OK! Wait one second!$"
gBwText_351_13:
	.string "Wooo!$"
gBwText_351_14:
	.string "Hey! Were you watching?\pYou can take a shortcut by\njumping off ledges! Amazing, eh?$"
gBwText_351_15:
	.string "No need to be shy!$"
gBwText_351_16:
	.string "When your Pokémon don't have\nenough energy to fight...\lJust walk on the road!\pPokémon only appear in the tall grass!$"
gBwText_351_17:
	.string "Battles between Pokémon Trainers\nare serious affairs you can't run from!$"
gBwText_351_18:
	.string "Route 2$"
gBwText_351_19:
	.string "Route 2$"
gBwText_351_20:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pPokémon that participate in battle\nreceive Exp. Points.\pHave your Pokémon battle often,\nand make them stronger and stronger!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_351
