	.4byte 2
gBwText_353_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_353_1:
	.string "You only have one Pokémon?\nAnd you call yourself a Trainer?\pWell, it's too dangerous for\nyou to go any further!$"
gBwText_353_2:
	.string "We're going to combine our strength\nand do our best, so please watch!$"
gBwText_353_3:
	.string "Ummm...\nOne plus one is two, right?$"
gBwText_353_4:
	.string "Maybe I could have won if I had used\na Potion or something at some point?$"
gBwText_353_5:
	.string "It's hard to win in a Double Battle if\none Pokémon faints.$"
gBwText_353_6:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, stop!\pWe both have a Trio Badge,\nso let's see which of us is stronger!$"
gBwText_353_7:
	.string "Cheren: I see.\nSo that's how you battle.$"
gBwText_353_8:
	.string "???: Out of the way!$"
gBwText_353_9:
	.string "Cheren: What was that about?$"
gBwText_353_10:
	.string "Bianca?\nWhy are you running?$"
gBwText_353_11:
	.string "Bianca: Hey!\nWhere were those people headed?$"
gBwText_353_12:
	.string "Cheren: That way, but...$"
gBwText_353_13:
	.string "Why are you running now?$"
gBwText_353_14:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, seriously!\nThey run so fast!$"
gBwText_353_15:
	.string "Little Girl: Miss... Oh...\nMy Pokémon?$"
gBwText_353_16:
	.string "Bianca: It'll be OK.\nIt'll be OK. Don't cry.$"
gBwText_353_17:
	.string "Cheren: Bianca, really, why\nwere you running?$"
gBwText_353_18:
	.string "Bianca: You have to hear this!\pThose people stole this girl's Pokémon!$"
gBwText_353_19:
	.string "Cheren: You should have\nspoken up sooner!$"
gBwText_353_20:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, we're going to get\nthat Pokémon back.\pBianca! Please stay by the girl's side.$"
gBwText_353_21:
	.string "Bianca: Please, {STR_VAR_1}.\pTeam Plasma took that Pokémon.\nGet it back!$"
gBwText_353_22:
	.string "Bianca: Please, {STR_VAR_1}.\pTeam Plasma took that Pokémon.\nGet it back!$"
gBwText_353_23:
	.string "Little Girl: Oh, why do they\ntake people's Pokémon?$"
gBwText_353_24:
	.string "Cheren: They ran inside here!\p{STR_VAR_1}, your Pokémon's HP is fine,\nand you're ready to go, right?$"
gBwText_353_25:
	.string "Then let's go.$"
gBwText_353_26:
	.string "I could never forgive myself if we were\nto lose to the kinds of thugs who would\ltake people's Pokémon!\pI'll wait here. Hurry and get ready!$"
gBwText_353_27:
	.string "I could never forgive myself if we were\nto lose to the kinds of thugs who would\ltake people's Pokémon!\pI'll wait here. Hurry and get ready!$"
gBwText_353_28:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, your Pokémon's HP\nis fine, and you're ready to go, right?$"
gBwText_353_29:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, thank you so much!\nThe two of you got her Pokémon back!\pI'm lucky to have friends like you two!$"
gBwText_353_30:
	.string "Little Girl: Thank you, mister! Please\ntake these as a thank-you present.$"
gBwText_353_31:
	.string "Little Girl: Thank you, miss! Please\ntake these as a thank-you present.$"
gBwText_353_32:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh! Those are Heal Balls!\pThey completely heal the captured\nPokémon on the spot! How sweet of you!\pI'm going to see this girl on her way,\nso see you later, {STR_VAR_1}. Bye-bye!$"
gBwText_353_33:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, stop!$"
gBwText_353_34:
	.string "That dark tall grass over there...\pEvery now and again, two Pokémon\nwill pop out at the same time.$"
gBwText_353_35:
	.string "In other words, you have to be\ncareful in the darker grass.\pI'm heading on to Nacrene City.$"
gBwText_353_36:
	.string "Heeey, {STR_VAR_1}!\nCome here!$"
gBwText_353_37:
	.string "Heeey, {STR_VAR_1}!\nCome here!$"
gBwText_353_38:
	.string "Pokémon battling is very popular\nat this Day Care.\pIf you go in the playground, you'll\nbe pestered into battling.$"
gBwText_353_39:
	.string "You w-want to have a Double Battle?\pOur P-Pokémon aren't strong enough\nyet.\pMaybe we'll leave them at the Day Care.$"
gBwText_353_40:
	.string "Our perfectly matched combination\nflusters all the other Trainers!$"
gBwText_353_41:
	.string "Sometimes they let\nus play with Pokémon!$"
gBwText_353_42:
	.string "Route 3$"
gBwText_353_43:
	.string "$"
gBwText_353_44:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pThe Pokémon placed in the upper\nleft of the Pokémon list is important!\pThe Pokémon set there is the first\nout when a Pokémon battle starts!$"
gBwText_353_45:
	.string "Pokémon Day Care\nWe Take Care of Your Precious Pokémon$"
gBwText_353_46:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_353
