gBwText_354_0:
	.string "I happen to be the daughter of the\ncouple running the Pokémon Day Care\lnext door!\pI know, it's sweet, isn't it?\pParents and daughter all bringing up\nyoungsters for a living.\pHelping Pokémon and people grow up\nhealthy is a wonderful thing!$"
gBwText_354_1:
	.string "Are you familiar with Double Battles?$"
gBwText_354_2:
	.string "Oh, I do love explaining how things work.\pNow, a Double Battle is a Pokémon battle\nwith two Pokémon on each side.\pChoosing two that combine well is vital.$"
gBwText_354_3:
	.string "You do have a Gym Badge, after all.\pYou're well aware that Double Battles\nare Pokémon battles where each side\luses two Pokémon!$"
gBwText_354_4:
	.string "Seriously. Guys are all just little boys.$"
gBwText_354_5:
	.string "Yeah! Yeah!$"
gBwText_354_6:
	.string "Rrrraaaaar!\pI'll run! You gonna chase me? \nYou run! Am I gonna chase you?\pChange your perspective--\nand the reality changes.$"
gBwText_354_7:
	.string "Your Pokémon are really energetic!$"
gBwText_354_8:
	.string "Um-hmm.\nYour Pokémon...\pThey don't seem to be healthy.\nLet them rest here a little bit!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_354
