gBwText_355_0:
	.string "When I picked up the Pokémon\nI left in the Day Care,\lit had learned different moves\lthan it knew when I left it there!\pPokémon can only learn four moves,\nso you have to be careful!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_355
