	.4byte gBwText_355_0
	.global gBwTextCount_355
gBwTextCount_355:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_356_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}!\pThis bothersome bunch doesn't\nreally listen to reason.$"
gBwText_356_1:
	.string "Team Plasma: That child cannot use\na Pokémon to its full potential.\pDoesn't that make the Pokémon sad?\pIt's the same thing for all your\nPokémon, so hand them over to us now!\pBetter yet...\nWe'll just take them!$"
gBwText_356_2:
	.string "Team Plasma: Wha...? How could we lose\nwhen we have right on our side?!$"
gBwText_356_3:
	.string "Cheren: Not bad, {STR_VAR_1}.\nOK, go return the Pokémon to that girl.$"
gBwText_356_4:
	.string "You don't need to return it!$"
gBwText_356_5:
	.string "Team Plasma: How troublesome.\pNot only do you fail to understand, but\nyou actually got in our way, to boot.$"
gBwText_356_6:
	.string "Team Plasma: There's two of you\nand two of us.\pWe'll show you our combined power\nand teach you that we are right!$"
gBwText_356_7:
	.string "Cheren: So, there were more of them...\pStill, why are Pokémon robbers\nacting so self-righteous?$"
gBwText_356_8:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\pWe've been friends our whole lives.\nWe've got each other's back when it\lcounts. Let's show them how it's done!$"
gBwText_356_9:
	.string "Team Plasma: In order to liberate\nPokémon from foolish people,\lwe will take their Pokémon!$"
gBwText_356_10:
	.string "Cheren: Whatever...\nWhat a waste of time.\pCome on, what reason could possibly\njustify stealing Pokémon from people?$"
gBwText_356_11:
	.string "Team Plasma: Pokémon Trainers\nlike you are making Pokémon suffer...$"
gBwText_356_12:
	.string "Cheren: What do you mean, Trainers are\nmaking Pokémon suffer?\lI don't get that at all!$"
gBwText_356_13:
	.string "Team Plasma: We'll give you back\nthe Pokémon...\pBut be aware of how this Pokémon\nsuffers from being used by people.$"
gBwText_356_14:
	.string "Team Plasma: Someday, open your eyes\nto your own complicity.$"
gBwText_356_15:
	.string "Cheren: Trainers bring out\ntheir Pokémon's strength.\pPokémon believe in their\nTrainers and respond to that.\pI don't understand what about\nthat makes Pokémon suffer!$"
gBwText_356_16:
	.string "OK, {STR_VAR_1},\nI'll return the Pokémon.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_356
