gBwText_358_0:
	.string "Hey! Trainer!\pThere is a bit of a problem up ahead.\nSorry, but you can't pass now.\pYou should go kill some time by\nchallenging the Castelia City Gym!$"
gBwText_358_1:
	.string "Hey! Trainer!\pThere is a bit of a problem up ahead.\nSorry, but you can't pass now.\pYou should go kill some time by\nchallenging the Castelia City Gym!$"
gBwText_358_2:
	.string "Deep in the desert ahead of here,\nat the Desert Resort,\lthere are some ruins that have\lbecome a little tourist destination!$"
gBwText_358_3:
	.string "Cheren: I believe it would be wise for me\nto catch some Ground-type Pokémon.\pOr perhaps I should strengthen my\nPokémon. What's my best path forward?$"
gBwText_358_4:
	.string "Cheren: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\pI've been waiting for you to get\nthe Insect Badge.\pAnd now it's time to see which one of us\nis the stronger Trainer!$"
gBwText_358_5:
	.string "Cheren: It's now clear to me.\pThe reason you are so tough is the\ntrust between you and your Pokémon.\pBut...that shouldn't be a problem.\pI can get more out of {STR_VAR_1}\nand my other Pokémon, too.$"
gBwText_358_6:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_358_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_358_8:
	.string "Cheren: Nimbasa City's gate is\nstraight down Route 4.$"
gBwText_358_9:
	.string "When I look at the freeway,\nI feel exhilarated!$"
gBwText_358_10:
	.string "Ruins buried in the desert...\nIt's like a grand adventure in a story.$"
gBwText_358_11:
	.string "Oh! Trainer, take a look at the sand.\pDo you see how some areas are lighter?\nAnd some of the sand looks...darker...\pPokémon are hiding in the darker sand!$"
gBwText_358_12:
	.string "Route 4$"
gBwText_358_13:
	.string "$"
gBwText_358_14:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pPokémon have a source of energy\nfor using moves.\pIt's called PP, meaning Power Points.\nThey have PP for each move.\pWhen a move has no PP remaining,\nthat Pokémon cannot use that move.\pThat's a good time to head for\nthe Pokémon Center!$"
gBwText_358_15:
	.string "Tired Workers should head\nto the prefab house by Castelia City!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_358
