gBwText_360_0:
	.string "Sandstorms are terrible!\pBut Rock-type, Ground-type, and\nSteel-type Pokémon can weather\la Sandstorm without damage.$"
gBwText_360_1:
	.string "I don't mean to brag, but I'm a Dig pro!\pI'll give you this TM so you can\nuse it, too!$"
gBwText_360_2:
	.string "Using Dig in a cave takes you back to\nthe entrance instantly!\pWhat do you think of that? Amazing, eh?\nBe sure to Dig and Dig some more!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_360
