	.4byte 3
gBwText_361_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, stop!\pYou've got a Bolt Badge...\nI've got a Bolt Badge...\pLet's test who's stronger--you or me!\nThis time, I'm going to win!$"
gBwText_361_1:
	.string "Cheren: Why?\nWhy can't I beat you?$"
gBwText_361_2:
	.string "Elesa: Oh, you two are friends...\pThat's nice, how you're helping each\nother get better by competing.$"
gBwText_361_3:
	.string "OK, let's go.$"
gBwText_361_4:
	.string "???: Oh!\nWhy, if it isn't Elesa!$"
gBwText_361_5:
	.string "???: Aren't festivals grand?\nLife should be enjoyed!$"
gBwText_361_6:
	.string "Cheren: Who is this man?$"
gBwText_361_7:
	.string "Elesa: This is Alder,\nthe Unova region's Champion.$"
gBwText_361_8:
	.string "Cheren: Champion?!\pWhy would the Champion be\ngoofing off in a place like this?$"
gBwText_361_9:
	.string "Alder: I heard that remark. You're quite\na judgmental young person, are you not?\pMy name is Alder. I'm the Unova\nPokémon League's Champion.\pPleased to make your acquaintance.\pFor your information, I'm not\ngoofing off. I'm on a voyage.\lI know every corner of Unova.$"
gBwText_361_10:
	.string "Cheren: Um. I'm Cheren, from\nNuvema Town.\pMy goal as a Trainer is to\nbecome the Champion.$"
gBwText_361_11:
	.string "Alder: Hm. Traveling with a goal in mind\nis a commendable thing.\pAnd what do you plan to do\nafter becoming the Champion?$"
gBwText_361_12:
	.string "Cheren: What else is there other than\nstriving to become stronger?\pThe strongest Trainer--\nthat's the Champion.$"
gBwText_361_13:
	.string "Alder: Hmm. Becoming stronger...\nBecoming stronger, you say...\lIs that alone enough of a goal? Hmmm.\pIt's not that I'm trying to say your\nway of thinking is wrong...$"
gBwText_361_14:
	.string "In my travels, I've helped many people\nlearn to love Pokémon. I think that's\limportant, too.\pIf you play with those children, you\nmight gain more of an understanding.\pWill you two have a Pokémon battle\nwith those two?$"
gBwText_361_15:
	.string "Hey, you two. Come\nhere for a moment.$"
gBwText_361_16:
	.string "Cheren: ...Understood.\pBut, before that...$"
gBwText_361_17:
	.string "Cheren fully healed \n{STR_VAR_1}'s Pokémon!$"
gBwText_361_18:
	.string "Cheren: OK, let's battle.$"
gBwText_361_19:
	.string "Alder: Nicely done! You didn't win, but\nthat was a good battle. Your Pokémon\llooked like they were having fun.$"
gBwText_361_20:
	.string "Young man, if there are people\nlike you who pursue strength,\lthere are also people who are\lhappy just being with Pokémon.\pThere are many different people\nand many different answers.\pWhen it comes to what a Champion should\nbe, you and I may hold differing views,\lbut so be it! Give it some thought.$"
gBwText_361_21:
	.string "Alder: It's tremendous that people and\nPokémon, each so different, can\lacknowledge each other and be\ltogether!$"
gBwText_361_22:
	.string "Alder is so strong!\nAnd he's nice to Pokémon!$"
gBwText_361_23:
	.string "I was scared of Pokémon, but Alder\ntaught me that they're nice and\lfriendly.$"
gBwText_361_24:
	.string "Elesa: Let's roll.\nThe Driftveil Drawbridge is just ahead.$"
gBwText_361_25:
	.string "Cheren: The Champion is the strongest\nof the strong! That's all there is to it.$"
gBwText_361_26:
	.string "Cheren: This way.$"
gBwText_361_27:
	.string "Elesa: Now to contact him...$"
gBwText_361_28:
	.string "It's me, Elesa.\nPlease lower the drawbridge.\pI have a couple of Trainers here\nwho want to challenge you.\pOK...\nThanks.$"
gBwText_361_29:
	.string "Now, watch this!$"
gBwText_361_30:
	.string "Elesa: I have a TV gig, so I've got to\ngo.\pThe Gym Leader of the next town\nmay take some getting used to...\lDo your best, both of you.$"
gBwText_361_31:
	.string "Cheren: What I am is a Trainer.\pI prove I'm right by getting stronger\nand winning in battle--\leven against the Champion.$"
gBwText_361_32:
	.string "Excuse me!\nPlease stop right there!$"
gBwText_361_33:
	.string "The drawbridge is raised right now\nso ships can pass. You can't cross.\pIf you make a request to Driftveil's\nGym Leader, Clay, he could... Well, I'm\lnot sure how you'd reach him over\lthere...\pIf you talk to Nimbasa City's Gym\nLeader, Elesa, she might be able to do\lsomething.$"
gBwText_361_34:
	.string "The drawbridge is raised right now\nso ships can pass. You can't cross.\pIf you make a request to Driftveil's\nGym Leader, Clay, he could... Well, I'm\lnot sure how you'd reach him over\lthere...\pIf you talk to Nimbasa City's Gym\nLeader, Elesa, she might be able to do\lsomething.$"
gBwText_361_35:
	.string "A bridge would be meaningless\nif no one ever crossed it.\pBridges connect the world...\nThat's as solid as a symbol can get.$"
gBwText_361_36:
	.string "Hum fiercely! My battle song!\nBattle fiercely! My Pokémon!$"
gBwText_361_37:
	.string "In battling you, I came to understand...\pYou're the best!\nHere! This is for you!$"
gBwText_361_38:
	.string "$"
gBwText_361_39:
	.string "$"
gBwText_361_40:
	.string "If you want your Pokémon to\nhold this Electric Guitar,\lgo to the Musical Theater!\lCooler than cool!$"
gBwText_361_41:
	.string "Cheren: Strength and strength alone\nis what matters in this world.\pSo I believed, until I met Alder here.$"
gBwText_361_42:
	.string "But, winning in Pokémon battles\nisn't all there is to life.\pOnce I learned that lesson, my eyes\nwere opened to many different things.$"
gBwText_361_43:
	.string "We all have our own brand of strength,\npeople and Pokémon both.\pThe strength to make our dreams\na reality, the strength to protect\lwhat we hold most dear...$"
gBwText_361_44:
	.string "Why do I think this way now?\nIt's thanks to you, {STR_VAR_1}...\pAnd Bianca...\nAnd Alder...\pIf only N could see this, too, someday.$"
gBwText_361_45:
	.string "I'm going to take a long, hard look\nat myself on Victory Road.\pI'm going to think about what I can do\nand who I can become...\pVisit me sometime, if you want.\nWe'll have a battle like old times.$"
gBwText_361_46:
	.string "The Pokémon and the performers\nall have amazing moves!$"
gBwText_361_47:
	.string "I think being able to make people\nsmile is a super-awesome talent!\pThat's why Pokémon are so awesome!\nBecause they can make you smile!$"
gBwText_361_48:
	.string "The street performers are my favorites.\nThey're so charming!$"
gBwText_361_49:
	.string "Route 5\nPerformer Street$"
gBwText_361_50:
	.string "Driftveil Drawbridge$"
gBwText_361_51:
	.string "$"
gBwText_361_52:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pThere are different Cases\nfor each type of item.\pItems are placed automatically in\nthe correct Case by their type.\pThe name of the Case tells you\nwhat type of items will be kept there.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_361
