gBwText_363_0:
	.string "Here on Route 6, there's a place called\nMistralton Cave.\pSupposedly, deep in that cave you can\nfind an amazing Pokémon called\lCobalion, who was said to have\lprotected Pokémon from a sea of fire in\lancient Unova.\pIf you can use a move called Surf\nthat lets you move over the water's\lsurface, maybe you can see Cobalion.$"
gBwText_363_1:
	.string "I've heard that there are also Pokémon\nthat should be called Cobalion's allies.$"
gBwText_363_2:
	.string "Now what should I do?\pThe entrance to Chargestone Cave,\njust ahead, is blocked off.\pIt's because of a Pokémon called\nGalvantula, and if I don't ask Clay to\ldo something, there's no way to pass.$"
gBwText_363_3:
	.string "Chargestone Cave seems like\na complicated maze, but actually\lit's a straight road.$"
gBwText_363_4:
	.string "Pokémon with Dry Skin love Water-type\nmoves and rainy weather. ?\pI'm talking about the Ability\nof these Pokémon, of course.$"
gBwText_363_5:
	.string "Route 6$"
gBwText_363_6:
	.string "$"
gBwText_363_7:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pYou can register certain items with\nthe Y Button to use them easily!\pLook for a square checkbox beside\nthe name of a Key Item.$"
gBwText_363_8:
	.string "Researching the Year's Seasons:\nThe Season Research Lab$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_363
gBwTextTable_363:
	.4byte gBwText_363_0
	.4byte gBwText_363_1
	.4byte gBwText_363_2
	.4byte gBwText_363_3
	.4byte gBwText_363_4
	.4byte gBwText_363_5
	.4byte gBwText_363_6
