gBwText_367_0:
	.string "Kawbraa!$"
gBwText_367_1:
	.string "The Pokémon climbed up the rock wall\nand disappeared somewhere into the\lcave...$"
gBwText_367_2:
	.string "The Pokémon climbed up the rock wall\nand disappeared somewhere into the\lcave...$"
gBwText_367_3:
	.string "The strength you exhibited\ncommunicating with your Pokémon also\lgot through to Cobalion.\pIf you and your Pokémon train together\nand get even stronger, it will probably\lreturn to this place.$"
gBwText_367_4:
	.string "It seems that thanks to you, Cobalion\nhas sensed a change in the world.\pIt's a world where people and Pokémon\nhelp each other and live together.\pI believe Cobalion wants to remain\nwith you and travel by your side.$"
gBwText_367_5:
	.string "The fact that you battled Cobalion and\nyou related to each other should be\leasily communicated to Terrakion and\lVirizion because of the close bond\lbetween the three.\pI'm sure they will also give you a\nchance to prove your worth.$"
gBwText_367_6:
	.string "The obstacles that separated\nTerrakion and Virizion from people are\lprobably gone now.\pWhether you want to search for those\ntwo is up to you, but they are\ldefinitely waiting for you...$"
gBwText_367_7:
	.string "I saw your skill. It's impressive for\none so young.\pMaybe you're the one...\nHmmm... It may be possible...\pHow about it? Will you listen to\nan old man's story?$"
gBwText_367_8:
	.string "In the distant past, when Pokémon and\npeople lived in different worlds,\la war between people started\lan intense fire in a forest where\lmany Pokémon lived.\pThe Pokémon were surrounded by smoke\nand flames. They were in big trouble.\pAnd then, the legends Cobalion,\nTerrakion, and Virizion appeared!\pTerrakion used its amazing strength to\ndestroy rocks blocking the\lescape route.\pVirizion used its quick movements\nto protect Pokémon from looming flames.\pAnd Cobalion led the frightened\nPokémon out of the burning woods.$"
gBwText_367_9:
	.string "The people who started the war were\nrouted by the power of the legends.\pBecause of Cobalion, Terrakion, and\nVirizion, the war was ended.$"
gBwText_367_10:
	.string "When people fight, there's no peace for\nPokémon, either.\pThe three legends learned that\nthe deeds of humans could lead\lto dire consequences for their world.$"
gBwText_367_11:
	.string "They cut themselves off from people\nand disappeared.\pNo one saw much of them after that, and\nthe three faded into myth...$"
gBwText_367_12:
	.string "I've been searching for them for\ndecades, and I finally figured out that\lone of them was deep in this cave.\pBut the legendary three do not\ntrust people.\pIf people approach, they bare their\nfangs and attack.$"
gBwText_367_13:
	.string "It can't be helped, because they only\nknow the old world...\pThey still don't know the world has\nbecome a place where people and\lPokémon try to understand and help\leach other.$"
gBwText_367_14:
	.string "You seem like you might be able to show\nthem that people and Pokémon can trust\leach other and live together.\pIf they take another look at people,\nI think they will stop hiding from us...$"
gBwText_367_15:
	.string "It's not just about bonds between\npeople and Pokémon.\pHaving all living things appreciate and\ntrust each other would be best.$"
gBwText_367_16:
	.string "If you don't listen to what your elders\nhave to say, I can't expect much\lfrom you!\pYou shouldn't have come to this place!\nLeave now!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_367
