gBwText_368_0:
	.string "It's about the season to go to the\nCelestial Tower on Route 7.\pI have to ring the bell for my Petilil...$"
gBwText_368_1:
	.string "It's about the season to go to the\nCelestial Tower on Route 7.\pI have to ring the bell for\nmy Cottonee...$"
gBwText_368_2:
	.string "Mister!\nHere, have this!$"
gBwText_368_3:
	.string "Miss!\nHere, have this!$"
gBwText_368_4:
	.string "Know what? When I gave my Minccino a\nShiny Stone, it evolved and became a\ldifferent Pokémon!$"
gBwText_368_5:
	.string "What's this? Your Pokémon seem to be\nfull of energy!$"
gBwText_368_6:
	.string "Oh, dear! Your Pokémon...\nSomehow, they don't seem well.\pYou should rest here for a little while.\nYou can't go anywhere when you're not\lfeeling well.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_368
