gBwTextCount_368:
	.4byte 7
gBwText_369_0:
	.string "The Xtransceiver is ringing.$"
gBwText_369_1:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} picked up the Xtransceiver.$"
gBwText_369_2:
	.string "That raised walkway...\pIf you stand still, you'll fall off, so\nyou have to keep moving.$"
gBwText_369_3:
	.string "Oh! Bold enough to come talk to me,\nare you?\pYou're quite the Trainer. I like you!\nTake this TM!$"
gBwText_369_4:
	.string "When a Pokémon uses Charge Beam,\nsometimes its Sp. Atk goes up.\pIf you're lucky, the power will just\nkeep going up!$"
gBwText_369_5:
	.string "My, my...\nThat Pokémon has come again, too.$"
gBwText_369_6:
	.string "Now, now, child, don't you go heading\ninto the tall grass. That Pokémon might\lbe too much for you.$"
gBwText_369_7:
	.string "We'll catch cold standin' around\ntalkin' in this wind and rain.\pIt's not much, but come stay\nin my home a spell.$"
gBwText_369_8:
	.string "Krrrkrrrkrrak!$"
gBwText_369_9:
	.string "Whhhwhhhwhhh!!$"
gBwText_369_10:
	.string "Whew, what a storm!\pApparently it's that Pokémon's doing!$"
gBwText_369_11:
	.string "Route 7$"
gBwText_369_12:
	.string "Celestial Tower\nA place of rest for innocent spirits$"
gBwText_369_13:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pThe number of Exp. Points you get\nafter a battle is based on levels.\pWhen your Pokémon is weaker than\nits opponent, it will get more.\pBut if your Pokémon is stronger,\nit won't get as many.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_369
