gBwText_374_0:
	.string "Skyla: Oh, you came. Thank you!\pI was right.\nWhat I saw was a hurt Pokémon.\pDon't worry, though!\nIt's fine now!\pI gave it a Max Revive,\nthen it felt better and flew away!$"
gBwText_374_1:
	.string "Hee hee!\nDon't I have great eyesight?\pNo matter how far away things are,\na Pilot's eyes can see them!$"
gBwText_374_2:
	.string "Oh, that's right! Since you've come\nthis far, why don't you ring the bell?\pCelestial Tower's bell is for soothing\nthe spirits of Pokémon.\pAlso, the character of the person\nringing the bell is reflected in its\lsound.$"
gBwText_374_3:
	.string "Skyla: Come on, don't be shy!$"
gBwText_374_4:
	.string "What a pretty sound.\p{STR_VAR_1}, you are\na kind and strong person.\lIt's that kind of sound.$"
gBwText_374_5:
	.string "What a pretty sound.\p{STR_VAR_1}, you are\na kind and strong person.\lIt's that kind of sound.$"
gBwText_374_6:
	.string "I'd like to introduce myself again!\pI'm Skyla, the Leader of\nMistralton's Pokémon Gym.\lI use Flying-type Pokémon.\pWhen you are ready, please\ncome to the Gym.\lI'll give you a big welcome!$"
gBwText_374_7:
	.string "It's the Celestial Tower bell...\nWill you ring the bell?$"
gBwText_374_8:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} rang the bell...$"
gBwText_374_9:
	.string "The sound of the bell\nreverberates through the area...$"
gBwText_374_10:
	.string "The sound of the bell\nreverberates through the area...$"
gBwText_374_11:
	.string "The bell was left untouched...$"
gBwText_374_12:
	.string "Alder: ...$"
gBwText_374_13:
	.string "My old partner is resting\nhere in the Celestial Tower.\pIt was the first Pokémon\nI received when I became a Trainer.\pI come here to ring the bell\nand comfort its spirit.$"
gBwText_374_14:
	.string "It was a strong Pokémon.\nIt was courageous, noble, and kind...\pTogether, we madly pursued strength...\nWithout even knowing the meaning\lof strength.$"
gBwText_374_15:
	.string "But, in the same way that all stories\nhave a beginning and an end,\lall lives have an end, as well...\pIt was then that I understood that\nstrength isn't something that\lremains unchanged forever.$"
gBwText_374_16:
	.string "However, the joy one feels in being with\nPokémon--that is the real thing.\pIn order to spread the word, I left the\nPokémon League and kept traveling...\pThat's right! Traveling is wonderful.\pI've met many different Pokémon,\nmany different Trainers,\land now I've met all of you.$"
gBwText_374_17:
	.string "There are many more Trainers and\nPokémon to encounter in the world!\p{STR_VAR_1}! Go out and meet\nas many of them as you can!$"
gBwText_374_18:
	.string "Well, {STR_VAR_1}, I'll be waiting\nfor you at the Pokémon League!$"
	.align 2
