gBwText_375_0:
	.string "Kid! Have you caught any {STR_VAR_1}?\pIf you have, would you trade your\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_375_1:
	.string "OK! Let's start our Pokémon trade!$"
gBwText_375_2:
	.string "Oh! Oh! What a cute Pokémon!\nPlease cherish {STR_VAR_2}, too.$"
gBwText_375_3:
	.string "Hey! Come on, now!\nI want to trade for a {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_375_4:
	.string "I see... Well, come talk to me again if\nyou change your mind!$"
gBwText_375_5:
	.string "Trading Pokémon lets you get to know\nother Trainers!$"
gBwText_375_6:
	.string "I love the Pokémon moves Mega Drain\nand Giga Drain!\pYour opponent's HP is reduced, and the\nuser's HP increases!$"
gBwText_375_7:
	.string "Fwoo-ooo-ooosh...$"
gBwText_375_8:
	.string "Tralalala! ?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_375
