	.4byte 9
gBwText_376_0:
	.string "I'm making a delicious soup with\nwell-stewed vegetables.$"
gBwText_376_1:
	.string "Since her yammering stops while she's\ncooking, it's another bonus for me.$"
gBwText_376_2:
	.string "Even a young 'un like yourself will\ncatch cold if you get soaked by that\lcold rain.\pSit right down and have some soup,\nwhy don't you?$"
gBwText_376_3:
	.string "That's nice. A young 'un like you\nshouldn't be shy.$"
gBwText_376_4:
	.string "Come now, just have a little.\nIt's good for you.\pWould you listen to an old lady's story\nfor a moment?$"
gBwText_376_5:
	.string "In the Unova region, you see, there is a\nPokémon called Thundurus\lthat creates thunderstorms.\pIt flies around the region and sets\nloose wild winds and crashing lightning.$"
gBwText_376_6:
	.string "In the Unova region, you see, there is a\nPokémon called Tornadus that\lcauses windstorms.\pIt flies around the region while letting\nloose wild winds and pounding rain.$"
gBwText_376_7:
	.string "Have some soup now, dear.\nIt'll warm you up.$"
gBwText_376_8:
	.string "A soup jam-packed with healthy\nvegetables. It's delicious!$"
gBwText_376_9:
	.string "The heavy rain is ruining the crops\nI've worked so hard to raise!\pWhat a troublesome Pokémon!$"
gBwText_376_10:
	.string "I thought I would try to catch it, but\nit flies around so fast that even when\lI thought I'd found it, it just flew\laway.$"
gBwText_376_11:
	.string "In one day, it can make a lap around the\nentire Unova region.\pIn the mornings, it's in the south,\nand in the evenings, it's in the north.\pIt shows up here in the evenings!$"
gBwText_376_12:
	.string "It seems like someone somewhere\ntaught that stormy Pokémon a lesson.\pI wonder if it was...?$"
gBwText_376_13:
	.string "Long ago, I was a sharp-lookin' young\nman, and my wife was a fiiine-lookin'\lgirl. This is a story from way back then.\pRight around here, a certain Pokémon\ntaught a lesson to Thundurus, who had\lbeen causin' trouble dropping\llightning.\pFor around 30 years after that,\nThundurus kept calm, and it hid\lsomewhere around here.$"
gBwText_376_14:
	.string "Long ago, I was a sharp-lookin' young\nman, and my wife was a fiiine-lookin'\lgirl. This is a story from way back then.\pRight around here, a certain Pokémon\ntaught a lesson to Tornadus, who had\lbeen causin' trouble brewing storms.\pFor around 30 years after that,\nTornadus kept calm, and it hid\lsomewhere around here.$"
gBwText_376_15:
	.string "If you go in the tall grass during\na storm, it might pop out.$"
gBwText_376_16:
	.string "There is a Pokémon that\nquieted Thundurus.\pI remember hearing that there is a\nshrine built to honor that Pokémon\lsomewhere on Route 14.$"
gBwText_376_17:
	.string "There is a Pokémon that\nquieted Tornadus.\pI remember hearing that there is a\nshrine built to honor that Pokémon\lsomewhere on Route 14.$"
gBwText_376_18:
	.string "Oh my. Your Pokémon team...\pIt seems all worn out.\nRest for just a moment now!$"
gBwText_376_19:
	.string "Walking on the raised walkways\nis more tiring than you think, right?$"
gBwText_376_20:
	.string "Granny's meals are always\nnothing but vegetables!$"
gBwText_376_21:
	.string "Know the electric bulletin boards?\pThey'll tell you when lightning is\ncrashing down somewhere!$"
gBwText_376_22:
	.string "Know the electric bulletin boards?\pThey'll tell you when wind is\nblowing fiercely somewhere!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_376
