gBwText_377_0:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_377_1:
	.string "As I've been traveling lately,\nI've been thinking about things.\pThings like what I can do with my life,\nand what I want to do, but...\pI'm thinking how cool it would be\nto be a model like Elesa.\pAnd then, how cool it would be to do\nresearch on Pokémon like\lProfessor Juniper...\pIf that's what I want to do, I'm gonna\nhave to know a lot about Pokémon.\lSooooo...would you please battle me?$"
gBwText_377_2:
	.string "Bianca: Yep!\n{STR_VAR_1}, you're amazing!\pI'm really, really, really impressed, and\nthat makes me want to give this to you!$"
gBwText_377_3:
	.string "Bianca: In Castelia City, my precious\nPokémon was stolen by Team Plasma.\pSo I really, really understand!\pIf Team Plasma forces everyone to\nliberate their Pokémon,\lthere will be nothing but sad people!\p{STR_VAR_1}!\nStop Team Plasma!\pDon't allow Pokémon to be stolen\nfrom Trainers who love them!\pI think that's the truth--or\nideal--that you've been pursuing,\l{STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_377_4:
	.string "Bianca: Oh dear, here I've come all this\nway, and I'm afraid I'm bothering you\lwhen you're going through so much.\pAll I wanted was to help you relax,\n{STR_VAR_1}.\pKnowing you, you'll be fine!\nDefinitely! You'll totally be fine!\pI guarantee it!\pAnyway, you know what I mean...\nYeah... So, bye-bye!$"
gBwText_377_5:
	.string "Team Plasma: Apparently, some of us\nare working in Dragonspiral Tower,\lwhich is close to Icirrus City.$"
gBwText_377_6:
	.string "Team Plasma: Apparently some of us\nare working in the Relic Castle\lin the Desert Resort.$"
gBwText_377_7:
	.string "Team Plasma: Apparently, some of us\nare working in Dragonspiral Tower,\lwhich is close to Icirrus City!$"
gBwText_377_8:
	.string "Team Plasma: Apparently some of us\nare working in the Relic Castle\lin the Desert Resort!$"
gBwText_377_9:
	.string "My parasol is full of TMs.\nWould you like one?$"
gBwText_377_10:
	.string "Facade! Facade!\nWhen the user's poisoned, paralyzed,\lor burned, its attack power doubles!$"
gBwText_377_11:
	.string "That's right.\pI find rocks, and then\nI give them to people...\lThat's my simple life.\lYou rock...$"
gBwText_377_12:
	.string "Here, I'll give you the Damp Rock\nI found this morning.$"
gBwText_377_13:
	.string "Here, I'll give you the Heat Rock\nI found this afternoon.$"
gBwText_377_14:
	.string "Here, I'll give you the Smooth Rock\nI found this evening.$"
gBwText_377_15:
	.string "Here, I'll give you the Icy Rock\nI found tonight.$"
gBwText_377_16:
	.string "Yeah, yeah...\pIf you like rocks, come back tomorrow...\nRoll in at a different time, if possible.\lI'll be here, I pumice.$"
gBwText_377_17:
	.string "Route 8$"
gBwText_377_18:
	.string "$"
gBwText_377_19:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pPress SELECT to change the location\nof items in the Bag!\pPoink!$"
gBwText_377_20:
	.string "Tubeline Bridge\nUnova's famous railway bridge$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_377
