gBwText_378_0:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} seems to want to get out of\nthe Poké Ball!\pWill you let it out?$"
gBwText_378_1:
	.string "The Poké Ball has stopped moving...$"
gBwText_378_2:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} came jumping out!$"
gBwText_378_3:
	.string "Ooh! That Pokémon! It couldn't be...\pA bright red mane...and a lush tail...and\na single, noble horn!\pIt's exactly like the old legend!$"
gBwText_378_4:
	.string "Long ago, when a war between people\nstarted an intense fire in this forest,\la single young Pokémon was separated\lfrom its parents.\pCobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion\nteamed up to take care of this Pokémon.$"
gBwText_378_5:
	.string "The three acted as its parents and\ntaught it the knowledge and the moves\lit needed to survive...$"
gBwText_378_6:
	.string "The young Pokémon grew rapidly, and\ndeveloped a power that surpassed its\lthree caretakers.\pHowever... One day, that Pokémon\ndisappeared from the forest.\pNo one knows why. But when I think\nabout it... Young ones are always\lreckless and drawn to adventure...$"
gBwText_378_7:
	.string "It looks like they are all happy to see\none another again!\pI wonder if those three are trying to\nteach Keldeo something?$"
gBwText_378_8:
	.string "Cobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion are\ntrying to teach {STR_VAR_1} the new\lmove Secret Sword!\pTeach Secret Sword to {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_378_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_378_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_378_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_378_12:
	.string "If it weren't for you, these Pokémon\nnever would have been able to meet\lagain here in this forest that holds so\lmany memories for them.\pI'm sure they are very happy that they\nwere able to meet a Trainer like you.$"
gBwText_378_13:
	.string "It seems like it's looking for the three\nlegendary Pokémon that raised it:\lCobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion.\pMaybe something will happen if you\nbring them here, too...$"
gBwText_378_14:
	.string "How you raise Keldeo is up to you...\pSometimes it's necessary to think\nabout things carefully rather than\lacting on the spur of the moment.$"
gBwText_378_15:
	.string "For Keldeo and the three legendary\nPokémon of the Unova region--Cobalion,\lTerrakion, and Virizion--this forest\lhas a special meaning.\pIt seems like it would be best if you\nknew this story, as well.\pWould you mind listening to an old man's\nstory for a moment?$"
gBwText_378_16:
	.string "When you want to teach Keldeo this\nmove, you must bring Cobalion,\lTerrakion, and Virizion.$"
gBwText_378_17:
	.string "A verdant forest and clear water... For\nPokémon, this forest is like a paradise.\pIt's also very important for people,\nso I want to take good care of it!$"
gBwText_378_18:
	.string "Would you like to teach Keldeo this\nmove again?$"
gBwText_378_19:
	.string "If you don't get to do something you\nwanted to do, it sure stays with you.$"
gBwText_378_20:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_378
