gBwText_379_0:
	.string "How do I describe this...\pYou know that vibration you feel on the\nsoles of your feet when you're\lcrossing the Tubeline Bridge?\pIt's the coolest!$"
gBwText_379_1:
	.string "For anyone obsessed with railroads,\nespecially train photographers like me,\lthe Tubeline Bridge and Anville Town are\lboth perfect spots for taking\lpictures!$"
gBwText_379_2:
	.string "A giant steel bridge towering over\nthe road ahead...\pI get excited just looking at this model\nof the Tubeline Bridge!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_379
gBwTextTable_379:
	.4byte gBwText_379_0
	.4byte gBwText_379_1
	.4byte gBwText_379_2
	.global gBwTextCount_379
gBwTextCount_379:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_380_0:
	.string "Only strong Pokémon live in this cave!\pThe Champion occasionally\ngoes in for training, but you aren't\lready for this challenge.$"
gBwText_380_1:
	.string "Huh! You're quite the Trainer,\naren't you?\pEnter the cave, and strengthen both\nyourself and your Pokémon!$"
gBwText_380_2:
	.string "The pitcher throws his first pitch!$"
gBwText_380_3:
	.string "What I just threw was TM56 Fling!\pYou throw an item to do damage to the\ntarget, and the damage changes\ldepending on what you throw!$"
gBwText_380_4:
	.string "Route 9$"
gBwText_380_5:
	.string "Shopping Mall Nine\nColorful and wonderful!$"
gBwText_380_6:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pTry pressing SELECT while\norganizing your PC Box.\pIt'll let you move your Pokémon\naround more easily!$"
gBwText_380_7:
	.string "Tubeline Bridge\nUnova's famous railway bridge$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_380
