gBwTextCount_380:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_381_0:
	.string "Route 9 has a lot of Trainers\nfor such a short route.\pIf there is a place where people can\nride, similar people tend to gather!$"
gBwText_381_1:
	.string "Phew... I tried a little too hard.\pI bought way too much\nat Shopping Mall Nine!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_381
gBwTextTable_381:
	.4byte gBwText_381_0
	.4byte gBwText_381_1
	.global gBwTextCount_381
gBwTextCount_381:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_382_0:
	.string "I come shop at the Shopping Mall a lot\nbecause I want all the TMs!$"
gBwText_382_1:
	.string "On the first floor, they sell medicines.\pOn the second floor, they sell TMs\nand different kinds of Mail.\pOn the third floor, they sell items for\nraising stats and battle items.\pI really admire Mr. Clyde, the\nPokémon Gym guide, so I'm practicing\lbeing a guide, too!$"
gBwText_382_2:
	.string "There are even some people in the mall\nwho will challenge you to battles.$"
gBwText_382_3:
	.string "The thing I buy most often is the item\nthat raises a Pokémon's HP, called HP\lUp.\pThere are also a lot of other items that\ncatch my eye.$"
gBwText_382_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_6:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_7:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_8:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_11:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_12:
	.string "$"
gBwText_382_13:
	.string "Good Trainers never use only\nbrute force.\pThey think about many different\nstrategies, such as which Pokémon and\lmoves to use in battle, or the best time\lto use an item.$"
gBwText_382_14:
	.string "Playing hide-and-seek would be fun!$"
gBwText_382_15:
	.string "Welcome to Shopping Mall Nine! It's\ncalled Nine because it's on Route 9.\pYou can remember it by thinking of this:\n“Done shopping? Nein!“$"
gBwText_382_16:
	.string "Have you heard? There's a cave\nalong Route 9.\pI don't know exactly where it is or\nwhat's in it, though.$"
gBwText_382_17:
	.string "Hey! Pokémon Trainer!\pDo you know about an item called\nthe Thunderstone?$"
gBwText_382_18:
	.string "So you know Thunderstones make\ncertain Pokémon evolve, then? Niiice!$"
gBwText_382_19:
	.string "Well then, I'll tell you!\pIf you use the Thunderstone, it makes\ncertain Pokémon evolve!$"
gBwText_382_20:
	.string "Meeting here must be fate!\nThis is for you!$"
gBwText_382_21:
	.string "I've heard a Pokémon called Eelektrik\nevolves with the Thunderstone.$"
gBwText_382_22:
	.string "Shopping Mall Nine\nColorful and wonderful!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_382
