	.string "Oh, holder of the Quake Badge!\nMake your foes' hearts tremble!$"
gBwText_392_3:
	.string "First, obtain the Quake Badge\nfrom the Driftveil Pokémon Gym!$"
gBwText_392_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_392_5:
	.string "Gates are placed at the border of one\nspace and another space.\pIn other words, gates mean that the\nworld beyond here is a different world.\pIt does feel like every time you pass\nthrough a gate, you're going to a\ldifferent world.\pAnd you remember the Gym Leader who\ngave you the Badge at the same time...\pBut without the Quake Badge,\nyou cannot proceed.$"
