gBwText_398_0:
	.string "As its name suggests, Village Bridge\nis a village like a bridge...\lNo, it's a bridge like a village...\lNo, it's a bridge like a bridge...\lNo, it's a village like a village...\lOh, I'm so confused!$"
gBwText_398_1:
	.string "Pokémon love Village Sandwiches, too.\nA Berry topping is crucial to the taste.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_398
