gBwText_403_0:
	.string "I found this plate when I used the move\nDive in the sea around Undella Town!\pBut I don't know how to use it.\nYou can have it if you like.$"
gBwText_403_1:
	.string "I have another one.\nTake this, too!$"
gBwText_403_2:
	.string "They say there's a sunken temple at\nthe bottom of the sea around Undella\lTown.\pThose plates were resting in the\ntemple. Maybe they're treasure...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_403
gBwTextTable_403:
	.4byte gBwText_403_0
	.4byte gBwText_403_1
	.4byte gBwText_403_2
	.global gBwTextCount_403
gBwTextCount_403:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_404_0:
	.string "I'm one of the gate receptionists.\nOur assigned places change daily.\lCan you believe it?$"
gBwText_404_1:
	.string "Do you check electric bulletin boards?\pThe news about Pokémon mass outbreaks\nis hot now!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_404
gBwTextTable_404:
	.4byte gBwText_404_0
	.4byte gBwText_404_1
	.global gBwTextCount_404
gBwTextCount_404:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_405_0:
	.string "My husband can teach some Pokémon the\nultimate moves! I'll tell you their\lnames.\pThe blazing Fire-type Pokémon:\nCharizard, Typhlosion, Blaziken,\lInfernape, and Emboar!\pThe restless Water-type Pokémon:\nBlastoise, Feraligatr, Swampert,\lEmpoleon, and Samurott!\pThe quiet Grass-type Pokémon:\nVenusaur, Meganium, Sceptile, Torterra,\land Serperior!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_405
gBwTextTable_405:
	.4byte gBwText_405_0
	.global gBwTextCount_405
gBwTextCount_405:
	.4byte 1
gBwText_406_0:
	.string "Giallo: Greetings to you, strong\nPokémon Trainer who came to\lDragonspiral Tower.$"
gBwText_406_1:
	.string "Are you and Zekrom building\na mutual understanding?$"
gBwText_406_2:
	.string "Are you not making friends\nwith Zekrom?$"
gBwText_406_3:
	.string "Are you and Reshiram building\na mutual understanding?$"
gBwText_406_4:
	.string "Are you not making friends with\nReshiram?$"
gBwText_406_5:
	.string "There is a saying...\pIf somewhere in this world there is\nsomeone who understands you, it feels\llike that person is right beside you,\leven if you're as far apart as the end\lof the land and the top of the sky.\pAs my lord N and his Pokémon understand\none another, so, too, do you and your\lPokémon understand one another.\pWhich is my reason for giving you this...$"
gBwText_406_6:
	.string "Giallo: The legend of Unova is about\nPokémon and people working together\lto build a new world!\pThe message is that simple\nand that strong.\pIf changing the world makes you a hero,\nanyone can become a hero.\pAs each of us changes what is\nin our power to change, so the world\litself changes.$"
gBwText_406_7:
	.string "Looker: Regarding Team Plasma...\pI am an officer of the International\nPolice, and you must supply the\linformation I request!$"
gBwText_406_8:
	.string "Giallo: Indeed, I shall.\pTeam Plasma changed me, but it could\nnot change the world. I'm looking\lforward to seeing how you lot will do.$"
gBwText_406_9:
	.string "Looker: I beg you will accept my thanks!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pWhat do they think of?\nWhat do they hope for?\pI am intensely interested to know this.\nTo depart at once!$"
gBwText_406_10:
	.string "Looker: I thank you extremely!\pCuriously, {STR_VAR_1}...\nThere is a topic on which we must speak.\pA report has reached my ears of\nsomeone far from here. Indeed, this\lsomeone has spotted a person like N and\la... dragon Pokémon.\pI depart to substantiate the\nsubstance of this information. Until\lnext time, I say cheers to you!$"
gBwText_406_11:
	.string "Route 14$"
gBwText_406_12:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pThe maximum number of Boxes is now 24!\pIn other words, you can store\n720 Pokémon!$"
gBwText_406_13:
	.string "Trainer Tips!\pChange your type on the Trainer Card\nto change how other players see you.\pYou'll look different to others in the\nUnion Room and the Tag Log!\pMatch it with your introduction or\ncharacter to show your individuality!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_406
