gBwText_407_0:
	.string "If you want to enjoy the slow life, visit\nWhite Forest.$"
gBwText_407_1:
	.string "If you want to enjoy vibrant city life,\nvisit Black City.$"
gBwText_407_2:
	.string "White Forest is full of nature!\nPeople and Pokémon live together.$"
gBwText_407_3:
	.string "People in this city are really\nsomething!\pBe careful, 'cause they'll challenge\nyou if you talk to them!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_407
gBwTextTable_407:
	.4byte gBwText_407_0
	.4byte gBwText_407_1
	.4byte gBwText_407_2
	.4byte gBwText_407_3
	.global gBwTextCount_407
gBwTextCount_407:
	.4byte 4
gBwText_408_0:
	.string "If you wreck Great Landorus's little\nshrine, it'll cause a bad bad storm!$"
gBwText_408_1:
	.string "That's not true!\pThe Pokémon that brings bad\nthunderstorms is a different Pokémon!$"
gBwText_408_2:
	.string "That's not true!\pThe Pokémon that brings bad windstorms\nis a different Pokémon!$"
gBwText_408_3:
	.string "No, silly, you've got it wrong!$"
gBwText_408_4:
	.string "This is a shrine for Great Landorus. It\npunished a Pokémon that did a bad\lthing!\pIf you wreck the shrine, it can't punish\nthat stormy Pokémon if it comes back!$"
gBwText_408_5:
	.string "But that doesn't make any sense!\pIf a Pokémon does a bad thing,\nGreat Landorus will come to help us,\lwhether it has a shrine or not!\pYou're the silly one!$"
gBwText_408_6:
	.string "No, YOU'RE silly! Hey, wait!$"
gBwText_408_7:
	.string "This little shrine is dedicated to a\nPokémon called Landorus.\pThey say that when Tornadus and\nThundurus were whipping up storms that\ldamaged houses and fields all over the\lUnova region, Landorus made them stop.$"
gBwText_408_8:
	.string "That's a story from way long ago, when\nmy grandpa was a little boy.$"
gBwText_408_9:
	.string "So if Tornadus and Thundurus come here\nagain, Great Landorus may come back.$"
gBwText_408_10:
	.string "That's what my grandpa told me!$"
gBwText_408_11:
	.string "It's a small, weathered shrine.$"
gBwText_408_12:
	.string "It's a small, weathered shrine.$"
gBwText_408_13:
	.string "Tornadus and Thundurus are struggling\ninside their Poké Balls!$"
gBwText_408_14:
	.string "Karamukukuk!$"
gBwText_408_15:
	.string "Landorus flew far away into the sky...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_408
