gBwText_409_0:
	.string "It is the Great Landorus that protects\nthis land.\pWith its help, we are assured of rich\nsoil and a prosperous harvest.\pYou should visit Great Landorus's\nlittle shrine and pay your respects.$"
gBwText_409_1:
	.string "Tornadus brings howling windstorms.\nThundurus pelts us with lightning.\pWhen these two are together in the\nsame place, Great Landorus will come\lagain.$"
gBwText_409_2:
	.string "People and Pokémon should work\ntogether to protect this bounteous\lland.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_409
