gBwText_414_0:
	.string "By any chance, have you caught a\nPokémon called {STR_VAR_1}?\pI would be very happy if you would trade\nmy {STR_VAR_2} for your {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_414_1:
	.string "My heart is beating so fast!\nOK, let's trade!$"
gBwText_414_2:
	.string "Thank you very much! Please treat my\n{STR_VAR_2} with love!\pI will also take good care of the\n{STR_VAR_1} that you traded to me!$"
gBwText_414_3:
	.string "I'd like to trade for a {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_414_4:
	.string "Well, if you don't want to, I\nunderstand.\pBut if you ever change your mind, please\ntrade Pokémon with me!$"
gBwText_414_5:
	.string "I am so grateful that you traded\nPokémon with me!\pMy research is making progress, and\nabove all, I'm happy because it is\lfriendly to me.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_414
