gBwText_416_0:
	.string "I am me.\nYou are you.\p...You really don't know what to do when\nsomeone suddenly says that, do you?$"
gBwText_416_1:
	.string "A parasol inside the gate! Well, I\nreally don't want to get wet and dirty.$"
gBwText_416_2:
	.string "Oh, awesome! That just made my day!\pThis vending machine gave me\nan extra drink! For free!!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_416
gBwTextTable_416:
	.4byte gBwText_416_0
	.4byte gBwText_416_1
	.4byte gBwText_416_2
	.global gBwTextCount_416
gBwTextCount_416:
	.4byte 3
gBwText_417_0:
	.string "You know, there are people in the world\nwith many different values.$"
gBwText_417_1:
	.string "Some people enjoy things you might not\nthink are fun...\pHaving a lot of different values in the\nworld makes it a richer place.\lThat's what I think, anyway.$"
gBwText_417_2:
	.string "I really enjoy traveling around the\nworld and talking with different people,\lbut the woman who lives here seems to\lthink living quietly by herself is\limportant.$"
gBwText_417_3:
	.string "Growwwwf!$"
gBwText_417_4:
	.string "So this was Zoroark's home, then!$"
gBwText_417_5:
	.string "Zoroark was using its illusion to trick\npeople and Pokémon. It wanted to keep\lpeople away from its lair.\pI heard this place was suspicious, so I\ncame to have a look, but it looks like I\lwas tricked as well.$"
gBwText_417_6:
	.string "Zoroark really reacted strongly to the\nPokémon you have with you...\pThere must be some history there.\nA quarrel, or something.$"
gBwText_417_7:
	.string "Such a beautiful field, in a place\nlike this...\pIt's almost as if this lovely scenery is\nthe illusion!$"
gBwText_417_8:
	.string "The suspicious woman attacked!$"
gBwText_417_9:
	.string "The Pokémon vanished deep into\nthe forest...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_417
