gBwText_419_0:
	.string "Rood: It smells of the sea here.\pThis place has the same ocean smell\nas where I was born...$"
gBwText_419_1:
	.string "Ghetsis wandered the lands of this\nworld all over, collecting knowledge of\lall kinds while searching for\llike-minded people.\pFrom the moment we met, he\nunderstood what I desired.$"
gBwText_419_2:
	.string "The ability to understand the minds and\nthe needs of others...\pThis is an ability that everyone needs\nto survive.\pMy lord N is a kind and excellent person\nwho understands the hearts of Pokémon.\pBut, conversely, perhaps his ability to\nunderstand the hearts and feelings\lof people is not developed enough.$"
gBwText_419_3:
	.string "But... Even that was part of the\nperfection of Ghetsis's plan.\pWhen it comes to Ghetsis, I cannot\nseparate the truths from the lies.\pSee this? I received it from Ghetsis,\nbut I no longer need it.\lI hope you can put it to good use.$"
gBwText_419_4:
	.string "Rood: Someday, if my lord N develops the\nability to understand the feelings\lof people as well as Pokémon,\lI would like us to gather again.\pMore than anything, I want to see\nN confront Ghetsis.$"
gBwText_419_5:
	.string "Looker: Ah... And now,\nabout Team Plasma...\pI am an officer of the\nInternational Police, and there are so\lmany things you must tell me at once!$"
gBwText_419_6:
	.string "Rood: If that is what you desire...$"
gBwText_419_7:
	.string "Looker: Many thanks!\pNow, Ghetsis notwithstanding, there\nyet remains but {STR_VAR_1} of the\lSeven Sages still at large.\pWhat it is they are thinking,\nwhat it may be they are hoping,\lthis is the information I have need of.\lQuick and soon, say I!$"
gBwText_419_8:
	.string "Looker: Thank you a lot!\pEh, {STR_VAR_1}...\nOn a topic I must speak to you.\pHaving received such a report, of\nsomeone far from here, who has seen\la person like N and...a dragon Pokémon.\pI am on my way to verify the veracity\nof this information.\lWe will meet again one day!$"
gBwText_419_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_419_10:
	.string "$"
gBwText_419_11:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
