gBwText_425_0:
	.string "Iris: Guess what!!\pI can teach you the strongest\nDragon-type move!\pFun, huh? Want me to\nteach your Pokémon this move?$"
gBwText_425_1:
	.string "OK! Well, if you change your mind,\ncome again, OK?$"
gBwText_425_2:
	.string "Let me see...\pWell, this Pokémon can learn the move,\nbut you need to have a really strong\lbond of friendship first.\pI don't think I can teach it yet.$"
gBwText_425_3:
	.string "OK, great!\nOh, but...\pYou don't seem to have a\nPokémon that can learn this move.$"
gBwText_425_4:
	.string "OK, great! Which Pokémon should\nlearn this move?$"
gBwText_425_5:
	.string "Um... I'm sorry...\nThat Pokémon can't learn this move!$"
gBwText_425_6:
	.string "What?\pYou want me to teach the move to an\nEgg? OK, I'll do my best!\p...\n...\pSorry!\nI think it's impossible!$"
gBwText_425_7:
	.string "This one?\pUm, but...it looks like this Pokémon\nalready knows {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_425_8:
	.string "Iris: Draco Meteor's power is\nreally amazing!\pBut after you use it, your Sp. Atk stat\ngoes down.$"
gBwText_425_9:
	.string "$"
gBwText_425_10:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} learned\n{STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_425_11:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} is trying to\nlearn {STR_VAR_2}!\pBut {STR_VAR_1} can't learn more than\nfour moves.\pDelete a move to make room\nfor {STR_VAR_2}?$"
gBwText_425_12:
	.string "Give up on learning the\nmove {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_425_13:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} did not learn {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_425_14:
	.string "Is it OK to forget the\nmove {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_425_15:
	.string "1, 2, and... ... ... Ta-da!\p{STR_VAR_1} forgot how to\nuse {STR_VAR_2}.\pAnd...$"
gBwText_425_16:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} learned {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_425_17:
	.string "Drayden: If you wish, I can teach your\nPokémon the strongest\lDragon-type move.\pWould you like your Pokémon to learn\nthat move?$"
gBwText_425_18:
	.string "Understood.\nCome again if you change your mind.$"
gBwText_425_19:
	.string "Hmm...\pThis Pokémon can learn this move, but\nyour bond of friendship is not yet\lstrong enough.\pThat means I cannot teach\nit this move.$"
gBwText_425_20:
	.string "I see...\pBut there are no Pokémon with\nyou right now that can learn this move.$"
gBwText_425_21:
	.string "Which Pokémon should\nlearn this move?$"
gBwText_425_22:
	.string "I'm very sorry, but...\pThis Pokémon cannot learn this move.$"
gBwText_425_23:
	.string "That's an interesting request, but...\nNot even I can teach a move to an Egg.$"
gBwText_425_24:
	.string "Hmm... It looks like this Pokémon\nalready knows {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_425_25:
	.string "Drayden: Draco Meteor's power is\nexceptional, but using it lowers\lthe user's Sp. Atk stat.$"
gBwText_425_26:
	.string "Your quest for power has brought\nyou here...\pVery well.\pLet me reward your passion with some\nabsolutely astounding moves.\pThey're the ultimate moves!\pShall I teach them to\nyour Pokémon?$"
gBwText_425_27:
	.string "$"
gBwText_425_28:
	.string "The Pokémon with you can't\nlearn these moves!\pGo talk to my wife! Keh!!$"
gBwText_425_29:
	.string "Hmm... Well, that is fine, as well.\nVisit if you have a change of heart.$"
gBwText_425_30:
	.string "Well, which Pokémon should I teach?$"
gBwText_425_31:
	.string "That Pokémon can't learn a move!\nGo talk to my wife! Keh!$"
gBwText_425_32:
	.string "Teach a move to an Egg?\nImpossible, even for me! Keh!$"
gBwText_425_33:
	.string "The bond with your Pokémon\nis not strong enough! Keh!$"
gBwText_425_34:
	.string "That Pokémon already knows\nthat move! Keh!$"
gBwText_425_35:
	.string "I should teach {STR_VAR_2} to\n{STR_VAR_1}, right? Keh!$"
gBwText_425_36:
	.string "$"
gBwText_425_37:
	.string "Heya!\pThe professor gave you a Pokémon to\nstart your journey, right?\pIf that Pokémon is still with you, and if\nyou two have a strong bond, there's a\lspecial move it can learn...\pWant me to teach it a battle combo\nmove?$"
gBwText_425_38:
	.string "A special move...\nShould I teach it a battle-combo move?$"
gBwText_425_39:
	.string "I can't teach these Pokémon.$"
gBwText_425_40:
	.string "Is that so...\nWell, come on back now, y'hear?$"
gBwText_425_41:
	.string "Which Pokémon should learn the move?$"
gBwText_425_42:
	.string "Now, that Pokémon can't learn this\nspecial move!\pI told ya, it's only for the Pokémon who\nstarted your journey with you.$"
gBwText_425_43:
	.string "Teach a move to an Egg?\nWhat kinda crazy talk is that?!$"
gBwText_425_44:
	.string "This Pokémon... Well, it doesn't look\nlike it's too comfortable with you yet.$"
gBwText_425_45:
	.string "I can't teach it twice. This Pokémon\nalready knows the special move!$"
gBwText_425_46:
	.string "Want me to teach {STR_VAR_2}\nto {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_425_47:
	.string "The Pokémon I've taken a shine to are\nthe ones you get from the professor!\pTo teach all of these Pokémon a\nspecial move, a battle combo move...\lThat's my pledge!$"
	.align 2
