gBwText_426_0:
	.string "I'm the Day-Care Man.\pWe take care of the precious Pokémon\nof other Trainers.\pIf you'd like us to raise your\nPokémon, have a word with my wife.$"
gBwText_426_1:
	.string "Glad you came!\nYour {STR_VAR_1}'s doing just fine.$"
gBwText_426_2:
	.string "Glad you came!\pYour {STR_VAR_1} and\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing just fine.\pThe two seem to get along very well!$"
gBwText_426_3:
	.string "Glad you came!\pYour {STR_VAR_1} and\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing just fine.\pThe two seem to get along.$"
gBwText_426_4:
	.string "Glad you came!\pYour {STR_VAR_1} and\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing just fine.\pThe two don't really seem to like\neach other much.$"
gBwText_426_5:
	.string "Glad you came!\pYour {STR_VAR_1} and\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing just fine.\pThe two prefer to play with other\nPokémon more than with each other.$"
gBwText_426_6:
	.string "Ah, it's you!\pWe were raising your Pokémon,\nand my goodness, were we surprised!\pYour Pokémon was holding an Egg!\pWe don't know how it got there,\nbut your Pokémon had it.\pYou do want it, don't you?$"
gBwText_426_7:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} received the Egg from\nthe Day-Care Man.$"
gBwText_426_8:
	.string "You take good care of it.$"
gBwText_426_9:
	.string "You have no room for it right now...\nCome back when you've made room.$"
gBwText_426_10:
	.string "I really will keep it.\nYou do want this Egg, yes?$"
gBwText_426_11:
	.string "Well then, I'll hang on to it.\nThanks!$"
gBwText_426_12:
	.string "I'm the Day-Care Lady.\nWe can raise Pokémon for you.\pWould you like us to raise\nyour Pokémon?$"
gBwText_426_13:
	.string "I'm the Day-Care Lady.\pWe can raise Pokémon for you.\nWhat do you want to do today?$"
gBwText_426_14:
	.string "Very good.\nCome again.$"
gBwText_426_15:
	.string "Ah, there you are!\nMy husband was looking for you.$"
gBwText_426_16:
	.string "You can't leave your only Pokémon\nwith me! How would you battle?\pCome back another time.$"
gBwText_426_17:
	.string "Which Pokémon should we raise\nfor you?$"
gBwText_426_18:
	.string "Now, now.\nThat is merely an Egg!$"
gBwText_426_19:
	.string "Fine, we'll raise your {STR_VAR_1}\nfor a while.$"
gBwText_426_20:
	.string "Come back for it later.$"
gBwText_426_21:
	.string "We can raise two of your Pokémon.\nWould you like us to raise another?$"
gBwText_426_22:
	.string "You have energetic Pokémon.\nDo you want your Pokémon back?$"
gBwText_426_23:
	.string "By level, your {STR_VAR_1} has\ngrown by about {STR_VAR_2}.$"
gBwText_426_24:
	.string "If you want your {STR_VAR_1} back,\nit will cost ${STR_VAR_2}.\lDo you want it back?$"
gBwText_426_25:
	.string "You don't have enough money...$"
gBwText_426_26:
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} took {STR_VAR_1} back\nfrom the Day-Care Lady.$"
gBwText_426_27:
	.string "Do you want to take back the other\none, too? $"
gBwText_426_28:
	.string "Huh? Now, now.\pIf you leave that Pokémon with\nme, you'll be left with just one.\pYou will be better off if you catch\nsome more, if I do say so myself.$"
gBwText_426_29:
	.string "$"
gBwText_426_30:
	.string "Leave Pokémon$"
gBwText_426_31:
	.string "Take back$"
gBwText_426_32:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_426_33:
	.string "$"
gBwText_426_34:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}? Lv. {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_426_35:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}? Lv. {STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_426_36:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} Lv. {STR_VAR_2}$"
