	.4byte 10
gBwText_428_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}! \pI understand the feeling.\nI want to go somewhere with\lmy Pokémon too, but first\lwe have to go thank Professor Juniper.\pCome on. The lab is this way!$"
gBwText_428_1:
	.string "Cheren: I'm sorry, but could you\ngo to Bianca's house?\pI'll bet she's spacing out\nlike she usually does.\lShe's totally flighty.$"
gBwText_428_2:
	.string "Bianca: ...That's a secret, OK?$"
gBwText_428_3:
	.string "Cheren: OK!\nLet's go meet the professor.$"
gBwText_428_4:
	.string "Bianca: Heeey!\n{STR_VAR_1}, wait up!$"
gBwText_428_5:
	.string "Bianca: Come on!\n{STR_VAR_1}, wait up!$"
gBwText_428_6:
	.string "Mom: Oh, there you are! And...?\nWhat did the professor have to say?\pShe asked you to complete the\nPokédex?! I can't believe it!$"
gBwText_428_7:
	.string "Well, actually, I can.\nI already knew she was going to ask.$"
gBwText_428_8:
	.string "That's why I brought you three of\nthese Town Maps. Take them with you!$"
gBwText_428_9:
	.string "Mom: Here you are, Cheren.$"
gBwText_428_10:
	.string "Cheren: I'll take good care of it.$"
gBwText_428_11:
	.string "Mom: And one for you, too, Bianca.$"
gBwText_428_12:
	.string "Bianca: Th-thank you so much!$"
gBwText_428_13:
	.string "Mom: As for your room, {STR_VAR_1}--\nor what's left of it...\pNo need for any of you to worry.\nI'll take care of tidying up.\pOK, {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_428_14:
	.string "Mom: Ah, Pokémon. They are so cute,\nbut they have enough power to destroy\la bedroom! They are really something.\pWith Pokémon like that at your side,\nyou'll be safe wherever you go!$"
gBwText_428_15:
	.string "I'll let your parents know!\pI hope that, in addition to Pokémon,\nyou'll find lots and lots of places\lyou like in the Unova region--\land become wonderful adults!\pHave a great trip!$"
gBwText_428_16:
	.string "Cheren: If I use the Town Map,\nI'll always know where I am...\lThat's certainly helpful.\pShall we head to Route 1?\nThe professor's waiting.$"
gBwText_428_17:
	.string "Bianca: Let's go, let's go!\n{STR_VAR_1}, hurry and come too, OK?$"
gBwText_428_18:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}...\nIt's this way!$"
gBwText_428_19:
	.string "Cheren: Bianca says if we're starting a\njourney together, she wants us all to\ltake our first step at the same time.$"
gBwText_428_20:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}!\pLet's all take our first step\non Route 1 together!$"
gBwText_428_21:
	.string "Cheren: OK, here we go!$"
gBwText_428_22:
	.string "$"
gBwText_428_23:
	.string "One, two!$"
gBwText_428_24:
	.string "The power of science is amazing!\pNow you can use infrared to do all\nsorts of things in the blink of an eye!$"
gBwText_428_25:
	.string "Do you think traveling with Pokémon\nchanges people?$"
gBwText_428_26:
	.string "Me too! Traveling and thinking about\nmany things can definitely make a\ldifference.$"
gBwText_428_27:
	.string "You're right! It's fine to just enjoy\nthe journey without overthinking it!$"
gBwText_428_28:
	.string "I've heard there are a lot of Pokémon\nand many different people in the world.\pWhen I hear stories about them,\nI get very excited!$"
gBwText_428_29:
	.string "Bianca: Oh! I wonder what will happen!\nIsn't this so exciting?!$"
gBwText_428_30:
	.string "Cheren: It sure is!\nC'mon, the professor's waiting.$"
gBwText_428_31:
	.string "Nuvema Town\nThe Start of Something Big!$"
gBwText_428_32:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s House$"
gBwText_428_33:
	.string "Cheren's House$"
gBwText_428_34:
	.string "Bianca's House$"
gBwText_428_35:
	.string "Juniper Pokémon Lab$"
gBwText_428_36:
	.string "Cheren: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\nIs Looker through talking to you?$"
gBwText_428_37:
	.string "Bianca: ...I'm sorry.\pBy the time I went to get the\nStriaton City Gym Leaders,\leverything was over...$"
gBwText_428_38:
	.string "Cheren: If that's the case...\pI let Ghetsis escape when the\nShadow Triad created an opening.$"
gBwText_428_39:
	.string "Bianca: ...Ghetsis?\nThe Shadow Triad?$"
gBwText_428_40:
	.string "Cheren: I'll tell you later about what\nhappened in the castle.\pIt's more important to ask what you\nplan to do now, Bianca.$"
gBwText_428_41:
	.string "Bianca: You know what? You know what!\nI'm gonna go to White Forest!$"
gBwText_428_42:
	.string "Bianca: You know what? You know what!\nI'm gonna go to Black City!$"
gBwText_428_43:
	.string "Cheren: That's the city on the other\nside of Route 16 when you leave from\lNimbasa City. Hmm.\pIf you go that way, you might be able to\nmeet all sorts of Pokémon\lyou've never seen before.$"
gBwText_428_44:
	.string "Cedric: Oh!\nWell, this is nice timing!\lI see you're all here!$"
gBwText_428_45:
	.string "Just a moment ago, I got some National\nPokédex data from an acquaintance.\pSince you're here, let's upgrade your\nPokédex with the National Pokédex\ldata.\pI'm sure you'll be visiting a wider\nrange of places. Naturally, that means\lyou'll be encountering more Pokémon.\pLet me see your Pokédex for a sec!$"
gBwText_428_46:
	.string "There you go, Bianca!$"
gBwText_428_47:
	.string "Next up is Cheren!$"
gBwText_428_48:
	.string "And last, but not least...$"
gBwText_428_49:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s Pokédex was upgraded\nwith the National Mode!$"
gBwText_428_50:
	.string "Cedric: You can now switch your\nPokédexes to the National Mode\lPokédex.\pCompleting the National Pokédex will\nsurely be a big challenge.\pSo, take your time, enjoy yourselves,\nand meet lots of Pokémon.$"
gBwText_428_51:
	.string "Bianca: Wow, the National Pokédex...\pIt looks like there are tons of Pokémon\nI don't know yet! \pOh! Ooh! I want to show Mom and Dad\nmy Pokédex! I gotta go!\pLet's meet again somewhere, OK?!$"
gBwText_428_52:
	.string "Cheren: Huh. Bianca's as impetuous as\never, no matter what is going on.$"
gBwText_428_53:
	.string "I think I'll travel all the way around\nUnova, starting at Route 1 again.\pI'm sure I'll discover lots of new\nthings.\pCould be I'll encounter the Seven\nSages along the way...\pAnd, {STR_VAR_1}, if we spy each other\nalong the way, let's battle again, OK?$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_428
