gBwText_429_0:
	.string "Cheren: I'm very sorry about\nall the trouble, ma'am.$"
gBwText_429_1:
	.string "Bianca: Well, um...\nWe can clean up...$"
gBwText_429_2:
	.string "Mom: Cleaning up?\nNo worries. I'll take care of it later.\pShouldn't you be on your way to\nmeet Professor Juniper?$"
gBwText_429_3:
	.string "Cheren: Yes, thank you!\nPlease excuse us.\pCome on.\nLet's go thank Professor Juniper.$"
gBwText_429_4:
	.string "Cheren: I'll be waiting in front of\nthe Pokémon Research Lab.$"
gBwText_429_5:
	.string "Bianca: Oh! Wait!\nI've gotta go home first.$"
gBwText_429_6:
	.string "Thanks for having us over!$"
gBwText_429_7:
	.string "Mom: My, my, {STR_VAR_1}.\pPokémon battles are so lively,\naren't they?\pI could hear the Pokémon's\ncries clear down here!$"
gBwText_429_8:
	.string "Hm. That sure reminded me of\nmy first Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_429_9:
	.string "Oh, and you know? After a battle,\nyou need to rest your Pokémon!$"
gBwText_429_10:
	.string "Your Pokémon is looking great!\pNow, if you're going out, don't forget\nyour “cross-transceiver“!$"
gBwText_429_11:
	.string "You're going to thank the\nprofessor too, right?\lBetter get going, honey!$"
gBwText_429_12:
	.string "Mom: Phew! I'm taking a little break\nfrom cleaning up.\pYou and your Pokémon should take\na break, too.\pGood Trainers don't push their\nPokémon too hard.$"
gBwText_429_13:
	.string "Mom: You and your Pokémon should all be\nfilled with energy again!\lNow, you can go anywhere!$"
gBwText_429_14:
	.string "Mom: I wonder where you'll go next\nand what kind of Pokémon you'll meet.$"
gBwText_429_15:
	.string "Mom: {STR_VAR_1}!\nHow are your Pokémon?\pYou should rest a little!\pGood Trainers don't push\ntheir Pokémon too hard.$"
gBwText_429_16:
	.string "Mom: Great! You and your Pokémon\nlook raring to go, {STR_VAR_1}.\pBest get back to your journey!$"
gBwText_429_17:
	.string "Mom: {STR_VAR_1},\nare you being kind to your Pokémon?\pPokémon work so hard to help you out!\pYou're normally very kind to your\nPokémon, aren't you?$"
gBwText_429_18:
	.string "Mom: Now that you mention it...\pYour father went on a journey\nwith Pokémon, just as you are!\pWe met during his trip...$"
gBwText_429_19:
	.string "Mom: How are things going?\pHave you caught many Pokémon? That\nwas the professor's request, right?$"
gBwText_429_20:
	.string "Mom: I wonder what Cheren and Bianca\nwill find during their travels.\pWhat they really want from life...\pIf they figure that out for themselves,\nI think their journeys will prove to be\lall they could hope for!$"
gBwText_429_21:
	.string "Mom: {STR_VAR_1}!\nWelcome home!\pSounds like you've been through a lot!\nYou should rest a little bit!$"
gBwText_429_22:
	.string "Mom: Oh, my! You and your Pokémon look\nfull of bounce!\pThis is just a little advice from your\nmother, but...\pWhen a Pokémon's energy--um, I mean,\nHP--runs out, hurry to a Pokémon\lCenter and get it restored.\pIt's also a good idea to buy Potions\nat a Pokémon Mart for times when you're\ladventuring far from civilization.\pPlease be careful!\nHave a good trip!\lI'll always be cheering for you!$"
gBwText_429_23:
	.string "“Mom“: Welcome home, {STR_VAR_1}.\pSeems like you've been through\nmany amazing things, is it not so?$"
gBwText_429_24:
	.string "“Mom“: Incredible, really.\pAmazing, absolutely, meeting these\ntwo Pokémon of legend!$"
gBwText_429_25:
	.string "“Mom“: Ah, ah, this is...$"
gBwText_429_26:
	.string "“Mom“: Oh!\nI still wear my disguise! Pardon!\pOr, rather, let me introduce myself.$"
gBwText_429_27:
	.string "I am a globe-trotting elite of the\nInternational Police.\pMy name... Ah, no, I shall inform you\nof my code name only.\pMy code name, it is Looker.\nIt is how I am called!$"
gBwText_429_28:
	.string "Looker: Behind the scenes in this\nregion of Unova, an organization called\lTeam Plasma conspires...\pThis I have heard, and therefore,\nto this region I must come, but...$"
gBwText_429_29:
	.string "Thanks to the Gym Leaders and to you,\nyes, Team Plasma's castle has fallen.\pAnd the members, they have gone upon\ntheir separate ways!\lThis is what I hear, most certainly!$"
gBwText_429_30:
	.string "But, however!\nHowever, but...\pThe ones known as the Seven\nSages--still, they hide themselves in\lthe Unova region.$"
gBwText_429_31:
	.string "And so, in the end, it explains why I\nmust ask this of you, Trainer of amazing\lskill!\pTravel the Unova region and search it\nup and search it down for the Seven\lSages!\pAlder, the Champion of renown,\nrecommended you to my notice.\pAre you willing to help me?$"
gBwText_429_32:
	.string "Ah, ah!\pYet once more shall I ask!\pIf you please, travel the Unova region\nand search it low and high for these\lSeven Sages!$"
gBwText_429_33:
	.string "Looker: Excellent! I thank you!\pNow I feel as if I have perhaps \na million people on my side.\pPermit me to give this into your hands!$"
gBwText_429_34:
	.string "Mom: ...That's a Super Rod, right?$"
gBwText_429_35:
	.string "Looker: Yes, correct!\nIt is certainly a Super Rod!$"
gBwText_429_36:
	.string "Mom: Weren't we talking about\nTeam Plasma's Seven Sages?\pWhat does this have to do with\nlooking for those people?$"
gBwText_429_37:
	.string "Looker: I see.\pIt is truly {STR_VAR_1}'s mama to ask\nso! What a magnificent question! I\ladmire it.\pIt is my pleasure to answer.\pAbsolutely nothing!$"
gBwText_429_38:
	.string "...$"
gBwText_429_39:
	.string "...$"
gBwText_429_40:
	.string "Mom: I see...$"
gBwText_429_41:
	.string "Looker: Yes, I shall provide the\nexplanation of this, the Super Rod!\pFirst!\nFace the water and employ the rod!\pSecond!\nConcentrate your focal point!\pWhen it occurs that these Pokémon bite,\n“!“ will indicate. Immediately, reel in!\pFor the rest, {STR_VAR_1},\nI depend upon you!$"
gBwText_429_42:
	.string "Mom: People from the International\nPolice are kind of...unique, aren't\lthey?\pWell, no worries. I think you should just\ndo what you want to do.\pYou're practically a grown-up now!$"
	.align 2
