	.4byte 43
gBwText_430_0:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}!\pI heard from Professor Juniper.\nWe can have a Pokémon?$"
gBwText_430_1:
	.string "...\n...\pWhat's keeping Bianca?$"
gBwText_430_2:
	.string "Bianca: Am I a little late again?\nSo-oooo-orry!$"
gBwText_430_3:
	.string "Cheren: Bianca...\pI've known for ten years that you\nhave no sense of time, but...seriously...\pToday's the day we can get a\nPokémon from Professor Juniper!$"
gBwText_430_4:
	.string "Bianca: I know. Sorry, {STR_VAR_1}.\nSorry, Cheren.$"
gBwText_430_5:
	.string "Bianca: So, where are the Pokémon?\pThey were delivered to {STR_VAR_1}'s\nhouse, so {STR_VAR_1} gets first pick.$"
gBwText_430_6:
	.string "Cheren: Naturally.$"
gBwText_430_7:
	.string "The Pokémon are waiting for us\ninside that gift box.\pOK, {STR_VAR_1}, you go first and take\na peek at the gift box.\pI want to meet the Pokémon right now!$"
gBwText_430_8:
	.string "Cheren: Aren't you going to check\nout the gift box? Where are you going?$"
gBwText_430_9:
	.string "Cheren: Would you get a move on\nand open the gift box already?\pI'm sure the Pokémon are just as\nexcited to meet us!$"
gBwText_430_10:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh!\nWhat kind of Pokémon could they be?$"
gBwText_430_11:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} opened the gift box!$"
gBwText_430_12:
	.string "I've brought three Pokémon,\none for you and one for each\lof your friends. Please settle\lyour choices politely.\lEnjoy your Pokémon!\l                --Professor Juniper$"
gBwText_430_13:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_14:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_15:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_16:
	.string "The Water-type Pokémon\n{STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_430_17:
	.string "The Fire-type Pokémon\n{STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_430_18:
	.string "The Grass-type Pokémon\n{STR_VAR_2}$"
gBwText_430_19:
	.string "Choose a Pokémon.$"
gBwText_430_20:
	.string "Is this the Pokémon you want?$"
gBwText_430_21:
	.string "Pick this one!$"
gBwText_430_22:
	.string "YES$"
gBwText_430_23:
	.string "NO$"
gBwText_430_24:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} chose\n{STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_430_25:
	.string "Bianca: OK, I'll take this Pokémon!\nCheren, that one's yours!$"
gBwText_430_26:
	.string "Cheren: Hey, how come you get to pick\nout my Pokémon?\pOh, never mind. I wanted {STR_VAR_2}\nfrom the start, anyway.$"
gBwText_430_27:
	.string "Bianca: Everyone has chosen a Pokémon!\n...So that's that!\pHey, I know!\nLet's have a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_430_28:
	.string "Cheren: Honestly, Bianca...\pEven though they're still weak\nPokémon, you shouldn't have Pokémon\lbattles inside a house.$"
gBwText_430_29:
	.string "Bianca: Don't be a worrywart! These\nlittle ones are weak, like you said.\pWe have to let them battle so they'll\nget stronger. It's settled,\l{STR_VAR_1}! Get ready for a Pokémon\lbattle!$"
gBwText_430_30:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_31:
	.string "...The box is empty.$"
gBwText_430_32:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_33:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_34:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_35:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_36:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_37:
	.string "Bianca: Wow...\p{STR_VAR_1}, you're gonna be\nan awesome Trainer someday, I can tell!\pNo doubt!$"
gBwText_430_38:
	.string "Bianca: Wha...?\pI got so absorbed in having my Pokémon\nuse moves, I won before even realizing...$"
gBwText_430_39:
	.string "Cheren: Uh...\n...\pBianca, would you take a look around?$"
gBwText_430_40:
	.string "Bianca: Wh-whoa!\nWhat happened?!$"
gBwText_430_41:
	.string "Wow! Pokémon are amaaaaazing!!\nSo little, but so strong!\pI'm so glad that I get to have a\nPokémon!\p...Oh.\nUm, sorry about your room, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_430_42:
	.string "Cheren: You...are completely hopeless.\pHere!\nI'll restore your Pokémon for you.$"
gBwText_430_43:
	.string "Cheren healed Bianca's Pokémon!$"
gBwText_430_44:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}'s Pokémon needs\nto be fixed up, too.$"
gBwText_430_45:
	.string "Cheren healed {STR_VAR_1}'s Pokémon!$"
gBwText_430_46:
	.string "Cheren: It's amazing that you won\nwithout your Pokémon's losing any\lenergy, which is called HP.\pBut you used some of the moves'\nPower Points, or PP, though.$"
gBwText_430_47:
	.string "Bianca: Hey, Cheren!\nHow about you battle, too?\pWith all you know, I'm sure you can\nbattle without turning the room into\la disaster area like I did!$"
gBwText_430_48:
	.string "Cheren: I believe you're right!\pIt'll be no problem for me to keep\nthe room from getting any messier.\pBesides, it's not fair if you two are\nthe only ones who get to have fun\lbattling!$"
gBwText_430_49:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_50:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_51:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_52:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_53:
	.string "It's decided. You'll be my opponent...\nin our first Pokémon battle!\pLet's see what you can do, {STR_VAR_2}!$"
gBwText_430_54:
	.string "$"
gBwText_430_55:
	.string "Cheren: I made a strange blunder\nin my first battle, but\lthis feeling I have...\l...I'm finally a Trainer.\pBut first, we'd better go apologize to\nyour mother about this messed-up room.$"
gBwText_430_56:
	.string "Cheren: This feeling...\nFinally, I'm a Trainer.\pOn top of that, we'd better go\napologize to your mother about this\lroom.$"
gBwText_430_57:
	.string "Bianca: Oh!\nI'd better come, too!$"
gBwText_430_58:
	.string "It's a Wii console!\nIt has a Wii Remote!$"
gBwText_430_59:
	.string "It's a Wii console!\pIt's not even scratched!$"
gBwText_430_60:
	.string "It's a flat-screen television\nthat Dad bought!$"
gBwText_430_61:
	.string "It's a bed.\pThe sheets smell great because\nMom just washed them!$"
gBwText_430_62:
	.string "The bed's a mess!$"
gBwText_430_63:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} checked the PC.\pPokémon Basics...\pPeople live alongside Pokémon in\nthis world.\pThe people who battle with Pokémon\nare called Pokémon Trainers.$"
gBwText_430_64:
	.string "It's an award for completing\nthe Unova Pokédex!$"
gBwText_430_65:
	.string "It's an award for completing\nthe National Mode Pokédex!$"
gBwText_430_66:
	.string "It's a trophy proving you defeated\nthe Single Master in the Battle Subway!$"
gBwText_430_67:
	.string "It's a trophy proving you defeated\nthe Double Master in the Battle Subway!$"
gBwText_430_68:
	.string "It's a trophy proving you defeated\nthe Multi Master in the Battle Subway!$"
	.align 2
