gBwText_431_0:
	.string "No, no, a thousand times no!$"
gBwText_431_1:
	.string "Bianca: But, I'm...\pI'm a good Trainer who got\na Pokémon and everything!\lI can totally go on an adventure!$"
gBwText_431_2:
	.string "Bianca: Oh...\nIt's OK.\p...It's fine!\pI'll be waiting for you in front\nof the lab, OK?$"
gBwText_431_3:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: What nonsense is this?\pHow could my daughter, who knows\nnothing about the world,\lbe going on a journey with Pokémon?$"
gBwText_431_4:
	.string "Bianca's Mom: Don't mind my husband,\ndear. He's just being overprotective.\pAll children go on adventures\nwith Pokémon.\lIt's part of growing up.$"
gBwText_431_5:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Well, then. I look forward\nto the stories Bianca will have for us\lnext time she comes home.$"
gBwText_431_6:
	.string "Bianca's Dad: Even if there are many\nthings you want to do,\lyou're only one person.\pIt's frustrating, isn't it?$"
gBwText_431_7:
	.string "Bianca's Mom: Choosing one thing means\nhaving to give up something else.\pSo, of course it's very hard to decide.$"
gBwText_431_8:
	.string "Bianca: I was just looking over\nmy Pokédex again and thinking...\pI sure have met a lot\nof different Pokémon.$"
