gBwText_433_0:
	.string "Cheren's Dad: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}!\pI heard it from the professor!\nSo, you're getting a Pokémon, eh?\pOh, you've already got it!\nHm, that sure is a cute Pokémon.\pAnd you're all finally\nstarting your journeys as Trainers?\pWell, let me read you a passage from\na book called “Adventure Rules.“\p“The X Button is vitally important\nfor Trainers.” Never forget that.$"
gBwText_433_1:
	.string "Cheren's Mom: That Cheren.\nI'm sure he's at the laboratory. \pHe's so... How should I put it?\nDiligent or, better, conscientious.$"
gBwText_433_2:
	.string "Cheren's Dad: Traveling is great!\pYou encounter so many things you've\nnever seen and things you don't yet\lunderstand. Wherever you go, you'll\llearn something new and grow up a\llittle.$"
gBwText_433_3:
	.string "Cheren's Mom: Why, {STR_VAR_1}.\pI hear the professor asked you to\ncomplete the Pokédex.\pDon't worry! You'll always have\nPokémon by your side.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_433
