gBwText_434_0:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} checked the PC screen.\pAdventure Rule No. 1\nThe X Button opens the menu!\pAdventure Rule No. 2\nRecord your progress with SAVE.\pThere is nothing else on here...$"
	.align 2
