gBwText_435_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_435_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_435_2:
	.string "Hi there!\nI've been waiting for you young people!\pLet me introduce myself again.\nMy name is...$"
gBwText_435_3:
	.string "Cheren: Professor Juniper?\nWe know your name.$"
gBwText_435_4:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Come, come, Cheren!\nThis is not a time to take things\llightly.\pToday is a day to remember always, so\nit's best to behave with some\lformality.\pThat being so, once again, my name is\nProfessor Juniper, and I am researching\lwhen and how the creatures called\lPokémon came into existence.$"
gBwText_435_5:
	.string "Oh, that's unusual!\nYou've already had a Pokémon battle!\pSo maybe that's why...\pIt feels as though your Pokémon have\nalready begun to trust you!\pBy the way, would you like to give your\nPokémon a nickname?$"
gBwText_435_6:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Uh-huh, I see. Are\nyou OK with the nickname {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_435_7:
	.string "Professor Juniper: {STR_VAR_1} is its\nname. That is such a great name!$"
gBwText_435_8:
	.string "Professor Juniper: You aren't planning\nto use a nickname? Well, that's fine,\ltoo.$"
gBwText_435_9:
	.string "Professor Juniper: As for why I gave all\nof you Pokémon...$"
gBwText_435_10:
	.string "Cheren: It's for the Pokédex, right?$"
gBwText_435_11:
	.string "Bianca: Pokédex?$"
gBwText_435_12:
	.string "Professor Juniper: I am astonished.\nNice work, Cheren!\pYou have already studied Pokémon\nextensively, haven't you?\pStill, let me explain everything from\nthe beginning, for everyone's sake.$"
gBwText_435_13:
	.string "The Pokédex is a high-tech device that\nautomatically records the Pokémon\lyou encounter!\pSo, I want you three to visit many\nplaces and meet all of the Pokémon\lin the Unova region!$"
gBwText_435_14:
	.string "This is my request.\p{STR_VAR_1}!\nCheren! Bianca!\pYou'll go on an adventure to\ncomplete the Pokédex, will you not?$"
gBwText_435_15:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Here is what I need\nfrom you!\pWhat I want to hear are the courageous\nwords of people who will blaze new\lpaths around the world!\pI want you three to travel to many\ndistant places and meet all of the\lPokémon in the Unova region!$"
gBwText_435_16:
	.string "Bianca: OK!\pI mean... Yes, professor!$"
gBwText_435_17:
	.string "Cheren: Thank you very much.\pBecause of you, I can become a Pokémon\nTrainer, exactly as I've always wished.$"
gBwText_435_18:
	.string "Professor Juniper: All of you, thanks!\pYou have given me the best\npossible answer!$"
gBwText_435_19:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} obtained the Pokédex!$"
gBwText_435_20:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Next, I need to\nteach you how to meet Pokémon.\pPlease meet me at Route 1, OK?$"
gBwText_435_21:
	.string "Bianca: S-since the professor asked us,\nit's OK to go on an adventure, right?\pI can explore and maybe find out what I\nwant to do in life. I think I'd like that.$"
gBwText_435_22:
	.string "Cheren: Of course.\pWe can travel however we want\nwhile we complete the Pokédex.$"
gBwText_435_23:
	.string "Bianca: For some reason,\nmy heart is pounding, {STR_VAR_1}.\pWhat are you and {STR_VAR_2} going to\ndo?$"
gBwText_435_24:
	.string "Cheren: Finally, I can become\na Pokémon Trainer.\pI'll have real battles with other\nTrainers and get stronger. Wait and\lsee!$"
gBwText_435_25:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Why, hello,\n{STR_VAR_1}! How have you been lately?$"
gBwText_435_26:
	.string "Cedric: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}!\nAre you meeting lots of Pokémon?\pThere really are lots of Pokémon\nin the Unova region and the\lrest of the world!$"
gBwText_435_27:
	.string "$"
gBwText_435_28:
	.string "$"
gBwText_435_29:
	.string "$"
gBwText_435_30:
	.string "Cedric: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_435_31:
	.string "Skreet! Skreet!$"
gBwText_435_32:
	.string "Bianca: Professor Juniper is\nletting me help out.\pWhen I was looking at my Pokédex,\nI realized something...\pI met so many Pokémon during my\njourney.\pI just want to learn more and more\nand more about the little darlings!$"
gBwText_435_33:
	.string "Oh yeah! That's right.\p{STR_VAR_1}, do you know\nabout massive outbreaks of Pokémon?$"
gBwText_435_34:
	.string "Bianca: I knew you'd know, {STR_VAR_1}!\pI'm sure you also know that lots of a\ncertain Pokémon appear in the grass all\lover, and that if you look at the\lelectric signs in the Route gates, you\lcan see where the mass outbreaks are\lhappening in the Unova region!$"
gBwText_435_35:
	.string "Bianca: Tee-hee!\nOK, then, I'll tell you about it.\pFirst of all, lots of a certain Pokémon\nappear in the grass all over.\pIf you look at the electric signs in the\nRoute gates, you can see where the\lmass outbreaks are happening in the\lUnova region! Isn't that amazing!$"
gBwText_435_36:
	.string "I have to study lots of Pokémon\nresearch, but I don't mind. This is the\lanswer I found during my adventure!\lIt's actually a lot of fun!\pAnd I have an idea! Every now and then,\ncome have a Pokémon battle with me, OK?\p'Cause by doing that, I'll learn\na lot more about Pokémon!$"
gBwText_435_37:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pIf you give a Pokémon called Feebas\na Prism Scale and trade it with someone,\lapparently it evolves.\pIsn't that amazing?\pPokémon sure are mysterious beings,\naren't they?$"
gBwText_435_38:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pIn Pinwheel Forest, there is a rock\nthat's covered in moss.\pIt might be related to the rock, I\ndunno, but there is a Pokémon that\levolves when it levels up in Pinwheel\lForest!\pPokémon sure are mysterious beings,\naren't they?$"
gBwText_435_39:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pDeep in Twist Mountain,\nthere's an ice-covered rock.\pThere is a Pokémon that evolves\nwhen it levels up near that rock.\pPokémon sure are mysterious beings,\naren't they?$"
gBwText_435_40:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pThere are Pokémon that evolve when\nthey level up knowing a certain move!\pPokémon sure are mysterious beings,\naren't they?$"
gBwText_435_41:
	.string "Bianca: {STR_VAR_1}, did you know this?\pThere are Pokémon that evolve when\nyou give them a certain item and they\llevel up at night!\pPokémon sure are mysterious beings,\naren't they?$"
gBwText_435_42:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, {STR_VAR_1}!\pWould you have a Pokémon\nbattle with me today?$"
gBwText_435_43:
	.string "Bianca: Great! {STR_VAR_1}!\pWe're battling indoors, so\ndon't get too worked up!$"
gBwText_435_44:
	.string "Bianca: Whaaaaat!\pWait...\nNo, I'm pretty disappointed...$"
gBwText_435_45:
	.string "Bianca: Oh, so you will have a\nPokémon battle with me, then?$"
gBwText_435_46:
	.string "Bianca: Phew!\nI'm totally sure, {STR_VAR_1}.\pYou're really a strong Trainer.\pI love your style of Pokémon\nbattling, {STR_VAR_1}.\pSomehow your Pokémon look like\nthey're having so much fun!$"
gBwText_435_47:
	.string "Who is this with Professor Juniper?\nThere's a smiling man in the picture.$"
gBwText_435_48:
	.string "Father and daughter...\pIt's a picture of the two\nProfessor Junipers.$"
gBwText_435_49:
	.string "Adventure Rule No. 1\nThe X Button opens the menu.$"
gBwText_435_50:
	.string "Adventure Rule No. 2\nRecord your progress with SAVE.$"
gBwText_435_51:
	.string "There are lots of books about Pokémon!$"
gBwText_435_52:
	.string "There are lots of materials and\nresearch reports about Pokémon!$"
	.align 2
