gBwText_436_0:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Ah, {STR_VAR_1}!\nThere you are!\pTraveling with your Pokémon is truly\none of the joys of being a Trainer!\pPlease follow me.\pI'd like to show you the most important\nplace for a Trainer to know!$"
gBwText_436_1:
	.string "Please listen, everyone.\pWe have something important to talk\nto you about. Wait here for a moment.$"
gBwText_436_2:
	.string "Please excuse me...\nWe are still preparing.\pIf you could continue to be patient...$"
gBwText_436_3:
	.string "Please excuse me...\nWe are still preparing.\pIf you could continue to be patient...$"
gBwText_436_4:
	.string "$"
gBwText_436_5:
	.string "Cheren: Wasn't that the professor\nwaiting in front of the Pokémon Center?\pI know about the Pokémon Center\nalready. Anyway, I want to battle soon!\pReal battles are the best way to become\nstronger, you know!$"
gBwText_436_6:
	.string "Sounds like something's going\non in the plaza!$"
gBwText_436_7:
	.string "Well, let's have a little look-see.$"
gBwText_436_8:
	.string "Cheren: {STR_VAR_1}, come here a sec.$"
gBwText_436_9:
	.string "My name is Ghetsis.\pI am here representing Team Plasma.\pToday, ladies and gentlemen, I would\nlike to talk to you about Pokémon\lliberation.$"
gBwText_436_10:
	.string "Huh?$"
gBwText_436_11:
	.string "What?$"
gBwText_436_12:
	.string "Ghetsis: I'm sure most of you believe\nthat we humans and Pokémon are\lpartners that have come to live\ltogether because we want and need\leach other.\pHowever...\nIs that really the truth?\pHave you ever considered that perhaps\nwe humans...\lonly assume that this is the truth?$"
gBwText_436_13:
	.string "Pokémon are subject to the selfish\ncommands of Trainers...\pThey get pushed around when they are\nour “partners“ at work...\pCan anyone say with confidence that\nthere is no truth in what I'm saying?$"
gBwText_436_14:
	.string "Yikes!$"
gBwText_436_15:
	.string "No way.$"
gBwText_436_16:
	.string "I don't know...$"
gBwText_436_17:
	.string "Ghetsis: Now, ladies and gentlemen,\nPokémon are different from humans.\pThey are living beings that contain\nunknown potential.\pThey are living beings from whom we\nhumans have much to learn.\pTell me, what is our responsibility\ntoward these wonderful beings called\lPokémon?$"
gBwText_436_18:
	.string "What could it be?$"
gBwText_436_19:
	.string "Liberation?$"
gBwText_436_20:
	.string "Ghetsis: That's right!\nWe must liberate the Pokémon!\pThen, and only then, will humans\nand Pokémon truly be equals.\pEveryone, I end my words here today by\nimploring you to consider the\lrelationship between people and\lPokémon... and the correct way to\lproceed.\pWe sincerely appreciate your attention.$"
gBwText_436_21:
	.string "Older Man: About that speech...\nWhat do you think we should do?$"
gBwText_436_22:
	.string "Younger Man: Liberate Pokémon?\nThat's not even possible!$"
gBwText_436_23:
	.string "???: Your Pokémon...\pJust now, it was saying...$"
gBwText_436_24:
	.string "Cheren: Slow down. You talk too fast.\pAnd what's this about\nPokémon...talking? That's an odd thing\lto say.$"
gBwText_436_25:
	.string "???: Yes, they're talking.\pOh.\nThen, you two can't hear it, either...\lHow sad.\pMy name is N.$"
gBwText_436_26:
	.string "Cheren: My name is Cheren,\nand this is {STR_VAR_1}.\pWe were asked to complete the Pokédex,\nand we just left on our journey.\pMy main goal is to become the\nChampion, though.$"
gBwText_436_27:
	.string "N: The Pokédex, eh?\pSo... You're going to confine many, many\nPokémon in Poké Balls for that, then.\pI'm a Trainer, too,\nbut I can't help wondering...\pAre Pokémon really happy that way?$"
gBwText_436_28:
	.string "Well, {STR_VAR_1}, is it?\nLet me hear your Pokémon's voice again!$"
gBwText_436_29:
	.string "N: As long as Pokémon are confined\nin Poké Balls...\pPokémon will never become\nperfect beings.\pI have to change the world for\nPokémon, because they're my friends.$"
gBwText_436_30:
	.string "Cheren: Huh... Strange guy.\pBut I'm not going to worry about it.\pTrainers and Pokémon help\neach other out!\pListen, I'm going on ahead.\pI want to battle the Gym Leader\nin the next town--Striaton City.\pAim to battle Gym Leader after\nGym Leader. The best way for a Trainer\lto become stronger is to challenge\lthe Gym Leaders in each area.$"
gBwText_436_31:
	.string "What's this?\pYou and your Pokémon\nsomehow resemble each other!$"
gBwText_436_32:
	.string "Let me give you the benefit of\nmy experience.\pYou listening? The number of Pokémon\nyou can take with you at one time is\lsix!$"
gBwText_436_33:
	.string "Pokémon do everything in\ntheir power for people.\pPeople treat these Pokémon\nwith love and affection.\pThat's what I think our\nmutual relationship is.$"
gBwText_436_34:
	.string "Beautiful scenery and relaxing\nsounds...\pOh, man. I sure do loooove this place.\nSure makes me feel happy.$"
gBwText_436_35:
	.string "Some wild Pokémon jump out of the\ntall grass and attack...\pBut you can make friends with those\nPokémon if you reach out to them!$"
gBwText_436_36:
	.string "Accumula Town\nThe Fast-Growing Town!$"
gBwText_436_37:
	.string "$"
	.align 2
