gBwText_437_0:
	.string "Professor Juniper: This is a\nPokémon Center!\pDon't you feel better as soon as you\nstep through the door?\pOK, let's start your tour!$"
gBwText_437_1:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh, wait for me!$"
gBwText_437_2:
	.string "Professor Juniper: A Pokémon Center is\na truly incredible place!\pDo you know why?\nBecause your Pokémon can be healed!\lAnd, what's more, it's absolutely free!\pA Pokémon Center is a Trainer's\nbest friend!\pHere, {STR_VAR_1}, give it a try.$"
gBwText_437_3:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Hey, {STR_VAR_1}.\nWhere are you off to?\pHumor me and talk to the lady at the\ncounter. Let her take your Pokémon.$"
gBwText_437_4:
	.string "Professor Juniper: You should be\ntalking to the lady at the counter, not\lto me...$"
gBwText_437_5:
	.string "Bianca: All you need to do is give her\nyour Pokémon, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_437_6:
	.string "Professor Juniper: OK. Now that your\nPokémon have rested, I'll show you how\lto use the PC at a Pokémon Center.$"
gBwText_437_7:
	.string "Professor Juniper: This is the PC.\nIt's free for any Trainer to use.\pYou can store Pokémon in your PC Boxes\nor select Pokémon stored in your\lPC Boxes to take along with you.\pIn addition, if you catch a new Pokémon\nwhile you have six Pokémon traveling\lwith you, the Pokémon you just caught\lis sent automatically to the PC\lnetwork!\pSurprising, isn't it? Amazing, even.\nHere's something else that's cool.\pIf you select my PC, I'll evaluate the\nprogress you've made on your Pokédex!$"
gBwText_437_8:
	.string "Bianca: Professor...\pIt says “Someone's PC“\non the screen. Who is Someone?$"
gBwText_437_9:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Very good, Bianca.\nThat's a great observation!\pGood question, and I'd like to say more,\nbut for now, just ignore that and\lgo ahead and use the PC.\p“Someone“ is the person who made the\nPokémon Storage System.\p...Someone I'm sure you'll meet\nsomeday! OK, let's move on!$"
gBwText_437_10:
	.string "Professor Juniper: Now, this is the\nPoké Mart.\pThis is the place to buy useful items\nand sell the ones you don't need\lanymore!\pThat gentleman over there will\nhelp you with a smile!$"
gBwText_437_11:
	.string "Professor Juniper: So, let's\nwrap this up.\pI've given you the basics of being\na Trainer!\pI'm going to head back to Nuvema Town.\pOne final thing...\pWhen you get to Striaton City, go and\nmeet an inventor named Fennel.\pShe's a friend of mine from long ago,\nand I'm sure she'll help you on your\lway!\pBest of luck! I hope that your journeys\nprove to be the adventure of a\llifetime!$"
gBwText_437_12:
	.string "Bianca: Ooh! What should I buy?\pPotions and Poké Balls are definitely\nimportant. Ummm...thinking...$"
gBwText_437_13:
	.string "Be sure to save what's happened up\nto this point before you forget.\lThen you can take a break.$"
