gBwText_438_0:
	.string "It is important to train your Pokémon in\nbattle, but when their HP goes down,\ltake them to a Pokémon Center.$"
gBwText_438_1:
	.string "Trainer, how many Poké Balls do\nyou have?\pIf you think you don't have enough,\nit's a good idea to buy some\lat a shop in a Pokémon Center!$"
gBwText_438_2:
	.string "Oh! Your Pokémon!\nYou're so lucky. I envy you.\lI want to be a Trainer, too!$"
