gBwText_439_0:
	.string "Someone said that because there are\ndifferent ideas, disputes will arise...\pSomeone else said that because there\nare different ideas, the world will\lexpand...\pI guess they're both right.$"
gBwText_439_1:
	.string "We've just gotten married. Men and\nwomen are so different, aren't they?\pBut I don't see much difference\nbetween male and female Pokémon...$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_439
gBwTextTable_439:
	.4byte gBwText_439_0
	.4byte gBwText_439_1
	.global gBwTextCount_439
gBwTextCount_439:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_440_0:
	.string "On Route 2, many Trainers train their\nPokémon by having them battle!$"
gBwText_440_1:
	.string "Guess what I know!\pI know! Pokémon can remember\nup to four moves at a time! Hee hee!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_440
gBwTextTable_440:
	.4byte gBwText_440_0
	.4byte gBwText_440_1
	.global gBwTextCount_440
gBwTextCount_440:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_441_0:
	.string "Wow, you have that great Bag that can\nstore anything!\pWhy don't you buy a lot of Potions\nand put them in your Bag?$"
gBwText_441_1:
	.string "Weak Pokémon, strong Pokémon,\ncool Pokémon, cute Pokémon...\pMany Pokémon look forward\nto meeting you!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_441
gBwTextTable_441:
	.4byte gBwText_441_0
	.4byte gBwText_441_1
	.global gBwTextCount_441
gBwTextCount_441:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_442_0:
	.string "Pokémon will be strong if you train\nthem, even if they're weak now.\pLove is what's important!$"
gBwText_442_1:
	.string "If you get strong, you can move\nforward. If you move forward, you'll be\lstronger.\pThat's the cool thing about journeys!$"
gBwText_442_2:
	.string "When a hero leads the world, a Pokémon\nis going to come and help the hero...\pEverybody in the Unova region\nknows that legend!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_442
