	.4byte 9
gBwText_445_0:
	.string "Lacunosa Town\nMethodical and Orderly$"
gBwText_445_1:
	.string "Welcome to Lacunosa Town.\pIn this town, people live as\nmethodically as clockwork from morning\lto night.\pIf you live your life soaking up\nsunlight, you can sleep very well at\lnight.$"
gBwText_445_2:
	.string "Well, hello there, young traveler!\pWould you like to hear an old story\nof Lacunosa Town?\pBear with me, because I'm an old lady\nwho likes telling tales the\lold-fashioned way!$"
gBwText_445_3:
	.string "There's a great big hole at the back\nof this town.\pA long time ago, a huge meteor fell from\nthe sky and made the big hole.\pA very scary monster was hiding\ninside the meteor!\pPeople say the monster appeared in the\nvillage at night, bringing a cold wind,\land it stole away people and Pokémon...\pSo the villagers built big walls to keep\nthe monster out and made a rule that\lno one could go out after dark.$"
gBwText_445_4:
	.string "...Of course, nowadays nobody believes\nin such things.\pBut you know...\pEven now, the people of this town\nstay inside after dark.\lIsn't that strange?\pI guess old stories and old traditions\nhave some influence on our current life.$"
gBwText_445_5:
	.string "Oh, well, that's too bad. Come talk to me\nif you're ever in the mood for a story!$"
gBwText_445_6:
	.string "At night, a scary monster comes out of\nthe big hole, so you have to go home\land be good!$"
gBwText_445_7:
	.string "Along the road ahead, there is a\ncoastline that fishing fans love.\pWhirrrrr...plunk!\pThat's the sound my fishing rod makes.\nI like to hear it every day!$"
gBwText_445_8:
	.string "My grandma loves to tell old stories.\pShe makes me listen to her long stories\nall the time!$"
gBwText_445_9:
	.string "There are a lot of people in the world,\nand there are just as many different\lcharacteristics and ideas.$"
gBwText_445_10:
	.string "I don't have anything to do ever since\nI took a post here.\pSince nobody goes outside at night,\nit's very peaceful.$"
gBwText_445_11:
	.string "Gahoo! Gahoo!$"
gBwText_445_12:
	.string "My Pokémon always goes out\nfor fun without me.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_445
