gBwText_446_0:
	.string "Oh, Shaymin!\pWhen it comes to Shaymin,\nGracidea flowers are important!\pI have a lot of Gracidea flowers,\nso let me share one with you.$"
gBwText_446_1:
	.string "Since early times in Sinnoh, people\nmade a bouquet of Gracidea flowers\lto give someone to show their\lfeelings of appreciation.\pIsn't that interesting?\pBy giving a Gracidea bouquet,\nyou don't have to say a word, and\lsomeone will know how grateful you are.\pQuite a delightful custom!$"
gBwText_446_2:
	.string "Do you know about Gracidea flowers?\pSince early times in Sinnoh, people\nmade a bouquet of Gracidea flowers\lto give someone to show their\lfeelings of appreciation.$"
gBwText_446_3:
	.string "Every Gym Badge tells the story\nof a hard-won victory against\la worthy opponent.\pI can look at a Gym Badge and\ntell you that story.\pCan I see one of your Gym Badges?$"
gBwText_446_4:
	.string "OK. You don't have to show me anything.\nI'm sure your memories are all you need!$"
gBwText_446_5:
	.string "Which Badge are you going to show me?$"
gBwText_446_6:
	.string "You got the Trio Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_7:
	.string "You got the Basic Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_8:
	.string "You got the Insect Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_9:
	.string "You got the Bolt Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_10:
	.string "You got the Quake Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_11:
	.string "You got the Jet Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_12:
	.string "You got the Freeze Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_13:
	.string "You got the Legend Badge with...$"
gBwText_446_14:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_446_15:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.$"
gBwText_446_16:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2}, and\n{STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_446_17:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2},\n{STR_VAR_3}, and {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_446_18:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2},\n{STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_3}, and\l{STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_446_19:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, {STR_VAR_2},\n{STR_VAR_3}, {STR_VAR_3},\l{STR_VAR_3}, and {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_446_20:
	.string "Want to show me another Gym Badge?$"
gBwText_446_21:
	.string "Trio Badge$"
gBwText_446_22:
	.string "Basic Badge$"
gBwText_446_23:
	.string "Insect Badge$"
gBwText_446_24:
	.string "Bolt Badge$"
gBwText_446_25:
	.string "Quake Badge$"
gBwText_446_26:
	.string "Jet Badge$"
gBwText_446_27:
	.string "Freeze Badge$"
gBwText_446_28:
	.string "Legend Badge$"
gBwText_446_29:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_446_30:
	.string "I don't have anything to do ever since\nI took a post here.\pSince nobody goes outside at night,\nit's very peaceful.$"
