gBwText_447_19:
	.string "My Pokémon is always running off\nto go play on its own.\pBut it always comes back before dark,\nso I guess it's OK.$"
gBwText_447_20:
	.string "Gahoohoo...$"
gBwText_447_21:
	.string "This is Lacunosa Town. Here, everyone\nlives according to the rules, from the\lmoment they awaken to the time they\lgo to sleep.$"
gBwText_447_22:
	.string "At night, a scary monster comes out of\nthe big hole, so you have to go home\land be good!$"
