gBwText_448_0:
	.string "Zzz... Zzz...\p...W-what?\nWhat do you want, now?\pDid you pick now to listen to\nmy stories?$"
gBwText_448_1:
	.string "Mmm... OK, I'll tell you...\pBehind our Lacunosa Town,\nthere's a big hole in the ground.\pThat hole, way in the past...\pAaaahhh, I'm so tired...\pThat hole, there was a...a big...\ncrashed down...inside was...\pbig, scary...really scary...\pZzz... Zzz... Zzz...$"
gBwText_448_2:
	.string "Aaaahhh... Oh, I should...\nOK, I'll sleep then...\pGoodni... Zzz...\nZzz... Zzz...$"
gBwText_448_3:
	.string "My grandma loves old stories!\pI'm always having to listen\nto her really long stories.\pBut sometimes if it's night, she'll fall\nasleep right in the middle of a story.\pIt's OK, though. She's not only\nhealthy, she's a free-spirited grandma,\ltoo!$"
