gBwText_450_27:
	.string "There are a lot of people in the world,\nand there are just as many different\lcharacteristics and ideas.\pI think I'd be really happy if I could\nmeet a lot of people and see the\ldifferences for myself!$"
gBwText_450_28:
	.string "My mama says there's a scary monster\nwho comes out of the big hole at night,\lso we have to stay home and be good!\pBut that monster must be a Pokémon.\nRight? So I'm not scared at all!$"
gBwText_450_29:
	.string "Along the road ahead, there is a\ncoastline that fishing fans love.\pI'm busy, so I won't fish at night, but\nthere may be big fish!$"
gBwText_450_30:
	.string "My grandma loves to tell old stories,\nand she makes me listen to her long\lstories all the time.\pSometimes I just want to go out on my\nown and paint the town red!$"
gBwText_450_31:
	.string "Ever since I took a post here, I don't\nreally have anything to do.\pI'm so bored! I'm afraid all my policing\nmuscles will shrivel up because I don't\luse them anymore.$"
gBwText_450_32:
	.string "My Pokémon always goes out\nto have fun without me.\pI wonder where it gets that attitude?$"
gBwText_450_33:
	.string "Gahoon! Gahoon!$"
gBwText_450_34:
	.string "My work keeps me very busy, and I only\ngo home once a week or so.\pI'm sorry to leave my wife lonely, but\nthat's the life of a powerful\lexecutive.\pOh, this is a souvenir from a business\ntrip, but she does not seem to need it,\lso I will give it to you.$"
gBwText_450_35:
	.string "I leave on a business trip\nagain tomorrow.\pI think of myself as a role model\nfor businesspeople.$"
