gBwText_451_0:
	.string "You have an extremely bored look\non your face!\pOK! I'll let you have a very exciting\nPokémon battle with me!$"
gBwText_451_1:
	.string "Oh, you are not bored...$"
gBwText_451_2:
	.string "Well, if you insist, I'll let you have\nanother very exciting battle\lwith me tomorrow!$"
gBwText_451_3:
	.string "I like you!\pI will let you see a very special thing,\nso follow me!$"
gBwText_451_4:
	.string "The sea... ? It's a source of life... ?\nThe sea... ? It's a lot of water... ?\pSo, teach this move to your Pokémon,\nand you can dive into the sea!$"
gBwText_451_5:
	.string "Inside this Hidden Machine is Dive!\pThe darkest parts of the sea are called\ndiving points, and if you use Dive there,\lyou can dive all the way to the bottom\lof the sea!$"
gBwText_451_6:
	.string "The sea!!$"
gBwText_451_7:
	.string "Ah, Cynthia...\nWhy are you so Cynthia...?$"
gBwText_451_8:
	.string "Even Maids sometimes have to roost.\pOh, I was confused! A Pokémon restores\nits HP when it uses the move Roost!\pBut for people, it's called resting.$"
gBwText_451_9:
	.string "The sunlight is strong...\pDepending on the Pokémon, that can be\neither an advantage or a disadvantage.\pStrong sunlight makes Fire-type moves\nstronger and Water-type moves weaker.$"
gBwText_451_10:
	.string "Yaaaay! Yaaay!\nUndella Town!!$"
gBwText_451_11:
	.string "Undella Town\nA Town of Rippling Waves$"
gBwText_451_12:
	.string "This big villa belongs to the Riches!$"
