gBwText_452_0:
	.string "Hello, boy!\pDo you have a villa in Undella?\nYou are rich!\pAs a token of our new acquaintance,\nplease accept this!$"
gBwText_452_1:
	.string "Hello, girl!\pDo you have a villa in Undella?\nYou are rich!\pAs a token of our new acquaintance,\nplease accept this!$"
gBwText_452_2:
	.string "Isn't the Prism Scale beautiful?\nIt may be good to let a Pokémon hold it.$"
