gBwTextCount_452:
	.4byte 8
gBwText_453_0:
	.string "Isn't it great? Isn't it spacious?\pThis is my dad's villa, and\nI can use it freely!$"
gBwText_453_1:
	.string "But when I came here, surprisingly\nthere was nothing to do, so now I'm\lbored.\pAs you may know, my dad is totally\nobsessed with items at the ruins...$"
gBwText_453_2:
	.string "Hey, you're bored, aren't you?\pCome here tomorrow, too!\nI don't mind having a battle with you!$"
gBwText_453_3:
	.string "Hey, you're bored, aren't you?\pCome here tomorrow, too!\nI don't mind having a battle with you!$"
gBwText_453_4:
	.string "Oh, you came!\pYou have an extremely bored look\non your face.\pI don't mind having a battle with you!$"
gBwText_453_5:
	.string "$"
gBwText_453_6:
	.string "Ah... You are not bored...$"
gBwText_453_7:
	.string "Argh!\nSo frustrating! Whywhywhy?$"
gBwText_453_8:
	.string "You're awesome!\nI don't mind giving you a little credit!$"
gBwText_453_9:
	.string "Oh, you seem to be having fun.$"
gBwText_453_10:
	.string "How are you, Trainer?\pI've been so dreadfully bored in my\nfather's villa! May I join you?$"
gBwText_453_11:
	.string "How are you, Trainer?\nI won't lose today.$"
gBwText_453_12:
	.string "In my father's villa, I have too much\ntime on my hands.\pPlease come for a visit tomorrow, too.\nI will have a battle with you.$"
gBwText_453_13:
	.string "In my father's villa, I have too much\ntime on my hands.\pPlease come for a visit tomorrow, too.\nI will have a battle with you.$"
gBwText_453_14:
	.string "You are as strong as usual.\nBut I wonder what will happen next time.$"
gBwText_453_15:
	.string "How are you?\nI am pleased you came here today, too.\pMay I trouble you for another battle?\nLet me see...\pFirst, please have a battle\nwith my little brother!$"
gBwText_453_16:
	.string "None of the Riches is a match for you...\pI admire your strength!$"
gBwText_453_17:
	.string "Oh, it's quite lively for some reason.$"
gBwText_453_18:
	.string "I truly appreciate you for having\nbattles with my grandchildren.\pAnd now, I'd like to see in what ways\nyour skills exceed theirs.$"
gBwText_453_19:
	.string "Hoho! Do you have confidence\nin winning against me?$"
gBwText_453_20:
	.string "Undella Town is a relaxing and\ncomfortable place.\pBut my grandchildren seem\nsomewhat bored.\pPlease come visit us tomorrow, too.\nMy grandchildren will be happy\lto see you again.$"
gBwText_453_21:
	.string "Undella Town is a relaxing and\ncomfortable place.\pBut my grandchildren seem\nsomewhat bored.\pPlease come visit us tomorrow, too.\nMy grandchildren will be happy\lto see you again.$"
gBwText_453_22:
	.string "Ho, ho. You are genuinely strong!\nYou look dependable!$"
gBwText_453_23:
	.string "Welcome back, young Trainer.\pMy grandchildren are itching to have\nmore battles with you.$"
gBwText_453_24:
	.string "Children of today are very strong in\nPokémon battles.\pHoho! I wonder if my grandchildren\ncan become Trainers like you?$"
gBwText_453_25:
	.string "Hoho!\nPokémon battles bring back memories.$"
gBwText_453_26:
	.string "I am so excited, my blood is boiling!\nMay I please trouble you for a battle?$"
gBwText_453_27:
	.string "I am so excited, my blood is boiling!\nPlease have a battle with me today, too.$"
gBwText_453_28:
	.string "Hoho! No matter how old I get,\nPokémon battles are fun!\pThis kind of excitement\nis not bad from time to time!\pPlease come back anytime.\nNext time, I will win!$"
gBwText_453_29:
	.string "Hoho! No matter how old I get,\nPokémon battles are fun!\pThis kind of excitement\nis not bad from time to time!$"
gBwText_453_30:
	.string "Hoho! Welcome!\nYour visit is very exciting!$"
gBwText_453_31:
	.string "Hoho! Youth!\nHowever, next time won't be like this.$"
gBwText_453_32:
	.string "Hoho!\nPokémon battles with the entire family!\pWe all had a good time!$"
gBwText_453_33:
	.string "What's happening?\nIt's pretty lively.$"
gBwText_453_34:
	.string "Trainer, are you strong?\nThen, try to defeat me!$"
gBwText_453_35:
	.string "Today, for sure, I am going to win!\nNow, try to defeat me!$"
gBwText_453_36:
	.string "I may not look like it, but I am very\nfamiliar with Pokémon.\pI would like to have a battle with you\nsomeday again.$"
gBwText_453_37:
	.string "I may not look like it, but I am very\nfamiliar with Pokémon.\pPlease have a battle with me again.$"
gBwText_453_38:
	.string "Welcome.\pToday for sure I'm going to show you\nthe real strength of the Riches!$"
gBwText_453_39:
	.string "I didn't expect you to be this strong...$"
gBwText_453_40:
	.string "It's a complete defeat...\pThe Riches sincerely wish every\nsuccess to you in the future.$"
gBwText_453_41:
	.string "You! Do you still call yourself\none of the Riches?$"
gBwText_453_42:
	.string "I am Miles, the next head of the Riches!\nI will protect the honor of our family!$"
gBwText_453_43:
	.string "No matter how often you try, \nyou cannot defeat me!\pI will protect the honor\nof The Riches!$"
gBwText_453_44:
	.string "You may come back again tomorrow.\pHowever, I have no intention of losing\nin the name of the Riches.$"
gBwText_453_45:
	.string "You came!\pIf you can defeat my family,\nI will let you have a battle with me.$"
gBwText_453_46:
	.string "Sigh.\pI guess...it's still too early to\nidentify myself as the head of the\lfamily.$"
gBwText_453_47:
	.string "Sigh.\pI guess...it's still too early to\nidentify myself as the head of the\lfamily.\pYou should be proud of yourself\nfor defeating the distinguished\lTrainer family, the Riches!$"
	.align 2
