gBwText_454_0:
	.string "Fun in summer...\nBeautiful girls playing in the water...\pHey! I'm just thinking out loud.\nPlease don't listen to me!$"
gBwText_454_1:
	.string "The best luxury is to enjoy\njust doing nothing.$"
gBwText_454_2:
	.string "Phew...\pI've been relaxing in Undella Town too\nlong, and I've gotten a little chubby.\pIf {STR_VAR_1} is by my side, I can get\nsome exercise by training it, and\lthat'll help me lose weight.\pWould you trade my {STR_VAR_2}\nwith {STR_VAR_1}?$"
gBwText_454_3:
	.string "Phew! All right, let's trade!$"
gBwText_454_4:
	.string "Phew... Thanks.\pPlease take good care of {STR_VAR_2}.\nIt spent a summer with me.\pI will work hard to train your\n{STR_VAR_1} and get some exercise!$"
gBwText_454_5:
	.string "Phew... What I want is {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_454_6:
	.string "Phew... That's disappointing.$"
gBwText_454_7:
	.string "Hello, there!\nYou kindly traded me that Pokémon, and\lnow you can hardly recognize me, eh?\pBecause {STR_VAR_1} is by my side,\nI've trimmed down a little!$"
	.align 2
