gBwText_455_0:
	.string "We come here for vacation from\nfaraway Hoenn during the summer!$"
gBwText_455_1:
	.string "Hoenn is a nice place.\nFor example...\pDo you know a Trainer named Steven?\pAlthough he is reeeally strong,\nI hear he collects only stones!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_455
