gBwTextCount_455:
	.4byte 2
gBwText_456_0:
	.string "???: What's this?$"
gBwText_456_1:
	.string "What an uncanny resemblance...\pIt's surprising to meet another Trainer\nwho has intense eyes like that\lPokémon Trainer.\pWhat's your name?\p...\pOK. I'll remember that!\n{STR_VAR_1}, nice to meet you.\pI'm Cynthia.\nI'm a Pokémon Trainer, too, like you.\pI have an insatiable curiosity for\nresearching Pokémon myths.$"
gBwText_456_2:
	.string "I'm sure you know about Undella Town's\nAbyssal Ruins, right?\pI'm staying here at my friend's villa\nso I can investigate them.$"
gBwText_456_3:
	.string "In order to get to know each other\nbetter as Pokémon Trainers, I would like\lour Pokémon to have a match.\pWould you care to be my opponent?$"
gBwText_456_4:
	.string "Before I send out my Pokémon,\nmy heart always begins to race...\pInteresting...\nMy Pokémon in their Poké Balls are\lradiating a happy feeling.\pAre you the reason?\nWhat are you?$"
gBwText_456_5:
	.string "Ha ha. You prefer to take things slowly\nand rationally, am I right?\pWhen you're ready, come and talk to me.\nI'll be happy to see you.$"
gBwText_456_6:
	.string "Cynthia: Oh.\nYou've had a chance to get ready?\pI do want our Pokémon to have a match...\nAre you prepared to be my opponent?$"
gBwText_456_7:
	.string "Cynthia: That was beyond my\nexpectation! What an exceptional\lbattle!\pYou certainly bear a resemblance\nto that Trainer who faced Giratina...\pOh, pardon me.\nI was just thinking out loud.\pI love being here in spring and summer.\pI can't stay all year, because there's\nso much to investigate in Sinnoh, as\lwell.\pYou're a great Trainer, and it would\nmake me happy to see you again\lsometime.$"
gBwText_456_8:
	.string "Cynthia: I love to come here in\nspring and summer.\pBut there are a lot of things to\ninvestigate in Sinnoh, as well.\pI'd be delighted to see you again.\nYou're an awesome Pokémon Trainer!$"
gBwText_456_9:
	.string "Cynthia: How terrific to see you again!\pI've got to tell you...\nMy Pokémon are excited to battle yours.\pWould you care to be my opponent?$"
gBwText_456_10:
	.string "Cynthia: This will be such fun!\nNo holds barred!$"
gBwText_456_11:
	.string "Cynthia: Oh, what a pity.\pSummers in Undella Town make me feel\nlike I'm on holiday. I forget about\lbattling!\pBut in spring, I feel like getting\nworked up with a good battle.$"
gBwText_456_12:
	.string "Cynthia: I can tell that my Pokémon are\nexcited about battling your Pokémon...\pWould you care to be my opponent?$"
gBwText_456_13:
	.string "Cynthia: For some reason, this reminds\nme of a time when I told a Trainer like\lyou to go see many, many more places\land to meet many more Pokémon.\pFor me, it has really been worthwhile to\ncome all the way to far Unova.\pWhy? Because...\nI met you, and my world got wider!$"
gBwText_456_14:
	.string "Cynthia: To live their lives to the\nfullest, people and Pokémon need\lthe chance to throw themselves into\lbattle against the fiercest opposition.\pThat's why I want to battle you.\nHow about it?$"
gBwText_456_15:
	.string "Cynthia: As our Pokémon meet in battle,\nI'll learn more about you\land how you've taken care of them.$"
gBwText_456_16:
	.string "Cynthia: I'm a little disappointed.\pI know you can battle on bigger\nstages than you've done so far!\pIt's so plain to me that your light can\nshine brighter than this...$"
gBwText_456_17:
	.string "Cynthia: Are you prepared?\pLet's battle at full strength and see\nhow bright our lights can shine!$"
gBwText_456_18:
	.string "Cynthia: When you meet Trainers, battle\nthem to learn about the kind of people\lthey are. Observe the Pokémon they\lchoose, which moves they taught them,\land which items the Pokémon hold.\pYou don't need words at such times...\pIf you want to know more about me...\nCome to Sinnoh!$"
gBwText_456_19:
	.string "Caitlin: Having everything go your way\nis the road to disillusionment.\pKnowing the difference between what's\nimpossible and what's possible...\pI used to know someone who \ntalked about that a lot.$"
gBwText_456_20:
	.string "Caitlin: No matter how hard I try,\nI cannot defeat Cynthia.\pBefore, I would have exploded with rage.\pNow, I have the tranquility to reflect\non my performance to see how I can\limprove.$"
gBwText_456_21:
	.string "Caitlin: Tell me something.\nAre you familiar with Battle Castles?\pYou can find them in Johto and Sinnoh,\nso challenge them to improve yourself.$"
gBwText_456_22:
	.string "Caitlin: This is my villa.\pI have villas all over the world,\nand I allow Cynthia to use them.\pYou are welcome to come and play\nwhenever you wish.$"
gBwText_456_23:
	.string "Caitlin: Having no psychic powers at all\nis better than having psychic powers\lyou can't control.$"
gBwText_456_24:
	.string "Shauntal: When I'm writing novels,\nif I don't have enough input,\lmy output suffers.\pIt's the same thing for Trainers.\pTo grow stronger, Trainers need to have\ncountless battles and learn many\lthings.\pThen, they must put what they've\nlearned to the test in real battles.$"
gBwText_456_25:
	.string "Shauntal: Rainbow Wing...\nSilver Wing...\lThey stir the imagination!$"
gBwText_456_26:
	.string "Shauntal: Distortion World...\nand the single Pokémon found there...\lWhat an amazing scene!$"
gBwText_456_27:
	.string "Shauntal: No matter how much research\nI do, I still have no clue.\pHow old do you think Cynthia is?\nAny idea?$"
gBwText_456_28:
	.string "Shauntal: I chose my scarf with a\ncertain Pokémon in mind.\pDo you get it?\nUsing your imagination is important!$"
gBwText_456_29:
	.string "Cynthia: What is necessary for becoming\nstronger than you are now?\pMy answer is simply loving Pokémon\nwith all your heart.\pThat's how I am, so that's all I can\nsay.$"
gBwText_456_30:
	.string "Cynthia: Once every few years, the\nChampions of each region gather and\lcompete to see who is the strongest!\pAn interesting idea, don't you agree?$"
gBwText_456_31:
	.string "Cynthia: I'd love to live here...\pBut if I did, there would be a mountain\nof research materials piled up...\pAm I right? Cynthia, enough for now!\nNext time, clean up.$"
gBwText_456_32:
	.string "Cynthia: Here's my problem.\pI have a white swimsuit and\na black swimsuit...\lWhich one would look better on me?$"
gBwText_456_33:
	.string "Cynthia: Hmm. This is difficult.\pI was greedy and brought\na lot of swimsuits, but now I can't pick\lwhich one to wear.$"
gBwText_456_34:
	.string "Iris: Oh, hey!\nDid you see Cynthia's Garchomp?\pIt's too cute!$"
gBwText_456_35:
	.string "Iris: Soon, Drayden and I are going\nto ride the cruise ship!\pCastelia City is wall-to-wall people,\nbut if I'm with him, I'll be OK!$"
gBwText_456_36:
	.string "Iris: Sometimes I think about the\nvillage where I was born, but I'm\ltotally OK!\pBecause I met lots of Pokémon--\nand all of you!$"
gBwText_456_37:
	.string "Iris: Look! Look! It's the ocean!$"
gBwText_456_38:
	.string "Iris: The ocean is so pretty. I love it!\nSo I stayed underwater a long time.\lI made everyone worry!$"
gBwText_456_39:
	.string "Skyla: I get along well with Elesa, but\nPokémon battles are a different story!\pIf you're not super prepared,\nyour battles with Electric types\lwill leave you in shock!$"
gBwText_456_40:
	.string "Skyla: Seeing the ground again after\nsafely passing through a rain cloud\lin a violent rainstorm...\pSomeday, I'd like to share\nthat moment with you.$"
gBwText_456_41:
	.string "Skyla: I was just thinking about that.\pWhen it comes to swimsuits...\pYou're either about self-composure\nor you're about self-exposure!$"
gBwText_456_42:
	.string "Skyla: Even distant Sinnoh is just a\nhop, skip, and a jump if I use my cargo\lplane.\pBut... I also love to travel the sky\nwith a Pokémon when it's using Fly!$"
gBwText_456_43:
	.string "Skyla: Mmm...\nSwimming in the ocean sure feels great!$"
gBwText_456_44:
	.string "Elesa: I must say it's difficult for\npeople to draw out a Pokémon's charm if\lthey don't have any themselves.$"
gBwText_456_45:
	.string "Elesa: You know Nimbasa City?\pYou know it runs on energy generated\nby Electric-type Pokémon?\p...Just kidding!$"
gBwText_456_46:
	.string "Elesa: Getting wrapped up in worries\nis bad for your body and spirit.\pThat's when you must short out your\nlogic circuits and reboot your heart.$"
gBwText_456_47:
	.string "Elesa: Without a word...\nWithout even a whisper...\pMy Pokémon connect me to other\nTrainers, transmitting the current of\lmy feelings.$"
gBwText_456_48:
	.string "Elesa: Put bluntly, \nswimsuits are nothing but cloth, right?$"
gBwText_456_49:
	.string "Lenora: Aren't Fossils amazing?\pAlthough they are not alive and\ncannot speak, they tell us so much\labout the era in which they lived.\pHee, hee.\nIt was Professor Juniper who said that.$"
gBwText_456_50:
	.string "Lenora: TMs can be used as many times\nas you wish, to be sure.\pIf you teach Retaliate to many\ndifferent Pokémon, eventually you\lshould find the perfect Pokémon for it!$"
gBwText_456_51:
	.string "Lenora: When I was a little girl,\nmy dad, who was a miner, would\lalways bring back bones for me.\pMy young heart was captured by bones!\nBefore I knew it, I was a researcher.$"
gBwText_456_52:
	.string "Lenora: Recently, a girl named Bianca\ncame to ask me about Pokémon.\pA Trainer's curiosity is insatiable\nat any stage.$"
gBwText_456_53:
	.string "Lenora: Cynthia is a famous\narcheologist.\pIn the course of our research, we have\nshared many academic conversations.$"
	.align 2
