gBwText_457_0:
	.string "A beautiful tune is spreading\nthroughout the town...$"
gBwText_457_1:
	.string "Anville Town\nRolling Out the Steel Rails$"
gBwText_457_2:
	.string "It's a subway map of the Unova region.$"
gBwText_457_3:
	.string "Oh, are you also curious about\nthat train?$"
gBwText_457_4:
	.string "Unfortunately, no train has\ncome here today.$"
gBwText_457_5:
	.string "See the train there?$"
gBwText_457_6:
	.string "All righty!\nLet me explain!$"
gBwText_457_7:
	.string "All righty!\nAll aboard!$"
gBwText_457_8:
	.string "Oh, that's a shame.$"
gBwText_457_9:
	.string "Hahaha!\nYou're right.$"
gBwText_457_10:
	.string "Today's train car is a Hyperspeed\nTrain! It runs faster than a rocket! It\lruns quieter than an air conditioner!$"
gBwText_457_11:
	.string "This is a Single Train! It's the oldest\ntrain in the Battle Subway.$"
gBwText_457_12:
	.string "This Super Single Train is\na new mass-produced car!$"
gBwText_457_13:
	.string "This car is a Double Train!\nThis is a mass-produced car\lfrom a decade ago!$"
gBwText_457_14:
	.string "This Super Double Train is\na new mass-produced car!$"
gBwText_457_15:
	.string "This car is a Multi Train!\nFew cars of this model were produced.$"
gBwText_457_16:
	.string "This train car is a Super Multi Train!\nThis is the latest train car!$"
gBwText_457_17:
	.string "This train car is a Wi-Fi Train!\nIt is the fastest long-distance\lhigh-speed train in the Battle Subway!$"
gBwText_457_18:
	.string "As you know, this is a local train to\nAnville Town! Isn't it just so cute?$"
gBwText_457_19:
	.string "This train car is the kind that ran\na long time ago.$"
gBwText_457_20:
	.string "This train car is a new train\nto run in the future!$"
gBwText_457_21:
	.string "I can see!\nI can see it!\pThat lovely smooth curve! Ah, I wish\nI could reach out and touch it!$"
gBwText_457_22:
	.string "It's for a loop line to go around the\nUnova region!$"
gBwText_457_23:
	.string "It's an environmentally friendly train,\nbecause they revised all the parts to\ldrastically reduce power consumption!$"
gBwText_457_24:
	.string "Compared to a Single Train,\nthe number of parts was reduced\lso it could be built for a lower cost.$"
gBwText_457_25:
	.string "Such a streamlined and refined design!\nBeauty and utility working together!\pThat kind of beautility is unique to\nmass-produced train cars!$"
gBwText_457_26:
	.string "This is a test car to develop future\nmass-produced cars that will replace\lthe old Double Trains.$"
gBwText_457_27:
	.string "Improved acceleration and\ndeceleration! Automated train-car\lcontrols! It's full of cutting-edge\ltechnologies.$"
gBwText_457_28:
	.string "This is called a pendulum car. Its body\ntilts while going around curves, so it\lcan run without slowing down!$"
gBwText_457_29:
	.string "This one is a little slow and heavy.\nWhen it runs, the whole train sways.$"
gBwText_457_30:
	.string "Compared to contemporary train cars, it\nhas more parts, so I heard it was\ldifficult to build.$"
gBwText_457_31:
	.string "Wooo! Cool! Super cool!\nThe latest motor breathes fire!$"
gBwText_457_32:
	.string "I can see it so clearly! But I cannot\ntouch the Hyperspeed Train!\pIt really is hyper technology!\pAs you can see, we engineers are\nalways seriously dreaming that someday\lthe dream will become a reality!$"
gBwText_457_33:
	.string "Do you know Tubeline Bridge?\pThe train that runs on it is\nthis Single Train.$"
gBwText_457_34:
	.string "Newer trains have to be built\nin a way that's both functional\land environmentally friendly.\pCompared to the past, they've\nimproved significantly.$"
gBwText_457_35:
	.string "The number of parts influences the\nbudget and construction time.\pThe streamlined and beautiful design of\nthe Double Train is still valued today.$"
gBwText_457_36:
	.string "It uses the same train car\nas a Super Single Train.\pThe only difference is the appearance.\pIt is a superb train car that will go\ndown in the history of the Battle\lSubway!$"
gBwText_457_37:
	.string "The technology born during the\ncreation of this train car made the\lSuper Single Train and Super Double\lTrain possible!$"
gBwText_457_38:
	.string "Also, a regeneration brake system,\na car-body tilting system,\la whatchamacallit system,\la thingamabob system...\pI don't remember all the details,\nbut it's just a big festival of all\lthe latest technology!$"
gBwText_457_39:
	.string "Faster! Farther! Our engineers' spirits\nare infused in it!$"
gBwText_457_40:
	.string "The train car is the same model as a\nSingle Train.\pBecause it is an old train car, I hear\nthe maintenance is hard, but it's the\lone I always ride, because I loved it as\la kid!$"
gBwText_457_41:
	.string "The old train cars built with lots of\nsmall parts have their own unique\lbeauty and attract a lot of fans.\pThose cars no longer run in the\nBattle Subway, but I hear they're still\lused in a faraway region.\pAh... I'd love to be on that train!$"
gBwText_457_42:
	.string "Uh-oh, if it really breathed fire, that\nwould be bad!\pBut it is full of the latest\ntechnologies! It's undergoing a lot of\ltesting.\pIt's called a gauge-convertible train.\pIt's a sweet car that can adjust its\nwheels to run on any rail!$"
gBwText_457_43:
	.string "A train to Nimbasa City is leaving\nthe station shortly.\pWould you like to board?$"
gBwText_457_44:
	.string "Then, please get on the train and wait.$"
gBwText_457_45:
	.string "This is a quiet town!\nRelax and stay for a while.$"
gBwText_457_46:
	.string "Gave the {STR_VAR_1} in exchange for\nthe {STR_VAR_3}!$"
gBwText_457_47:
	.string "Ah... I'm in trouble.\pI was so engrossed in my trip that I ran\nout of {STR_VAR_1}.\pLet me see... Will you trade your\n{STR_VAR_2} {STR_VAR_1} for my\l{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_48:
	.string "Will you trade your {STR_VAR_2}\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_3}\l{STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_49:
	.string "Great, let's trade!$"
gBwText_457_50:
	.string "Oh, that's a shame.$"
gBwText_457_51:
	.string "Hehe! It was a delightful trade,\nwasn't it?$"
gBwText_457_52:
	.string "...Uh-oh. You don't have\nenough {STR_VAR_1}s.$"
gBwText_457_53:
	.string "...Uh-oh. You don't have enough room for\nthe {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_457_54:
	.string "I am a {STR_VAR_1} collector!\pYou, over there! Let's have a\nbusinesslike exchange.\pWill you trade your {STR_VAR_2}\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_3}\l{STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_55:
	.string "Will you trade your {STR_VAR_2}\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_3}\l{STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_56:
	.string "Excellent. Let's do business!$"
gBwText_457_57:
	.string "Why? Do you think this is a bad deal?$"
gBwText_457_58:
	.string "Hah! It was a mutually beneficial trade!\nThis is a win-win relationship, right?$"
gBwText_457_59:
	.string "Hah! You don't have\nany {STR_VAR_1}s.$"
gBwText_457_60:
	.string "Hah! You don't have enough room for\nthe {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_457_61:
	.string "With that face, I bet you have\nsomething I want.\pWill you trade your {STR_VAR_2}\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_3}\l{STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_62:
	.string "Will you trade your {STR_VAR_2}\n{STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_3}\l{STR_VAR_3}?$"
gBwText_457_63:
	.string "Yay!\nThen, let's trade!$"
gBwText_457_64:
	.string "Oh, it seems I was mistaken...$"
gBwText_457_65:
	.string "Ooh-la-la! This luster!\nI really like {STR_VAR_1}s.\pAn experienced person like me can tell\nthe difference of the luster of each\lone!$"
gBwText_457_66:
	.string "Ooh-la-la!\nYou don't have enough {STR_VAR_1}s.$"
gBwText_457_67:
	.string "Ooh-la-la! You don't have room for\nthe {STR_VAR_3}.$"
gBwText_457_68:
	.string "It's so lively on weekends!\nOh, me? I came here to watch the trains.$"
gBwText_457_69:
	.string "You can trade lots of items.\nIt was surprisingly fun when I tried!$"
gBwText_457_70:
	.string "What delicious air!$"
gBwText_457_71:
	.string "I wanted to get a picture from\nthis angle!$"
gBwText_457_72:
	.string "Why do people love trains?\pMaybe it's the design, the way they can\nrun so fast and still be so comfortable.\pAll the essential parts work together...\nIt's simple but so beautiful!$"
gBwText_457_73:
	.string "Trains are so cooooool!\pMy mom brought me, but now she's\ntaking pictures somewhere.$"
gBwText_457_74:
	.string "On weekends, a lot of people come here\nto watch the trains.$"
gBwText_457_75:
	.string "They are full of people today, too.\nDo you also trade items?$"
gBwText_457_76:
	.string "This is a rare weekend when there\naren't any trains.$"
gBwText_457_77:
	.string "A lot of train cars have a rest here.$"
gBwText_457_78:
	.string "If there are a lot of people,\nI feel that the trains are happy!$"
gBwText_457_79:
	.string "Today all the train cars are resting!$"
gBwText_457_80:
	.string "The girl on the bridge...\pShe's playing a lullaby for all the\nsleeping trains of this town.$"
	.align 2
