gBwText_458_0:
	.string "Anville Town is famous for its\nturntable. You saw it from the bridge,\lright?$"
gBwText_458_1:
	.string "Lots of people ride on trains, right?\pSo the people who drive the trains\nand the people who maintain them\lhave a big responsibility!$"
	.align 2
