gBwText_459_0:
	.string "If you come out on the weekends to\nwatch the trains, there will be a lot of\lpeople.$"
gBwText_459_1:
	.string "On the weekends, many {STR_VAR_1}\ncollectors gather here.\pIt must be easier for them to collect\ntheir items because many people who are\ltrading different items come here.$"
	.align 2
