gBwText_460_0:
	.string "Oh ho! With a face like that,\nI'll bet you're a Pokémon Trainer!\pI work as a Depot Agent on the\nBattle Subway!\pHave you tried challenging the\nBattle Subway yet?\pIt's a hot spot for those who want\nsome serious battling action!\pBut some people get too wrapped up\nin their battles, and there's no end\lto the lost-and-found items.\pThat's right. Nobody ever came to\npick this up, so I'll give it to you!$"
gBwText_460_1:
	.string "I have a lost-and-found item\nthat no one has claimed.\pIf you don't mind, could you take it\noff my hands?$"
gBwText_460_2:
	.string "Oh! I've been waiting for you!\pRecently, we've gotten more\npassengers, so there's more\llost-and-found items!\pNo one has claimed this, so if you don't\nmind, could you take it off my hands?$"
gBwText_460_3:
	.string "No worries. No worries.\nJust take it!\pIt's better for a Trainer to use it than\nfor me to hold on to it.\pI'm sure the item is happier, too!$"
gBwText_460_4:
	.string "If I have another lost-and-found\nitem, come get it, OK?\pAlso, if you're interested, take on the\nBattle Subway in Nimbasa City!$"
gBwText_460_5:
	.string "Oh, my. There's no more room for\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\pYou'll need to remove some from your\nBag before you can accept any more!$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_460
