gBwText_461_0:
	.string "I will judge your battles in a\nBattle Test!\pWhat would you like to do?$"
gBwText_461_1:
	.string "The master returns! Would you like to\nchallenge a Battle Test?$"
gBwText_461_2:
	.string "I am sorry...\pIt may be too early for you to challenge\na Battle Test.\pPlease come back after you finish\nyour journey and build your strength.$"
gBwText_461_3:
	.string "See you again.$"
gBwText_461_4:
	.string "Which challenge would you like,\nSingle or Double?$"
gBwText_461_5:
	.string "Then, let's begin.\pPlease bear in mind that once you start\nthe challenge, you will face five\lbattles without a break.\pNow, please choose the Pokémon you\nwould like to battle with.$"
gBwText_461_6:
	.string "Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.$"
gBwText_461_7:
	.string "Now, the Battle Test begins!\nPlease go inside!$"
gBwText_461_8:
	.string "All right.\pI will tell you the result of your\nBattle Test.\pThe test result is...$"
gBwText_461_9:
	.string "Master Rank! Wonderful!\nPlease let me be your apprentice.$"
gBwText_461_10:
	.string "The result is Elite Rank!\nThat's something you can brag about!$"
gBwText_461_11:
	.string "The result is Hyper Rank!\nYou must be doing a lot of practice.$"
gBwText_461_12:
	.string "The result is Super Rank.\nYou are quite strong.$"
gBwText_461_13:
	.string "The result is Normal Rank.\nYour strength is average.$"
gBwText_461_14:
	.string "The result is Novice Rank.\nYou could try a little bit harder.$"
gBwText_461_15:
	.string "The result is Beginner Rank. Maybe you\nshould learn the basics first.$"
gBwText_461_16:
	.string "I've been waiting for you!\pWould you like to challenge\nthe downloaded Single Battle Test?$"
gBwText_461_17:
	.string "Would you like to download\na special Battle Test?$"
gBwText_461_18:
	.string "Hmm... I don't see anything\nto download...\pWhat would you like to do?$"
gBwText_461_19:
	.string "I downloaded a special\nSingle Battle Test!\pYou only have one chance to challenge,\nso please battle until the end\lwithout turning off the power.$"
gBwText_461_20:
	.string "I downloaded a special \nDouble Battle Test!\pYou only have one chance to challenge,\nso please battle until the end\lwithout turning off the power.$"
gBwText_461_21:
	.string "Would you like to challenge right away?$"
gBwText_461_22:
	.string "OK. See you later.\nI've been waiting for you!$"
gBwText_461_23:
	.string "You will take a Battle Test using\nthree Pokémon for Single Battles\land four Pokémon for Double Battles.\pYou may not use duplicate Pokémon or\nheld items.\pFor these battles, all Pokémon will be\nset to Lv. 50.\pYou will battle against five Trainers in\na row, and I will be your judge.\pWhat would you like to do?$"
gBwText_461_24:
	.string "You will be facing opponent No.\n{STR_VAR_1}. Good luck!$"
gBwText_461_25:
	.string "I've been waiting for you.\pWould you like to challenge\nthe downloaded Double Battle Test?$"
gBwText_461_26:
	.string "You seem to have taken all of the\ncurrent Battle Tests already.\pWhat would you like to do?$"
gBwText_461_27:
	.string "There is no test result to display now.$"
gBwText_461_28:
	.string "Which test result would you like to see?$"
gBwText_461_29:
	.string "Communicating... Don't turn off the\npower. Press the B Button to cancel.$"
gBwText_461_30:
	.string "Challenge$"
gBwText_461_31:
	.string "Info$"
gBwText_461_32:
	.string "Cancel$"
gBwText_461_33:
	.string "Single$"
gBwText_461_34:
	.string "Double$"
gBwText_461_35:
	.string "Download$"
gBwText_461_36:
	.string "Normal$"
gBwText_461_37:
	.string "Special$"
gBwText_461_38:
	.string "SINGLE BATTLE$"
gBwText_461_39:
	.string "DOUBLE BATTLE$"
gBwText_461_40:
	.string "TEST RESULT$"
gBwText_461_41:
	.string "POINTS$"
gBwText_461_42:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_461_43:
	.string "BEGINNER RANK$"
gBwText_461_44:
	.string "NOVICE RANK$"
gBwText_461_45:
	.string "NORMAL RANK$"
gBwText_461_46:
	.string "SUPER RANK$"
gBwText_461_47:
	.string "HYPER RANK$"
gBwText_461_48:
	.string "ELITE RANK$"
gBwText_461_49:
	.string "MASTER RANK$"
gBwText_461_50:
	.string "The download was canceled.$"
	.align 2
	.global gBwTextTable_461
