gBwText_463_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Union Room.\pIf there is anything you need help\nwith, please let me know! $"
gBwText_463_1:
	.string "$"
gBwText_463_2:
	.string "Which topic would you\nlike me to explain?$"
gBwText_463_3:
	.string "There are five Battle Formats.\pSingle Battle is for two Trainers\nwith one or more Pokémon each.\pEach Trainer can have one Pokémon\nin battle at a time.\pDouble Battle is for two Trainers\nwith two or more Pokémon each.\pEach Trainer will send out two\nPokémon to battle at a time.\pTriple Battle is for two Trainers\nwith three or more Pokémon each.\pEach Trainer will send out three\nPokémon to battle at a time.$"
gBwText_463_4:
	.string "Rotation Battle is for two Trainers\nwith three or more Pokémon each.\pEach Trainer sends out three Pokémon\nat a time, one in front and two in the\lback.\pMulti Battle is for four Trainers\nwith one or more Pokémon each.\pEach Trainer can have one Pokémon\nin battle at a time.$"
gBwText_463_5:
	.string "You may trade your Pokémon with\nother players.\pMeeting new people could be a\nshortcut to meeting rare Pokémon!$"
gBwText_463_6:
	.string "$"
gBwText_463_7:
	.string "In a Spin Trade, participants each bring\nan Egg for trading with others.\pWhich Egg will you end up with?\nWhat kind of Pokémon is in that Egg?\lIt's quite exciting and fun!\pUp to five players can take part, so\ntry it with your friends!$"
gBwText_463_8:
	.string "You may get together with others\nand draw a picture.\pYou all get to work on one sheet\nof paper at the same time.\pI'm sure a drawing made by friends\nwill be a memorable masterpiece!\pUp to five players can take part,\nso try it with your friends!$"
gBwText_463_9:
	.string "If you touch an icon on the bar\non the Touch Screen below,\lyou can choose words for chatting\lor tell others what you want to do,\lsuch as battles or trades.\pAlso, players who have chosen the same\nicon as you will jump up and down\lso you can spot them easily.\pTouch any icon to find a person you\nwant to play with.$"
