gBwText_466_0:
	.string "$"
gBwText_466_1:
	.string "It feels so peaceful here. I love it!$"
gBwText_466_2:
	.string "When you're surrounded by trees,\nyou feel like your entire being\lhas become one with nature.$"
gBwText_466_3:
	.string "City life seems like it would be\nreally nerve racking...$"
gBwText_466_4:
	.string "Fresh air!\nA comfortable breeze.\lMmmm... This place has everything.$"
gBwText_466_5:
	.string "No surprises, no stress--\nthat is the secret of a good life!$"
gBwText_466_6:
	.string "Pokémon are the same! They prefer to\nlive in a natural setting, too.$"
gBwText_466_7:
	.string "Here, everyone is pleasant and kind\nto everyone else.\pI want to work with everyone\nfor the sake of this incredible forest!$"
gBwText_466_8:
	.string "The force of nature commands\nour respect.\pThe force of nature is what supports\nall life. Nature's bounty brings us\lso much goodness.\pNature's power surpasses imitation!$"
gBwText_466_9:
	.string "Leo: Hello there! Ah... Doesn't it feel\nterrific to enjoy the beauties of\lnature?\pI'm Leo. I come from the Black City\n{STR_VAR_1} visited.\pNice to meet you!$"
gBwText_466_10:
	.string "Leo: Hello there!\pToday, I woke up to the pleasant\nrustling of leaves in the wind. This\lplace is so relaxing!$"
gBwText_466_11:
	.string "Recently, I've been feeling a certain...\nHm, I don't know...\l...Maybe I'm craving the city lights.$"
gBwText_466_12:
	.string "Guess what?\nCheck this out!\pA Pidgey was eating food\nin the grass right over there!$"
gBwText_466_13:
	.string "Silvia: Why, hello!\pIsn't this place sublime?\nThe air is so fresh. It's all so tranquil.\pI'm Silvia. I'm from the Black City\n{STR_VAR_1} visited.\lIt's a pleasure to meet you!$"
gBwText_466_14:
	.string "Silvia: Even if I take off my glasses,\nI'll know exactly where I am.\pWhat tells me is the lush greenery\nall around.$"
gBwText_466_15:
	.string "You know, the time I spend here is\nlovely, but something's missing...\pThat's how I feel.$"
gBwText_466_16:
	.string "If my triple-strength glasses don't\nlie, I met a little Wurmple-kins in a spot\ljust ahead of here!\pThis is a special place... So serene!$"
gBwText_466_17:
	.string "Dave: 'Sup! Call me Dave!\pI used to mix it up a lot with\n{STR_VAR_1} in Black City!\pNice meetin' ya!\pI feel like this place is bold enough to\ntake in a tough guy like me!$"
gBwText_466_18:
	.string "Dave: 'Sup!\nI've got it goin' on today!\pListen up! I'm gonna spread the word\nabout all the awesome things about\lnature! With a fierceness!$"
gBwText_466_19:
	.string "What can I say?\nWhite Forest is too dull.\pIt doesn't have enough hustle and\nbustle to keep a guy like me interested.$"
gBwText_466_20:
	.string "Aaaaaaaeeeeeeeek!\nIs that a Gastly over there?\pOh, whew. It's just your shadow.\nBut I have seen a Gastly recently.$"
gBwText_466_21:
	.string "Britney: I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s friend\nBritney.\pI'm used to living on the edge\nin Black City!$"
gBwText_466_22:
	.string "Britney: We're up to our ears in nature\nhere. It sure winds you down.\pCouldn't be more different from\nthe freewheelin' life in Black City!$"
gBwText_466_23:
	.string "Hmm.\pNow that I've started to think about\nit, I miss being wild and free in Black\lCity.$"
gBwText_466_24:
	.string "Are you searching for Hoppip? No\nproblem! I saw one! Run through the tall\lgrass and catch it!$"
gBwText_466_25:
	.string "Robbie: I'm Robbie from Black City,\nwhere {STR_VAR_1} passed through!\lNice to meet you!\pYou know what? I'd never imagined\na place like this really existed.\pIt's nothing but green as far as\nthe eye can see! I'm shocked!$"
gBwText_466_26:
	.string "Robbie: I was in Black City because I'm\nfascinated by architecture, but being\lin a forest is pretty nice, too!$"
gBwText_466_27:
	.string "Ohhhhhhh, am I bored! So bored!\nI want to go back to Black City!$"
gBwText_466_28:
	.string "Oh! You'll never guess!\pElekid! I saw an Elekid\nrunning off that way!\pMaybe I should chase it!$"
gBwText_466_29:
	.string "Miki: Hello!\nMy name's Miki! Nice to meet you!\pI battled {STR_VAR_1} in Black City!\nSuper tough!$"
gBwText_466_30:
	.string "Miki: Ahhh, mmm... This place is soothing.\nI read somewhere that the scent of\ltrees and grass makes you feel calm, in\lan aromatherapy kind of way. This place\lseems to have the same effect!$"
gBwText_466_31:
	.string "Gosh. Maybe I've become too calm...\n'Cause I'm bored now!\pBut that's worth feeling, too,\nfrom time to time.$"
gBwText_466_32:
	.string "Wait, what?\nA Togepi just ran behind you right now!$"
gBwText_466_33:
	.string "Ryder: Take a deep breath!\nThe air here is so pure and wonderful!\pI'm Ryder. I'm from the Black City,\nwhere {STR_VAR_1} visited. Good to meet\lyou.$"
gBwText_466_34:
	.string "Ryder: Hyah! Hyah! Hyah!\pWhen the air is this fresh,\nit gives you extra power for training!\pBut it is a bit of a problem not to have\na sparring partner!$"
gBwText_466_35:
	.string "Hyah... Hyah? Hyah?\pI've been having trouble lately\ngetting into my training...\pMaybe Black City suits me better...$"
gBwText_466_36:
	.string "When I was practicing forehand strikes\nwith my Pokémon, a Machop was watching\lus in envy. Why don't you go look for\lit?$"
gBwText_466_37:
	.string "Karenna: I got here from Black City\nas fast as I could!\pI'm impressed by how {STR_VAR_1}\nfights, and I know I still have a long\lway to go!$"
gBwText_466_38:
	.string "Karenna: Keep going! Yeah!\nMy Pokémon and I are running!$"
gBwText_466_39:
	.string "Phew... I'm tired of running!\pTime for another battle!\nFor that, back to Black City!$"
gBwText_466_40:
	.string "Oh. Are you going to run with me?\pI just saw a wild Slakoth.\nIf we go running, maybe you'll meet it.$"
gBwText_466_41:
	.string "Doug: Hello, hello! I'm Doug!!\nI came from Black City.\lI'm an acquaintance of {STR_VAR_1}.\pNow, there's someone who has furious\nPokémon battles!$"
gBwText_466_42:
	.string "Doug: When I'm surrounded\nby nature, I work!\lIt's coming along pretty well!$"
gBwText_466_43:
	.string "So, I've had a lot of fresh air,\nand I think I'm well refreshed!\pI have a lot of other work to do,\nso I want to go to Black City.$"
gBwText_466_44:
	.string "Recently, I saw a Shinx in this area!\nYes, just being here refreshes me!$"
gBwText_466_45:
	.string "Vincent: Hey, how are you?\pIn Black City, I was {STR_VAR_1}'s\nsparring partner.\pNot too bad of a Trainer, I'd say,\nbut not as strong as I am.$"
gBwText_466_46:
	.string "Vincent: The vastness of nature\nspices up my life!\pYeah, I really have taken a liking to\nthis place.$"
gBwText_466_47:
	.string "Well, you know, I was born and raised in\nthe city, so maybe I should go home\lsoon.$"
gBwText_466_48:
	.string "Recently a Magby was staring at me from\nover there!\pIt ran as soon as our gazes met.\nIf it likes me, it should let me know!$"
gBwText_466_49:
	.string "Marie: The oxygen is so rich!\nJust like {STR_VAR_1} said!\pIn a place like this, I'm sure I can\nfocus and write my paper!$"
gBwText_466_50:
	.string "Marie: Fresh air and a good paper...\nOnce I write it, I'll present it in\lBlack City!$"
gBwText_466_51:
	.string "I'm good and refreshed, so I\nwant to go back to Black City.$"
gBwText_466_52:
	.string "A few seconds ago, when I was doing\nsome deep-breathing exercises, I saw a\lMagnemite imitating me! It made me\llaugh.$"
gBwText_466_53:
	.string "Lena: {STR_VAR_1}...?\nSorry. You look like someone I know...\pA person I met in Black City and had a\nPokémon battle with...$"
gBwText_466_54:
	.string "Lena: The plants grow thick and green\nwith the blessing of the soil. I want to\lbe thankful for this as I walk.$"
gBwText_466_55:
	.string "People are drawn to man-made things.\nI miss Black City...$"
gBwText_466_56:
	.string "It's so peaceful here. I love listening\nto the Grass-type Pokémon breathing\land the bird Pokémon chirping...\pDid you notice? A Ralts just ran past\nright behind you.$"
gBwText_466_57:
	.string "Carlos: Oh! Hello!\nThere is so much to see here!\pI just came from Black City, where I met\na Trainer named {STR_VAR_1}\lwho was very strong. It was fun!$"
gBwText_466_58:
	.string "Carlos: Oh! Hello!\pI've traveled in many places, but\nplaces this close to nature are very\lrare!$"
gBwText_466_59:
	.string "But, hmmm... I think it's about time\nto head somewhere else.$"
gBwText_466_60:
	.string "Starly!\pStarly was just there!\nWhy don't you go look for it?$"
gBwText_466_61:
	.string "Molly: So this is White Forest!\nIt's very different from Black City!\pHey, do you know a Trainer named\n{STR_VAR_1} who is really strong?$"
gBwText_466_62:
	.string "Molly: I've been traveling, and I've\nseen a lot of places, but I have never\lseen a place this pretty before!$"
gBwText_466_63:
	.string "This is a pretty place, but maybe\na little boring...$"
gBwText_466_64:
	.string "Oh, that's right! An Azurill was running\nhappily toward the grass!\pMaybe I should run with the Pokémon\nin the grass!$"
gBwText_466_65:
	.string "Frederic: {STR_VAR_1}?!\p...Oh! My mistake!\pI'm very frustrated at losing our\nPokémon battle, so I want a rematch\lthe next time I see that Trainer.$"
gBwText_466_66:
	.string "Frederic: Oh... Have a look at this!\nMy Pokémon is so happy!\pPokémon love nature, but...\nI'm the complete opposite!$"
gBwText_466_67:
	.string "Well, my Pokémon is having fun, but\nI'm starving for some excitement.$"
gBwText_466_68:
	.string "Just a second ago, my Pokémon was\nplaying with a wild Budew.\pIt ran away when it saw me, but\nit really looked like it was having fun!$"
gBwText_466_69:
	.string "Lynette: How are you?\pI was in Black City, and I got to battle\n{STR_VAR_1}, who was really strong!\pIt was wonderful.$"
gBwText_466_70:
	.string "Lynette: This environment with\nnothing but nature is nice, too.\lIt's soothing.$"
gBwText_466_71:
	.string "But I'm a little tired of being out in\nthe countryside.\pI want to spend time in a place where\nthere is more stuff.$"
gBwText_466_72:
	.string "I saw an Oddish today!\pI haven't really seen one before,\nso I was fascinated!$"
gBwText_466_73:
	.string "Pierce: Until recently, I was in\nBlack City. I also battled with\l{STR_VAR_1} there.\pI suspect {STR_VAR_1} likes White\nForest more than you might suspect.$"
gBwText_466_74:
	.string "Pierce: Living simply among\nnature and enjoying your own life...\pI think that is not a bad way to live.$"
gBwText_466_75:
	.string "Hmmm...\pBut I might be getting tired of\nthe slow life...$"
gBwText_466_76:
	.string "Today, I saw a Mareep!\pThat's something you could\nonly see in White Forest!$"
gBwText_466_77:
	.string "Gene: Nature is great! But I remember\nBlack City sometimes.\pMy battle with {STR_VAR_1} is an\nimportant memory!$"
gBwText_466_78:
	.string "Gene: My hobby is meeting Pokémon\nin their natural habitat!$"
gBwText_466_79:
	.string "But recently, I've been thinking I want\nto test the strength of the Pokémon\lI've met.$"
gBwText_466_80:
	.string "I met an Aron today! It was really\nlucky!\pWhite Forest definitely fits me\nlike a glove!$"
gBwText_466_81:
	.string "Piper: The natural surroundings here\nare very comfortable.\pUntil recently, I was in Black City, and\n{STR_VAR_1}'s battling style was\lfairly efficient.$"
gBwText_466_82:
	.string "Piper: Leisurely time passed together\nwith Pokémon...\lThings like that are important.$"
gBwText_466_83:
	.string "But recently, for some reason, leisurely\npassing time like this makes me feel\la little impatient.$"
gBwText_466_84:
	.string "I spent today with a Bellsprout!\nIt was a precious experience!$"
gBwText_466_85:
	.string "Miho: Pokémon in White Forest\nare so adorable!\pBut {STR_VAR_1}, who I met in\nBlack City, was pretty cute too!$"
gBwText_466_86:
	.string "Miho: Pokémon and this expansive\nnature!\pEveryone is in their natural state,\nand I think it's wonderful!$"
gBwText_466_87:
	.string "But I might need a little more\nthan just nature.\lI have to find more things I want to do!$"
gBwText_466_88:
	.string "In nature, Seedot and people can\nbecome friends... That sure is a\lwonderful thing, isn't it?$"
gBwText_466_89:
	.string "Shane: Everyone is very honest\nin White Forest.\pI wonder if {STR_VAR_1}, who I just met\nin Black City, will like White Forest more\lthan you might expect.$"
gBwText_466_90:
	.string "Shane: Here both Pokémon and\npeople can just be themselves.$"
gBwText_466_91:
	.string "But I'm worried about how this\nmore honest me will be seen.$"
gBwText_466_92:
	.string "I just saw a Rhyhorn over there!\nA Rhyhorn in its natural state... Wow!$"
gBwText_466_93:
	.string "Ralph: In White Forest, it's fun how\npeople and Pokémon can deal with\lone another directly.\pBefore, in Black City, I battled\n{STR_VAR_1}, and we were able to show\leach other how we felt!\pThat was fun, too!$"
gBwText_466_94:
	.string "Ralph: I want Pokémon and people to be\nable to face each other directly and\lunderstand one another.$"
gBwText_466_95:
	.string "But I also think I want to promptly\nbe able to show people how I feel!$"
gBwText_466_96:
	.string "I met a Lotad over there today!\pWe communicated our feelings to each\nother, and I'm still awed by the memory.$"
gBwText_466_97:
	.string "Eliza: A lifestyle where you encounter\nnature is fulfilling.\pBut when I had a Pokémon battle with\n{STR_VAR_1} in Black City, something\labout that made me feel fulfilled, too.$"
gBwText_466_98:
	.string "Eliza: When you encounter nature,\nyour heart becomes that much richer.$"
gBwText_466_99:
	.string "But...\pJust looking at nature doesn't fulfill\nyour spirit.\pThat's what I've been thinking\nrecently.$"
gBwText_466_100:
	.string "I saw a Trapinch, and it made\nmy heart happy.$"
gBwText_466_101:
	.string "Collin: My success story begins here!\pIn Black City, I had a rival named\n{STR_VAR_1}, but I don't have one here!\pI'm going to make a fortune!$"
gBwText_466_102:
	.string "Collin: I like how everyone here looks\nso happy!\pI want to make them even happier with\nmy business!$"
gBwText_466_103:
	.string "Business opportunities don't just come\nrolling at you so easily.\pAhh... I feel like Black City may be a\nbetter fit for me...$"
gBwText_466_104:
	.string "Successful people are always looking\nup!\pSo I was looking up while I was walking,\nand I accidentally walked into an Abra.\lSorry, Abra!$"
gBwText_466_105:
	.string "Ken: I feel that I've grown as a Trainer\nwho can look at Pokémon with a\lbroad mindset.\pI wonder how {STR_VAR_1}, who I met in\nBlack City, is doing these days.$"
gBwText_466_106:
	.string "Ken: Studying many different Pokémon\nand gaining a lot of far-reaching\lknowledge widens your world.$"
gBwText_466_107:
	.string "But now I'm thinking I'd rather think\nabout just one thing very deeply.$"
gBwText_466_108:
	.string "When you have a broad mindset, you\nnotice things about nature and\lyourself and about yourself and\lPokémon.\pI thought that when I saw a Nidoran?\nover there recently.$"
gBwText_466_109:
	.string "Jacques: When you see how many\ndifferent Pokémon there are in the\lworld, you understand there are lots of\ldifferent answers to problems, too.\pWhen I met {STR_VAR_1} in Black City, I\nfelt that Trainer's way of thinking was\lone of those answers.$"
gBwText_466_110:
	.string "Jacques: Several different answers\nexist for each problem.\pWatching different Pokémon makes me\nfeel that way.$"
gBwText_466_111:
	.string "But I want to study something\nwith a more clear, definite answer...$"
gBwText_466_112:
	.string "A variety of Pokémon,\na variety of answers.\lAll of them equally valid.\pI thought that when I saw a\nNidoran? over there recently.$"
gBwText_466_113:
	.string "Rosa: Here, you can feel growth from\nday to day.\pBefore, in Black City, when I battled\n{STR_VAR_1}, I thought I hadn't grown\lat all.$"
gBwText_466_114:
	.string "Rosa: Watching the growth of nature\nlets you feel some kind of growth every\lday.$"
gBwText_466_115:
	.string "Well, that may be true, but just\nwatching nature gets boring sometimes.\pI don't have anything to do.$"
gBwText_466_116:
	.string "Every day of being alive means many\nsmall changes that give the day\lmeaning.\pI thought that when I saw\na Whismur recently.$"
gBwText_466_117:
	.string "Herman: I've settled in here now, but\nbefore, when I lived in Black City...\pPokémon battles with {STR_VAR_1}\nsure were fun!$"
gBwText_466_118:
	.string "Herman: Living here, surrounded by\nnature, is very calming.$"
gBwText_466_119:
	.string "But it's not like me to stay\nin one place forever.$"
gBwText_466_120:
	.string "Oh yeah... I just saw a Porygon!\pSo strange to see one here... It must\nhave taken a liking to the forest.\pI want to live the slow life here, too!$"
gBwText_466_121:
	.string "Emi: Right now, I'm on a leisurely\njourney, but before that, I had a goal:\lto win against {STR_VAR_1} in Black\lCity.$"
gBwText_466_122:
	.string "Emi: It's fun to travel as you like, with\nno particular goal in mind.$"
gBwText_466_123:
	.string "But maybe it's better to have at least\nsome idea of where you're going?$"
gBwText_466_124:
	.string "In my travels through this forest, I\nmet a Happiny! I was so happy!$"
gBwText_466_125:
	.string "Grace: The beauty of the Pokémon\nbattle I had with {STR_VAR_1} in Black\lCity can stand up to the beauty of\lnature!$"
gBwText_466_126:
	.string "Grace: The beauty created by nature...\nIts grandness exceeds human\limagination.$"
gBwText_466_127:
	.string "The beauty I want to see right now is\nthe artistry of human hands. I can't\lsatisfy that craving here.$"
gBwText_466_128:
	.string "The beauty of the Bagon I just saw was\nnatural and good...$"
gBwText_466_129:
	.string "White Forest\nPeople and Nature in Harmony$"
	.align 2
