gBwText_468_0:
	.string "Ho! Hoo!\nWelcome to White Forest!\pIn White Forest, people live in harmony\nwith nature and with Pokémon.\pPlease listen to the voice of the\nforest.\pIt's saying “Bienvenue!“\nHo! Hoo! Hoo!$"
gBwText_468_1:
	.string "I do research into the Pokémon\nthat live in this forest.\pIn theory, you should find {STR_VAR_1}\nliving in this forest.$"
gBwText_468_2:
	.string "Hoo!\nThat's {STR_VAR_1}!\pSo it lives in this forest, too!$"
gBwText_468_3:
	.string "What's more, you caught it today!\nHo hoo!\pThis means there are {STR_VAR_1}\nin White Forest.\pFor you, my skilled Pokémon catcher--\nthis small trifle. Hoo!$"
gBwText_468_4:
	.string "If you return here tomorrow, I'm sure\nthe forest will say “Bienvenue“ again!$"
gBwText_468_5:
	.string "Thank you very much for today.\nSee you again tomorrow!\pThe forest is murmuring, “À très vite!“$"
gBwText_468_6:
	.string "I'm researching the Pokémon\nthat live in this forest. Hoo!\pBut there haven't been any Pokémon\nrecently, and the forest is forlorn.$"
gBwText_468_7:
	.string "If you see {STR_VAR_1} in this forest,\nplease let me know.\pThat will be proof that Pokémon\nare living in this forest.$"
gBwText_468_8:
	.string "But--that {STR_VAR_1} wasn't caught\ntoday, was it? Hoo!\pWhat I want to know is whether\n{STR_VAR_1} is still living in the forest.\pThe forest itself wants to know, too!$"
gBwText_468_9:
	.string "Did you notice the sky's beauty today?\nTomorrow will be fine, too!$"
gBwText_468_10:
	.string "Let's go Berry picking together!$"
gBwText_468_11:
	.string "I need Berries for tomorrow's dinner,\nso go pick some, OK?$"
gBwText_468_12:
	.string "Let's have a Triple Battle with the\nPokémon I have worked so hard to raise!$"
gBwText_468_13:
	.string "A Triple Battle is a new style of battle\nin which you use three Pokémon!\pPlease get three Pokémon together\nto use in battle!$"
gBwText_468_14:
	.string "Oh... I wanted to see\nthe Pokémon you've raised.$"
gBwText_468_15:
	.string "I'll work even harder raising my\nPokémon!$"
gBwText_468_16:
	.string "I have always lived with these Pokémon.\pHmm. How would you like to try a\nTriple Battle with me?$"
gBwText_468_17:
	.string "In order to have a Triple Battle,\nyou need to have at least three\lPokémon able to battle.$"
gBwText_468_18:
	.string "Oh... I hope I'll get to see them another\ntime!$"
gBwText_468_19:
	.string "There are so many things to consider,\nbut that is part of the fun of\lTriple Battles!$"
gBwText_468_20:
	.string "$"
gBwText_468_21:
	.string "$"
gBwText_468_22:
	.string "$"
