gBwTextCount_468:
	.4byte 23
gBwText_469_0:
	.string "Have you noticed it's been getting\nwarmer out lately? It's really nice.\pHey, want to hang out for a while? If\nyou have time, we could have a battle.\pSound good?$"
gBwText_469_1:
	.string "All right! Lucky me, meeting\na cool dude like you here.\pLet's battle right now!$"
gBwText_469_2:
	.string "Eep, my bad.\nI shouldn't have sprung that on you.\pSorry! Forget I asked!$"
gBwText_469_3:
	.string "Wow! {STR_VAR_1},\nyou are so good at Pokémon battles!\pI want to ask you something else...\nWill you ride the Ferris wheel with me?\pI bet I get just as nervous asking a\nguy as a guy would asking a girl...\pYou're OK with that, right? Good!\nC'mon!$"
gBwText_469_4:
	.string "Woo, that was fun! I've been wanting to\nride this Ferris wheel for a long time.\pBut you have to have two people,\nand I worried that if I went with my\lfriend, she'd see how scared I was.\lEmbarrassing!\pThen you came along!\nHow lucky is that?\pOK, I'm still scared of heights, but...\nWith you, it was a little bit easier.\pUm... Want to ride it again?$"
gBwText_469_5:
	.string "Hi, {STR_VAR_1}! How are you?\nWant to hang out for a little while?\pWe could have a Pokémon battle\nand ride the Ferris wheel together!\pThis time, I kinda think\nI won't get scared!$"
gBwText_469_6:
	.string "Hee hee hee. Awesome!\p{STR_VAR_1}, let's have a\nPokémon battle right now!$"
gBwText_469_7:
	.string "Oh. Oh well, that's how it goes.\nYou do look kinda busy, {STR_VAR_1}.$"
gBwText_469_8:
	.string "Boy oh boy! {STR_VAR_1},\nyou are so good at Pokémon battles.\pNo matter what I tried, it was all you!\nI'm done with Pokémon battles.\pSo, shall we...ride the Ferris wheel? Eep,\ndon't give me that look! I'll be fine!\lI'm calm, cool, and collected. Going to\lbe absolutely fine this time!\pUh-huh...$"
gBwText_469_9:
	.string "Aww... That was scary again.\pBut, you know, {STR_VAR_1}, when I'm\nwith you, I can almost enjoy being\lscared.\pIt's like you make it safe anyway.\nHa ha, maybe I'm weird.\pI like hanging out with you, {STR_VAR_1}.\nI'm looking forward to seeing you\lagain!$"
gBwText_469_10:
	.string "It sure is getting nice out.\nThe warmer it gets, the sleepier I feel!\pOh, hey, do you have a minute?\pI want to ride the Ferris wheel, but it's\ntwo at a time, so I can't go by myself.\pYou don't mind riding with me, do you?\pI don't have anything to give you in\nexchange, but I've got a great\lPokémon I've been raising, so we\lcould at least have an awesome battle.$"
gBwText_469_11:
	.string "You serious? Aww, thanks!\nYou're awesome!\pLet me introduce my Pokémon. It rocks!$"
gBwText_469_12:
	.string "OK... Sorry to have bothered you.\nI'll find somebody who's not in a rush.\pHave a good one!$"
gBwText_469_13:
	.string "Er, {STR_VAR_1}? Did I get that right?\pYou rocked the house!\pI know I might not look it, but among\nmy crowd, I've never lost a battle!\pHere I was thinking you're just cute,\nand then, seriously, you ruled the\lbattle!\pThat's even cooler! Right! Let's go and\nride the Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_469_14:
	.string "Wh-what?\pWhy are you asking if something's\nwrong?\pI'm OK! I'm OK!\nIt's all...good.\pAnyway, thanks, {STR_VAR_1}. I figured\nthe Ferris wheel was kid stuff.\pThe view was great...\nGave me the shivers...\pI guess this ride is not too bad\nonce in a while.\pIn fact, let's ride it again sometime!\nSee ya, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_469_15:
	.string "Oh, hi, {STR_VAR_1}!\nW-wanna hang out...maybe...\pFeel like...having a Pokémon battle...and\nriding the Ferris wheel?$"
gBwText_469_16:
	.string "Did you say y-yes? Seriously!\nCool!\pI knew you were awesome\nthe minute I saw you!\pReady to battle? Let's go!$"
gBwText_469_17:
	.string "Oh...\nSorry.\pWell, when you're free,\ngive me a shout sometime.\lSee ya, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_469_18:
	.string "Ugh, ugh, ugh. As usual,\nyou showed no mercy on me.\pHave you thought about trying\nto become the Champion?\p{STR_VAR_1}, I think that\ncould be more than a dream for you.\pAnd I'll cheer you all the way!\pYeah. Anyway...\nLet's go and ride the Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_469_19:
	.string "Hmm-mmmm... Hm, hm, hmm...\pAh, sorry, sorry...\nI was just thinking.\pI feel like... \nWhen I am hanging out with you,\ltime passes sooooo fast.\lI mean, I was thinking...\lHow cruel time can be.\pHa ha, forget I said anything! Thanks\nfor the fun! Let's hang out again!\pBye, {STR_VAR_1}!$"
gBwText_469_20:
	.string "Hi, Trainer. Enjoying the summer?\nIt's sure hot today.\pThat's summer for ya.\nWhat? You wanna ride the Ferris wheel?\lIt's for two at a time, so take a friend.\pWhat? You want me to ride it with you?\nSure, I guess. I'll ride with ya...\lBut you gotta win a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_469_21:
	.string "Sure enough.\pA little battle practice is a good way\nto spend a summer's day.$"
gBwText_469_22:
	.string "Oh well. Didn't feel like wasting my time\nriding a Ferris wheel anyway.$"
gBwText_469_23:
	.string "Nice job. I'm impressed.\nYou and your Pokémon make a great team.\lThanks, that was fun. See ya!\pWhat?\nThat's not what I promised?\lYou still want to ride the Ferris wheel?\pOK, sure enough, I guess...$"
gBwText_469_24:
	.string "It...uh...it was fun...\nYeah, great view...\pWhat? I wasn't looking at the view?\nI was looking at my feet the whole time?\lWhat are you talking about?\pYou think I'm scared of heights?\nNah. That would be lame.\pI hike on mountains way higher than\na silly little Ferris wh-wheel.\pC-catch ya later, Trainer!$"
gBwText_469_25:
	.string "Oh. You again.\nSummer's about over, you know.\pTime to put the hiking boots away.\nWait... You want to ride the Ferris wheel\lagain...\pEr...\pI guess...$"
gBwText_469_26:
	.string "If you want me to ride the Ferris wheel,\nyou have to win a Pokémon battle first.\pWhat? Don't be ridiculous!\nIt's not an excuse. Why would I need an\lexcuse? No Hiker is scared of heights!$"
gBwText_469_27:
	.string "Oh, you changed your mind? Ha ha ha.\nWell, don't feel bad if you're scared.\lLots of people are scared of heights.\pNo need to be embarrassed about that.\nMe? Scared? Ya think? Me, a Hiker?\lI'm all that and a slice of pie. Got it?\lGood. S-see ya!$"
gBwText_469_28:
	.string "Y'know, kid, I figured you'd have\nPokémon that were strong and tough!\lYou're gonna be a big success!\pYep, that was a fun battle. See ya!\pWha...?\nYou still wanna ride the Ferris wheel?\pEr...\nOK, let's go.\lSigh...$"
gBwText_469_29:
	.string "I-it was... It was fun, eh?\nWhat? I what? I fainted?!\lDon't be ridiculous!\pI'm a Hiker!\nI'm not scared of heights.\pThe only reason I was on the floor\nwas because there was gum on my shoe.\pThat's it, kid. I'm out! See ya!$"
gBwText_469_30:
	.string "I can't believe how hot it is! Can you?\pSay, are you interested in the Ferris\nwheel? I'm here for the same thing!\pThe Ferris wheel seats two people,\nso, unfortunately, you can't ride alone.\pLet me think. Say, why don't you have\na Pokémon battle with me?\pIf you win the battle,\nI wouldn't mind riding with you.\pWhat do you say? Battle on?$"
gBwText_469_31:
	.string "Sure, sure...\pI'm interested in you because you seem\nto be so drawn to the Ferris wheel.\pThat being said, I am an Ace Trainer.\nI won't compromise in battle.$"
gBwText_469_32:
	.string "All right. Just as well for you...$"
gBwText_469_33:
	.string "Gah. I hate to admit it...\pLosing to you is a complete surprise.\pSigh...\nLooks can be deceiving, so they say...\pFair enough. As I said earlier,\nI'll ride the Ferris wheel with you.\pActually, it's my first Ferris wheel\nride.$"
gBwText_469_34:
	.string "I had no idea.\pCall me stupid, but I didn't know\nhow scary altitude could be.\pAnd...now I know.\nThanks to you.\lI mean, thank you.\lThank you for staying calm.\pLet me ask you something...\nLet's keep the whole altitude thing\lbetween you and me.\pAnd then, if you really want to ride the\nFerris wheel again, I'll ride with you.\pBeing an Ace Trainer means finding\na way to conquer my fear.$"
gBwText_469_35:
	.string "Ah. H-hi.\pYou're calling me out to ride\nthe Ferris wheel again?\pYou see how I'm acting like it's the\nsimplest thing for me to conquer my\lfear?\pYou can help me out. We'll battle.\pYou win, and I'll ride the Ferris wheel\nwith you again.\pDo you believe in me?$"
gBwText_469_36:
	.string "I knew it!\nI knew you would bet on me!\pIf I didn't try to conquer this fear,\nthen I really would be stupid.\lLet's get going!$"
gBwText_469_37:
	.string "I'm letting myself down here.\pThis was a chance for me\nto conquer my weakness...\lto change my attitude about altitude...$"
gBwText_469_38:
	.string "My sincerest thanks for calling me out.\nI'd be a fool to hang on to this fear.\pWhen you believe in me,\nI believe in myself and in my ability\lto become a truly fearless Ace Trainer.\pIt's all up to me... Watch it happen!$"
gBwText_469_39:
	.string "What are you grinning for?\pAm I imagining it, or are you\nlaughing at me?\lNice. Nice... Well, thanks for nothing.\pI am absolutely sure I will probably\nconquer my fear when the time comes.\lBecause I am an Ace Trainer!\pBut for now, I'm out.\nBut if you keep thinking about riding\lthe Ferris wheel with me again, and you\ljust can't help yourself, come find me.$"
gBwText_469_40:
	.string "It's autumn already.\nSummer goes by so fast...\pDo you know what I mean?\nSee the Ferris wheel?\pI've ridden it so many times,\nbut now, summer's almost over\land everyone's gone away...\pGone to school, gone on journeys.\nAnd I'm still here, all alone.\pI'd like to ride one more time,\nbut I need a friend to ride with.\pDo me a favor and ride with me?\nIn return,\lI'll do my best in a Pokémon battle.$"
gBwText_469_41:
	.string "Aww. Ha ha. Thank you, young man.\nYou have a kind heart.\pWell, let's have a Pokémon battle!\nLook out! I'll show you how it's done!$"
gBwText_469_42:
	.string "I see. Pardon me for being so out there.\nI'm sorry for intruding on you,\la stranger...$"
gBwText_469_43:
	.string "Whoops... That seemed like an easy win!\nI did my best, though.\pHa ha. Thanks for the lesson!\nIt was fun.\pWell, now...\nReady to ride the Ferris wheel?$"
gBwText_469_44:
	.string "Boo-hoo...\nThis view reminds me of so many things...\pSniff... Oh... I'm fine, I'm fine...\pOh...\nI don't even know your name.\pWell, do you mind my asking...?\nYour name is {STR_VAR_1}... Nice name.\pI'll be around here for a while.\nIf you don't mind, I'd be happy if you\lrode the Ferris wheel with me again.$"
gBwText_469_45:
	.string "Oh, it's you. Hi.\nHow have you been?\pAre you here to ride the Ferris wheel?\nI'd love to go again...\pWe could have another Pokémon battle...$"
gBwText_469_46:
	.string "I'm so glad... Thank you...\nYour kindness really lifts my spirits.\pI know you're probably on your way\nsomewhere. Everyone's always busy.\p{STR_VAR_1}, ready for my best battle?\nLet's see how it goes this time!$"
gBwText_469_47:
	.string "Whoops, I thought you looked too busy.\pSorry to have stopped you.\nSee you...$"
gBwText_469_48:
	.string "Oh, my. {STR_VAR_1},\nyou are really good at Pokémon battles.\pA battle with me is not\nchallenging enough, is it?\pBut you've been kind enough to battle\nwith me anyway.\lI wish I had a...a little brother like you.\pSorry, I'm just thinking out loud.\pCome on, let's ride the Ferris wheel\nagain! I can't wait!$"
gBwText_469_49:
	.string "Boo-hoo... {STR_VAR_1},\nyour kindness has meant a lot to me.\pI don't know why I'm telling you this,\nbut I wish I had a little brother like\lyou.\p{STR_VAR_1}, I feel so alone these days.\nThanks for spending time with me.\pI don't know if I'll see you again...\nI hope so, {STR_VAR_1}! See you!$"
gBwText_469_50:
	.string "It's kinda getting cool...\nI betcha it's gonna get cold soon.\pAre you here to ride the Ferris wheel?\pMe, too.\nBut you've gotta have two people.\pWhat do you wanna do?\nHow about we have a Pokémon battle?\pWin, and I'll ride the wheel with you.$"
gBwText_469_51:
	.string "Just like that, you say yes?\nYou're kinda confident, hey?\pWhatever...\nOne battle will show what's what.\pLet's see what you got on your plate!$"
gBwText_469_52:
	.string "Ack. Whatever.\pI'll be around a while if you\nchange your mind.$"
gBwText_469_53:
	.string "Whew... I was no match for you.\pGuess I was the one who was kinda more\nconfident than I should have been!\pI figured I knew my Pokémon battles,\nbut you showed me what is really what!\pOK, like I said, one ride on the\nFerris wheel--over easy.$"
gBwText_469_54:
	.string "Haah! It was so relaxing to talk with\nyou!\pIt felt great to really let my hair down\nand have some girl talk for a change.\pThat's what I think--sometimes you\nneed another girl to talk to, and that's\lthat.\pHey, I'm gonna hang out here for a bit!\pIf you feel like it, stop by and we'll\ntalk some more!$"
gBwText_469_55:
	.string "Hey! We met the other day!\nGlad to see you! How're you doing?\pIf you're not busy, let's hang out\nagain.\pWhy don't we have a Pokémon battle\nand chat while riding the Ferris wheel?$"
gBwText_469_56:
	.string "Yeah? You good? Yeah!\pFor whatever reason, hanging out\nwith you energized me like whoa!\pOoh, let's have a Pokémon battle first!$"
gBwText_469_57:
	.string "Aww. Oh well, if you gotta motor...\nWe'll have another chance to catch up\lsometime. Say hi next time, OK?$"
gBwText_469_58:
	.string "Sigh... I lost...again!\pYou've got a knack for\nhandling Pokémon, too.\lI'm just not in your league.\pAnd you're smart and pretty and nice...\nI gotta say, I'm totally jealous of you!\pCome on, at least we can ride the\nFerris wheel together.$"
gBwText_469_59:
	.string "Aww... It's over already! I knew it.\pWhen I hang out with you,\ntime just seems to zip by!\pI probably shouldn't say this,\nbut I don't have a lot of friends...\pSo finding someone to do stuff with\nand, you know, just talk and stuff...\lWell, it's really important to me!\pUm, thanks for being someone\nI can talk to.\pAnytime you wanna hang out, let me\nknow!$"
gBwText_469_60:
	.string "It's already cold out.\nIt would be so fun if it snowed.\pWhat's the matter?\nDo you wanna go for a ride?\pOh, I get it.\pYou can't ride 'cause\nyou're all by yourself!\pThey don't let you ride this\nFerris wheel by yourself.\pHey! I know what!\nI thought of something!\pI don't have anything to do\nuntil my dad comes back...\pWe could play and have a\nPokémon battle, if you want?\pIf you play with me, then we\ncan both ride the Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_469_61:
	.string "You do? You want to play with me?\nHee hee! I'm happy!\pFun! Fun! Let's battle!$"
gBwText_469_62:
	.string "You don't want to play?\nAww. I'm bored!$"
gBwText_469_63:
	.string "That was fun! Thank you!\pI knew you'd be strong\n'cause you're big!\pMy dad is very strong in\nPokémon battles, too!\pBut, he's been busy working,\nso he doesn't play with me.\pBut you're gonna play with me!\pNext, let's ride the Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_469_64:
	.string "Yay! That was cool!\nDid you have fun?\pIt's been a while since I had fun.\pMy dad doesn't take me anywhere lately.\nHe just comes home and sleeps.\pSo, I try to have fun here by myself\nuntil my dad comes back.\pLet's play some more!$"
gBwText_469_65:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\pI have a lot of time!\nDo you have time to play, too?\pLet's play!\nAnd let's have a Pokémon battle!\lAnd let's ride the Ferris wheel!$"
gBwText_469_66:
	.string "Tee hee! Yay! Thank you!\n{STR_VAR_1}!\pUm, OK...\nFirst, let's have a Pokémon battle!$"
gBwText_469_67:
	.string "Booo!\nAre you busy?\pAll grown-ups are busy.\nI am soooooo bored...$"
gBwText_469_68:
	.string "Tee hee! That was so fun!\n{STR_VAR_1}, you're really strong!\pI bet you're stronger than my dad\nin Pokémon battles!\pUm, OK, next!\nThe Ferris wheel! The Ferris wheel!\pHurry up! Let's go!$"
gBwText_469_69:
	.string "Hee hee! That was fun!\nYou had fun, too. Right? Right?\p{STR_VAR_1}, you know what?\nI like you 'cause you play with me!\pAnd! You know what else?\nUm, it's... I don't like my dad lately.\pMy dad and me, we're alone.\nI know he's working hard, but...\pI don't like my dad 'cause\nhe doesn't play with me or anything.\pI want him to play with me more.\nWait!\pYou'll play with me again, right?\pRight?\nOK. See ya! Bye-bye!$"
gBwText_469_70:
	.string "Hi...\nPretty chilly out, don't you think?\pEr... Well...\nI was wondering if you'd think about...\pActually, this is the first time I've\nbeen out of the house in a long time.\pSince I'm out anyway, I want to get\nsome exercise for my Pokémon.\pAnd I want to ride the Ferris wheel, too.\pSo... Want to keep me company?$"
gBwText_469_71:
	.string "Really? Yes? OK!\pThanks!\nYou seem like a nice person.\pLet's start by giving our Pokémon\na little warm-up battle for exercise.$"
gBwText_469_72:
	.string "OK. Totally understand.\nDidn't mean to intrude on your time.$"
gBwText_469_73:
	.string "Pant, pant... I'm crushed! It's been way\ntoo long since I got enough exercise.\pBut...\nIt was fun!\pMy Pokémon also looks pretty happy,\nthanks to the exercise.\pThank you for having a battle with us.\nNow, shall we ride the Ferris wheel?\pI've been looking forward to this\nfor a long time.$"
gBwText_469_74:
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}, thank you.\pI'm sorry if I caused you any trouble.\pI don't get out much.\nMy health has never been strong.\pIt's been tremendous hanging out\nwith you today...\pSo, thanks again, {STR_VAR_1}.\nWhen I feel well enough, I'll be back.\pI'd love to hang out with you again.$"
gBwText_469_75:
	.string "Hello, {STR_VAR_1}. Good to see you!\nIt's cold, eh? How are you doing?\pI feel good today, so I'm out for a walk.\pIf you don't mind, {STR_VAR_1}, it would\nbe nice to have a Pokémon battle and\lride the Ferris wheel together...\pLet's hang out for a while,\nif that sounds good?$"
gBwText_469_76:
	.string "All right! I like that answer!\pShall we begin with a little\nPokémon exercise?$"
gBwText_469_77:
	.string "I see, alas. You are a busy person.\pWhen you have time, it would be nice\nto talk with you again.$"
gBwText_469_78:
	.string "Pant, pant...\pStill...\pStill...don't have the physical strength\nto keep up with you...\pBut it's fun\nto have a battle...\pMy Pokémon's also\nglad to see you.\pThank you...\pShall we ride the Ferris wheel now?\nLet's be on our way, {STR_VAR_1}...$"
gBwText_469_79:
	.string "Again, sorry if I've caused you trouble.\pBut, {STR_VAR_1}, since I started\nhanging out with you, I feel better...\pAnd, to be honest, {STR_VAR_1},\nI am very happy to hang out with you.\pAs long as you don't mind, I'd enjoy\nhaving you hang out with me another\ltime.\pAgain, thank you very much for today.\nSee you, {STR_VAR_1}...$"
	.align 2
