gBwText_470_0:
	.string "Welcome to the Pokémon Wi-Fi Club!\pWould you like to use\nNintendo Wi-Fi Connection?$"
gBwText_470_1:
	.string "Please do visit again.$"
gBwText_470_2:
	.string "Would you like to launch\nNintendo WFC?$"
gBwText_470_3:
	.string "Right this way, please.$"
gBwText_470_4:
	.string "...Oh?\pI'm sorry, but you don't have any\nfriends registered in your Pal Pad.\pThe Wi-Fi Club cannot be used if\nno friends are in your Pal Pad.\pWould you like to get your own\nFriend Code at least?{STR_VAR_1}$"
gBwText_470_5:
	.string "...Oh?\pI'm sorry, but you don't have any\nfriends registered in your Pal Pad.\pThe Wi-Fi Club cannot be used if\nno friends are in your Pal Pad.\pPlease register friends in your\nPal Pad, and then come back.$"
gBwText_470_6:
	.string "At any Wi-Fi Club, you may play using\nNintendo Wi-Fi Connection.\pBy doing so, you may trade or battle\nwith friends you have registered in\lyour Pal Pad.\pCheck the monitor inside the room to\nfind other people to play with.\pOr you may play with your friends\nby talking to them directly.\pWould you like to use\nNintendo Wi-Fi Connection?$"
gBwText_470_7:
	.string "Sorry, we're getting things ready.\nPlease come back later.$"
gBwText_470_8:
	.string "You have at least one Pokémon\nthat can't be taken.$"
gBwText_470_9:
	.string "Communication error.$"
gBwText_470_10:
	.string "Go to Wi-Fi Club$"
gBwText_470_11:
	.string "Info$"
gBwText_470_12:
	.string "Cancel$"
